    {'code': '893006', 'port_slug': 'aarhus', 'title': 'Moesgaard and City of Aarhus', 'slug': 'moesgaard-and-city-of-aarhus-893006', 'price': 164.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>City Highlights &amp; Museum:</strong> Experience the heart of Aarhus on this comprehensive tour, starting with a panoramic view of iconic landmarks like Arne Jacobsen’s marble City Hall and the Concert Hall. Continue to Den Gamle By, an open-air museum where you can immerse yourself in 400 years of Danish life, exploring homes, workshops, and shops from the time of Hans Christian Andersen to the lively 1970s.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Aarhus Cathedral:</strong> Discover Aarhus Cathedral, Denmark's tallest and longest church, where you can admire stunning gothic architecture, intricate altarpieces, and beautiful frescoes. Dive into its 800-year history and learn about its significant role in shaping the city.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Moesgaard Museum:</strong> Step into Denmark's prehistoric history at this premier museum, where interactive exhibits transport you from the Stone Age to the Middle Ages. Don’t miss the Grauballe Man, Europe’s best-preserved bog body, and the immersive Iron Age battlefield experience.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Guided city drive and walking exploration.</li>\n\t<li>Entry to Den Gamle By and the Moesgaard Museum.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/893006-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDMwMTZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR00zTDJobFppODVNRFl6TnpNd056UXhNamM0THpnNU16QXdOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4YjE1NjIzZTRiNjE4MzQ0NmIzNWM0MDg5YjhmNDRhZWUxMjYxZjM5ZTdhYjYyNmE5ZmI1NjNhYzA1OWU5OTRh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '893005', 'port_slug': 'aarhus', 'title': 'Aarhus Walk and Harbor Cruise', 'slug': 'aarhus-walk-and-harbor-cruise-893005', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Walking History:</strong> Discover Aarhus on a guided walking tour that highlights the city's major sights near the pier, including its Viking origins. Learn about the transformation of this charming Danish town into the country's second-largest city with over a thousand years of history.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Harbor Cruise:</strong> Experience Aarhus from the water on a scenic boat tour, where you'll glide past the historic customs building, the vibrant Aarhus Ø district, and the bustling marina. Enjoy stunning views of the city's architectural marvels, blending history and modernity.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Aarhus Cathedral &amp; Latin Quarter:</strong> Admire the majestic Aarhus Cathedral before a stroll through the delightful Latin Quarter, known for its colorful houses, and quaint cafes.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Boat cruise through Aarhus harbor.</li>\n\t<li>Guided walking tour of the city’s top historical landmarks.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/893005-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM1Njh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0psTDJoa1pTODVNRFl6TnpNd01qUTVOelU0THpnNU16QXdOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiYzgyY2RiZWQ5ZDQzMjc3ZTFlNzBmZjQxYmE2NzFiN2NlN2E3ZWU2YzY5NjkyMWIzMjM1NGMyZmU4YzQ3MmQ0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
