    {'code': '308016', 'port_slug': 'acapulco', 'title': "Captain's Choice Snorkel Adventure with Open Bar", 'slug': 'captain-s-choice-snorkel-adventure-with-open-bar-308016', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Cruise in Paradise:</strong> Set sail across the sparkling waters of Acapulco Bay aboard a comfortable vessel, cruising toward the day’s top snorkeling spot.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Snorkeling Adventure:</strong> Dive into a vibrant underwater world filled with colorful tropical fish and coral reefs. Explore at your own pace and soak in the beauty beneath the surface.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Scenic Bay Cruise:</strong> Relax as you glide past Acapulco’s stunning coastline, lined with luxurious villas, lush hills, and golden beaches—perfect for unforgettable photo ops.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Open Bar &amp; Relaxation:</strong> After your aquatic adventure, unwind on deck with unlimited Mexican beer and refreshing soft drinks. With sunshine, sea breezes, and great company, this is paradise at its finest.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Open bar consisting of Mexican beers &amp; sodas.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/308016-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTk4MjN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJqTDJoalppODVNVEkyT1RZMU1UZ3lORGswTHpNd09EQXhOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4ZDMwZmIyNzZkOGFjMTk1YTc5ZjZjNzRlZGNlZjVjNWU4ZDgzZTZjZDMzZjcyMzJhNDgxMDMyZDdlNmM3M2Y1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '308059', 'port_slug': 'acapulco', 'title': 'Tehuacalco: Sacred Place of the Yope Tribe', 'slug': 'tehuacalco-sacred-place-of-the-yope-tribe-308059', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Sacred Spaces:</strong> Discover Tehuacalco, the first excavated site of the Yope people. Walk among ancient pyramids, temples, and a Mesoamerican ball court built with quake resistant stonework. Your guide will highlight petroglyphs carved into the rocks and share the meanings of the site from Nahuatl. Learn why it is known as the place of the stone box, house of the priests, or house of sacred water.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>One snack per person: croissant with ham and cheese.</li>\n\t<li>One drink per person: water or soda.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/308059-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTI3MDJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFpsTDJnellpODVNVE16TVRZNE1qWXpNVGs0THpNd09EQTFPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjY2NjMjM2YWU5ZjAzYzdkOTQ0NGVmMmE3Y2Y2NDdlNmM1MTczZjE0ZDRjNDc2MTE5MWUyMTY5ZmI1ZDllMmIz', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '308052', 'port_slug': 'acapulco', 'title': 'Acapulco Edition: City, Cliff Divers & Shopping', 'slug': 'acapulco-edition-city-cliff-divers--shopping-308052', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Acapulco City Edition &amp; Gifts:</strong> Browse local shops for handcrafted souvenirs and jewelry, then cruise along the vibrant Costera Miguel Alemán Avenue. Enjoy sweeping views of Acapulco before heading to the city’s historic district, passing the nautical zone and Caleta Beach.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Panoramic Viewpoint:</strong> Take in breathtaking vistas of Acapulco and Puerto Marques from a scenic overlook that showcases the region’s natural beauty.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Nautical Acapulco &amp; Flamingos Hotel Walk:</strong> Travel through the old town and nautical district to the iconic Los Flamingos Hotel. Sip a refreshing drink and step back in time at the former home of “Tarzan” star Johnny Weissmuller.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Fort of San Diego:</strong> Step into Acapulco’s star-shaped fortress, built to defend against pirates and protect Spanish treasures. Now a museum, it features 12 immersive exhibits on the city’s dramatic past, including tales of piracy, revolution, and Pacific trade. Outside, enjoy stunning views of Acapulco Bay.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Acapulco's World-Famous Cliff Divers:</strong> After exploring this untouched island paradise, return to the pier for a front-row view of Acapulco’s legendary cliff divers. Since 1934, these elite athletes have wowed crowds with daring headfirst dives from towering cliffs into a narrow, churning inlet—a Guinness World Record-honored tradition.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>One drink (soda or beer) at Flamingos hotel per person.</li>\n\t<li>Fort entrance fee.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/308052-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDEzMTZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1EyTDJoak1DODVNVE14T1RNNE1qVXdOemd5THpNd09EQTFNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1NzY3NTdmYjIyMzkyNmVkYTk2NmU1OWIzOTQyNjU5M2UzMmRiZDY3OGRkYzlhZmQ1YmIwMzdkMjNmMTE1ZGQ4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '308054', 'port_slug': 'acapulco', 'title': 'Pierre Mundo Imperial Beach Resort & Buffet Lunch', 'slug': 'pierre-mundo-imperial-beach-resort--buffet-lunch-308054', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Panoramic Viewpoint:</strong> Stop by Las Brisas residential area for a panoramic view of Acapulco.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Pierre Mundo Imperial:</strong> Built in 1957 by American philanthropist J. Paul Getty as a personal retreat, this hotel features timeless Mexican architecture, lush gardens, and magnificent uninterrupted views of the Pacific Ocean to create a relaxing hideaway for beach lovers. A testament to a superior experience and service levels, the hotel has been named the recipient of the prestigious AAA Four Diamond Recognition. Amenities offer a fitness center, spa, tennis court and a large outdoor pool with a waterfall. Enjoy a delicious lunch and variety of exotic cocktails while you overlook the dazzling blue waters of the Pacific Ocean.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Beach towels.</li>\n\t<li>Buffet lunch: Rotating selection of daily dishes including soup du jour, chicken, fish and beef paired with different side options like beans, rice, potatoes, vegetables and desserts.</li>\n\t<li>Two domestic drinks per person.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/308054-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY5NTB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR05pTDJneE5pODVNVEkyT1RZNE5Ea3lNRFl5THpNd09EQTFOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlNzA4YmVlZTFiYjdmMzVjYjgzYmRiMjQ0MWEyMWRhOTQ4ZThkMDdjZTVhNmFmZjBjNDFhYTU2YjM1OTJhNDQy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '308051', 'port_slug': 'acapulco', 'title': 'Save Baby Turtles & The Acapulco Drop', 'slug': 'save-baby-turtles--the-acapulco-drop-308051', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Hands-On Turtle Release:</strong> Visit the Sea Turtle Rescue Center, where dedicated conservationists protect endangered gGolfina sea turtles. Learn about their journey from rescue to hatch, then take part in a heartwarming moment—naming and releasing a baby turtle into the ocean to help boost its chances of survival.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Scenic Coastal Drive:</strong> Enjoy a relaxing ride along Acapulco’s stunning coastline. Your guide will highlight city landmarks as you take in sweeping views of golden beaches, mountain backdrops, and the sparkling Pacific.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Exclusive Eco-Experience:</strong> Witness the inspiring work being done to save these gentle creatures and connect with nature in a meaningful way. This hands-on experience lets you contribute to one of Acapulco’s most impactful conservation efforts.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Mexican Lunch: guacamole, chicken tacos (deep fried), chips and green salsa.</li>\n\t<li>Drinks: peppermint and pineapple water.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/308051-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDA3MzB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFJqTDJnMU55ODVNVEkyT1RZM016RXlOREUwTHpNd09EQTFNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhNTViZmZhMjA0Nzc3OWZkZjVjMGRiNGMyZTJjMGRhYWNkZDhhMTA1MTc0M2IyMDZiZDFlZDBjOGNiMmE0NjVh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
