    {'code': '794016', 'port_slug': 'alicante', 'title': 'Cheese Making & Vermouth Tasting', 'slug': 'cheese-making--vermouth-tasting-794016', 'price': 149.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Cheese Lovers Workshop:</strong> Join acclaimed cheesemaker Chelo Martinez, a Best Cheese Board finalist, for a hands-on workshop celebrating Alicante’s cheese-making traditions. Learn to craft traditional Napkin Cheese and cottage cheese using techniques inspired by a treasured family recipe passed down from his grandmother, then enjoy tastings of local Fondillón wine and vermouth.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/794016-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTcwOTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFZrTDJoaE55ODVOamM1TXpnNE9EQXpNVEF5THpjNU5EQXhOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmMmY4Y2IzNTkwM2E0ZDMxMjAxMDNiN2M2MzNmNzdiM2M2OWYzYjY0Mjc4OGU1ZWZlOWNiMzIwMzMyNzAwOTE4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '794017', 'port_slug': 'alicante', 'title': 'Uncover Tabarca Island', 'slug': 'uncover-tabarca-island-794017', 'price': 124.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/794017-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjA0OTB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFF3TDJobVppODVOamM1TXpnNU16WXdNVFU0THpjNU5EQXhOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwNTRhZTJhYzhhYjVmODJmYmE1MzFiYmNmOThkZDViMzFiM2E1ODJiNDc2ZTJiZTI0M2Q2ZTZmNjY0NjRhMzI0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '445048', 'port_slug': 'amber-cove', 'title': 'Deluxe Catamaran Sail & Snorkel w/Lunch & Drinks', 'slug': 'deluxe-catamaran-sail--snorkel-w-lunch--drinks-445048', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.7, 'review_count': 19, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Sailing Catamaran:</strong> Embark on an unforgettable high-seas adventure aboard a luxurious catamaran, where you'll be treated to a fun-filled experience and breathtaking views of this beautiful tropical paradise as you sail along its stunning North Coast.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Snorkeling:</strong> Dive into the crystal-clear waters of Sosua on a guided snorkeling tour, where you'll be surrounded by flourishing marine ecosystems and an array of tropical fish in every hue imaginable. Treat yourself to a satisfying light lunch and sip on fruity Caribbean cocktails from the open bar as you unwind and soak up the beauty of this snorkeling haven.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Snorkel gear and floating vest.</li>\n\t<li>Lunch and Caribbean open bar.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Freestyle-30-of-32.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNDY5Mjl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaG1OeTlvWTJRdk9EZ3hOREE1T1RBek9ESXpPQzVxY0djfDA0ZTE4MDExMmQyNDNhODMwNzQ4NDEzYzU0YmQ1YmYxYTE5ZDEyZjMxYTkxYmQ2ZGI1OWU3NjFkYzA3OTYwZGE', 'duration': '5.0 Hours', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': '8'},
    {'code': '445015', 'port_slug': 'amber-cove', 'title': 'Coconut Cove: All Inclusive Cliffside Beach Oasis', 'slug': 'coconut-cove-all-inclusive-cliffside-beach-oasis-445015', 'price': 98.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 22, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>All-Inclusive Beach Break:</strong> Treat yourself to a leisurely day at a tropical beachside oasis. See the countryside on your 45-minute off-road journey to Coconut Cove. Explore the grounds or simply soak your feet in the ocean. Feeling adventurous? Go snorkeling! Feast on an authentic Dominican buffet and enjoy island cocktails from the Caribbean open bar.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Watersports Fun:</strong> Enjoy a variety of thrilling activities, including paddleboarding, kayaking, and snorkeling in the vibrant Caribbean Sea, weather permitting.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Beach chairs and umbrellas.</li>\n\t<li>Lunch: authentic Dominican buffet including a salad bar, rice, beans, chicken, fish, pasta and seasonal fruits.</li>\n\t<li>Open bar with seasonal local beer and a selection of tropical cocktails.</li>\n\t<li>30 minutes of watersports: kayaks, paddle board and snorkeling (weather dependent).</li>\n\t<li>Beach games and entertainment.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/445015-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODM4Njh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFJrTDJnd055ODVNRFF5T0Rrek56azVORFUwTHpRME5UQXhOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w5YzMxYmU2NWUzY2Q1NmExMmExZWU0ZmVhZWFkZThkYzk0MzlmZmYyMDhmZWNhNzVjYmIxNmY5MTM1OWNlYWE0', 'duration': '4.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '445037', 'port_slug': 'amber-cove', 'title': 'Dolphin Swim & Ocean World Day Pass', 'slug': 'dolphin-swim--ocean-world-day-pass-445037', 'price': 169.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Dolphin Swim:</strong> Delight in an experience of a lifetime, feeding, dancing and playing with dolphins. Enjoy the thrill of a boogie-board ride through the lagoon with your new dolphin friend.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Ocean World Day Pass:</strong> Featuring one of the largest man-made dolphin lagoons in the world, Ocean World Adventure Park is a must-see attraction in Amber Cove. During your free time, take in the dolphin, sea lion, shark and tropical bird exhibit that is sure to educate and entertain the family. Stroll through the fascinating bird aviary and see the love bird sanctuary or go snorkeling in the Tropical Reef Aquarium. Cool off from the tropical heat at the Pirate’s Pool or just swim and relax in the calm waters of the Dolphin Beach Lagoon. Guests can enjoy Dominican chocolate and coffee tasting, and woodcarving and cigar rolling displays any time at their leisure.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Access to Pirate’s Pool and Dolphin Beach Lagoon.</li>\n\t<li>Small group dolphin swim program.</li>\n\t<li>All park exhibits (time permitting).</li>\n\t<li>Snorkel gear.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/445037-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDcyNTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGRrTDJnMVppODRPVGM1TmpRMk9EQTRNRGswTHpRME5UQXpOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkZWYxNTk0M2NhNzM4MTg1NzBhYTNlNTkwMjU5YWZiZGIwOWRhYzA1NGY2NWM4Njg2NjY5NTExMTRhOTA1OTQy', 'duration': '5.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': '6'},
    {'code': '445108', 'port_slug': 'amber-cove', 'title': 'Waterfalls Of Damajagua - Adrenaline Adventure', 'slug': 'waterfalls-of-damajagua--adrenaline-adventure-445108', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 20, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Hiking Adventure:</strong> Arrive at Damajagua Park and gear up for adventure with a lifejacket and helmet before hiking 40 minutes through a stunning rainforest. Marvel at unique Caribbean flora and fauna while journeying to magnificent waterfalls.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Waterfall Experience:</strong> Discover the thrill of the Damajagua Waterfalls, where you can slide, jump, and swim through a series of cascading falls, and natural rock slides. Experience the refreshing mountain pools and narrow canyons carved over centuries in this unforgettable playground.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Bottle of water.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/445108-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTkyMTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1JsTDJnek5pODVNREUxT1RRNU56VTBNems0THpRME5URXdPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmODVkNWMyMjg2MDIxM2JmNTdmZmIyNWU4YzQzNThlNjkxMTAwMWFjMWVhYzE2N2ViYTliYTkxOTIyNDJkNTRi', 'duration': '4.0 Hours', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': '8'},
    {'code': '445139', 'port_slug': 'amber-cove', 'title': 'Mega Truck Country Ride & Culture with Lunch', 'slug': 'mega-truck-country-ride--culture-with-lunch-445139', 'price': 93.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.7, 'review_count': 71, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Mega Truck Adventure:</strong> Get a full picture of Dominican life, history, culture, and folklore on this tour of Puerto Plata. The landmarks of Puerto Plata are on display as you drive along the Malecon (waterfront). You will also pass the San Felipe Cathedral and Independence Square. Let your guide show you the hidden treasures of the countryside as you drive off rode thru hills, streams, sugarcane fields and local villages. Visit a local school and typical Dominican home.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Dominican Culture &amp; Tasting:</strong> At the ranch, a groomed pathway leads you through plantations of different kinds of local fruits, cacao, bananas, papaya and pineapple, as well as a variety of exotic flowers and plants. Enjoy a tasty Dominican homemade lunch and organic cocoa.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Authentic Dominican lunch.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/445139-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM4MDh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3pNUzlvWXpBdk9EZzFOVGt3TXpRd05EQTJNaTVxY0djfDQ4YzA3MjdkNjJhNjdjNDViNDE4MjliMzlmODUyZGQwMGZhNjVkNjY3ZTNhNmJlMDkwNTU4MzA3ZDc4ZjIwMWM', 'duration': '5.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '6'},
