    {'code': '445105', 'port_slug': 'amber-cove', 'title': 'VIP Dolphin Swim Adventure at Ocean World', 'slug': 'vip-dolphin-swim-adventure-at-ocean-world-445105', 'price': 209.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 15, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/445105-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY4ODV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJtTDJneFlpODRPVGM1TmpRMU16TXpOVE0wTHpRME5URXdOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0MmYzZjUwNDQzNTUxMDA2OGZmY2I5ZGM4MDVkZjkxYTBmOGY0ZTZmOTg4MjI4YmM3OGNlYjIyMDY5ZTAyZjc0', 'duration': '5.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': '6'},
    {'code': '800003', 'port_slug': 'amsterdam', 'title': 'Windmills & Edam', 'slug': 'windmills--edam-800003', 'price': 154.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Dutch Countryside:</strong> Embark on a scenic coach ride through the Dutch countryside to Zaandam, where you’ll discover the enchanting Zaanse Schans, an open-air museum carefully designed to replicate the Zaan community of the 18th and 19th centuries. Join your guide and immerse yourself in the authentic atmosphere of this faithfully re-created Dutch town, with its authentic wooden houses and windmills. Wander through its cobbled streets and witness skilled artisans keeping the traditions of the past alive. Enjoy some time on your own where you can take the opportunity to witness clog-making at a traditional wooden shoe factory and browse the market for local produce and unique keepsakes.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Edam Walking Tour:</strong> Journey through the lush lowlands to Edam, a peaceful 17th-century town celebrated for its renowned Edam cheese. Engage in an enlightening walking tour that showcases the town's tranquil ambiance, with its scenic canals, rustic drawbridges, and charming homes adorned with blooming flower gardens.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/800003-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU5OTh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1F4TDJnM1pTODVNREkwTmpjNE1UQXhNREl5THpnd01EQXdNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjNzFhNmQwNzQzNmYzNjBhMGMyNjVmM2YwYjczNWQ0ZmYwNDc0MGI2ZTc1Mjk4YzM3ZDFmMDkyMDhjM2E4MDNk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '800005', 'port_slug': 'amsterdam', 'title': 'Volendam & Marken:Traditional Dutch Fishing Towns', 'slug': 'volendam--marken-traditional-dutch-fishing-towns-800005', 'price': 134.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Marken:</strong> Journey to Marken, a charming fishing village on the former Zuider Zee. Wander through its charming streets, admire the well-preserved green-and-white clapboard houses, and be captivated by locals dressed in traditional attire, transporting you to another era.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Volendam:</strong> Immerse yourself in the historic beauty of Volendam on a guided tour, where you'll encounter quaint canals, drawbridges, and a delightful harbor boasting traditional Dutch boats. Enjoy some free time to explore boutique shops filled with delightful Dutch treats and souvenirs. Complete your visit with a stop at a local cheese farm for a sampling of delicious produce before returning to your ship.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/800005-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQzNzN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0poTDJobE55ODVNREkwTmpjM01UZ3pOVEU0THpnd01EQXdOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2NjMzOGNmN2I2NzBlYzA2NTQ1ZWJhODkxNjAzMjljYTg4OWJkZmM1OGY1ZDZlYmVhMzgxNjUzMWYyNTU2MTIx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '800023', 'port_slug': 'amsterdam', 'title': 'Haarlem: Capital of North Holland', 'slug': 'haarlem-capital-of-north-holland-800023', 'price': 134.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Haarlem Highlights:</strong> Step back in time and discover the industrial and artistic heritage of Haarlem on a guided city walk. Wander along charming streets lined with picturesque crow-stepped gable houses, lush gardens, and beautiful churches. Learn about Haarlem's importance in Early Modern Times, particularly in the textile and artistic sectors. Explore the market square with its impressive town hall and venture inside the UNESCO World Heritage, St. Bavo Church, where you’ll witness one of the world's largest organs and stunning stained-glass windows. End the tour with some free time in the center of Haarlem before returning to Amsterdam.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/800023-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTk1NzB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1E0TDJobFlTODVNREkwTmpZME5EWTVOVE0wTHpnd01EQXlNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w5MDBkMjM0NWQ2MDhkMGYyMzA2NTVkMWFhYjBmNzljYWM1ZDI3MmY3OWI4MTBiYjk0MTc4MDgzZDk2OGI1M2Ex', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '800024', 'port_slug': 'amsterdam', 'title': 'Windmills & Waterways: A Dutch Biking Adventure', 'slug': 'windmills--waterways-a-dutch-biking-adventure-800024', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Windmills &amp; Waterways:</strong> Begin your journey with a short bike ride to the ferry and enjoy the scenic views during the water transfer. Venture into the captivating Waterland area on a biking tour, passing by iconic Dutch windmills and pausing for a memorable photo stop. Take a short break for a refreshing drink at a local café and treat yourself to some Dutch delicacies, before concluding your adventure with a serene ferry ride back and a short bike ride to the starting point.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/800024-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTkzMjV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGhtTDJnM01DODVNREkwTmpZMU9URXhNekkyTHpnd01EQXlOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzZjU4ZWRhNmVjZWJmZTVmODc3OWU4ZjY1ZjYxY2Q3YjExZGJkOWEyYmM2OWFkMGFhNzhmMTZiNzBjY2VjZWVl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '800026', 'port_slug': 'amsterdam', 'title': 'City Walk & Cheese and Wine Tasting', 'slug': 'city-walk--cheese-and-wine-tasting-800026', 'price': 179.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>City Walk:</strong> Following a short transfer into the city center, explore the lively streets of Amsterdam on a guided walking tour in the city center. Experience the colorful floating flower market, wander through the tranquil beguinage, and admire the regal Royal Palace at Dam Square.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cheese &amp; Wine Tasting:&nbsp;</strong>Discover Indulge in a sensory journey of Dutch cheeses and wines. Delight in the flavors of five exquisite cheeses alongside perfectly paired wines, all while discovering the art and history of cheese making. Complete your half-day tour with a short walk back to your ship.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/800026-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTMzMTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFZsTDJnd1pDODVNREkwTmpZMk56TXdOVEkyTHpnd01EQXlOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1NmVlMTExNGU0MzgyMWRkYmJlMTNiZGVmOGU4MTZhZWUwZTFiZWE1MzVlYTAwNjkwMGFjZTI5ZTlhZmU0YjEy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
