    {'code': '800021', 'port_slug': 'amsterdam', 'title': 'Panoramic Surroundings of Amsterdam', 'slug': 'panoramic-surroundings-of-amsterdam-800021', 'price': 124.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/800021-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTIzMzB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREpsTDJnMU1pODVNREkwTmpZeU9USTVORE00THpnd01EQXlNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzMDI1YTgyOWZlYjQ5ZTY4NmMyMWE1MWM5NDc2NDE2M2VjYTc2ODI1NThmMWJjMDA3NzJiNWQxOGZjZGFhMDM5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '800025', 'port_slug': 'amsterdam', 'title': 'Amsterdam Sightseeing & Canal Cruise', 'slug': 'amsterdam-sightseeing--canal-cruise-800025', 'price': 179.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.7, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/800025-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjExNTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGsxTDJneFlTODVNREkwTmpZMk16Y3dNRGM0THpnd01EQXlOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wxOTQxZTYzNDNhNjczOGJkYjBhNjVkZjk4NWUxYWFjNDYxZGYwMTdhNjY2MTViM2JmMzI2MDg2NzcwZGNmNWU5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '411010', 'port_slug': 'antigua', 'title': 'Stingray Sensation', 'slug': 'stingray-sensation-411010', 'price': 94.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.6, 'review_count': 50, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Stingray Village:</strong> Experience the thrill of swimming with graceful stingrays at Antigua’s Stingray Village. Your adventure begins with a scenic bus ride through the island's picturesque countryside, followed by a boat transfer to the captivating sandbar. You'll have the opportunity to feed and interact with these friendly creatures in shallow waters. After your unforgettable encounter, head back to land and enjoy a refreshing rum or fruit punch before returning to your ship.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-stingray-sensation-antigua-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNzI3OTZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGtaUzlvWkRndk9EZ3hNemt3Tnpnd05ERTVNQzVxY0djfDk4NWNiYzI1NGEzZGE0MWI5ZTk5ODU2YWYwMjJkYWQ1YTMxNDBhYjYwMWYzYTM0MGY1MjJhMTNmMjY3MmIwYTk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '411057', 'port_slug': 'antigua', 'title': 'Antigua by Land & Sea with Lunch & Open Bar', 'slug': 'antigua-by-land--sea-with-lunch--open-bar-411057', 'price': 184.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Island Exploration:</strong> Explore Antigua on both land and sea, the optimal way to discover the island. Enjoy three captivating land stops, beginning in the charming northern capital, St. John's. Journey through the heart of Antigua's tropical countryside, immersing yourself in the picturesque village life and serene rolling hills. Lastly, delve into the historical southern English Harbour, featuring the renowned Nelson’s Dockyard and the panoramic Shirley Heights Lookout.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Coastal Sailing Adventure:</strong> Next, journey via Fig Tree Drive, exploring Antigua's vibrant rainforest along the southern coast, where a sailing catamaran awaits. Sail along the magnificent Antiguan coastline from Jolly Harbour to St. John’s. Embark on a guided tour led by an experienced guide, hugging the coastline to witness landmarks such as Darkwood Beach, Turner’s Beach, Ffryes Beach, Jolly Harbour, numerous secluded beaches, 5-star hotels, and exclusive residences.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Delicious lunch.</li>\n\t<li>Open bar.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/411057-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTMxMTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE0wTDJoak5DODVNREk0TmpFNU56azJOVEV3THpReE1UQTFOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhNGE5Njk1NmEwNzBiYmJiZjYxMGYxNDg0YWE0NDBiMTViYTY3NTJjMzJhMThkMGZkNjU3ZjY1MDYxMjU0Mjc1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '411052', 'port_slug': 'antigua', 'title': "Devil's Bridge National Park & Long Bay Beach", 'slug': 'devil-s-bridge-national-park--long-bay-beach-411052', 'price': 102.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.2, 'review_count': 10, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Scenic Island Drive:</strong> Enjoy a picturesque drive to beautiful Long Bay Beach, located approximately 9 miles from St. John's, the capital of Antigua. Your journey will take you within the city center and the eastern countryside, riding past St. John's Cathedral, The Antigua Recreation Grounds, the ruins of the Sugar Factory and the Sir Vivian Richards Cricket Stadium.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Devil’s Bridge:</strong> Stop at Devil's Bridge to see this natural limestone arch formed by the powerful swell of the Atlantic breakers on the rocks.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Long Bay Beach:</strong> Afterwards, relax and enjoy the sun, sand, and swimming at Long Bay, one of Antigua's 365 white sand beaches. Enjoy a complimentary drink, beach chair rental, and umbrella rental that are provided for you at the beach.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>One complimentary drink.</li>\n\t<li>Beach chair and umbrella rental.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-devilsbridge.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMDk0MTJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJaQzlvTVRRdk9EZ3hNemt4TXpBME56QTNNQzVxY0djfDZmMDcyZTA3ODIyYmZhYTMyNGRiOGE5MDU2YzU4YWI0YWVhYTc4ZjQ5NWU1MTUwZmNjODdjNDU4ZTU3MjU0OTg', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '411022', 'port_slug': 'antigua', 'title': 'Best of Antigua', 'slug': 'best-of-antigua-411022', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic Island Drive:</strong> Discover Antigua’s colonial history on a scenic drive aboard an air-conditioned motor coach. See the remnants of old sugar mills set in green rolling hills and learn about the island’s natural harbors. Antigua served as the naval base for the British Royal Navy in the Caribbean long ago.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Block House:</strong> Your first photo stop will be at the Block House. Standing 400 ft. atop sheer cliffs, this overlooks the mighty Atlantic Ocean.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Shirley Heights Lookout:</strong> Move on to the Shirley Heights Lookout, the southernmost point in Antigua that was also the principal fortification of the British fleet stationed at English Harbor.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Nelson’s Dockyard:</strong> Make your final stop at Nelson’s Dockyard, one of the biggest attractions in the eastern Caribbean, and the world’s last remaining Georgian naval dockyard still in use today. Enjoy a short walking tour to explore the Admiral’s Inn Museum, mystery pillars, bakery and the sleek yachts tied to the old stone quay side. A complimentary beverage will be offered at an 18th century Inn.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Entrance fee to each location.</li>\n\t<li>Complimentary drink: water, fruit juice, or rum punch.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/Best-of-Antigua-HERO-.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNDM2OTh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR05rTDJneE5pODRPVFV4TURFek16UXpNall5TDBKbGMzUWdiMllnUVc1MGFXZDFZU0FvU0VWU1R5a3VTbEJIfGI4ODVjYzYzZDdhMmRmOTg4YjE3NDNiYzcwNDMwMDhhODFhOTRkODU2N2MzZGJlYzNlZDdjNGUwNWViNGM0NDI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '411023', 'port_slug': 'antigua', 'title': 'Green Island Catamaran Escape: Open Bar & Lunch', 'slug': 'green-island-catamaran-escape-open-bar--lunch-411023', 'price': 147.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 83, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Catamaran Sail:</strong> Circumnavigate Antigua’s magnificent coastline aboard a state-of-the-art powered catamaran and be whisked away to an offshore Island. Experienced guides will welcome you aboard the Excellence, a powered catamaran, and make your day unforgettable. Glide by the coastline and sit back and relax while listening to the rhythmic sounds of calypso and reggae music as you pass by Jumby Bay, Bird Island and the natural spectacle of Devil's Bridge.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Green Island:</strong> Come to a stop at a secluded cove on Green Island for approximately 2.5 hours of relaxation on the beach or exploration of the natural reef. Enjoy an open bar and lunch served by your friendly crew before reboarding your catamaran. Enjoy spectacular views of sparkling beaches and pristine bays as you pass Antigua's western coast on your journey back to the pier.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Lunch.</li>\n\t<li>Drinks.</li>\n\t<li>Snorkel Gear.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-see-antigua-by-sea-antigua-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxOTAzODN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGtNUzlvTXpBdk9EZ3hNemt3T1RJM09EYzFNQzVxY0djfGYwN2JhZGY5NjFiZTc4NDViYjYxYzYxNGMxYzY5NGJkZWI2ZDdiNTY1YmVhMzI2ZjkzNWI0NTc1N2JiZmJiNmQ', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
