    {'code': '413087', 'port_slug': 'barbados', 'title': 'Discover Barbados: Island Explorer Tour', 'slug': 'discover-barbados-island-explorer-tour-413087', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Tropical Flower Garden:</strong> Explore the Tropical Flower Garden, nestled on six acres amidst Barbados' countryside, surrounded by sugarcane fields. At 810 ft. elevation, catch panoramic views from multiple spots. It's a perfect haven for showcasing a variety of lush tropical plants.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Gun Hill Signal Station:</strong> At Gun Hill, the signal station was restored and landscaped by the Barbados National Trust. It is now a spot for military relics and offers a stunning island panorama.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sunbury Plantation:</strong> Step into history at this grand plantation house. Marvel at mahogany antiques, vintage prints, and a unique assortment of horse-drawn carriages. Explore every room – it's the only great house with this privilege.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What's Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Complimentary rum punch or fruit punch.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-best-of-barbados-4.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0MDY2Mjd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3dZeTlvTjJRdk9EZ3hNemt5TlRNd01qTXdNaTVxY0djfDE3ZjAzMjkxYTFiMjAzOTI2NzdlMWI4ZTI0OWRlMmVhMTI5ZjFjOWQ0NWY5ODI3NTAzMGJkZjQzNDNmZjA2YjM', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '413068', 'port_slug': 'barbados', 'title': 'Catamaran Tiami Turtles Snorkel, Beach & Open Bar', 'slug': 'catamaran-tiami-turtles-snorkel-beach--open-bar-413068', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Catamaran Sail:</strong> Embark on a catamaran cruise for a unique marine encounter plus time on a beautiful Barbados beach. Enjoy island hospitality on board with the attentive crew who create a friendly ambience and serve complimentary cocktails as you bask in the sun or chill out in the shade.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Turtle Encounter:</strong> In the sheltered waters of Carlisle Bay, snorkel and swim alongside sea turtles in their natural habitat.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Beach:</strong> Swim towards the white sands of a beach.</p>\n<p><br />\n<strong>What's Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Open bar – rum punch, rum mixes, vodka mixes, local beer, soft drinks, fruit juices and bottled water.</li>\n\t<li>Snorkel gear.</li>\n\t<li>Safety gear.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-tiami-sail-turtles-and-beach-413068-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMTk2MTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNOUzlvT0dNdk9EZ3hNemt5TWpRNE5ESTFOQzVxY0djfDcwMjk0NzgzNmY5YWIzZTJmZWYwODgzOGI4YTdjODc3ZDU0M2QxNTBhZTY0YThiNmFkNzRkNmY0YTJlNWIwNjA', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '413094', 'port_slug': 'barbados', 'title': 'Railway, St Nicholas Abbey & Rum Tasting', 'slug': 'railway-st-nicholas-abbey--rum-tasting-413094', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>History &amp; Rum:</strong> Explore the 17th-century St. Nicholas Abbey, one of the finest Jacobean mansions in the Western Hemisphere. Discover its rich history and meticulous restoration while touring its beautifully preserved rooms. Enjoy a brief overview of Barbados' rum-making legacy, capped off with a tasting of the renowned St. Nicholas Abbey rums.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Steam Train Adventure:</strong> Hop aboard the St. Nicholas Abbey Heritage Railway for an exciting steam locomotive adventure! Travel through enchanting mahogany woods and lush plantation fields, ending with panoramic views of the island's east coast from Cherry Tree Hill.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Morgan Lewis Mill:</strong> As the tour concludes, enjoy a beautiful drive along Cherry Tree Hill toward Barbados's rugged East Coast. Stop for photos at Morgan Lewis Mill, the last working windmill in Barbados.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-st-nicholas-abbey-rum-tasting-and-railway-413094-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODYyOTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzROQzlvWkdRdk9EZ3hNemt5TmpNeE9ERXhNQzVxY0djfDE1N2RkN2NmMzU3NmMwN2I5NThkNWE1MmE5NmRlOTFmM2FhNWM3NTVlNGYzYThlMjIwZjZiYjllMjU0Y2NiOGU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '413067', 'port_slug': 'barbados', 'title': 'All Inclusive 5 Star Catamaran: Turtles & Wrecks', 'slug': 'all-inclusive-5-star-catamaran-turtles--wrecks-413067', 'price': 134.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Catamaran Adventure:</strong> Experience a fun day on the water aboard a catamaran and the friendly crew. Sail along Barbados' stunning coastline to a cozy bay, where you can swim, snorkel, and join a guided snorkel and swim near a variety of marine life in their natural habitat.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Turtle Snorkel:</strong> The marine park at Carlisle Bay is a favorite spot for snorkeling. There are six shipwrecks in the bay, which attract an abundance of marine life such as tropical fish, rays, eels, and sea turtles. Barbados is home to a healthy population of hawksbill and leatherback turtles.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Lunch:</strong> Delight in a buffet lunch featuring local fare.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What's Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Buffet lunch – roasted chicken, grilled fish, macaroni pie, rice, seasonal salads and cake.</li>\n\t<li>Open bar – rum punch, rum mixes, vodka mixes, gin, wine, local beer, soft drinks, fruit juices and bottled water.</li>\n\t<li>Snorkel gear.</li>\n\t<li>Safety gear.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/413067-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDIwNTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREpoTDJoa1lpODRPVGd4TVRVeE1qVXlOVEV3THpReE16QTJOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wxMTdkYmUzN2Y5MDE3ZmYxYTA1NDZmNTliYzJkMzViNDhiNjI4MzllYTk0MTY3MGE4MWU4NWY2Yzk4NTAzMTRj', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '413101', 'port_slug': 'barbados', 'title': "Harrison's Cave, Aviary & Rum Tasting", 'slug': 'harrison-s-cave-aviary--rum-tasting-413101', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Harrison’s Cave Tram Tour:</strong> Explore Harrison’s Cave by tram – one of Barbados’ greatest wonders! Descend into the depths of the cave aboard a glass-enclosed elevator. The adventure begins at the Cave Interpretation Center. Seated comfortably on a tram, enjoy the sights and sounds of this natural wonder while your guide shares interesting facts about its rich history. Have your camera ready to snap some phenomenal shots of stalactites, stalagmites, crystalline subterranean streams, and an awe-inspiring subterranean cascade, plunging into an emerald abyss.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Bird Aviary:</strong> After your tour of Harrison’s Cave, enjoy a guided tour of a nature trail, featuring a vast variety of flora. This trail then leads you to our bird aviary which is home to numerous species of birds such as the blue and gold macaws, peacocks and colorful sun conures just to name a few.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Rum Tasting:</strong> End your tour in the Mount Gay Rum Tasting Room. Sip and savor three of their varieties while learning about the rum’s history and heritage.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Guided tram ride through the caves.</li>\n\t<li>Guided tour of bird aviary.</li>\n\t<li>Access to the Mount Gay Rum History Museum.</li>\n\t<li>Rum tasting.</li>\n\t<li>Free time.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/413101-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDgwNTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGczTDJneE1TODRPVGd6TXpJME1UTXhNelU0THpReE16RXdNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3ZjUwMDVmZWIzZjI5OWVhZDg4MzgwNjdiZmQwZjRhMGU0MGRhZTM4YmI1ZDg0NzYxNTc0N2E2NjE3OTIzYmE5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
