    {'code': '509059', 'port_slug': 'belize', 'title': 'Private Crystal Cave Tubing & Zipline With Lunch', 'slug': 'private-crystal-cave-tubing--zipline-with-lunch-509059', 'price': 144.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.4, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Zipline Adventure:</strong> Embark on an exhilarating zip-line adventure that takes you soaring 700 feet above Mayan hunting grounds and an ancient ceremonial cave. With a short jungle trek and five traverses through the lush jungle, this is an adrenaline-pumping experience you won't want to miss.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cave Tubing:</strong> Immerse yourself in the ancient allure of the Maya's sacred crystal caves as you transition from harness to life vests and descend underground. Journey through the mystical caves on a tube, exploring sections on foot, and conclude your adventure with a refreshing dip in the enchanting underground lagoon.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Belizean Delights:</strong> Refuel your energy with a mouthwatering Belizean lunch upon completion and treat yourself to an array of refreshing drinks available for purchase to enhance your post-adventure relaxation.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/private-crystal-cave-tubing-zipline-with-lunch-509059-1A.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTc0Mzh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3lZUzlvT0Rjdk9EZ3pNemM1TnpBNU5UUTFOQzVxY0djfGMyMjQzNTc0YWFmNzQ4NDczZDg0Y2NhODViN2MwOWViZjI1ZGFmMmY1ZTJkMDBmZDU1ZDc3MmZkMTIwMjJkYTU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '509148', 'port_slug': 'belize', 'title': 'Scenic Wildlife River Cruise', 'slug': 'scenic-wildlife-river-cruise-509148', 'price': 81.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.7, 'review_count': 42, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic Boat Ride:</strong> Embark on a wildlife adventure where you will have a chance to observe manatees, dolphin, crocodiles, iguanas and many species of aquatic birds. Cast-off from the dock as your captain heads along the Belize city coastline on a short run to the Belize River. Your guide will help you keep a sharp look-out for crocodiles, manatees, iguanas and numerous species of colorful birds. Once wildlife is spotted, your captain will bring you as close as possible for photo opportunities. You&rsquo;ll also see tropical trees and flora and learn about some of the Belizean bush medicine remedies that were used by the Mayan people for centuries. You will also encounter a beautiful giant mangrove canopied waterway, making up the beautiful riverine forests of Belize. On the return journey, enjoy some beverages while you listen to rhythmic Caribbean vibes.<br /> <br /> <strong>What&rsquo;s Included:</strong></p> <ul> \t<li>Rum punch and fruit punch.</li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/509148-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTMzNzZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFZoTDJnNE1DODRPRGt3TVRReE1ERTJNRGswTHpVd09URTBPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlZDI1ZGU1NzBiZThlYjA1NTc4YWNlNzk0MDY0ODJkNzYyZGM2YWQyNWRjODYzYjgyN2RmY2RlYzc3NzQ5YjMw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '509096', 'port_slug': 'belize', 'title': 'Sharks, Rays, Barrier Reef Snorkel & Island Escape', 'slug': 'sharks-rays-barrier-reef-snorkel--island-escape-509096', 'price': 142.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.6, 'review_count': 112, 'desc_html': '<strong>Scenic Boat Ride:</strong> Your awe-inspiring excursion begins when you take a scenic boat ride along Belize barrier islands to beautiful, unspoiled Caye Caulker for your three-in-one adventure. <br /><br /> <strong>Snorkeling Adventure:</strong> Enjoy the rich, pristine waters, abundant marine life and coral formations during the snorkeling portion of the trip. Learn about the ecological importance of Belize barrier reef, a UNESCO World Heritage site. <br /><br /> <strong>Sharks & Rays:</strong> After snorkeling you\'ll proceed to Shark & Ray Alley where you will enter the water in small groups for an amazing experience of swimming with these gentle creatures. You can stand on the sandy bottom or float and just let these gentle creatures swim by you. <br /><br /> <strong>Relaxation Time:</strong> You can purchase lunch and exotic tropical drinks at The Lazy Lizard located at the world famous Split. While there, take advantage of the breathtaking views of the waves crashing over the reef, join a friendly game of volleyball or other beach games, or simply lounge on a rented beach chair while soaking up the tropical sun. <br /><br /> <strong>What’s Included:</strong> <ul>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Snorkeling gear.     </li>       <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         All entrance fees.     </li>    </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Shark-Rays-Barrier-Reef-Snorkel-Island-Escape-HERO.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0NDcxNDZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNNaTlvWVdZdk9EZ3hNemsxTVRBMU56azFNQzVxY0djfGU0OWYzZGU3ODU3MWZhYjY4N2YxZWU4OGZmNGU2NGMxMGFlNDJkZWVjZWZlOTI3NWJkMGQzOWNlNDhiNjBmMzU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '509094', 'port_slug': 'belize', 'title': 'Best of Belize', 'slug': 'best-of-belize-509094', 'price': 87.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.9, 'review_count': 7, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>City Tour:</strong> Exclusive half-day tour of the most popular Belize attractions. No line-ups as you take advantage of the VIP entrance to see and explore the highlights.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Enjoy a scenic drive through the city while your guide discusses local culture, history, and national landmarks.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>St. John’s Cathedral:</strong> Tour inside the oldest Anglican cathedral in Central America. Constructed with ballast bricks, this 200-year-old church has withstood every hurricane.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Belize Sign Monument:</strong> Visit our newest attraction on the Caribbean Sea which offers a fantastic photo opportunity.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Natural History Museum:</strong> Take a mini-train ride tour through the museum exhibits.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Landmarks:</strong> Governor’s Mansion, Baron Bliss Lighthouse and Tomb, Supreme Court House, Swing Bridge.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Natural History Museum entrance.</li>\n\t<li>Bottled water.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/509094-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTAwMTZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0V6TDJnd05TODRPVEE1T1RJeE5UVXdNelkyTHpVd09UQTVOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwY2IxMTBjMmMwNzI4NjQ1MTUyMDM2ZWRkNWU5Njg1Mjg3YzE2YWRlYWM3YTE4ODA4ZGMzZTliOGNhZjFiODRh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '509098', 'port_slug': 'belize', 'title': 'Lamanai: Majestic Ceremonial Ruins & River Cruise', 'slug': 'lamanai-majestic-ceremonial-ruins--river-cruise-509098', 'price': 125.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 67, 'desc_html': '<strong>Mayan Ruins:</strong> Explore these ancient Mayan ruins and climb to the top of one of the largest ceremonial temples in Mesoamerica, including more than 100 minor structures, a ball court and about 12 major buildings, most notably the Temple of the Mask. Pass through historic villages on the way to majestic temples, which were the original settlements of the colony of British Honduras. <br /><br /> <strong>Scenic River Cruise:</strong> Take a scenic boat ride on the New River Lagoon where you can see exotic flora and fauna. <br /><br /> <strong>Lunch:</strong> Enjoy a traditional local lunch made with flavorful local spices. <br /><br /> <strong>What’s Included:</strong> <ul>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Traditional Belizean lunch.     </li>       <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Archeological park fees.     </li>    </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Lamanai-Bird-view.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjQ1NjB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3dNeTlvWVdRdk9EZ3hNalUwT1RrMk16Z3dOaTVxY0djfDRmNTRlZjJkNzkxODExM2MzMWEzYjU0N2EwZDA3YzhlYWEwY2Y5NDBlMDFiM2Y5YmI2ZjZjNDYzYWRhMDg2ZDE', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
