    {'code': '830022', 'port_slug': 'cadiz-seville', 'title': 'Contryside Andalusia & Conil de la Frontera', 'slug': 'contryside-andalusia--conil-de-la-frontera-830022', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/830022-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTkyNTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREl3TDJnelppODRPVE0zTURZME9Ea3dNems0THpnek1EQXlNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3NmRkMzA5ZTg3MzA3ZDRmMmI4NWJhYTE3ZThmZTM2MDdmMjRlMDRlOWM3NjgxYmMzMWYwOTg4OGUwODE0YWM1&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '830021', 'port_slug': 'cadiz-seville', 'title': 'Flamenco and Traditional Spanish Meal', 'slug': 'flamenco-and-traditional-spanish-meal-830021', 'price': 134.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p>As you head out on your tour, watch for the Mudejar-style tobacco factory, built in 1741, which now serves as the Congress building. Your guide will also point out the Santo Domingo Church, the old Royal Prison in Andalusian neo-Classical style and the Roman Theater. Pass the ancient Phoenician port of La Caleta, Puertas de Tierra (the Old Walls) and the castle walls that once protected the town. Leave your motor coach at Plaza de España and walk to the Flamenco place, La Cava, for a stylish demonstration of typical Spanish dance. A traditional Spanish meal including tapas and drinks will be served as you watch the performance.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/830021-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDMxMzJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0k0TDJobU5pODRPVE0zTURjMU56WTVNemMwTHpnek1EQXlNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwYTI1OGEyNzBkNTJjM2YzYjA3MjY4NDg3OWEzNjQwMDllZTZiNDk0OGNjZjk0N2QxYzViODdkYTNmYTEyNTlk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '830020', 'port_slug': 'cadiz-seville', 'title': 'A Taste of Cadiz', 'slug': 'a-taste-of-cadiz-830020', 'price': 179.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/830020-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQxODN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREZoTDJnMFlTODRPVE0zTURZME5USTVPVFV3THpnek1EQXlNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwMmViMmRmN2I2OTAwOGZlNThiOTk1N2VkNzY1NTZhMDI5ZmQ4ZmU5NDA2ODlkOTU2MjdiZTc4MGQzNGFmOGIz&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '830018', 'port_slug': 'cadiz-seville', 'title': 'Panoramic Cadiz & Jerez with Sherry Tasting', 'slug': 'panoramic-cadiz--jerez-with-sherry-tasting-830018', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/830018-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNjk0NDd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE00TDJoaFpDODRPVE0zTURZek56RXdOelV3THpnek1EQXhPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjNTFkNTYyM2ZlNmMyODFjZDgyODUxMTIxZjE1NjdkNTAyZGFkNDFhMTdjNWE5NGQ0M2RkZTMzMzJiNTQzMjgx&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '830019', 'port_slug': 'cadiz-seville', 'title': 'White Villages & Countryside', 'slug': 'white-villages--countryside-830019', 'price': 124.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Begin your journey with a guided coach drive through Cadiz, where you'll take in the city's most important monuments and landmarks as your guide provides insightful commentary.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Independent Explorations:</strong> Arrive at the charming village of Vejer de la Frontera. Stroll through its hilly cobblestone streets, admire hidden patios, and observe typical houses. Take some free time to shop for souvenirs or sample local specialties at your own pace.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Atlantic Route:</strong> Travel along the scenic Atlantic Route, surrounded by breathtaking countryside views. Marvel at the La Brena Nature Park, with its protected pine forest and impressive cliff-top vistas rising up to 300 ft.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cape Trafalgar Lighthouse:</strong> Time and traffic permitting, make a stop for photos at Cape Trafalgar Lighthouse, the historical site of the Battle of Trafalgar in 1805, where Franco-Spanish forces clashed with the British led by Lord Horatio Nelson.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Conil de la Frontera:</strong> Explore the picturesque town of Conil de la Frontera, nestled between pine forests and the sea. Immerse yourself in its typical Andalusian charm, with narrow streets and whitewashed houses. Enjoy some free time to explore, relax on the beaches, or taste local delicacies like pescaito.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/830019-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM1MTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0UxTDJnMVlTODRPVE0zTURZME1EY3hNVGs0THpnek1EQXhPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3YjIyYTQ2YTgwZTM3NGNlZjFjNGJiOTU3ZjQ1NGYxYjk5YTkxOTUwZjI0ZDY3MDkxM2FkNDY2NDdhODU3ODg2', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '830017', 'port_slug': 'cadiz-seville', 'title': 'A Walk-through Cadiz & the Flamenco Dance', 'slug': 'a-walk-through-cadiz--the-flamenco-dance-830017', 'price': 159.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Travel by coach to the heart of Cadiz and enjoy glimpses of notable landmarks along the way, such as the Mudejar-style tobacco factory, built in 1741, which now serves as the Congress building, the Santo Domingo Church, the old Royal Prison, the Roman Theater, the ancient Phoenician port of La Caleta, and the historic castle walls that once protected the town.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cadiz Stroll:</strong> Disembark the coach at Plaza San Juan de Dios and embark on a walking tour visiting Plaza de la Mina, formerly a monk’s vegetable patch and the exterior of the Cadiz Museum. Stroll along Calle Ancha, where you can admire beautiful 19th-century palaces and the impressive cathedral. Step inside to see the eclectic blend of 13th-century Baroque style and neo-Classical architecture.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Art of Flamenco:</strong> Conclude your day at La Cava, a renowned Flamenco venue, where you can enjoy a lively demonstration of typical Spanish dance, accompanied by delicious tapas and drinks.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/830017-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDExODN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0ZqTDJobE1TODRPVE0zTURjMU1URTBNREUwTHpnek1EQXhOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0NDk2YzU5M2ZmYTQ5NTE5ZDJjNWU3ZDcyMjQzN2MzNTgxODRiN2IyODFlZGIxYjJkMGMwMWU0NDhkMDZkNmY0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '830025', 'port_slug': 'cadiz-seville', 'title': 'MEDINA & VEJER', 'slug': 'medina--vejer-830025', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Medina Sidonia:</strong> Explore the idyllic streets of Medina Sidonia on a guided walk, marveling at the cobblestone streets, white buildings, gothic church, and Moorish gate. Delight your taste buds in the pastry capital of Andalusia, where you can sample the exquisite artisan pastries that make this town famous.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Vejer de la Frontera:</strong> Uncover the rich history and beauty of Vejer de la Frontera on this guided exploration. Explore the national monument that offers a glimpse into Andalusian life during Islamic rule. Wander through the charming cobblestone streets, discover hidden corners, and admire the scenic Plaza de España. Take advantage of some free time for independent exploration before heading back to your ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Medina Sidonia guided walking tour.</li>\n\t<li>Local artisan pastries tasting.</li>\n\t<li>Vejer de la Frontera guided walking tour and free time.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/830025-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjEzMzV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1kxTDJnNE1TODVNREkzTURnME5URTNOREEyTHpnek1EQXlOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmNTk5MzQxNzJjMTE1YjNiODAyMDdmZWJmOTQyZjlkMDNkZTFhMzcyZGVjZjQxZTBhOWFhOTUyZDUwOTUwNDE4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
