    {'code': '802013', 'port_slug': 'cartagena', 'title': 'Craft Brew Tasting', 'slug': 'craft-brew-tasting-802013', 'price': 189.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/craft-brew-tasting-802013-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMzU4MjZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJZUzlvWVRRdk9EZ3pNekEwTURRNE1qTXpOQzVxY0djfGM0MGNhNDljMjI2YWEzODE0MzcwM2M1Mzc1OTZhOWY2M2JiZmJjMzJjY2VlNDgwYzNjMDFlMjhkNDRkM2JiMzM&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '511033', 'port_slug': 'cartagena', 'title': 'Colombian Aromas & Flavors by Land and Sea', 'slug': 'colombian-aromas--flavors-by-land-and-sea-511033', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Coffee &amp; Cooking:</strong> Embark on a scenic boat ride around Cartagena's bay aboard the Sibarita Master. Enjoy an enlightening coffee tasting led by a local expert, followed by a cooking experience with a talented chef, revealing the secrets of traditional dishes made from fresh ingredients.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Marketplace Delights:</strong> Visit a lively marketplace and dive into the world of local foods that influenced the works of Nobel Prize winner Gabriel Garcia Marquez. Taste the flavors that bring his stories to life.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>City Stroll:</strong> Arrive at the Old City and take part in a guided tour within the city walls. Discover must-see spots like Plaza de Bolivar, Plaza San Pedro, and the Cathedral, learning about the vibrant history of the area.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Independent Explorations:</strong> Following the guided tour, take the opportunity to explore this UNESCO World Heritage site at your own pace before returning to the ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Open bar aboard the Catamaran.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/511033-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM4NjJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFpoTDJobVlTODVNVEU1T1Rnd05URTVORFUwTHpVeE1UQXpNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwOWZmYzE2ZmFiYTgyNmQxNzVlNzE2YWJhNWY0ZjMxNWE4Y2RlYTZjMWI5NTA0MmFlNGQ2NDYwNWY1MjlhMjFi', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '511019', 'port_slug': 'cartagena', 'title': 'Coffee Baptism with a Touch of Gold', 'slug': 'coffee-baptism-with-a-touch-of-gold-511019', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<strong>Café San Alberto:</strong> Embark on a panoramic tour of the old city before heading to San Alberto Coffee Shop, a haven for coffee enthusiasts. Upon arrival, you\'ll be greeted and seated for an immersive experience known as "catación," exploring bean selection, roasting, and preparation. Participate in the milling process and enjoy a cupping session, where you\'ll discover the aromas and flavors of various coffees.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Gold Museum:</strong> After your coffee experience, stroll through the enchanting streets of Cartagena and visit the Gold Museum. Discover exquisite gold ornaments crafted by Colombia\'s indigenous peoples that reflect their rich heritage.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Las Bovedas:</strong> Wrap up your day with a visit to Las Bovedas artisans’ market, where you can shop for unique handicrafts. Find the perfect souvenirs before your return journey to the ship.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        City Panoramic Drive.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Interactive Coffee Experience.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Entrance to Gold Museum.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Shopping at Las Bovedas Market.\n    </li>\n</ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-brewed-coffee-bag-and-bug-511019.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxOTY4NTB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3pOeTlvWlRJdk9EZ3hNems1T0RBNE1EQXpNQzVxY0djfGU2ZDkyY2M5ODAzZDAzMGIzMjFmZDA4OTdkNTBmMTdhYjg0N2I5MjlhNTZkMmI4YzUzNDcxMDQxNjA5ZDQ5ZGQ', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '802005', 'port_slug': 'cartagena', 'title': 'Best of Caravaca', 'slug': 'best-of-caravaca-802005', 'price': 154.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/best-of-caravaca-802005-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY3Njd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzFNaTlvWXpBdk9EZ3pNamswTWpZMk9UZzFOQzVxY0djfDE5ZGUyMDQ4YTAwMmFlNzJjZTYzZmNmZjFjYjYwZTA1NDI1Nzc2ZWJkYWFjNGM2OTk0MmE1YzRmMTlkOWIwNDQ&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '511030', 'port_slug': 'cartagena', 'title': 'Cartagena Sightseeing & Local Food Tasting', 'slug': 'cartagena-sightseeing--local-food-tasting-511030', 'price': 105.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.7, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Cartagena Sightseeing:</strong> Discover the captivating history of Cartagena as you hop on an air-conditioned bus and explore its once pirate-filled past, guarded by an unconquerable fortress. Led by an expert guide, admire the splendid Republican architecture, the restored elegance of Manga's mansions, and capture the extraordinary Spanish military feat with a photo stop at the 17th-century San Felipe de Barajas Fort. Visit notable landmarks like the Inquisition Palace at Simon Bolivar Square, the Church of San Pedro Claver, and wander through the charming streets of the Old City.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Local Food Tasting:</strong> Immerse yourself in the flavors of Cartagena as you wander through the city, indulging in local delicacies and renowned Colombian coffee. Treat your taste buds to the savory Arepa de Huevo, savor homemade sweets known as Ducles del Portal, and enjoy the refreshing taste of tropical fruits. Don't miss the chance to sample Colombia's world-famous coffee, completing your culinary adventure in Cartagena.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Local snacks (Arepa de Huevo, Dulces del Portal, and Tropical fruits).</li>\n\t<li>Colombian coffee &amp; Corozo Juice.</li>\n\t<li>Entrance fees to Inquisition Palace and San Pedro Claver Church.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/511030-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjA2OTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREppTDJoaVpDODVNRFF4TVRnM016QTNOVFV3THpVeE1UQXpNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkOWEwOGVlYTcwZmIzMzJiZjY3NjYwYTk2YjI3YmU0YmY3YzFjZTMzNzcyMWFkZDdmYWI1MzI4MWMzMjBlOWNl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '511020', 'port_slug': 'cartagena', 'title': 'Cartagena Sightseeing & Cultural Show', 'slug': 'cartagena-sightseeing--cultural-show-511020', 'price': 59.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic City:</strong> Begin your tour in Manga, a residential area known for its elegant mansions, then pause for a photo at the impressive Fort of San Felipe de Barajas. Continue to the walled city, where colonial architecture and historic fortifications await around every corner.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Folkloric Show:</strong> Take a brief 15-minute drive to the Rafael Nuñez House and Museum, where four-time President Rafael Nuñez lived. Explore the Antillas architecture and delight in a vibrant folkloric show.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Shop &amp; Sights:</strong> End your day with a chance to shop for unique handicrafts at Las Bovedas artisan market. After shopping, take a panoramic drive through Bocagrande and Castillo Grande, renowned for their lively shops and restaurants, as you head back to the ship.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-MG-5230.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxMTgyMzl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGlPUzlvTURJdk9EZ3hNems1T0RJeE1URXdNaTVxY0djfDA4OTQyYmNkOTdjODQzYmI2ODhhODY0NTE0YTJiYzNjNmUxZWY1YWVkYTdhMjgxYWQwODA5YmMxNTk3NTNmOTA', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '511014', 'port_slug': 'cartagena', 'title': 'Cartagena Chiva Party Bus', 'slug': 'cartagena-chiva-party-bus-511014', 'price': 74.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.7, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Party Bus:</strong> Embark on a party on wheels with a Chiva tour in Cartagena! Step onto a hand-painted wooden artisan bus and dive into the lively ambiance with continuous local music, complimentary drinks, and captivating stories about Cartagena's history and traditions. Sing, laugh, and enjoy the festive experience as your chiva navigates through the enchanting streets of the city.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Capturing Cartagena:</strong> Capture stunning photos at San Felipe Fortress, Manga, Pie de la Popa, El Centro, Boca Grande, Laguito, Castillo Grande, and Las Bovedas. Have a blast at the historic Santa Catalina's Bastion, dancing and enjoying the infectious music. Get some shopping done for souvenirs and handicrafts at the Las Bovedas Artisan Center.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Complimentary drinks (local rum, beer, soda).</li>\n\t<li>Live music band of Vallenato.</li>\n\t<li>English speaking guide.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/cartagena-party-bus-3.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMjIwNjd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREEzTDJoaVpTODVNRFF4TVRjNU1qUTJOakl5TDJOaGNuUmhaMlZ1WVMxd1lYSjBlUzFpZFhNdE15NXFjR2N8ZmUwY2Q3YjRiMDk0ZWRmZjg0YWE5YWVmMzZkZGQ5MTkwZTc3MTA4ZGI1NjllYzcxNjg1NjcwMGE1NmRhNzJhMA', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
