    {'code': '409019', 'port_slug': 'celebration-key', 'title': 'Luxury Daybed at Starfish Beach', 'slug': 'luxury-daybed-at-starfish-beach-409019', 'price': 126.99, 'price_unit': 'Daybed for 4', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 7, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/celebration-key-starfish-beach-daybed-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzcyMjV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1U0TDJnMU55ODVNVEUyT0RFek5Ua3dOVFU0TDJObGJHVmljbUYwYVc5dUxXdGxlUzF6ZEdGeVptbHphQzFpWldGamFDMWtZWGxpWldRdGFXMW5NUzVxY0djfDRiZGVjY2NlNzk4ZmY1MWY3YzUyZjk4OTg0ODlkZWRkOTJjMTQ0NDY3NmZjOTRjYmQ0ZTEyYzE3Yjc4NzhhZGY', 'duration': '6.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '409031', 'port_slug': 'celebration-key', 'title': 'Over-the-Lagoon Cabana at Starfish Lagoon', 'slug': 'over-the-lagoon-cabana-at-starfish-lagoon-409031', 'price': 517.99, 'price_unit': 'Cabana for 7', 'rating': 3.3, 'review_count': 7, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/celebration-key-starfish-lagoon-cabana-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM4MzF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFkxTDJoak1TODVOamt3TnpJMk9USTBNekU0TDJObGJHVmljbUYwYVc5dUxXdGxlUzF6ZEdGeVptbHphQzFzWVdkdmIyNHRZMkZpWVc1aExXbHRaekV1YW5CbnxkNjZhYmQzMzZjNjgzNjZkZjM5NmU5OTZmOTkxMmEwM2YwMjhmNzBkMGYxODQ3OGM2NWU4M2VkMzg3NGQ4ZTI4', 'duration': '6.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '432067', 'port_slug': 'celebration-key', 'title': 'Top 10 of St. Lucia: Soufriere, Pitons & More!', 'slug': 'top-10-of-st-lucia-soufriere-pitons--more-432067', 'price': None, 'price_unit': '', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Derek Walcott Square:</strong> KTravel through the capital city of St. Lucia and enjoy a brief visit to Derek Walcott Square. Named after one of the island's distinguished Nobel Laureates, this square is a testament to the rich history and culture of St. Lucia.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Morne Fortune:</strong> At Morne Fortune, soar 900 feet above sea level for breathtaking panoramic views of Castries and its surroundings. Dominating the landscape is the historic century-old Government House, adding to the area's grandeur.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Historic Sites:</strong> Relive history on a scenic drive through the Sir Arthur Lewis Community College, passing important landmarks like the old military barracks, war cemetery, and gunpowder battery.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Eudovic’s Art:</strong> Journey to Eudovic’s Art Studio for a glimpse into the world of local sculptors as they expertly shape abstract sculptures from native wood.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Marigot Bay:</strong> Enjoy a brief visit to Marigot Bay, where enchanting vistas await. This picturesque location offers incredible photo opportunities against the backdrop of the iconic bay.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Banana Plantation:</strong> Experience the expansive Roseau Valley Banana Plantation, the largest in St. Lucia. Discover the banana cultivation process and indulge in fresh, sweet ripe bananas during your visit.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Set off from Roseau, as you ascend into the lush hills along the west coast. Delight in the picturesque coastal communities, complete with vibrant fishing boats lining the shores.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Piton Mountains:</strong> As you reach Soufriere, the majestic Piton Mountains will take your breath away, rising 2,600 feet above the sea. Celebrated as St. Lucia's most famous landmark, these volcanic peaks are also a UNESCO World Heritage Site.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Drive-in Volcano:</strong> Travel by the iconic Petit Piton on your way to the Caribbean's only drive-in volcano, with a short stop for memorable photos of this natural beauty.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Beacon Viewpoint:</strong> Sip a refreshing non-alcoholic drink at the Beacon viewpoint as you marvel at the stunning scenery of the Pitons and the Caribbean Sea. After this scenic interlude, you'll journey back to Castries harbor.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/top-10-of-st-lucia-soufriere-pitons-and-more-432067-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODI0MzJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGlPQzlvWW1Jdk9EZ3pOVE00TmpNM05qSXlNaTVxY0djfDkwYjdjMDVhZmUwMzM3YjZlN2Q5Y2IxY2Y5YjdlNmE0MTE5MGZjNTgxMjhjYjAxZGNhMGMxZjljNzI4YzdmMjI', 'duration': '6.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '5'},
    {'code': '431026', 'port_slug': 'celebration-key', 'title': 'Soar Above: Sky Safari Zipline', 'slug': 'soar-above-sky-safari-zipline-431026', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 344, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Sky Safari:</strong> Embark on a scenic ride to the historic Wingfield Estate for an unforgettable 4-zipline adventure. Begin with a brief orientation, then hop into a Land Rover to explore the Valley of the Giants, where you may encounter playful monkeys among the fruit trees. Take in stunning views of Brimstone Hill National Fortress, Old Road Village, the Caribbean Sea, and Mount Liamuiga as you head to your first zipline. Experience a breathtaking glide, using state-of-the-art equipment, across valleys and lush vegetation. Ideal for adventurers of all skill levels, this tour guarantees spectacular sights and exhilarating moments!</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-sky-safari-zip-lining-st-kitts-wi-10.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjgwODB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGtPQzlvT0dFdk9EZ3hORFExTVRBMk5EZzJNaTVxY0djfDgzMTRjYzc1Njg0OTE5Nzc5NGM1YTEwNGFiMjdiYmIzMjJhYTYxMWVjZjg2MjVkNGEyYzE3MjkxODdjOTU5YjA', 'duration': '3.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '6'},
    {'code': '171101', 'port_slug': 'celebration-key', 'title': 'Whale Watching & Lighthouse Exploration', 'slug': 'whale-watching--lighthouse-exploration-171101', 'price': 249.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<strong>Whale Watching:</strong> Enjoy a narrated ride to Auke Bay (Statter Harbor). Upon arrival, you’ll meet the crew and board the vessel. Relax in a heated cabin with a hot cup of coffee and enjoy outside viewing areas while on the lookout for wildlife. Keep your camera close – you never know when the perfect photo opportunity will arise! Search for humpback whales, sea lions, porpoises, bald eagles, and various marine birds. Cruising through Alaska’s Inside Passage, learn about whales and the history of its lighthouses.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Sentinel Island Lighthouse:</strong> Upon arrival at Sentinel take a short walk on a scenic boardwalk loop with photo opportunities along the way. Amazing views include Lynn Canal (one of the longest and deepest fjords in the world) and the surrounding islands and waterways. Think of the deep maritime history from its construction in 1902. Climb up the lighthouse tower and look across beautiful Lynn Canal. Enjoy a scenic ride to Yankee Cove and finally stop at the Brotherhood Bridge viewpoint of the Mendenhall Glacier.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Whale watching cruise.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Snacks including locally made Alaskan fudge and caribou sausage sticks.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Coffee/tea and bottled water.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Photo opportunity of the Mendenhall Glacier.\n    </li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/171101-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ3NjF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0l5TDJneE5pODRPVEk0TkRJNU5UY3lNVEkyTHpFM01URXdNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhNTBkN2I1NmY4NTMxZmIwODA4MzliNjhiMTI5YjY2NTIzNjEyNjQzNzExMWVmNDZjNmRjZWQxYzc4ODA5MWU0', 'duration': '4.25 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '824018', 'port_slug': 'celebration-key', 'title': 'Olympia&Olive Hill w Cooking Lesson', 'slug': 'olympia-olive-hill-w-cooking-lesson-824018', 'price': None, 'price_unit': '', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Ancient Olympia Tour:</strong>Immerse yourself in the birthplace of the Olympic Games as you explore iconic ruins like the Temple of Zeus and the Palaestra.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Karambelas Factory Tour:</strong>Discover a family-owned olive mill, enjoy ouzo or wine, and olive pie as you delve into the benefits of olive oil. Learn about sustainable farming, taste diverse oils, and master pairing them with food.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Greek Culinary Hands-On:</strong>Participate in a cooking lesson where you’ll use the finest olive oil and local ingredients to make classic Greek dishes like a fresh Greek salad, creamy tzatziki, and savory pita souvlaki.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/824018-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNjQyNTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREptTDJnek55ODVNREkwTmpVME1ERTJOVFF5THpneU5EQXhPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wxZWUwOTc0MGIzYWQyNWU0ZjE3Y2M2MTE3N2QzMTdiNzlhNmIxNjRiMzk4MGY5YmE5NTYwOTQ2OTA4ODMwMjZj', 'duration': '5.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '1'},
    {'code': '974009', 'port_slug': 'celebration-key', 'title': 'Samui 4x4 Village Vibes', 'slug': 'samui-4x4-village-vibes-974009', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/974009-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzU3OTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREUwTDJoak1TODVOVFE1TnpjNU1UQTNPRGN3THprM05EQXdPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1YWIwOGZkMjQ4YmMwYmI3ZmU4YmY4Y2Y3ODYzYmU5YTA4MTMwZDk1MDMxMWY2NWQwYzI0YWIxNzg3NDVhOWQ5', 'duration': '6.5 Hours', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': '6'},
    {'code': '171040', 'port_slug': 'celebration-key', 'title': "Dog Sled Discovery & Musher's Camp", 'slug': 'dog-sled-discovery--musher-s-camp-171040', 'price': None, 'price_unit': '', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Sled Dog Discovery at Mushers Camp:</strong> Experience a true Alaskan adventure while supporting the state sport in the state capital! Board the bus in town for a pleasant ride over to a dog camp on Douglas Island, where you will feel and hear the excitement of the dogs as you arrive! Enjoy an amusing and wildly fun sled ride through the lush Tongass National Forest, attend a Musher Presentation to learn about this unique element of Alaskan culture from real mushers, and play with the precious husky puppies!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Sled dog ride.</li>\n\t<li>Water and hot beverages.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-dog-sled-discovery-and-mushers-camp-juneau-ak-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTUwOTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3dZeTlvTXpBdk9EZ3hOREUxT0RZME16SXpNQzVxY0djfDcyZGYxMzYxNGEzYmY5NjhiNWVmMTE3ZmNlMTk0MzgyZWY0MGM4NzRjOTJkMWJkYWNmNWNhZmViYjhmZjc4YmU', 'duration': '2.25 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '435013', 'port_slug': 'celebration-key', 'title': 'The Baths at Virgin Gorda', 'slug': 'the-baths-at-virgin-gorda-435013', 'price': None, 'price_unit': '', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 52, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic Views:</strong> Experience a scenic 40-minute ferry ride to Virgin Gorda, taking in beautiful views of surrounding islands. Upon arrival, hop on a safari bus for a brief 10-minute transfer through Spanish Town to reach the stunning top of the Baths.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Top of the Baths:</strong> Once at the Baths, your guide will give a brief orientation before you embark on a 300-yard hike to Devil’s Bay. The trail features rugged terrain and uneven surfaces with small pebbles.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Devil’s Bay Beach:</strong> Spend 45-minutes relaxing at Devil’s Bay before your guide navigates you through giant boulders and wooden ladders to the Baths Beach, where refreshments are available for purchase at the Poor Man’s Bar. Enjoy some time at leisure, then return via a 300-yard trail to catch the bus back to the ferry.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>1 fruit/soft drink served during return boat trip.</li>\n\t<li>Entrance fee into the Baths.</li>\n\t<li>Boat transportation to Virgin Gorda, and vehicular transportation to the Baths.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/435013-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjA1NzN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFUzTDJneE15ODVNVEF5T1RRM016RTVPRE00THpRek5UQXhNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0OGMwZGYxZTQ0NmQyZGM4ZWZkZmY5NmI3YTdiMmRmOTE0YzA2ZWI4MWQzODhhZWU2Y2FmNjQ1MjRmYzFmZTcw', 'duration': '4.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '5'},
    {'code': '435023', 'port_slug': 'celebration-key', 'title': 'Jost Van Dyke Beach Escape', 'slug': 'jost-van-dyke-beach-escape-435023', 'price': None, 'price_unit': '', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 24, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Scenic Sail:</strong> Enjoy a scenic ride on a motor catamaran from the cruise pier to Jost Van Dyke, taking in the beauty of Tortola and nearby islands. Upon arrival, a short safari bus transfer will take you to the pristine White Bay Beach.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Beach Escape:</strong> Take advantage of approximately 2.25 hours of free time on beautiful White Bay Beach. Visit the famous Soggy Dollar Bar for its signature Painkiller drink, along with other beach bars like Hendos, O'Too's and Gertrudes.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>One soft drink.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-jost-van-dyke-beach-escape-with-lunch-tortolabritish-virgin-islands-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxODY4OTJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGpaQzlvTldJdk9EZ3hORFE1T0RRNE1ERTFPQzVxY0djfGU4ZDhhMTg4MTY1NmQ2NzAyMDFlMDg0OTMzNGE4OWE5M2VmYjIyMjA3N2U5YTA0ZDk4ODE4MTY3NmRlOTFhOTI', 'duration': '5.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '435025', 'port_slug': 'celebration-key', 'title': 'Virgin Gorda Bath & Snorkel', 'slug': 'virgin-gorda-bath--snorkel-435025', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 10, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Motor Catamaran Cruise:</strong> Embark on a motor catamaran from the cruise pier for an unforgettable trip to the famous Baths beaches in Virgin Gorda. Once anchored off Devil’s Bay, you can dive into the crystal-clear waters for swimming and snorkeling, with convenient ocean access from the stern ladders. Under the guidance of the captain and supported by the attentive crew, enjoy a 300-yard swim to the beach.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Snorkel Experience:</strong> Equip yourself with snorkel gear during the cruise, then swim 300 yards to the stunning beach while taking care to avoid marine life among the boulders. Enjoy 45-minutes of relaxation and exploration on the white sands or swimming in the crystal-clear waters.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Virgin Gorda’s Baths:</strong> Explore majestic caves with the boat crew as you trek to the second beach, maneuvering over boulders, through sea pools and climbing wooden ladders. Enjoy time to relax or grab a drink at Poor Man’s Bar before swimming back to the repositioned boat or returning to the first beach and swimming back from there.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>1 soft drink, snorkel gear, mask, tube, fins, vest.</li>\n\t<li>A tour guide to accompany the group in the water.</li>\n\t<li>A tour guide to lead guests along the beach and into cave explorations.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/435025-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTg1Mjl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1UzTDJoak1pODVNVEF5T1RRMU1qZzRNakl5THpRek5UQXlOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2OWVjNzIzMjkyM2FlYjZlMWMxOThhM2E2MGIzMWI0ZGIyNTg0NjU1ZTNkZDhiZmJjZDI5ZjE2NjQ3Mjg2YzJi', 'duration': '4.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '1'},
    {'code': '820040', 'port_slug': 'celebration-key', 'title': 'Châteauneuf Wine & Avignon Discovery', 'slug': 'ch-teauneuf-wine--avignon-discovery-820040', 'price': None, 'price_unit': '', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 10, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Vineyard Views:</strong> Explore Châteauneuf-du-Pape, where vineyards flourished under the Avignon Popes and helped build the region’s international reputation for exceptional wines, then visit Domaine Mousset for a tasting of three regional wines.&nbsp;<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Avignon Discovery:&nbsp;</strong>Discover Avignon, one of Provence’s most fascinating cities, known for medieval architecture, artistic heritage and its 14th-century role as the Catholic Church’s seat. Stroll through its historic center and admire landmarks including the Cathedral, the Palace of the Popes, and the city's impressive fortifications.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Independent Explorations:</strong> Enjoy approximately two hours of free time to browse boutiques, savor lunch at a local café or explore the city’s remarkable history at your own pace.&nbsp;<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>A visit to Châteauneuf-du-Pape.</li>\n\t<li>Wine tasting at Domaine Mousset.</li>\n\t<li>Guided walking tour of Avignon.</li>\n\t<li>Free time in Avignon for lunch, shopping, and independent exploration.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/820040-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc0MTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0psTDJnd1ppODVOakUzTWpBek1qTXlOems0THpneU1EQTBNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyZDMyNTk4ZDY2YThmZTY0M2QzNTNhY2NjMDBjYzUzY2UzNzUzNGM0NmQ0MTE1NGE4YTY0YzI0ZmYxYzM3ODM3', 'duration': '7.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '117014', 'port_slug': 'celebration-key', 'title': 'Transportation from Port to SFO Airport', 'slug': 'transportation-from-port-to-sfo-airport-117014', 'price': 34.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/carnival-transportation-bus.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxOTI4MjZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzRaUzlvWkRVdk9EZ3pNak0wT1RrNU5UQXpPQzVxY0djfGVkZDk4OTQ2YjQ4NzVlMDI0NTNiNTUxODY0MmRkNjFjOGMyMDFkZjFhOTdjYjA0ODViMTRiZGEzNGJkZGQxODk', 'duration': '1.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': '1'},
    {'code': '223004', 'port_slug': 'charlottetown', 'title': 'Charlottetown City Escape', 'slug': 'charlottetown-city-escape-223004', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Victoria Park:</strong> Discover the tranquility of Victoria Park where scenic vistas, charming gardens, and impressive trees that reflect the area's rich natural beauty await.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Waterfront Stroll:</strong> Take a stroll along the Charlottetown waterfront where you may discover the historic Prince Edward Battery, a fascinating glimpse into the island's military past.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Victoria Row:</strong> Wrap up your adventure with a visit to Victoria Row, a lively area brimming with cafes and shops. Take time to enjoy the vibrant atmosphere before heading back to your cruise ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Guided scenic drive through Ensenada.</li>\n\t<li>Resort day access.</li>\n\t<li>Buffet lunch (Mexican &amp; international selections).</li>\n\t<li>Use of outdoor pool, indoor heated pool, jacuzzis, and lounge chairs.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/223004-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTk2MTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR05pTDJneU9TODVOVEUyTVRBMk1UZzJOemd5THpJeU16QXdOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyMmUwNWQ4MTQwMzc1MmMwOWU4NGE3ZWJkNjI3NTA1MDgwMzQ0MWRlNThmZTM2OTUxOTRiNzNiNzk4NzFiZWI3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '223003', 'port_slug': 'charlottetown', 'title': 'Picture Perfect: City Selfies in Charlottetown', 'slug': 'picture-perfect-city-selfies-in-charlottetown-223003', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Prince Edward Battery:</strong> Begin your selfie adventure at Prince Edward Battery, where you can explore the city's history and scenic coastal views. With a selfie tutor guiding you, capture perfect photos against picturesque landmarks.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Great George Street:</strong> Walk the beautiful Great George Street and uncover various unique backdrops for your photos. Don't miss the chance to pose in front of the vibrant Lobster Mural at Timothy's World Coffee along the way.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Victoria Row:</strong> Wrap up your selfie journey with some leisure time at Victoria Row. This delightful streetscape is bursting with local culture and energy, making it an ideal spot to experience the heart of Charlottetown.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Selfie sticks during the tour.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/223003-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTg3MjJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0ZoTDJnek5pODVOVEUyTVRBMU5EQXdNelV3THpJeU16QXdNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4MjM4Y2Q2ZTdiMjAyZmU0OGZjNTFiOTJmMTAxMzZlZWNiMTk2MWM5ZmUwZWE4ZDQ0MGE4YWNhZGZiZDZlMjI0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '223005', 'port_slug': 'charlottetown', 'title': 'Brewventure: Canada’s Origins through Beer Tasting', 'slug': 'brewventure-canada-s-origins-through-beer-tasting-223005', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Brews &amp; Views:</strong>Experience the best of Charlottetown's taproom and brewing culture on this delightful walking tour. Savor a selection of local beers at various establishments while taking in the historical significance of Canada's birthplace. Let your guide bring the city's landmarks to life with fascinating stories and trivia, ensuring an enjoyable outing for everyone.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Beer tastings at multiple venues.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/223005-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQyMDB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGMwTDJnNU5pODVOVEUyTVRBM01qTTFNelU0THpJeU16QXdOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkZmIzYmY3ZGVmYmNlMjQwNzRmN2E4M2NhODYxZDhjYjFjMTg0YzYyOGJmOWFiODIyOGYxYmFmODA4NGMyMWY0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
