    {'code': '804128', 'port_slug': 'civitavecchia-rome', 'title': "Vatican & St.Peter's Basilica Inside, & Colosseum", 'slug': 'vatican--st-peter-s-basilica-inside---colosseum-804128', 'price': 234.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.4, 'review_count': 38, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-10-Inside-The-Vatican-Colosseum-St-Peters-Combo.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxOTY1MDJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGxaaTlvTUdNdk9EZ3hOREF3TXpReU1USXhOQzVxY0djfGRhMGNlZTkzMWM2YzZmNDQ5ZmYxYzViOTAwYTVmMjlkZjVmNzQ5ZDk3NWJmMGJmMTg2YmNhODk0Y2Q0Y2M2OWU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '804099', 'port_slug': 'civitavecchia-rome', 'title': 'Explore Rome on Your Own', 'slug': 'explore-rome-on-your-own-804099', 'price': 124.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.8, 'review_count': 12, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/804099-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDA3Mzh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREk0TDJneFpTODRPVEV4TmpNNE5qa3hPRGN3THpnd05EQTVPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2MmVjN2Q0ZWEzNGVhNjY4YzFmMzgwNWNkNWEwNjNmZGVkMDM4MDAxZTk1YzZkZGE4NmFhYTdhNmZkODk4NmVi', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '804003', 'port_slug': 'civitavecchia-rome', 'title': 'Orientation City Tour - Ship to FCO Airport', 'slug': 'orientation-city-tour--ship-to-fco-airport-804003', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p>Depart Civitavecchia pier and head to Rome by motorcoach.</p>\n<p>In the Eternal City, a panoramic drive takes you through the lovely Borghese Gardens and along Via Veneto – Rome’s famous, elegant and outrageously expensive shopping street. A slice of Roman life takes place among the fashionable sidewalk cafés, luxury shops and up-market hotels here.</p>\n<p>Drive by the Colosseum and Circus Maximus immortalized in Ben Hur. This is where chariot races took place in Roman times.</p>\n<p>You’ll also see Palatine Hill with the residence of Roman Emperors. Passing through St. Paul's Gate, watch for the Pyramid of Caius Cestius nearby.</p>\n<p>Continue along the old Ostiense Way to St. Paul's Basilica, where you will have brief free time.</p>\n<p>End your tour with a transfer to the airport.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/804003-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0MDMyNDB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0l5TDJneE5TODRPVEl5TWpRd09ERXhNRE00THpnd05EQXdNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhN2FhNzhiMzBhZTVhMzVhN2UxMzEwNzEwMGQwYjE2NmNjMGRmZDJlODU5MTk2ZWM1ZDY4YzViZjg4OWM2NjRj', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '804129', 'port_slug': 'civitavecchia-rome', 'title': 'Tivoli Gardens and Roman Ruins of Villa Adriana', 'slug': 'tivoli-gardens-and-roman-ruins-of-villa-adriana-804129', 'price': 174.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p>This combined tour of the Tibertine Villas is a perfect balance of architecture, archaeology, art, nature, relaxation and entertainment. On this tour, you will enjoy a mythical journey back in time to the 18th century, when you visit Villa d'Este . The magnificent villa built in the 16th century is a masterpiece of Italian landscape gardening. The site was declared a World Heritage Site by UNESCO in 2000. The gardens have been nominated and awarded the title of Most Beautiful Park in Europe more than once and it is well known throughout the world for its splendid fountains, which adorn the park and enrich it with water displays. Following this visit you will go to the exceptional Villa Adriana, built by the Emperor Hadrian, who closely followed this project in every detail. On the interior there are monumental buildings, streets, ponds, thermal springs, libraries and theatres which had impressed the emperor during his numerous journeys throughout the provinces of the empire. The emperor’s thirst for knowledge from faraway places served to shape the structure of the Roman Empire and enriched it with different cultures. This villa is a city unto itself and covers an area of approximately 741 acres.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Villa-Adriana-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNjc3NTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzFOaTlvTXpJdk9EZ3hNalUxTnpFM01qYzJOaTVxY0djfGFhYjU2NWI5NzdmYWY1ZWYxNmQxYTJlNDRmYmRiMzFmZmIyNTMxNjBmMWY4NmNkZWIyNjhlNWVlMTQxYTE1MjY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '804147', 'port_slug': 'civitavecchia-rome', 'title': 'Hop On, Hop Off Rome City Tour with Transfer', 'slug': 'hop-on-hop-off-rome-city-tour-with-transfer-804147', 'price': 134.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/804147-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjAxMzV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREZqTDJnNE5TODVNREkwTmpjek5EUTNPVFkyTHpnd05ERTBOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhMGMzZjM0ZDYyYWUxZjgxMTg5ZjFiMWY1MjI3MWYzZjdlMzhlZWU1YWQ3OGY1ZjJhYmFkODE4MDIzMGU5Mzgx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '804160', 'port_slug': 'civitavecchia-rome', 'title': 'Introduction to Rome,Trevi Fountain FCO AIRPORT', 'slug': 'introduction-to-rome-trevi-fountain-fco-airport-804160', 'price': 149.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Motor Coach to Rome:</strong> Meet your guide at the pier and board your motor coach to Rome. Once in Rome, you will follow your guide for an exploration of the Eternal City and see some of Rome's most iconic sites including the Trevi Fountain.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Walking Tour:</strong> Your expert guide will take you on a walking tour which includes Venice Square with its imposing monument dedicated to the first King of Italy. Leaving Venice Square you'll get to the Roman Forum, the heart of the ancient city of Rome before you arrive at the Colosseum where an outside commentator will be provided. Don’t miss out on a photo opportunity or two.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Panoramic Drive:</strong> Re-board your motor coach and take a short panoramic drive passing the Circus Maximus and the old Ostiense Way to St. Paul's Basilica. Your tour will end at the Airport terminal.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Transfer to airport.</li>\n\t<li>Headset.</li>\n\t<li>Licensed guide.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/804160-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0MDMyNDB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1E0TDJobU1pODRPVGMzTURNeU1UZ3pPRE00THpnd05ERTJNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlYTNhZWY1NmEwMzAzYjIyMWJjOTM1ODFjZTM4ZmRkZGFlOGVkMjkyMWFiMTU5MWM3NDM3M2JmODkwZmJiMjk5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
