    {'code': '865005', 'port_slug': 'corfu', 'title': 'Easy Corfu Island Tour', 'slug': 'easy-corfu-island-tour-865005', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-Corfu-Island-Tour-5.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNTg2NjB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzVNUzlvWkRJdk9EZ3hNems1TkRZM01qRTFPQzVxY0djfDU2YzM5NTNmMDE3NTI1YjYwOGQzMzRiZjFmMzUwMDkzOTU3MWU5ZGIxMjZiMTZkYWY0OTExY2RhMTFlZTQ0NGM', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '865015', 'port_slug': 'corfu', 'title': 'Paleokastritsa & Corfu', 'slug': 'paleokastritsa--corfu-865015', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/865015-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDgxMDN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGszTDJnd09DODRPVEl5TWpNeU16STBNVEkyTHpnMk5UQXhOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzN2UzOTFiMDE2ZWEzOWRlNDUxYjk5NTQ5YTYyODk2OTk1OGZmYjE0YTU5ZDFlZjdmZDdkNmRiNmVjNGNhNTEy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '316059', 'port_slug': 'costa-maya', 'title': 'VIP Chacchoben Exploration: Small Group', 'slug': 'vip-chacchoben-exploration-small-group-316059', 'price': 152.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.4, 'review_count': 18, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Exclusive Vehicles:</strong> Board your air-conditioned, 11-passenger minivan with a private driver. Beer, soft drinks, and bottled water will be provided during your tour.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Private Guides – Small Group:</strong> Your certified private bilingual guide will ensure you have the day of a lifetime. Prepare to enrich yourself with vital historical information about Mayan civilization, and wildlife and medicinal plants that are used by the modern-day descendants of the ancient Mayan people.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Chacchoben Mayan Ruins:</strong> Join a journey to the ancient place of Mayan pilgrimage known today as Chacchoben, “The Place of Red Corn”. Join your guided tour through the ruins located deep in the Mayan Jungle and learn about the sacred temples and other structures seen there as well as great information about this ancient civilization. See original red paint on the stucco walls of one of the pyramids and the temple where a mural was found showing the astronomical positions of the planet Venus.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Climb Basamento Temple:</strong> You will have the privilege of climbing the Gran Basamento Temple. Here, archaeologists found ceremonial offerings dating to around 1,000 B.C. Explore temples I and II for a breathtaking view of the jungle from above the treetops.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Entrance fee to the archeological site</li>\n\t<li>Two bottles of water, two beers and two sodas.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-316059-VIP-chacchoben-1-HERO.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w1OTAwMzZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJaaTlvTlRNdk9EZ3hOREF4TnpFMU1UQXdOaTVxY0djfDk1MWNhZWQ2MDU5MDlhYzQzZTY5NzY1ZWIwYWQ1OTRjMzk1NzIzNDRjMjgzMDhlZmMxZGNlMDk5ZTE4MjcyOWM', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '316087', 'port_slug': 'costa-maya', 'title': 'Bamboo Rafting & Relaxing on the River with Lunch', 'slug': 'bamboo-rafting--relaxing-on-the-river-with-lunch-316087', 'price': 123.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.7, 'review_count': 10, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Bamboo Rafting:</strong> Begin your exploration aboard a four-person raft that will navigate through the freshwater Bacalar Lagoon.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Relax &amp; Swim by the River:</strong> Protected on all sides by thick mangrove forest, the waters of the pristine lagoon are typically as smooth as glass and every imaginable shade of blue and green. The ever-changing hues are so captivating that the waterway is known as the Lagoon of Seven Colors. The setting is also extraordinarily serene, as no motorized boats are permitted on the lagoon. As you glide along, you can expect to see all sorts of wildlife, especially water birds. The water doesn't just look inviting, it is wonderfully refreshing and ideal for swimming.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Mexican Lunch:</strong> Stop for lunch and enjoy free time to wander about on your own.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Mexican lunch: two panuchos, two salutes and one empanada per guest.</li>\n\t<li>One glass of sparkling wine during the ride.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/316087-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTQzNTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGN6TDJneE5DODRPVFEzTXpBMU56UXlNelkyTHpNeE5qQTROeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlYTE3MjY4NmZhN2ExMThlMmE3NDBhODI3ZjRjODUxYzhiZGYyNjJmYTYwN2FjNmVhMjRjNmEwYWZjNDUzYzBj', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '316054', 'port_slug': 'costa-maya', 'title': 'Jaguar Safari Bus, Bike, Paddle Board & Beach', 'slug': 'jaguar-safari-bus-bike-paddle-board--beach-316054', 'price': 87.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.7, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Truck Scenic Drive:</strong> Enjoy a scenic drive on a “Jaguar Truck,” a custom-designed vehicle stocked with all the facilities and equipment to make your experience an amazing one. Embrace your love for the outdoors on this adventure that includes tandem biking, a natural swimming pool, and beach time.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Bike Adventure &amp; Cenote:</strong> Ride your bike through the jungle, then arrive at a small natural pool for a cooling splash in the water. The Mayans believed that these natural pools were sacred and used them to communicate with their gods. Lunch will be offered at the cenote before heading to the beach.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Beach Break:</strong> Spend some free time resting, swimming, or just taking in the views of this gorgeous paradise.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Beach chair and shared umbrella.</li>\n\t<li>Bottle of water.</li>\n\t<li>Mexican Lunch: Chicken and vegetarian tacos made on-site, along with a kid's option.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/316054-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY0MjN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFF3TDJneVlpODRPVFF3TURFMU1qVTFOVGd5THpNeE5qQTFOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwYTRhZWFiMTUxZmZmMTVkZDk3ODI3ZDZlM2M2MWMzNDc2Mjg3MTBiODY3MDM5M2Q5M2UyNzAzZjdjZDAwODlk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '316072', 'port_slug': 'costa-maya', 'title': 'Select Retreat & Mayan Wellness', 'slug': 'select-retreat--mayan-wellness-316072', 'price': 114.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 15, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Mayan Ritual:</strong> Spoil yourself with this Mayan holistic experience, releasing energies and opening for a spiritual cleanse. A shaman will lead you through the process in a unique 80-minute ceremony of six essential steps:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li><strong>Copal Cleansing (10 minutes):</strong> Feel released and purified with an ancient technique the shaman practices to ask the Mayan Gods for permission and start the ceremony.</li>\n\t<li><strong>Herbal Bath (15 minutes):</strong> Enjoy your warm water tub while the therapist massages your shoulders, up to your neck and head. Embrace the aromatic scents and heal with this ancient therapy.</li>\n\t<li><strong>The Temazcal (15 minutes):</strong> This step will take you to the center of the earth and turn you into a better version of yourself. Open and release any negativity while you experience this Mexican heritage while sitting in a traditional sweat lodge.</li>\n\t<li><strong>Organic Clay Mask Ritual (10 minutes):</strong> It’s time to pamper your skin. Refine your pores, clear away excess impurities, and give your face and body a natural radiance.</li>\n\t<li><strong>Coconut Bath (15 minutes):</strong> Let the view of the Caribbean Sea mesmerize your eyes while the bath renews your body.</li>\n\t<li><strong>Hammock massage (15 minutes):</strong> This can only be experienced in Costa Maya. Feel relieved as your back loosens up during a Mayan massage in a traditional hammock, made by local artisans’ hands.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Access to VIP port area.</li>\n\t<li>Towel during activity.</li>\n\t<li>Locker.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Spa-5.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxOTg3Mjd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3daQzlvWVRrdk9EZ3hOREF4T0RZMU9ETXpOQzVxY0djfGY2Y2M4MTUzNzcxZDJlYzJiZWY0ZmFmMDZmMTZjOWYzY2ZkMjllNTY3NDQ5NWIxZmY5ZjQwNTBlMzBmMDY5YTI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '316112', 'port_slug': 'costa-maya', 'title': 'Chacchoben Mayan Ruins & Beach Break', 'slug': 'chacchoben-mayan-ruins--beach-break-316112', 'price': 149.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Chacchoben Mayan Ruins:</strong> Embark on a 60-minute air-conditioned bus ride to Chacchoben, Costa Maya's premier archaeological site, where you'll explore three impressive, restored pyramids with a knowledgeable guide. Don't forget to visit local shops for a unique souvenir before your journey continues.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Beach Break with Open Bar:</strong> Transition from your cultural excursion to the exclusive Villa Mahikal beach club, where a refreshing cocktail awaits you at the open bar. Bask in stunning Caribbean views while walking along the sandy shore or swimming in crystal-clear waters. Indulge in delectable Mexican cuisine from the beach club restaurant, and, if available, kayak to discover the colorful reef just off the beach.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Entrance fee Chacchoben Mayan Ruins.</li>\n\t<li>1 bottle of water at Chacchoben Mayan Ruins.</li>\n\t<li>Snacks and open domestic bar at Villa Mahikal beach club.</li>\n\t<li>Beach chairs.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/316122-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNDk4NTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJtTDJobVlTODVNRFkxTVRZeU5EQTNPVFkyTHpNeE5qRXlNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0Yjc0NTFiODVmM2EyOWE2ZmIxMWQ3M2M2MmU4NzBlZWU4YzQyNzI3OTQ5MTk5YTAzYWIyNDU5ODIyY2RmYzRk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
