    {'code': '316007', 'port_slug': 'costa-maya', 'title': 'Beach Escape with Open Bar', 'slug': 'beach-escape-with-open-bar-316007', 'price': 70.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.2, 'review_count': 26, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Jungle-Beach-Break-HERO.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNTk4OTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGlNaTlvWWpVdk9EZ3hOREF4TURRek16VTJOaTVxY0djfGFlNGMwMjIwZjFmNDdjNzI3MGI1MTgzNTI5MWFiYWI3Yzc4ZTkzZGM0ZjMxZjE4YWRlM2JlN2UxZGUyYmNkNWE&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '304304', 'port_slug': 'cozumel', 'title': "Thrill & Chill:Zip Lines, Snorkel & Island's Beach", 'slug': 'thrill--chill-zip-lines-snorkel--island-s-beach-304304', 'price': 106.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.9, 'review_count': 199, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Private Beach Club:</strong> Experience a perfect day at Cozumel’s exclusive Islands Beach Club on the serene north end. Unwind by the pool, stroll along the sandy beach, and enjoy the beautiful ocean views. Immerse yourself in the stunning aquamarine waters of the Caribbean and relax on an array of floating swim pads!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Zipline Adventure:</strong> Unleash your inner adventurer as you can glide down three ziplines, traverse six exciting suspension bridges, and finish with a dramatic 75-foot free rappel to the ground.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Snorkeling:</strong> Discover a vibrant underwater world at one of Cozumel's premier snorkeling locations. Dive into the stunning aquamarine waters and swim alongside schools of colorful fish.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Fun Adventure Activities:</strong> Enhance your adventure with a variety of activities available at an additional cost including snorkeling, wave runners, power snorkel, invisible boat, paddle boards, electric bikes and more!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Shopping:</strong> Explore the lively Mexican market for fun t-shirts and unique souvenirs. Be sure to check out the photo department to take home cherished memories!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Tequila:</strong> Delight in a free tequila tasting and uncover the fascinating history behind Mexico's iconic beverage. Enjoy sampling three different flavors from their extensive selection.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Activity equipment for zipline and guided snorkel.</li>\n\t<li>Use of facilities including hammocks, sunbeds, showers, swimming pool and restroom.</li>\n\t<li>Free Wi-Fi.</li>\n\t<li>Tequila tasting.</li>\n\t<li>Access to facilities including hammocks, sunbeds, showers, swimming pool, floating swim pads, and restrooms.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/304304-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzUxMDl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1V4TDJneFlpODVNRGszTlRFd05qZ3lOalUwTHpNd05ETXdOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyODljOTAzY2I4ODFiM2QyNDg0NDEwMGFkYmQ0ODZmMmVmZTAzY2E3NTFlNGY2YWFlNDhhZjNiM2M2NzVmMTdi', 'duration': '3.0 Hours', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': '6'},
    {'code': '304391', 'port_slug': 'cozumel', 'title': 'Kuza Beach All Inclusive Pass', 'slug': 'kuza-beach-all-inclusive-pass-304391', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.7, 'review_count': 279, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Kuza Beach Club:</strong> Discover KUZÁ, where nature, adventure, and relaxation come together in an idyllic island paradise. Enjoy pristine beaches, engaging outdoor activities, and authentic Mexican culture, all within a sustainably designed park. Relax in your reserved lounge chair or explore the mangrove lagoon and scenic jungle trails, all while savoring beachfront dining and an open bar service.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Buffet selection of both cold and hot dishes: Taco Stations, wraps, sandwiches, quesadillas, Cochinita Pibil and vegetarian dishes.</li>\n\t<li>Open domestic bar: cocktails and frozen drinks.</li>\n\t<li>Beach chairs and umbrellas.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/304391-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc5ODZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFkyTDJoa01TODVNVEV3TkRRd09UTTFORFUwTHpNd05ETTVNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlNWNjYmRjMjhiYjBmN2UzODQ5OThmNWY2MDUxNTAyOWIyMTQ3OTZmMzg3NjNkZjg1MDUzYzM5ODY0NWE4OTkx', 'duration': '5.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '304053', 'port_slug': 'cozumel', 'title': 'Dolphin Swim & Close Encounter: All Inclusive', 'slug': 'dolphin-swim--close-encounter-all-inclusive-304053', 'price': 144.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.4, 'review_count': 30, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Dolphin Swim Along:</strong> Dive into a premium dolphin adventure at Dolphinaris Cozumel, where you can swim with these fascinating creatures in serene ocean coves. Experience the heartwarming "Smile" moment, where a gentle tickle encourages your dolphin to flash a joyful grin. The highlight of your encounter will be a memorable double dolphin kiss on both cheeks, creating unforgettable memories and stunning photos.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Optional Downtown Dropoff:</strong> Wrap up your day at our convenient downtown Cozumel location, giving you the freedom to explore local shops at your leisure.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>All-Inclusive Delights:</strong> Indulge in unlimited food and beverages.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Unlimited food and drinks: Green salad, chicken or vegetarian fajitas, cheese or chicken quesadillas, grilled fish fillet ajillo Style (ajillo is a red pepper) and rice, burger, and french fries.</li>\n\t<li>Open bar.</li>\n\t<li>Kayaks and paddle boards.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/304053-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzYwMzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFU1TDJnMk9TODVNRE0yTmpJMk1ETTBOekU0THpNd05EQTFNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3NzAxZDRhNWM3MjI1NmE0NzkyN2U4Y2ZhYWY0Mjg3YzVmNjIxNTI4NGFjYzRjYTBhMjdlYTkxYzEyODVhMGFj', 'duration': '3.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '304407', 'port_slug': 'cozumel', 'title': 'Blu Ocean Club: Exclusive Floating Adults Retreat', 'slug': 'blu-ocean-club-exclusive-floating-adults-retreat-304407', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.8, 'review_count': 13, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Escape to Blu:</strong> Leave the crowds behind and escape to BLU, Cozumel's exclusive floating ocean club reserved for adults seeking relaxation, elevated service and breathtaking Caribbean views. Lounge on oversized shaded daybeds and nets available on a first-come, first-served basis, sip handcrafted premium cocktails, savor chef-inspired bites, swim in crystal-clear turquoise waters, or simply let the gentle rhythm of the sea become the highlight of your vacation.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Ocean Playground:</strong> Swim, snorkel among vibrant marine life, glide across the Caribbean on a paddle board, or relax in the ocean pool and on the giant floats, Pato Pancho and Flamingo Mingo.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Blu Margarita Experience:</strong> Learn to mix BLU's signature margarita with the mixologist and enjoy your own handcrafted creation overlooking the turquoise Caribbean.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Chef-Crafted Coastal Cuisine:</strong> Indulge in gourmet appetizers, fresh guacamole, seasonal fresh fruit, ceviche and other varieties of gourmet finger foods before enjoying a chef-crafted lunch with your choice of premium burritos, all served with unlimited handcrafted cocktails, and premium spirits.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Caribbean Vibes:</strong> Relax to curated island music by the resident DJ, while warm hospitality and attentive service create a sophisticated yet laid-back atmosphere, the perfect soundtrack for an unforgettable day on the water.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Chef-crafted gourmet appetizers and lunch, complemented by an unlimited premium open bar featuring handcrafted cocktails, and top-shelf spirits.</li>\n\t<li>Signature Blu Margarita mixology experience with BLU's expert mixologist.</li>\n\t<li>Snorkeling, paddleboarding, and floating ocean amenities, including selected water toys (weather permitting).</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/304407-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU2NDZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGd4TDJneE5DODVOakl6TVRNeE5USXhNRFUwTHpNd05EUXdOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkN2E0ZGQ5NjQwMjVjNzU2Yjc2Y2I1ZjU1MzBlNGRlMjdiODBiMTQ2OGM5OWJiNGUzODlmYWNmNTE1ODg3ZjU0', 'duration': '3.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '18'},
    {'code': '304182', 'port_slug': 'cozumel', 'title': 'La Casa en la Playa: A Luxury Adults-Only Estate', 'slug': 'la-casa-en-la-playa-a-luxury-adults-only-estate-304182', 'price': 127.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 72, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Seaside Speakeasy:</strong> Discover the coast’s best-kept secret at this ultra-exclusive adults-only estate, turned luxury beachfront speakeasy. Unwind by the infinity pool, settle into a stylish beach bed or elevate your escape with an optional, soothing open-air, seaside massage.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Creative Cuisine:</strong> Let your private chef surprise you with a tableside bespoke multi-course lunch featuring fresh local catches and premium ingredients, while a master bartender creates signature cocktails inspired by your palate and mood.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Tequila &amp; Chocolate:</strong> Elevate your senses with a curated, expert-led tasting of premium boutique tequilas paired with rich, local chocolates.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Salsa Secrets:</strong> Step behind the scenes for an interactive culinary demo. Learn the insider secrets to crafting the ultimate, authentic Mexican salsa.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Reef &amp; Retreat:</strong> Dive into turquoise waters on a guided snorkeling adventure along the local coral reef or fully unplug in a secluded paradise where your dedicated host and estate staff cater to every detail.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Snorkeling gear.</li>\n\t<li>Mexican lunch: breaded fish filet, pollo pibil, chilaquiles la casa style and stuffed poblano peppers.</li>\n\t<li>Open domestic bar: cocktails, local beer, bartender creations.</li>\n\t<li>Tequila tasting &amp; cooking class.</li>\n\t<li>Cold towels.</li>\n\t<li>Wi-Fi.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/304182-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTkwODV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1ptTDJoa055ODVOVEUyTmpjd01UZzVOVGs0THpNd05ERTRNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w5NTIyNzc0YzMzMzhiODNiYzQ1NmQ0NDhmYjhhM2Y3OTg4OTY5ZGQ1MzFiODQyZjkyNjlhMWMxMmU5Njk5YmQ2', 'duration': '4.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '18'},
