    {'code': '304244', 'port_slug': 'cozumel', 'title': 'Xplor Park - All Inclusive Adventure', 'slug': 'xplor-park--all-inclusive-adventure-304244', 'price': 186.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.6, 'review_count': 23, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-02.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNDQyMzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGxOQzlvT1RVdk9EZ3hOREEyTlRRMU1UQXpPQzVxY0djfDYxYWYwMGNiM2MxMGQ0YjhlODU2YmE3NmI2MzFkZDA4MzI4MzMzODNlMDdiYWUwZDY2NzZkMTIzMDcyZWZjZTM', 'duration': '7.0 Hours', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': '6'},
    {'code': '414004', 'port_slug': 'curacao', 'title': 'Discover Curacao Island Tour', 'slug': 'discover-curacao-island-tour-414004', 'price': 72.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.6, 'review_count': 10, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Curacao Museum:</strong> Your certified tour guide will take you through the museum, a former military hospital built in 1853, and help you discover the impressive collection of contemporary sculpture in the garden and cultural artifacts from nearly 400 years of island history.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Hato Caves:</strong> Being more than 200,000 years old, the Hato Caves are the largest and most prominent caves on the island. Tour through the caves and see the famous Madonna statue, a colony of long-nosed fruit bats, impressive stalagmites, stalactites and a water pool.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Chobolobo Liqueur Factory:</strong> Landhuis Chobolobo is an iconic 19th century country mansion and one of Curacao's most renown tourist attractions. After your guide educates you on the distillation process, enjoy a free liqueur tasting and free time to walk around, and buy a bottle if you wish.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Willemstad:</strong> On the way back to the ship, take a scenic drive through Scharloo, with its historical buildings, most of which are protected monuments. Learn from your guide about the Jewish heritage on the island and later take in the breathtaking views crossing the Queen Juliana Bridge.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Liqueur tasting at Chobolobo.</li>\n\t<li>Entrance fee to Hato Caves.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/414004-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE4NzV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1JrTDJnd09DODRPVGt3TVRZek1qQTJNVGMwTHpReE5EQXdOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0MmVkYmI2ZDNiNTE4YTE5ZDBlYTEyNWQ2ZGE5Njc1MGE1ZmQ2MjYyNTRlMzljN2Y3YjliNjQwNWRiMDU4NzVl', 'duration': '3.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '414065', 'port_slug': 'curacao', 'title': 'All Inclusive Beach Resort & Aquapark', 'slug': 'all-inclusive-beach-resort--aquapark-414065', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.3, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<strong>The Resort:</strong> Enjoy an all-inclusive resort day at Mangrove Beach Corendon Curacao, the new pearl of Curacao! This 5-star luxury beach resort is surrounded by a beautifully protected mangrove forest and is only a short drive from the Cruise Terminal.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Beach & Amenities:</strong> Relax on the private beach or by the pool and peacefully enjoy the tropical weather that Curacao has to offer whilst sipping a delicious cocktail. Or if you are the more adventurous type, head on over to the aqua park, home to a kids splash zone and 6 different water slides, one of them being the impressive “King Cobra” slide!\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Lunch & Cocktails:</strong> Whilst you spend your day at the resort, you will be able to enjoy delicious cocktails and other drinks all day from the 3 different bars the resort has available, including a swim up bar by the pool. Furthermore, snacks will be available for your enjoyment all day in addition to the Lunch Buffet at Breeze (main restaurant).\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Lunch at the buffet at Breeze (main Restaurant).\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Enjoy various snacks at The Food Street (all day).\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        3 Bar options for drinks, including a pool swim up bar.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Beach and pool chairs.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Aqua Park.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Wi-Fi.\n    </li>\n</ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/414065-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMzUwMTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREZoTDJnek9TODRPVFUxT0RRMU1URTFPVE0wTHpReE5EQTJOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4NWIxMTM2ZDNmOWRmNjkzMjczZGE2YzY3YmRhMDIyOWQ2NTIyMWZhNzEwOGI2MTE5MGExMGI5MTA2ZDJjNTY5', 'duration': '5.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '414048', 'port_slug': 'curacao', 'title': 'Turtle Snorkel & Cas Aboa Beach', 'slug': 'turtle-snorkel--cas-aboa-beach-414048', 'price': 82.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 11, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Snorkel with Turtles at Playa Grandi:</strong> Enjoy a guided snorkel and explore the amazing and stunning underwater world of the marine park that has so much to offer, such as multi-colored tropical fish and a very good chance to swim around turtles.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cas Abao Beach:</strong> With its turquoise water, waving palm trees and bright white sand, Cas Abao is a true gem on the southwest coast of Curacao. Ideal for swimmers of all ages, its reefs are a paradise for snorkelers and scuba divers. Spend free time on your reserved beach chair, go swimming or get your drink at the bar. You choose how to relax during this beach stop.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">Entrance fee to Cas Abao Beach (includes beach chair, shower coin and 1 soft drink).</li>\n\t<li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">Snorkel gear.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/414048-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDI1MzV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFEwTDJnMVpDODRPVGt5TnpZeU1EWTVNREl5THpReE5EQTBPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4NDgwNjA5MTliOTkzZTBlYzhkYTJjNGMzMzU2MTk0ODk1NmFlM2E0MTllOGMxNDllODI0MWUyNGQ0YzEzMWY4', 'duration': '4.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '6'},
    {'code': '414001', 'port_slug': 'curacao', 'title': 'Dolphin Encounter', 'slug': 'dolphin-encounter-414001', 'price': 179.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Dolphin Encounter:</strong> Take part in an exciting Dolphin Encounter at the Curacao Dolphin Academy. These charming, intelligent creatures are waiting to play with you and dazzle you with their skills. Step into the water and onto a platform where you will stand in waist deep water and get to touch and interact with the dolphins while learning about their behaviors. This incredible interactive experience will be captured on photo for your purchase so you can remember your adventure for a lifetime.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sea Aquarium:</strong> After your encounter, you will have free time to explore the Sea Aquarium and see many species of marine life. You will have an opportunity to feed lobsters, sharks, and flamingos.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Admission to Curacao Sea Aquarium.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/414001-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDEwNjR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFkyTDJnellTODVNVEUxTVRreU9UZ3pOVGd5THpReE5EQXdNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwYjNjNGUzYmU2MjI3NjI1MDhhMWVjNWY0NGVmYTVlNmVhOTFhZWQ3ZTQ3M2MyNjJlN2IyZjk5MWFkN2U4NjZk', 'duration': '3.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '414052', 'port_slug': 'curacao', 'title': 'Curacao Treasures, Lagoon Turtle Swim & Lunch', 'slug': 'curacao-treasures-lagoon-turtle-swim--lunch-414052', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.8, 'review_count': 22, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Interactive Island Tour:</strong> Start your ultimate island experience with a fun and interactive tour on an air-conditioned bus through the cultural UNESCO heritage sites of the city and see the best hidden paradise spots and beaches on the "wild west" side of the island.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Shete Boca National Park Visit:</strong> Embark on a fun hiking adventure on an easy trail that includes two incredible photo stops for your best selfie. Discover two semi blowholes where you will see the incredible viewpoints as wild waves splash into the coves.&nbsp;<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Snorkeling with Sea Turtles:</strong> Jump in the water and enjoy an exhilarating snorkeling experience with wild sea turtles in their natural habitat at the famous Fisherman’s Beach at West Point. As you swim, the turtles will often come alongside, allowing you a fantastic opportunity to view them up close.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Knip Beach Swim &amp; Picnic:</strong> Stop at Knip Beach, which is the most beautiful beach on the island and one of the top beaches of the Caribbean. Relax, have a picnic lunch, swim, sunbathe or snorkel on your own, as you please.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Wild Flamingos Picture Stop:</strong> Enjoy a quick stop at the Flamingo Sanctuary to admire these pink beauties in their natural habitat.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Entrance fee to the national park.</li>\n\t<li>Boxed picnic lunch.</li>\n\t<li>One juice or soda and one&nbsp;bottle of water.</li>\n\t<li>Snorkel gear.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/ultimate-island-beach-turtle-414052-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTE3NzF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGhPQzlvWkdJdk9EZ3pORE01TURnMU1UWXhOQzVxY0djfGRiMGMzNjFiYzMzNTkxN2RlNzc1YTY0ZmI3YTU4NjYxN2UyN2MxY2Q1NDBiODVhZjFkODMxNmNhZjg2MWM0MWU', 'duration': '6.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
