    {'code': '414069', 'port_slug': 'curacao', 'title': 'Sea Trek Helmet Diving', 'slug': 'sea-trek-helmet-diving-414069', 'price': 118.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 10, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/414069-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY3ODV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFV3TDJoaFlTODRPVGc1T0RVMk9ESTFNemMwTHpReE5EQTJPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2Y2Q0ZGNkYTdlYThiMWRiYmFhMzhmYzU0NGQ2ZTRmM2UyNGY1Zjg0OTA5ZTgyMTdhN2QxNGVjZWFiNDg2NDA4', 'duration': '1.5 Hours', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': '8'},
    {'code': '415018', 'port_slug': 'dominica', 'title': 'Heart of the Island: Rainforest & Emerald Pool', 'slug': 'heart-of-the-island-rainforest--emerald-pool-415018', 'price': 44.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Rainforest:</strong> Start your journey in Roseau, the capital, exploring Morne Bruce's breathtaking views at over 300 feet. Continue to Dominica's Botanical Park and reach the heart of the rainforest at Emerald Pool.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Emerald Pool:</strong> Stroll along a serene rainforest trail for 15 minutes, leading to a secluded waterfall with a clear freshwater pool. Swim or take a refreshing dip before rejoining the bus.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Access ticket to the Emerald Pool National Park.</li>\n\t<li>Complimentary drink (water, soda, local juice, or rum punch).</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/415018-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ3ODd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE5sTDJnNVl5ODVNREV4T0RjME9UZzRNRFl5THpReE5UQXhPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wxZjBiOTRhMzhkZGEzNjkwNDViNGM0MTgzZDQ1N2ZkOTVkMTNmNGY4NzQzY2IyNTJlYTYzY2Q1YWFiNzFmZTkz', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '415038', 'port_slug': 'dominica', 'title': 'River Tubing, Jaco Falls & Eco Village', 'slug': 'river-tubing-jaco-falls--eco-village-415038', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Jaco Falls Photo Stop:</strong> Take a 98-ft. flat walk to view the picturesque Jaco Falls tucked away in rain forest greenery. This is a nice little waterfall that you can view from a viewpoint or walk down to the pool for a quick dip.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Hibiscus Eco Village:</strong> Be welcomed by a traditional dance performance by the indigenous Carib Indians. The site is known for its beautiful surroundings and natural river pools. With changing rooms, washrooms and easy river access, this site is a perfect starting point for your river tubing.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>River Tubing:</strong> Enjoy an exciting river adventure through a beautiful and peaceful voyage in the heart of nature. You will see various bird life, vegetation, and spectacular scenery staged by the beautiful valley of Concord. You will be traveling down the boundary line (the river) to the last and only Carib Indian territory in the world. The river will take you on a good combination of fast rapids and lazy slow flowing pools, which makes it both fun-filled and relaxing. Your journey will be approximately 1.5 hours of fun water adventure.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What's Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Complimentary welcome fruit juice.</li>\n\t<li>River tubes and safety equipment.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-river-tubing-hibiscus-falls-and-eco-village-dominica-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTk2MzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGhPUzlvWkRFdk9EZ3hOREE0TlRNd09EUTBOaTVxY0djfGNlZjlkZWFkZTQyNDA1YzRjMjFiMmZkM2EyMzY4Y2UzMmZjZjYwOTIyMTY0MGI4NDQ5YjJmNjU3NmJiZDZlMmU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '415045', 'port_slug': 'dominica', 'title': 'Trolley Train Ride: Botanical Garden, Local Church', 'slug': 'trolley-train-ride-botanical-garden-local-church-415045', 'price': 49.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>City Highlights:</strong> Visit a local Catholic church, capture memories at the Roseau River, and learn about the island's wildlife, culture and history on an open-air train tour. Conclude the journey with an optional stroll through the Botanical Gardens, admiring exotic flora and observing endemic parrots in their habitat while enjoying a complimentary fruit juice or rum punch.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Rum punch or fruit juice.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-city-highlights-by-trolley-train-415045-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDIxNDl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGhOUzlvTWpBdk9EZ3hOREE0TmpReU1qVTFPQzVxY0djfDI2YWJhMDBhZWQxMTViODYzM2UwN2E0MWZkMjFiMTc5YmQ2MzdhOTViOGI4MDdiNjU0NTIwZTUyYjA3ODAyODE', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '415051', 'port_slug': 'dominica', 'title': "Champagne Beach & Scott's Head Point Snorkel", 'slug': 'champagne-beach--scott-s-head-point-snorkel-415051', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Champagne Beach Snorkel:</strong> Enjoy Dominica’s protected marine-life while snorkeling on this world-famous beach. At the ‘bubbles’, it will be very much like swimming in a glass of champagne as the gases rise from submerged volcanic vents on the sea floor. Closer to the rocky shoreline, enjoy the tepid surf and experience the warming effect as the hot volcanic gases heat up the sea water. At the coral reefs, juvenile and adult fish as well as colorful sponge and coral growths are in abundance.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Scott’s Head Point Snorkel:</strong> Explore the tropical juvenile reef and see colorful fish and other marine life. Just a few feet into the water, a 70 ft. drop off opens a new underwater world. With a little luck, you might see snappers, squids, octopuses, and hawksbill turtles.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Safety vest.</li>\n\t<li>Snorkel, mask, and fins.</li>\n\t<li>Bottled water.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/415051-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNjgyNjB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJpTDJoaU1pODVNREF3TmpVMU1qSTBPRFl5THpReE5UQTFNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhYjkyZmU4ZmZjYzIzYTE2YmZlMTMzMjhlYzMzNDliYWNkNTc3OWQyNWZjMjA0NjQ4ZjdkMTVhN2JiNTY4OGJj', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '415025', 'port_slug': 'dominica', 'title': 'Dominica & Jaco Falls', 'slug': 'dominica--jaco-falls-415025', 'price': 59.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.3, 'review_count': 9, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Sightseeing Tour:</strong> Drive through the capital of Roseau to Morne Bruce for a scenic photo opportunity of the capital and the Caribbean Sea with the ship in the backdrop. Continue to the Botanical Gardens where you can see the famous and endangered Sissereau and Jaco Parrots in their protected habitat along with exotic flowers and tropical plants. Drive past tropical rain forests and several plantations displaying their fruit trees.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Jaco Falls:</strong> Take a 90-ft. flat walk to view the picturesque Jaco Falls tucked away in rain forest greenery. Take photos while getting a taste of local seasonal fruits along with a complimentary rum punch or fruit juice.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Seasonal fruits.</li>\n\t<li>Rum punch or fruit juice.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-easy-dominica-and-hibiscus-falls-dominica-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTY3Nzd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3laaTlvTmpjdk9EZ3hOREE0TkRJMU9UZzNNQzVxY0djfGIwYzFjZmMyMGQ2YThmMTdkNTU0NmU4ZDA1OWFhYTA4NDUwYmVkOTE1OWFmZDAxMzUyZDJlNzZkMDEzNDRhZTQ', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
