    {'code': '415049', 'port_slug': 'dominica', 'title': 'Whale & Dolphin Watching Adventure', 'slug': 'whale--dolphin-watching-adventure-415049', 'price': 114.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-whale-and-dolphin-watching-adventure-415049-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNTkyODF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJZUzlvTkdFdk9EZ3hOREE0TnpBeE1qTTRNaTVxY0djfGY3YTAyZmVlYzcyYTk0MGYwOTczOWFlNDQ0YzhhZDI2NDQ5YTAwZmY3YTZiYWE2ODFiMzkxMzBlZDc2ZjBmZmM&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '415033', 'port_slug': 'dominica', 'title': 'Experience Dominica:Emerald Pool & Beach Pleasures', 'slug': 'experience-dominica-emerald-pool--beach-pleasures-415033', 'price': 94.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 11, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-emerald-pool-and-beach-pleasures-dominica-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTAxMjh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGpOQzlvWWpZdk9EZ3hOREE0TkRVNE56VTFNQzVxY0djfDMwN2I4MzVkZmUyMWY4YzVkYTc0MzUyYTkxNDhjODMwZDVjZjgzODQyMGRiMjI4ODljMjkzMDRiMDRlYWVjZDg&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '953076', 'port_slug': 'dubrovnik', 'title': 'Country Home in Konavle', 'slug': 'country-home-in-konavle-953076', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': 'Genuine village family atmosphere and traditional specialties await you not far from the city. Pass through villages for one hour in your motor coach to the small village of Poljica, where the Glavic family will welcome you into their typical Konavle-style house. This family has lived here for generations producing grape brandy, olive oil and wine in the traditional Croatian way. Relax and take a stroll around their home learning all about their wine and olive oil production. Seat yourself in the large dining room and enjoy a typical Croatian lunch with home-made wine, while listening to two local musicians playing a medley of Croatian and international songs. This family atmosphere and exquisite scenery, plus the charm of your celebrated host, will provide a wonderful and memorable setting for an unforgettable day. You&rsquo;ll return to the Old City of Dubrovnik for some time to explore the town on your own.<br />', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Country-Home-in-Konvale-13.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMDkxNDYyfGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmcwWkM5b1ltWXZPRGd4TkRBM09UQTBPVGMxT0M1cWNHY3w5ZmM2OGRlMWFmNjBkYjg3YTIyYzc2MDdlNjU4YzRmMGY5MDk4MmRmMjgzZWM1YTk1MmFmNzcyY2Q2N2M4YWIx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '953089', 'port_slug': 'dubrovnik', 'title': 'Scenic Road Train & Wine Tasting', 'slug': 'scenic-road-train--wine-tasting-953089', 'price': 219.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': 'Learn the history of Konavle Valley grape cultivation, with climactic and geological conditions ripe for winemaking and the age-old traditions that local winemaking experts use to produce exceptional vino. Your vehicle will wend its way through the rural landscape to a series of charming vineyards nestled among olive orchards and citrus groves, each offering their own unique practices and varietals. Meet the local winemakers, learn how they produce and bottle their wines, and discover the chief characteristics of these southern Dalmatian nectars. Sample the best whites, reds and fruity dessert wines. Complete your tour at the village of Ljuta. The mill system was extremely important for the economy of Konavle, and here, visitors are introduced to a fully restored, authentic mill and the fascinating process of milling corn using the incredible force of water to set a huge millstone into motion. Additional cultural exhibits include a wool-making demonstration, performed by natives in heritage garb. Enjoy several wine tastings and a ploughmans lunch of smoked bacon and onions, just as the locals eat while working in the fields.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Konavle-7.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w5NTMzN3xpbWFnZS9qcGVnfGFXMWhaMlZ6TDJoaE9TOW9Zekl2T0RneE5EQTRNVGN6Tmpjek5DNXFjR2N8ODI3NjA5Mjg0NGZhOTQzNWFlMWI5ZTU5MDdlZTU4YjRiNjNjODcyYzc0Y2YzNWM4YWRmZmQ3ZmE5MDQ2MDA3YQ', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '953075', 'port_slug': 'dubrovnik', 'title': 'Dubrovnik Highlights', 'slug': 'dubrovnik-highlights-953075', 'price': 114.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': 'The tour is an ideal combination of panoramic views, a visit to the charming resort of Cavtat and free time in Dubrovnik. A drive high above the old town of Dubrovnik allows you to stop and capture the picture-postcard views. The route then continues through the lovely Zupa Valley, the beautiful eastern part of the Dubrovnik Riviera, and the picturesque resorts of Kupari, Srebreno, Mlini and Plat. The lovely little town of Cavtat, the southernmost town in Croatia, is situated in a bay between 2 peninsulas and is one of the oldest cities in this part of the Adriatic. Few places offer such a harmony of lush Mediterranean growth, emerald sea and new architecture, whilst cherishing a rich cultural and historical tradition. At a venue overlooking the beautiful bay, enjoy a refreshing soft drink, before free time to explore Cavtat at your leisure. Upon your return to Dubrovnik, you&rsquo;ll have approximately one hour to explore the city independently, before returning to the pier.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Cavtat1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzODQxNjV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzRPUzlvTVRrdk9EZ3hOREEzT0RreE9EWTROaTVxY0djfDNlNmUyYTRkMjJiMDMwMmE5NjUyZDZhY2ZkNGYzOGRhZGNkOTNiZjFiNWRmNzFiNWViYzUxNWJlNDQyMzU0NjM', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '953091', 'port_slug': 'dubrovnik', 'title': 'Ladies and Lords of the Throne', 'slug': 'ladies-and-lords-of-the-throne-953091', 'price': 174.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': 'Welcome to Dubrovnik -- an enchanting 1,400-year-old medieval walled town famously dubbed the Pearl of Adriatic. The ethereal beauty of this walled city was immortalized the words of writer George Bernard Shaw, who suggested that, "those who seek paradise on Earth should come to Dubrovnik."Perhaps it is no surprise, then, that in 2011, HBO chose Dubrovnik as a filming location for its award-winning show The Game of Thrones.&nbsp; <p><br /> </p> <p>The chemistry between HBO and Dubrovnik has proven to function perfectly. The city and its surroundings have been featured in a show for three consecutive years (seasons 2, 3 and 4) in the role of King\'s Landing and the magical town of Qarth -- \'the greatest city there was or ever will be\'. Because truth is never far from fiction, today you will get acquainted Dubrovnik\'s real-life \'game\' -- a medieval epic straight from the pages of history, covering how the small, but influential, medieval city-state of Dubrovnik has played against ruthless enemies and larger competitors to win its survival and preserve its precious freedom.&nbsp;</p> <p>A team of devoted Game of Thrones fans has carefully and thoughtfully constructed this tour, which showcases the spectacular Dubrovnik locations featured in the show. As you stride from one iconic GoT scene to the other, enjoy the familiar and breathtaking landscapes. It is an unforgettable journey that follows in the footsteps of your favorite characters, through the scenic sets of Blackwater Bay to the House of the Undying. Season 3 and 4 introduced the Trsteno Arboretum -- a lovely Mediterranean park. Iconic scenes involving Lady Margaery, Ser Loras and their witty grandmother, Lady Olenna Tyrell (the Queen of Thorns), take place here.&nbsp;</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-game-of-thrones-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNDU4Mzd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3lNQzlvTmpRdk9EZ3hOREE0TWpBNU56RTRNaTVxY0djfDFhNDE4YjBlOWE4ZDVlNDAyNmZlYjkxYzg2ZTk4M2M0ODdiODA1MDgxMzg2MDNhM2IzMDQxNTE3ZjA4ZWVjMGU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '953078', 'port_slug': 'dubrovnik', 'title': 'Dubrovnik By Land and Sea', 'slug': 'dubrovnik-by-land-and-sea-953078', 'price': 144.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': 'Experience a unique opportunity to explore Dubrovnik from the inside as well as the outside and enjoy the tranquility of the Island of Lokrum. Enjoy a 60-minute panoramic sail towards the Old City Harbor of Dubrovnik with great photo opportunities of the famous City Walls. Enjoy a guided walking tour of the Old City past the Sponza Palace, the Church of Saint Blaise, Onofriou&rsquo;s Fountain and the Rector s Palace. Explore the city on your own before returning to the boat. Sail to the Lokrum island, a nature preserve rich in history for some free time to explore. Sail back to the mainland and board your motor coach, stopping at the famous panoramic view point overlooking the Old City.<br /> <div></div>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Dubrovnik-by-Land-and-Sea-14.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTMzMzk1fGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmd4WXk5b1pqRXZPRGd4TkRBM09UTTNOelF6T0M1cWNHY3w4ZmNhZjdkYTMzNTBlYTE4NmU5ZmNiZDk2ZTJhNWUzMGE1MzFmMjM5OTVmZjU5YzAxMGJlNTdjOGUzNzI4NDA1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
