    {'code': '888024', 'port_slug': 'dun-laoghaire-dublin-ireland', 'title': 'Dublin Coast & Irish Traditions', 'slug': 'dublin-coast--irish-traditions-888024', 'price': 254.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/888024-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDcwNDJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREF4TDJobE5DODVNVEF6TnpBNE56Z3lOakl5THpnNE9EQXlOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiOWQ1MWU2NWY4N2Q1OWQyMzdiODg4ZDdlM2U5MmRkOGI4NGQ1N2M2MzRlOWE1NjcyOTU5MzMyY2MyOTQ1Nzdi&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '888026', 'port_slug': 'dun-laoghaire-dublin-ireland', 'title': 'Horseback Riding in the Garden of Ireland', 'slug': 'horseback-riding-in-the-garden-of-ireland-888026', 'price': 309.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/888026-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ2Njd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFF6TDJnM015ODVNVEF6TnpBM05UY3dNakEyTHpnNE9EQXlOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wxY2NhYmExNWEzNzk5MzU3YjdmNTg5ODZjNTc5MzE1YWU1NTk1ZDgzZTM3ZmQ3Y2YwNzc2ZGM1YTg1YzU3M2I5&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '888023', 'port_slug': 'dun-laoghaire-dublin-ireland', 'title': 'Dublin Combo - Christchurch Cathedral & Guinness', 'slug': 'dublin-combo--christchurch-cathedral--guinness-888023', 'price': 229.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Panoramic Dublin:</strong> Take in the sights of Dublin on a panoramic drive through the city, including the picturesque Georgian District and historic Merrion Square. Marvel at the iconic Christchurch Cathedral and admire the views of Trinity College, Ireland\'s oldest university, as you learn about the city\'s rich history and culture.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Christ Church Cathedral:</strong> Explore the historic heart of Dublin at Christ Church Cathedral, a landmark that has stood for almost 1,000 years. Discover its rich heritage, renowned liturgy, and musical excellence as you soak in its beauty and experience a sense of spirituality that transcends generations.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Independent Adventures:</strong> Enjoy the freedom to explore Dublin\'s culinary scene during your free time, as well as the chance to browse through the city\'s diverse shopping options and discover unique treasures.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Guinness Storehouse:</strong> Experience the birthplace of Ireland\'s most famous stout at Guinness Storehouse where you\'ll embark on a self-guided tour through the fascinating history of Guinness, witnessing the brewing process, and enjoying a complimentary taste of the iconic "black stuff,” while taking in panoramic views of Dublin.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Professional English-speaking tour guide.</li>\n\t<li>Admission to Christchurch Cathedral for a self-guided tour.</li>\n\t<li>Self-guided Guinness Storehouse Experience and 1 drink per person.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/888023-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTY0MzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGMxTDJnM09DODVNREkyTVRneE56STJNak00THpnNE9EQXlNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyY2Y5NWQwN2QwNTA5MzZiYTViMmFkNWJmNDU3ZjUzNGZkNGE5ZGI0YTk2MzQxMmQxZTA0MjkzOWZjODg5NmQ0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '310074', 'port_slug': 'ensenada', 'title': 'Baja’s Thrilling Desert Nest Zip Line', 'slug': 'baja-s-thrilling-desert-nest-zip-line-310074', 'price': 130.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.9, 'review_count': 15, 'desc_html': '<strong>Zip Line Adventure:</strong> Your body and spirits are lifted to new heights as you take to the air and zipline through this beautiful rocky mountain desert area of the Baja. A 25-minute air-conditioned bus ride takes you to the site bordered by the unique beauty of Cuatro Cuatros Vineyard.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>5 Zip Line Circuit:</strong> After a safety briefing, your guides will lead you along a rocky, uphill hike to the first zip line run. This super-speed, 5 Zip Line circuit is one of the longest (2.3-mile) in Mexico and takes zip-lining to a whole new level while delivering one adrenaline rush after another!\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Free time at Cuatro Cuatros:</strong> Afterwards, settle back down to earth gradually at this massive compound located on 2,130 acres of land between the world-famous vineyards of Valle de Guadalupe and the dramatic coastline of Baja California. Drinks available for purchase.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Zipline Equipment.\n    </li>\n</ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/310074-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY3MzB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFUyTDJnMU5TODRPVFEwTlRNeU5EVTFORFUwTHpNeE1EQTNOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyMzk4OTkyMzk1MzE4NmUxNjhhMmUzNzVlNmJmMGZlNjA4ZjAzMWQ4NDRhZjNiZGNkZmRlZjY5OTIzNDhhZTJi', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '310082', 'port_slug': 'ensenada', 'title': 'Become a Tequila & Mezcal Connoisseur in theValley', 'slug': 'become-a-tequila--mezcal-connoisseur-in-thevalley-310082', 'price': 92.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.8, 'review_count': 32, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Become a Connoisseur:</strong> Learn about the history and culture of Mezcal and Tequila, two of Mexico’s most famous drinks. Discover how Mezcal is distilled from the Maguey Agave and how tequila is produced from the exotic Blue Agave. You will also learn how to complement each spirit with Mexican elements like cocoa, citrus, Chapulin (yep, crickets), salt, worm salt, and marinated baked Chapulines with chilies.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Mezcal Tasting:</strong> Taste two kinds of Mezcal and savor its distinctively smoky flavor. It is often sipped with salt and fruit. Compare their unique flavors and aromas during this tasting experience.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Tequila Tasting:</strong> Sample two types of tequila, considered Mexico’s national drink and has long played an important role in Mexican culture. While its origins date back to the mid-16th century, tequila only gained widespread popularity after the Mexican Revolution.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Margarita Time:</strong> Enter a speakeasy bar to enjoy a delicious margarita made with authentic tequila.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Free Time:</strong> During your free time, visit the vineyard’s restaurant offering a selection of fresh seafood, gourmet tacos and other Mexican specialties. You’ll also have the chance to shop for some of the tequilas and mezcals you tasted before returning to your ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Mezcal and tequila tasting (2 shots of each).</li>\n\t<li>One margarita.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/310082-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE4NDJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1JrTDJnNE5DODVNRFF3TkRBMk9UTTNOak13THpNeE1EQTRNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w5YzRkMGNjY2Q3N2MxY2IyNDM3OTY5OTg2ZjFlMDM0NDBlNzMyZmRhYWY1YTJkNjNiYjc0ZDQwYjZiOTJmMTJm', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '310006', 'port_slug': 'ensenada', 'title': 'Wine Country Tour - Free Bottle of Wine!', 'slug': 'wine-country-tour--free-bottle-of-wine-310006', 'price': 86.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.4, 'review_count': 14, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Discover Guadalupe Valley:</strong> Board your air-conditioned bus for an educational 45-50-minute breathtaking drive though Calafia Valley. Laying 850 feet above sea level, this remote region of the Baja California Peninsula is widely recognized in Mexico for growing the highest quality grapes and producing world-renowned wines.<br /> <br /> <strong>L.A. Cetto Winery:</strong> Welcome to L.A. Cetto Winery, well known for delicious wines and a must do for wine lovers. Enjoy a 30-minute guided tour of the winery, learn about the wine making process, including crushing of grapes, fermentation, pressing, aging and bottling and other surprises. You will get to taste four different wines (reds and whites) and receive a free bottle of wine.<br /> <br /> <strong>La Casa de Do&ntilde;a Lupe:</strong> Taste selected wines served with assorted cheeses and biscuits. Try more than 30 kinds of fruit jams, cheese, bread, olive pate, cream liqueurs, jalapeno &amp; avocado dips, and a wide variety of cream cheese mixes. You can also visit the winery&#39;s store, where you may purchase these wines at considerable savings.<br /> <br /> <strong>What&rsquo;s Included:</strong></p> <ul> \t<li>Wine tasting at each winery.</li> \t<li>One bottle of wine per person.</li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-wine-country-tour-ensenada-mexico-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w3NDI2NzB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaG1ZeTlvWmpVdk9EZ3hOREV4TWpJME16YzBNaTVxY0djfDVjN2ZkNjYxYTY3YmZjNjA3NGVlM2YwOGEyYzAwMTE3YjFiN2ZjZGIxYjRhMmZmNDUyZGUyZDE5NjE1ZGRlMTA', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '310077', 'port_slug': 'ensenada', 'title': 'Rosarito Beach Break with Tacos & Margaritas', 'slug': 'rosarito-beach-break-with-tacos--margaritas-310077', 'price': 88.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 27, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Day at the Beach:</strong> Enjoy a relaxing day on the beach at an exclusive Rosarito Baja beach club. This day pass is specially designed for families. Chill on the lounge chairs while the kids join the beach activities organized by the club. You’ll also enjoy the lively Mexican music played by a DJ. Your day pass gives you access to the club’s facilities, including restrooms and showers.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Tacos &amp; Margaritas:</strong> Enjoy delicious and authentic Mexican tacos and margaritas.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Beach club entrance fee.</li>\n\t<li>Tacos (2) and margaritas (3) or soft drinks are included.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/310077-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM2ODV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGM1TDJneE5DODRPVGMzTURFNE1qVTNORE00THpNeE1EQTNOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0OGRlNWQ1NTE0N2E3OTk1MTA5YjM3YTQ3MWIxYTk2YTQ0NTRiNmYwMDUzYjhhNTFiNTRjOTk0ZTRlMDBjNDY0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '310014', 'port_slug': 'ensenada', 'title': 'Taste of Mexico & Margarita Madness', 'slug': 'taste-of-mexico--margarita-madness-310014', 'price': 102.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.6, 'review_count': 28, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>City Tour:</strong> Embark on a thrilling adventure through the heart of the city! Your guide will take you on a journey through the most iconic landmarks and attractions. Next, head to Ventana al Mar Plaza to see the historical monuments and the third largest Mexican flag in the country.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Valle de Guadalupe:</strong> Venture into the Napa Valley of Mexico! This is where the last Spanish mission was established before Mexico claimed independence. The local tradition of beautiful missionary gardens and vineyards continue to this day.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Mi Dulce Vista:</strong> In a peaceful outdoor atmosphere, spice up your culinary skills while enjoying unlimited margaritas. A local chef will tantalize your palate with authentic Mexican fare, sharing the secrets of traditional favorites such as molcajete salsa, tostada, enchilada, and guacamole. Enjoy a wine tasting, local bread, and extra virgin olive oil during your visit<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Local Tequilera:</strong> Learn about the ancient art of tequila-making! Discover the differences between various tequilas, sampling blanco, reposado, and añejo tequilas and additional liquors.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Shopping:</strong> Visit a local market where you can shop to your heart's content and take home a piece of Mexico with you.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Unlimited margaritas.</li>\n\t<li>3 tequila shots.</li>\n\t<li>3 liquor shots.</li>\n\t<li>Salsa molcajete.</li>\n\t<li>Beef tostada.</li>\n\t<li>Chicken enchilada.</li>\n\t<li>Guacamole.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/310014-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTEzMTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR00wTDJobU5DODVNREl5TVRFNE1qazNOak13THpNeE1EQXhOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjNjNiYzc4MWY0ZGFhN2E1N2NjZjBmODc5ZGY2NjEyYjA5MDQ3NGViNzEzNDBjOTk0MWI1NDJiYWE4ZWMxNzNh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
