    {'code': '310061', 'port_slug': 'ensenada', 'title': 'Lobster Lunch at Puerto Nuevo & Rosarito Shopping', 'slug': 'lobster-lunch-at-puerto-nuevo--rosarito-shopping-310061', 'price': 103.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 30, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y03-lobster-lunch-at-puerto-nuevo-rosarito-shopping-310061-3.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTQwMDB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGtZaTlvTkdVdk9EZ3hNalV4TVRrMU1qa3lOaTVxY0djfGMwODUwYTcwODExZGIzMzU4OTYwNTBkZDZkMTk3NWY2YmI1Y2MxYTllMDhjMzBlODk4MzJjZWY1ZmU4MTc1M2I&w=700&h=550&resize_profile=pdpgallery', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '733002', 'port_slug': 'fukuoka-hakata', 'title': 'Dazaifu Tenmangu Shrine', 'slug': 'dazaifu-tenmangu-shrine-733002', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Dazaifu Shrine:</strong> Experience the Dazaifu Shrine, dedicated to the revered 9th-century scholar Sugawara no Michizane. This shrine is particularly popular among students seeking success in school entrance exams. Michizane's legacy is honored with over 12,000 shrines across Japan, with Dazaifu Tenmangu being the most notable. Visit during spring to see the stunning 6,000-plus plum trees in bloom, including the famous Tobiume, or Flying Plum, said to have followed Michizane in exile by flying down from Kyoto to Dazaifu.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/733002-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTY3NzB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREZrTDJoa055ODVOalF5TnprNE1UZzJOVEkyTHpjek16QXdNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkNWU0ODIyMzA2YjZjOTdhNmYxZDE2OWFiZDgwODIyOTU2MzExMDEyZjNmMzZjYTAwYzI3ZWJiNGNiNjMzNmRm', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '733001', 'port_slug': 'fukuoka-hakata', 'title': 'Highlights of Fukuoka', 'slug': 'highlights-of-fukuoka-733001', 'price': 149.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Tenjin:</strong> Hop on an air-conditioned motorcoach and relax as you discover the beauty of Fukuoka city. Pass through the lively Tenjin area, known for its business activities and vibrant shopping scene.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Fukuoka Dome:</strong> As you explore Fukuoka, be sure to look for the Fukuoka Dome, the country's first baseball stadium equipped with a retractable roof.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Fukuoka Tower:</strong> Head to Fukuoka Tower for a photo opportunity at Japan's largest seaside tower. At 767 ft., it features 8,000 semi-mirrored panels and functions as a key broadcast antenna for local TV and radio networks.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Kushida Shrine:</strong> Discover Kushida Shrine, Fukuoka's historic shrine founded in AD 757, where local merchants seek blessings for health and prosperity. In mid-July, witness the 1,200-year-old Yamakasa festival with elaborate one-ton floats showcasing mythical creatures and historical figures at the shrine.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Hakata Machiya Folk Museum:</strong> Journey to the Hakata Machiya Folk Museum, nestled in three traditional townhouses that celebrate Japan's vibrant culture. Immerse yourself in a recreated Hakata neighborhood filled with historical images, artifacts, and skilled artisans showcasing their craft-making techniques.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/733001-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM5ODV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGMwTDJneVlTODVOak00TlRReE1EWTJNamN3THpjek16QXdNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzOWI2Y2YwOGViNDRkMWVhYjI4ZGUxODJkNjQwYzk2MzA3OTdlZDJkZDdmNTc1MTVlNzk4YmY2ZjkyZjI5MTNj', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '807024', 'port_slug': 'funchal', 'title': 'Botanical Gardens & Monte Cable Car', 'slug': 'botanical-gardens--monte-cable-car-807024', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/botanical-gardens-and-monte-cable-car-87024-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQwNzd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3paUzlvTmpBdk9EZ3lPVGM0TURNMk1USTBOaTVxY0djfGI4Y2YyZjZiMjMwYTYwOWJjZTg2ZTNhZDRkMzNjY2U0MTdkMDk1MGNiNDAwNjUyNzFhYTg5ZmJkYWUyOTZmNDA&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '807031', 'port_slug': 'funchal', 'title': 'Cabo Girao & Mercado dos Lavradores', 'slug': 'cabo-girao--mercado-dos-lavradores-807031', 'price': 102.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p>Travel through Funchal by motor coach and arrive at Cabo Girao, one of Europe’s highest standing sea cliffs at over 1,800 feet above sea level. You’ll travel past the picturesque fishing village of Camara de Lobos followed by vineyards, terraced fields, pinewoods, and eucalyptus groves. Arrive at Cabo Girao’s peak with dramatic views of the coast and Funchal in the distance. Later, enjoy the scenic view from Pico dos Barcelos observation deck, a panoramic scenery of Funchal with its red-tiled roofs. Next, head to the Mercado dos Lavradores (the Funchal farmers market), hosting colorful displays of fresh fruits, vegetables, flowers, and crafts where local Madeiran people shop daily. Afterwards, proceed to the embroidery factory and witness, first-hand, how hand-stitched embroidery is made. Embroidery has long been one of Madeira's exports and is as acclaimed as the island’s wine which will be offered to you as you browse the showroom. Enjoy your glass of wine before heading back to the pier.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/cabo-girao-and-mercado-dos-lavradores-807031-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ1NDV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGpOQzlvTm1Zdk9EZ3lPRGt6TURNNU1qQTVOQzVxY0djfDcwYTc1Nzk0MWEzMTM2ZGU4ODVmZmUwNTQwOGIyZDVmZTRiZmY2MDUyOWNhMTcxNjcwNzY4ZmJhODdmZjA0NDQ', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '807032', 'port_slug': 'funchal', 'title': 'Cabo Girao & The Blandy Wine Lodge', 'slug': 'cabo-girao--the-blandy-wine-lodge-807032', 'price': 106.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p>Board your motor coach and take a scenic drive through Funchal. You’ll travel past the picturesque fishing village of Camara de Lobos followed by vineyards, terraced fields, pinewoods, and eucalyptus groves enroute to the clifftop. Cabo Girao, the second highest sea cliff in the world at 1,500 feet above sea level, offers stunning views of the Funchal coastline. Next, make a photo stop at Pico dos Barcelos for panoramic shot of Funchal with its red-tiled roofs. Proceed to Blandy’s Wine Lodge, one of the oldest and most respected producers of Madeira wine, established in 1811. You'll learn about four different types of Madeiran wine and then sample two varieties of your choosing. You can even purchase a few bottles before you complete your tour and head back to the ship.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/cabo-giaro-and-the-blandy-wine-lodge-807032-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTkxNzB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3hPUzlvWVdRdk9EZ3pNVGc0TlRrek5EWXlNaTVxY0djfDQzNTQ1ZTUxMjBmZmIxNTIyM2EyOGU5NGRiYzFmMDYwMTI0YzM2YzVjMGQxMDFmZDY2ZjhiZmU3OGU3YTZkOGU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '807030', 'port_slug': 'funchal', 'title': 'Cable Car, Monte, Toboggan Ride & Wine Tasting', 'slug': 'cable-car-monte-toboggan-ride--wine-tasting-807030', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p>Ride the Madeira Cable Car from Funchal to Monte, a civil parish that is surrounded by amazing views of the city from over 700 feet in the air. Once there, you’ll tour Our Lady of Monte Church and see its beautiful interior with a statue of Our Lady of Monte, the patron saint of Funchal, sitting above the altar. The church also contains the tomb of Emperor Charles I, the last Hapsburg monarch, who died in exile in Madeira in 1922. After your visit, get ready for a thrilling ride as you climb into a wicker basket and experience the island’s famous toboggan ride, also known as the “Snowless Sled Ride.” Following your sled fun, you’ll head to a Madeira wine lodge that features some of the world’s oldest and most complex wines. Learn about the different types of Madeira wines and sample two varieties. Perhaps, purchase a bottle of wine before your departure back to the ship and reminisce about Madeiran culture as you sip your wine back home.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/cable-car-monte-toboggan-ride-and-wine-tasting-87030-2.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM1MjB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3dZeTlvWm1Fdk9EZ3pNamcyTkRZME9USTBOaTVxY0djfDQ4MmUxZWVjNDgxOWQwNzUwMmU1NDA4MTBmNmNmOTM2ODY1MGU1NWNkNTVmNDI5ZDBmMWZkODI5MDE3MDEzYzM', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '807026', 'port_slug': 'funchal', 'title': 'Scenic Madeira', 'slug': 'scenic-madeira-807026', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/scenic-madeira-807026-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc0MjR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3lOeTlvTXpRdk9EZ3lPVGczTVRRMU5qSTROaTVxY0djfGM3NmM4OWQ2MzZiM2RiNTljODgxNTYyZTYyNjQ0ZWUzN2FkNjBhNmVjOTAyYzA1YTJhNTkyNDFjYWUyYWQ4Zjk&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '807027', 'port_slug': 'funchal', 'title': 'The Spirit of Madeira', 'slug': 'the-spirit-of-madeira-807027', 'price': 169.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p>Discover the island of Madeira on this scenic drive excursion and toboggan ride adventure. You’ll travel to Camacha parish, the heart of the island’s fine wickerwork industry, and then visit Our Lady of Monte Church. After that, get ready for a thrilling ride as you climb into a wicker basket and experience the island’s famous toboggan ride, also known as the “Snowless Sled Ride.” As your tour comes to an end, enjoy a sample of delicious Madeira wine at a local wine lodge before heading back to the pier.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Madeira wine samples.</li>\n\t<li>Lunch.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/the-spirit-of-madeira-807027-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDMzNDd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzFNQzlvTW1Vdk9EZ3lPVGc0TnpFMU1qRTFPQzVxY0djfGM1OGE1YWU0ODZhYTE0MjE4ZWJkOWQ0ZWY1OGM3OGRmNjhjN2UwYzNhYjliODU5ZTlmY2MwYTliOGE5MWQwN2E', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
