    {'code': '807039', 'port_slug': 'funchal', 'title': 'Camara de Lobos & Riberia Brava by 4X4', 'slug': 'camara-de-lobos--riberia-brava-by-4x4-807039', 'price': 149.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/camara-de-lobos-and-riberia-brava-by-4x4-807039-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ1ODF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3hNQzlvWTJFdk9EZ3lPRFV5TURnNU1ETTVPQzVxY0djfGRmODllOWRkN2NiYmVmODI3MmE0MmU3YzYxMzg5OGEzMGZjYzJkNzgxZTMzZjMwMWQyNzE5OTExNDRiN2I3N2Q&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '807029', 'port_slug': 'funchal', 'title': 'Cable Car, Monte, Toboggan Ride & Gardens', 'slug': 'cable-car-monte-toboggan-ride--gardens-807029', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/cable-car-monte-tobboggan-ride-and-gardens-807029-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDYzNDd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzVPQzlvTURrdk9EZ3pNekEwT1RVMU9UQTNNQzVxY0djfGFjYTY5ZWY3MGJlODVmYjZkZGI2YWFjOTcyMTRlN2ZkY2ZjMTkwNjE5YWMyZGNiN2M1YjZjN2E4MDE4M2E2OWQ&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '807028', 'port_slug': 'funchal', 'title': 'Ribeira Brava, Cabo Girao & Porto Moniz', 'slug': 'ribeira-brava-cabo-girao--porto-moniz-807028', 'price': 154.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "Discover the island of Madeira on a panoramic drive that features sweeping views of the island’s dramatic sea cliffs, central plateau, and scenic southwest coast.\n<br /><br />\nBoard your motor coach and travel along the north shore to the small village of Ribeira Brava, perched on a steep canyon dividing the island. At the village, enjoy a brief tour before continuing to Cabo Girão, the second highest sea cliffs in the world, offering stunning views of Madeira. While there, you’ll enjoy a lunch that includes some of the island’s local specialties. In Cabo Girao, you'll have a chance to see the dramatic cliffs, scenic waterfalls and small valleys, each with their own microclimate. Proceed to Porto Moniz, famous for its natural swimming pools. Next, travel up to the central plateau of Paul da Serra, often described as the “Roof of Madeira”, measuring nearly 5,000 feet above sea level with dramatic cliffs at the end of the plateau's southwest coast. Afterwards, you’ll descend to Calheta, a fertile, coastal strip of land that produces sugar cane, bananas, and grapes. Take a tour of the distillery, Engenho da Calheta, where white rum is produced from the island’s sugar cane. You’ll have a chance to learn how rum is distilled and sample an island beverage made with rum and honey called “poncho.” Enjoy a slice of traditional Madeira cake before boarding your motor coach for the return trip to the pier leaving with a sweet taste of Madeiran culture.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n\t<li>\n        Lunch.\n    </li>\n</ul>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/ribeirra-brava-cabo-cirao-and-porto-moniz-807028-4.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQwMTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNPQzlvTnpBdk9EZ3lPVGczTlRrME5UVXdNaTVxY0djfDhiY2ZlZTg0MzFlYjY1MGI3YjBiOTliNjhiNDU2YmYwZWIyM2VmZTRmMDVmZGU2ZDU0ZjU2NTkzMmQwNzkyNjk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '861004', 'port_slug': 'gibraltar', 'title': 'World War II Tunnels & Europa Point', 'slug': 'world-war-ii-tunnels--europa-point-861004', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': 'Follow in the footsteps of the world leaders of World War II on this guided walk through the intricate network of tunnels. Enjoy the views of the most southerly point in Europe, site of the Trinity Lighthouse. Step back in time to the year 1940 when Britain was at war with Germany and Italy and the future of Gibraltar looked bleak. A decision was taken by Winston Churchill and the British Military leaders to construct a massive network of tunnels. Experience these World War II tunnels as your guide takes you on a journey through this amazing fortress. Visit the areas that housed the hospital, power station, military headquarters and accommodation for nearly 10,000 troops and civilians. On a clear day, the views of Spain are spectacular from Jock’s Balcony lookout point. You’ll have free time to enjoy the display of photographic images, depicting life as it was in the 1940s.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-World-War-II-Tunnels-and-Europa-Point-10.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0NTgwNDE5fGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmczTnk5b01Ua3ZPRGd3T1RFeU9Ea3hPVEEzTUM1cWNHY3xkYzg3ZDZhZGY0OGFmMTM0ODFlYzEyMDIzMTc0MWI2Yzg2Yzg4N2IyMzk5M2Y2ZjMxM2Q5NGQxNmNmOTQ3YmRk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '861005', 'port_slug': 'gibraltar', 'title': 'Cruise the Rock & Dolphin Watch', 'slug': 'cruise-the-rock--dolphin-watch-861005', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<strong>Sightseeing Cruise:</strong> After a short motorcoach transfer, board your vessel and sit out on deck to take in the splendid views. Have your binoculars and camera ready for this adventure along the Bay of Gibraltar in search of the three species of dolphins found in the waters – the Common, Striped and Bottlenose. These mammals breed in the sheltered bay which is rich in food. You can often see mothers and their calves in pods ranging from 20 to 30 to upwards of a hundred. To witness this incredible sight, in-person, defies description. Make sure you always have your camera ready to capture this thrilling experience. The tour concludes at the ship, but you may choose to make your own way into town from the ferry terminal to browse and shop independently. \n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Dolphin Adventure ticket.\n    </li>\n</ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Cruise-the-Rock-and-Dolphin-Watch-10.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0NDUxMTg3fGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmc0TUM5b1l6UXZPRGd3T1RFeU9USXhNems0TWk1cWNHY3w1ZTdhZWE1OTZmMGEyNmMzZDdmYTBjYWU1NzBlMzA1ZjZmMzcwMmQ2ZGVkMzk3NzQ5MDgzMThjMWQxNTIzNzFl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '861006', 'port_slug': 'gibraltar', 'title': 'Scenic Drive, Luxury Yacht & Europa Point', 'slug': 'scenic-drive-luxury-yacht--europa-point-861006', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Sightseeing:</strong> Board a small motorcoach at the pier for this panoramic drive and follow the route to Winston Churchill Avenue and across the airstrip to the Spanish border. Head towards the Trinity Lighthouse and pass by the historic city walls, American War Memorial, and Trafalgar Cemetery.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Europa Point:</strong> At Europa Point, enjoy the views across the Strait of Gibraltar to the North African mainland just 14 miles away.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sunborn Gibraltar Hotel:</strong> The culmination of the tour will be a visit to the luxury 5-star yacht hotel, Sunborn Gibraltar. Here, you will be treated to true Gibraltarian hospitality and enjoy a cup of tea, a selection of sandwiches, freshly baked scones, Cornish clotted cream, and strawberry jam.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Teatime experience.</li>\n\t<li>Licensed guide.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/scenic-drive-and-europa-point-861006-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTkzOTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzVaUzlvTmpNdk9EZ3pNekV3TlRNMk1qazNOQzVxY0djfDA0ZmY1ODcyOGZkNzYyMzM3ZjRlYTE0NTc1MWE5MWU2ODhmZjg1OTlhY2JiMzUxNmNkNTNiN2M1MDljMTYyMzU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '861012', 'port_slug': 'gibraltar', 'title': "Sightseeing & King's Bastion", 'slug': 'sightseeing--king-s-bastion-861012', 'price': 119.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<strong>Sightseeing:</strong> Enjoy a leisurely tour to some of Gibraltar’s must-see sights during this excursion. You’ll begin aboard a mini-coach and end with a walking tour of the 18th-century fortress known as King’s Bastion. First, you will follow the fortress walls passing by Camp Bay. Here, you’ll have perfect views of Parson’s Lodge, a fortification built by the British in 1842. From there, journey to Europa Point to photograph the beautiful lighthouse that dominates the landscape. Sharing the grounds is the Shrine of Our Lady of Europe and Ibrahim-al-Ibrahim Mosque, Europe’s most southerly mosque. \n<br /><br />\n<strong>King’s Bastion:</strong> The walking tour of King’s Bastion will take you past the old guns, uniforms and other exhibits from the era. Finally, you’ll have the option of returning to the ship, or shopping in the City Center, which is just a short walk away. \n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Licensed guide.\n    </li>\n</ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-861012-City-Kings-Castion-Tour.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNTQyMjR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzBZaTlvT0dJdk9EZ3dPVEV6TVRFME56STVOQzVxY0djfDQ1YjUzNmU1ZmY5NDA1NWNmOTM3NGE3MGFiZjk0NGY2MzY1MzYwZjJkZmE1Y2MyZThhMzVmMTA5MGU0MzhhZWM', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '861002', 'port_slug': 'gibraltar', 'title': "Ape's Den, St. Michael's Cave & Europa Point", 'slug': 'ape-s-den-st-michael-s-cave--europa-point-861002', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<strong>Europa Point:</strong> Board your motorcoach for a scenic drive to some of Gibraltar's most popular attractions. On Europa Point, the beautiful red and white striped lighthouse dominates the landscape. Situated at the gateway between the Atlantic and the Mediterranean on Europe's most southerly point, it stands proudly over the area and is visible for miles. Sharing the grounds is the Shrine of Our Lady of Europe and the Ibrahim-al-Ibrahim Mosque. \n<br /><br />\n<strong>St. Michael’s Cave:</strong> A walk through St. Michael's Cave, an extraordinary natural phenomenon, reveals illuminated stalagmites and stalactites, subterranean passageways, and an unexpected amphitheater. \n<br /><br />\n<strong>Ape’s Den:</strong> No visit to Gibraltar would be complete without seeing the Barbary Apes, the only free-roaming monkeys in Europe. These tailless creatures have been entertaining visitors with their playful antics for years and have mysteriously inhabited the area for centuries. At the conclusion of the tour, you may return directly to port or stay in town for independent sightseeing. \n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Entry into the Gibraltar Nature Reserve.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Entry into the St. Michael’s Cave. \n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Licensed guide.\n    </li>\n</ul>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Apes-Den-St-Michaels-Cave-and-Europe-Point-10.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjIwOTM1fGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmd3T0M5b09ERXZPRGd3T1RFeU9EQTVPVGczTUM1cWNHY3xmYTZhZDg3YjBhY2M0ZTM4NTM0OGYyNzlkNmU0ODJlZDJlOTM0YTgwMTIzNTgzMjY3ZDdjZWFjNDQzNzU3NDBl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '861003', 'port_slug': 'gibraltar', 'title': 'Apes Den, Cave and Great Siege Tunnels', 'slug': 'apes-den-cave-and-great-siege-tunnels-861003', 'price': 159.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Europa Point:</strong> Experience breathtaking views from Gibraltar's southernmost point as you gaze across the Strait of Gibraltar towards North Africa. Witness the unique meeting of two continents in one spectacular location.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Apes’ Den:</strong> Meet the famous Barbary macaques of Gibraltar as you explore the intriguing legends and history associated with these beloved animals.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>St. Michael’s Cave:</strong> Venture into a limestone cave where dramatic lighting highlights remarkable rock formations and expansive chambers.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Great Siege Tunnels:</strong> Journey through the hand-carved tunnels of the 18th-century Great Siege, enriched by immersive exhibits and panoramic viewpoints.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Iconic Airfield Viewpoint:</strong> Conclude your tour with a photo stop at Gibraltar's extraordinary airport runway, one of the most unique in the world. This runway stretches across the isthmus connecting land and sea, offering stunning views.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Entrance to St. Michael’s Cave.</li>\n\t<li>Entrance to the Great Siege Tunnels.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Cable-Car-Great-Siege-Tunnels01.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMjE0NTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNOUzlvT1Rrdk9EZ3dPVEV5T0RjeU1qUTJNaTVxY0djfDdlZTFlNWQ1Yjg3M2Q0OWE2MmY3YmY1OWM2Yjc5YjI4YzgyYjc5YTMzMzYxYmEwZGRiZTk1ZTYxYjdhNzVkZDA', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '861009', 'port_slug': 'gibraltar', 'title': 'Gibraltar Highlights - By Taxi', 'slug': 'gibraltar-highlights--by-taxi-861009', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/861009-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTc3MDh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1UwTDJneFpTODRPVGN3TXpZek9UWXhNemMwTHpnMk1UQXdPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhNjZkNDQ0ZWI3OGJlOWIwODkzZGI4NjJiYWJmMWU0MTAyZTUyOWY3ZmFiNmVhMzM2ZWU0ZGI3MmRiYzYzMjdh&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '861013', 'port_slug': 'gibraltar', 'title': 'Easy Gibraltar & Tapas', 'slug': 'easy-gibraltar--tapas-861013', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/861013-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU0NTR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1F6TDJnNE9DODRPVGN3TXpZME9UYzNNVGd5THpnMk1UQXhNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wxNmQ5ZTZmNzU2NDdjZTU1MjljMGMwZjYzMzk2YjFhMzZkYTBmNGJhMjlmOWIyY2E2NWZlY2IxNzExODMwMGRi&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '417222', 'port_slug': 'grand-cayman', 'title': 'Discover Grand Cayman & Food Tasting Experience', 'slug': 'discover-grand-cayman--food-tasting-experience-417222', 'price': 77.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.6, 'review_count': 17, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Tortuga Rum Cake Center:</strong> Visit the world-famous Tortuga Rum Cake Center to sample rum cake and rum, and shop for local souvenirs.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Wreck of the Ten Sails Memorial:</strong> Stop at the Wreck of the Ten Sails Memorial plaque and viewpoint and learn about the event.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Blow Holes of Cayman:</strong> Experience the geyser effect at Blow Holes. Watch the water splash and capture the perfect picture with amazing backgrounds.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Food Tasting:</strong> Visit an East End local restaurant, meet friendly locals, and sample a traditional Cayman dish. Enjoy a complimentary drink with your meal while soaking in a stunning sea view.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Rum sample.</li>\n\t<li>Rum cake sample.</li>\n\t<li>Local dish bite with drink.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/417222-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU0ODJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREEzTDJneU9TODVNREF5TmpBNU5qQTJOamcyTHpReE56SXlNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmMjYyNTE2NjUxMjMxZGQ0YTM2NjliMmMzMWQyNGViYjBmODAwMWM4NGM0ZDk3MDEyYmJiOWExMzJjZTViZDJi', 'duration': '4.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '417238', 'port_slug': 'grand-cayman', 'title': 'SeaTREK Helmet Dive at the Turtle Center', 'slug': 'seatrek-helmet-dive-at-the-turtle-center-417238', 'price': 119.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Turtle Adventure:</strong> Join a guided turtle experience and encounter sea turtles of all ages, from adorable hatchlings to mature breeders. Dive into the world’s first SeaTREK turtle interaction, where you can walk underwater with a specialized helmet that allows you to breathe naturally. Enjoy full admission to the Cayman Turtle Center, featuring vibrant reef fish, friendly turtles, and views of sharks through the Predator viewing glass.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Admission to Cayman Turtle Center.</li>\n\t<li>SeaTREK guided underwater helmet dive (20–25 minutes).</li>\n\t<li>Helmet, snorkel, mask, and vest.</li>\n\t<li>Guided tour of the Turtle Center facilities.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/417238-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDUwNjh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREkzTDJnNU5pODVNVEl4TnpjM01UVTJNVEkyTHpReE56SXpPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzNWYxYTMxNDE0M2NhZjQzN2UyYjVmOGRmMjFlYThkNjEwOGM1NThhOTI4MjQ1OGEyYjY1NjliZGU3NDdjMGEw', 'duration': '3.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '9'},
    {'code': '417019', 'port_slug': 'grand-cayman', 'title': 'Stingray Sandbar, Hell & Turtle Center Experience', 'slug': 'stingray-sandbar-hell--turtle-center-experience-417019', 'price': 92.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.7, 'review_count': 7, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Strike a Pose:</strong> Pass by the world-renowned Seven Mile Beach and stop at the old Homestead for a photo. A perfect chance to capture the island's scenic and historic highlights.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Turtle Center:</strong> Visit the Turtle Center at Boatswain's Beach, home to thousands of sea turtles. Learn about their habitat and conservation efforts during your guided tour.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Rum Cake:</strong> Stop by the Rum Cake Outlet for a taste of the island's famous rum cake. This flavorful treat offers a glimpse into local culinary traditions.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Hell:</strong> Discover Hell, a small-town famous for its dramatic ancient rock formations. A fun stop for photos and local folklore.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Stingray City:</strong> Step into the shallow waters of Stingray City for a hands-on, educational marine adventure with gentle stingrays.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Snorkel equipment and fruit punch.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/417019-img10.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDcyNTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR05sTDJnNVpTODVOamcwTkRrMk5UUTNPRGN3THpReE56QXhPUzFwYldjeE1DNXFjR2N8ODcyNTg1NjAwNmVmNDY2ZThiZDkyZGE2NWJjMWU0OTI0YzEwNjAwZmU0YjI0MjJmMmNlZDMwNmEwMzFhZjAzMw', 'duration': '4.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '417148', 'port_slug': 'grand-cayman', 'title': 'Cayman Crystal Caves Adventure', 'slug': 'cayman-crystal-caves-adventure-417148', 'price': 135.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.7, 'review_count': 10, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>South Sound:</strong> Take a scenic drive along the South Sound, passing luxurious homes and traditional Cayman-style houses. Continue through Bodden Town, the island’s first capital, rich in history and charm.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Crystal Caves:</strong> Discover three hidden caves tucked away in a tropical forest. Follow your guide into cool chambers filled with ancient crystals and fascinating formations. These caves are steeped in pirate lore and natural beauty. Wildlife sightings add to the adventure as birds, iguanas, and fruit bats call these caves home.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-CarolLakeCave.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNDc5ODN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGxOUzlvWmprdk9EZ3hNalV5TXpJeU5URXhPQzVxY0djfGUwZTBkNjNmZTRlOTg3MzNmOGMzM2QzM2E0MTFlYWM1NmUzMjI0MDlmNGE5Y2VkMWU0ZmVmZjg3MjMzNjQwMjI', 'duration': '3.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '8'},
    {'code': '417078', 'port_slug': 'grand-cayman', 'title': 'Stingray Encounter & Turtle Swim', 'slug': 'stingray-encounter--turtle-swim-417078', 'price': 82.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.1, 'review_count': 12, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Stingray City:</strong> Enjoy a 15-minute scenic ride along the Seven Mile beach before boarding a boat to Stingray City. Once there, you will have the chance to interact with stingrays in their natural environment. The experience is both exciting and educational, a highlight for visitors of all ages.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Turtle Center:</strong> Visit the Turtle Center, home to over 10,000 green sea turtles ranging from tiny hatchlings to massive 600-pound adults. Explore the breeding pond and a 1.3-million-gallon saltwater lagoon. Get up close with sharks and other marine creatures as you peer into the predator tank.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-stingray-encounter-and-turtle-swim-grand-cayman-cayman-islands-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxODE3OTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJOeTlvTW1Vdk9EZ3hNemszTXpVMk9UVTJOaTVxY0djfGZkZmU2MmQ0MTQzMjU5YmExMjJhZjc0OGY5MjZiNzVhMDQ2MjYxNTg2Y2Y2M2ExMjQzNDQyYjkxZTRlNjBiYzE', 'duration': '4.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '417225', 'port_slug': 'grand-cayman', 'title': 'Dolphin Swim Adventure', 'slug': 'dolphin-swim-adventure-417225', 'price': 102.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<strong>Dolphin Swim:</strong> Prepare for an unforgettable adventure guided by the natural power of dolphins. Begin your journey with a leisurely bus ride to Dolphin Discovery Cayman, where an orientation and life jacket will be provided. Dive into 3 feet of water for an enchanting 30 minutes of swimming and interaction with these incredible creatures, including the thrilling experience of being pushed on a boogie board then enjoy a gentle pull as it guides you with its pectoral fins. Explore the smooth skin of dolphins and learn about their communication techniques from your knowledgeable marine mammal specialists. Take home treasured memories with activities like handshakes and water dances and preserve the magic with souvenir photos.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/417225-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDA1MDN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1kzTDJoaU5DODVNRE0yTWpnNE5Ea3hOVFV3THpReE56SXlOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjZjBlOTM5ZDZiNDVjMmQ5YjI4N2U3ZmExOWM3MzdjZDg5ZjU4ZjQwMWU0YjdhMjQwZGU1MGNkZjRiNjc1Njgx', 'duration': '2.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '5'},
    {'code': '417232', 'port_slug': 'grand-cayman', 'title': 'Adventure: Blue Iguana Conservation & Botanic Park', 'slug': 'adventure-blue-iguana-conservation--botanic-park-417232', 'price': 113.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/417232-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTUyMTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGt6TDJnMk9DODVNRFExTnpVeE16QXdNVEkyTHpReE56SXpNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiMTJkMDEyODNhNjkwNTBiOWNmMjRiNDg2NjQ1MDg0MjliMTBmYTRmYjQ0NGUzMmJhZDM5MWIzZmVkM2M5MmJh&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '3.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '4'},
