    {'code': '417224', 'port_slug': 'grand-cayman', 'title': 'Dolphin Encounter Adventure', 'slug': 'dolphin-encounter-adventure-417224', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/417224-img4.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDMwMzZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGszTDJnMFl5ODVNRE0xTWpJME5qRXlPRGswTHpReE56SXlOQzFwYldjMExtcHdad3w0Mzc5NmY5NzIwNmYzMTY3ZDBhYWU2ZjE2NWE3MzUwYzFjZDgyYTk3MjU5ZDNkZThmODFkZmEyYTRlNzQwMjY4', 'duration': '2.3 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '417216', 'port_slug': 'grand-cayman', 'title': 'West Island & 7 Mile Beach', 'slug': 'west-island--7-mile-beach-417216', 'price': 72.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 8, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/417216-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY3MzV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0l5TDJoa05pODRPVFl4TmpnMk5qQXhOelU0THpReE56SXhOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkOWNiNjI5MjQ2OTM4OGM5Zjk0NzE4NjM1YWMyMGE2ZmUwM2U4OTkxZTE2ZjUwMWM0Y2JlZTg2Mjg3NWM1MzBj', 'duration': '2.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '440129', 'port_slug': 'grand-turk', 'title': 'Adventure: Exclusive Semi-Submarine Experience', 'slug': 'adventure-exclusive-semi-submarine-experience-440129', 'price': 81.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.6, 'review_count': 44, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Semi-Submarine Adventure:</strong> Experience the semi-submarine adventure, the sole semi-submersible vessel on this breathtaking Caribbean island, offering an exclusive journey over the renowned Grand Turk Wall. Go into the depths of the sea aboard a unique vessel, where half of it lies beneath the waterline, providing unparalleled views of the vibrant marine life inhabiting the reef. Encounter angel fish, turtles, puffer fish, nurse sharks, and barracuda, among others, in their natural habitat. Opt for the sundeck to admire the reef from above, soaking in panoramic vistas of the uninhabited islands surrounding Grand Turk, with the chance of spotting playful dolphins.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>The Grand Turk Wall:</strong> Discover the Grand Turk Wall, the world's third-largest barrier reef, boasting natural underwater cliffs plunging to depths of 7,000 ft. An experienced diver unveils hidden treasures within the rocks, including conch, starfish, and sea cucumbers, offering a glimpse into a fascinating underwater world.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/440129-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTEyNTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFkwTDJobFppODVNREU1TkRVeE1qRXhPREEyTHpRME1ERXlPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlMTAyYjBlNzcxZjQxZDliMTI5YmQ0YjAzZjI0MWM5NDY0M2Q2ODhmZmRkOTgzMzY1YTU4MDkyNjk3MTJlMzMw', 'duration': '1.3 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '440154', 'port_slug': 'grand-turk', 'title': 'Hands-On Artisan Series: Rug Tufting', 'slug': 'hands-on-artisan-series-rug-tufting-440154', 'price': 159.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Rug Tufting Workshop:</strong> Learn the art of rug tufting in a fun, hands-on workshop designed for all skill levels. Guided by an expert instructor, you’ll create a personalized take home rug with Turks and Caicos-inspired patterns and colors. Enjoy a small group setting with individual workstations and dedicated support and leave with a handmade island keepsake.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>All tufting materials and tools.</li>\n\t<li>Step-by-step instructions by an expert guide.</li>\n\t<li>Custom take-home rug: Adults: approx. 30” x 48”; Children: approx. 18” x 30”.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/440154-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDI1Nzl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1k0TDJoalpTODVOVFE1TnpneU16RTVNVE0wTHpRME1ERTFOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlZjY3YTI5N2UyOTkyMmFkYzg0ZDlmYWE1ZTk1N2I1NWJhZDRjODBiMmM5NDE2ZTg5NDI5N2M4NTgyYWY4MDFi', 'duration': '3.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '10'},
    {'code': '440131', 'port_slug': 'grand-turk', 'title': 'VIP All Inclusive TipsyTurtle Beach Club -Full Day', 'slug': 'vip-all-inclusive-tipsyturtle-beach-club-full-day-440131', 'price': 119.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.9, 'review_count': 94, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Beach Club:</strong> Nestled on the stunning white sands of the island next to Governors Beach, Tipsy Turtle Beach Club offers breathtaking ocean views and the perfect blend of relaxation and fun. Enjoy comfortable beach chairs while attentive staff cater to your every need, or dive into the crystal-clear waters. Don’t forget to explore the on-site gift shop featuring local art and crafts to take home a piece of paradise.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>4 Local Drinks (Spirits or Beer.)</li>\n\t<li>Caribbean buffet.</li>\n\t<li>Exclusive beach bar only for all-inclusive and cabana guests.</li>\n\t<li>Use of water toys.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/440131-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNDU5NzZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR00xTDJnME5DODVNVEUyT0RNME9EVTJPVGt3THpRME1ERXpNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3ZWJiMDhiMGIzZGFkYTY4Zjg2NjU5YjY3ODk4ZmMxNmEzZTFlN2UwOGQzMWUzNmEzMDdmMzAxZTNjMDJlOTg3', 'duration': '5.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '440097', 'port_slug': 'grand-turk', 'title': 'Grand Turk Flavors, Sightseeing & Lunch', 'slug': 'grand-turk-flavors-sightseeing--lunch-440097', 'price': 87.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.1, 'review_count': 38, 'desc_html': "<strong>Space Capsule:</strong> Embark on a journey through Grand Turk, where rich history meets vibrant culture. Explore the renowned replica of the John Glenn Space Capsule and immerse yourself in the island's captivating heritage.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Jags McCartney:</strong> Journey to the Jags McCartney Memorial Site, honoring the country’s national hero. Learn about the significant contributions of this remarkable individual as you pay your respects.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Front Street:</strong> Discover Front Street, where majestic colonial buildings from the 1820s invite you to explore their beauty. Enjoy a close-up view of one of Grand Turk's oldest churches and appreciate the historical significance that defines this area.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Retail Escape:</strong> Take a leisurely trip downtown and indulge in some retail therapy. Browse through unique shops and discover local treasures to take home.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Local Delights:</strong> Delight your taste buds at a quaint island restaurant in Grand Turk! Discover how to make scrumptious conch fritters and enjoy a delicious lunch brimming with local flavors. Don’t forget to take home the chef's secret recipe while keeping an eye out for seasonal flamingos and lounging donkeys.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Beach Break:</strong> Escape to one of Grand Turk’s stunning turquoise beaches! Feel the soft white sand beneath your toes while lounging in complimentary beach chairs and umbrellas. Soak up the sun and create lasting memories before heading back to the cruise port.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Beach chair and umbrella.\n    </li>\n</ul>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/local-conch-recipes-sightseeing-museum-and-lunch-440097-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNjgzODZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3hNUzlvWldJdk9EZ3pNekUzTXpNMU5qVTNOQzVxY0djfDcyZDYyMmIzYjc2N2E3NjQ0NzdiNTY1NWE0MzU5MzIwYWZmNWFhNGRjY2JhOGRhY2QxZDYyYjRhMTU3NTI5Nzk', 'duration': '3.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '440023', 'port_slug': 'grand-turk', 'title': 'Catamaran Sail,Snorkel & Secluded Beach & Drinks', 'slug': 'catamaran-sail-snorkel--secluded-beach--drinks-440023', 'price': 136.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 32, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>7,000-ft. Drop-Off:</strong> Experience a combination of sailing across the crystal turquoise waters of the Caribbean, a white-sand beach and extraordinary snorkeling. Board a spacious catamaran and set sail to discover the underwater world at the 7,000-ft. wall, the third deepest ocean trench in the world. Explore along the coral reef paradise teeming with bright tropical fish.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Secluded Beach Break:</strong> After snorkeling, grab a refreshing drink from the bar and sit back while you sail along the coastline to a beautiful, secluded beach for a break away from the crowds. Sink your toes into the soft, white sand of this remote beach, enjoy a swim, relax on a float, or discover the treasures of the island.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Dance Party:</strong> Set sail and dance away as your captain and crew jam to the rhythms of the Caribbean as you make your way to the pier.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/catamaran-sail-snorkel-private-beach-with-drinks-440023-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNDY3OTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGhZaTlvTkRrdk9EZ3pNemt5TmpneU16azJOaTVxY0djfDgyZDZjMTIwZjBkZjhmNDE5YWEzMjk1MTExMzBhNzNiMGY3YmM1YTQxN2EyOGNhZTZiMmMwNjllNGUyMWFiOWQ', 'duration': '3.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '6'},
    {'code': '440063', 'port_slug': 'grand-turk', 'title': 'Home Sweet Home! Your Adult Only Caribbean Retreat', 'slug': 'home-sweet-home-your-adult-only-caribbean-retreat-440063', 'price': 115.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.6, 'review_count': 52, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Your Private House:</strong> Receive a warm welcome from your host and then find your place to lounge and relax for the day. Everything will be taken care of, giving you the feeling of home away from home.<br />\n    <br />\n    <strong>Cuisine &amp; Service:</strong> Indulge in a sampling of local cuisine, like conch fritters, and delicious island cocktails and beverages to satisfy your inner foodie. The attentive service from your host will make you feel like royalty for the day.<br />\n    <br />\n    <strong>Fun in the Sun:</strong> There are lots of places to stretch out in the sun, under a shade, or inside your house, read a book by the clear blue waters.<br />\n    <br />\n    <strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Lunch.</li>\n        <li>Drinks: Island rum punch, island fruit punch, water, assorted sodas, local cold rum, coconut rum, and vodka.</li>\n        <li>Complimentary Wi-Fi.</li>\n        <li>Beach chairs and umbrellas.</li>\n        <li>Transfer back to the ship. The transfers times will be displayed at the location.</li>\n    </ul>\n    ', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/440063-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE4NjJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREV5TDJnMllpODRPVFUwT0RRek9ESTBNVFU0THpRME1EQTJNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1YzE2ZWJiZTk0OTMzNTRmYjg5NjE0NmIxZjkxNTlkYjM2ZDdhNDc2YjZkM2U2Y2NmOTI1YzgzZWEzY2FkOGQw', 'duration': '4.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': '18'},
