    {'code': '440106', 'port_slug': 'grand-turk', 'title': 'Guided Grand Turk by Golf Cart - 4 Seater', 'slug': 'guided-grand-turk-by-golf-cart--4-seater-440106', 'price': 156.99, 'price_unit': 'Golf Cart', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 102, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/440106-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY0NjN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFUzTDJneE9TODRPVEkxTVRZME5qQXhNemMwTHpRME1ERXdOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyYTczZmI0NDhmYWJmMGJlOTRlYTM4ODdkYjVkZWNmNmQ2NGUxZDg4YjJjMTFmY2E2ZGRhNTM4YjgxY2UxOGIx', 'duration': '2.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '8'},
    {'code': '808003', 'port_slug': 'greenock-glasgow', 'title': 'Glasgow City Walk& Free time', 'slug': 'glasgow-city-walk-free-time-808003', 'price': 174.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p>During this walking tour, take a close look of this vibrant city and then sample the atmosphere of a typical city pub. Few places in Britain have undergone such a change in style and image as Glasgow. Scotland’s largest city in the 1980s shook off its image of industrial decline and urban decay. Instead, it now flaunts its outstanding Victorian architecture, its sparkling cultural life and the best choice of shops in Scotland. On arrival into the center of Glasgow, we will commence a walk of approximately one and a half hours concentrating on the original city. In Cathedral Square, we will admire Glasgow Cathedral from the outside, the best relic of the medieval city and one of the most ancient and historic sites in Glasgow. Subject to services, we can visit the cathedral’s interior. Standing in Cathedral Square, your guide will point out Provand’s Lordship, which is Glasgow’s oldest house, dating from 1471. We will continue our walk by strolling through the campus of Strathclyde University and onto the area known as the Italian Center, which, although re-developed, it has maintained its original 19th century street frontage. Close by is George Square where you can see the City Chambers dating from the 1870s, built in Italianate style and dominating the surrounding area. Leaving George Square, we will make our way to Buchanan Street, Glasgow’s most prestigious thoroughfare, with its outstanding eclectic architecture and smart shopping area. Pass the Gallery of Modern Art which started life as the home of one of the tobacco merchants. Glasgow pubs are well known for their conviviality and jaunty air. You may want to taste some local favorites on your own like the famous British dish or traditional Scottish Haggis with a 'pint of bitter' like a real local. Not forgetting Glasgow is rated the best for shopping after London and, as we have time in the afternoon to spend in the city center, your guide during the morning will have pointed out the main areas for a huge array of stores – Buchanan Galleries, the Italian Center, Princes Square and St. Enoch Center. You have time to indulge fully in Glasgow’s shopping experience and your return to Greenock will be during mid-afternoon.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/808003-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc3MDV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGRpTDJnNU1TODRPVEkyTURJM01EZzNPVEF5THpnd09EQXdNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkMGQzYjBiYTdiMWU5OWJlNGZiNzcyOGZlYWViYWQ2NTcxODk2N2E1ODYzYTYyM2IzMjAwMmUxNGFiYjg4OWU5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '808004', 'port_slug': 'greenock-glasgow', 'title': 'Glasgow On Your Own', 'slug': 'glasgow-on-your-own-808004', 'price': 119.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/808004-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQxMzF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0l5TDJnNVpTODRPVEkyTURJM05EUTRNelV3THpnd09EQXdOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4NmJjYjViNzYwNGIwNmJhOTYxODkwYWUwZGYwMTU2YzYyMzY1ZDNmYTM0NWJkYWJmNzNhNjRmMDczZTIyZjdi', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '808008', 'port_slug': 'greenock-glasgow', 'title': 'Stirling Castle', 'slug': 'stirling-castle-808008', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/808008-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDUyNDR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFJsTDJobU5DODRPVEkyTURJNE5USTVOamswTHpnd09EQXdPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1NzcwNzhmZjEwMGQ3ZTA5NDk1MzUzZDg1ZTJlOTI3M2QxYTM2NDgzYjlmZDY2MmM2NjhhZTg4Y2Q1MDRkZjBj', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '808009', 'port_slug': 'greenock-glasgow', 'title': 'The Falkirk Wheel & Stirling On Your Own', 'slug': 'the-falkirk-wheel--stirling-on-your-own-808009', 'price': 174.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': '<p>Almost 100 years ago, a series of 11 locks was used to connect the Forth and Clyde Canal, running from Glasgow to Edinburgh’s Union Canal. As part of a Millennium initiative to encourage waterway usage, The Falkirk Wheel was designed and constructed to provide a 21st century solution to join the canals. It is a truly unique and awesome spectacle. Today, it is Scotland’s most exciting example of 21st century engineering, The Falkirk Wheel, is more than just the World’s first rotating boatlift. It is a symbol heralding the dawn of Britain’s new canal age. The boatlift’s role may be simple, but its shape is far from conventional. The Falkirk Wheel is unique, creating both an eye-catching working sculpture and Scotland’s most unusual tourist attraction. The Wheel has already claimed its place as a major Scottish landmark and is one of the World’s most important canal structures. The way its computer-controlled machinery gracefully raises or lowers 500 tons of boats and water, the 82 ft. difference between two canals appears complex but is deceptively simple. On arrival at The Wheel, you’ll embark on the canal boat and experience the journey through a canal tunnel and across an aqueduct – before seeming to drop off the end as your boat is lowered by the Wheel, you will be enjoying the most memorable yet gentle of white knuckle rides! Nothing like it has ever been built before anywhere in the world. Boat lifts are nothing new, though the last built in Britain was in 1875. But a rotating boat lift? The result is awe-inspiring and beautiful. Coming back to dry land, rejoin the motorcoach and continue the short distance to Stirling. On arrival into this major Scottish city, you will have free time to spend on independent sightseeing, shopping or a castle visit.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/808009-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQwNTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFUwTDJobE9TODRPVEkyTURJNE9Ea3dNVFF5THpnd09EQXdPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2OThlMTM5YTg3MjNkZDA0MTljMDMwNTY2YTFhYjk5ZTI3YTE0NDBmMzY1MGU5ZDJkZjk1ZmQ1YjU1NjU0MmU5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '808002', 'port_slug': 'greenock-glasgow', 'title': 'Glengoyne Distillery & Loch Lomond Shores', 'slug': 'glengoyne-distillery--loch-lomond-shores-808002', 'price': 154.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p>This tour takes you away from the city of Glasgow and out into the quiet countryside of the historic Blane Valley. Nestling in the lea of the Campsie Hills from where Glengoyne Distillery draws its pure soft water, tumbling down a 50-ft. waterfall, you`ll find this neat compact distillery is an ideal spot to view the skills and crafts of the distiller. For more than 150 years, Glengoyne distillery has been working continuously. Its traditional methods have been handed down from generation to generation to produce a distinctive malt whisky enjoyed by a growing number of connoisseurs. On arrival, you will be welcomed in the reception room, overlooking the dam, glen and waterfall, with a dram of Glengoyne single malt whisky. While enjoying your dram, there is a short explanatory video describing the distillery and the processes in making malt whisky. You are then taken on an entertaining tour of the distillery. There is time for you to browse in the small shop selling various whiskies and a selection of Scottish sourced souvenirs before leaving the distillery. Reboard the motorcoach and make your way to Loch Lomond Shores. Here, you'll have some free time to relax and enjoy the views over Loch Lomond. Alternatively, seize the opportunity to visit some of the shops before reboarding your motorcoach and commencing the return drive to Greenock.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/808002-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM1NjF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1ZoTDJnelpTODRPVEkyTURJMk56STNORFUwTHpnd09EQXdNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiNDdjMzk0MDg1YmUzN2YzNTE4ZjdhOTFjNTExZDBhMDU5NDE4ODA3YzdiNDMyZmEyZWRiZjRiNzk4MzViZTQz', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '808013', 'port_slug': 'greenock-glasgow', 'title': 'Transfer to The Royal Edinburgh Millitary Tattoo', 'slug': 'transfer-to-the-royal-edinburgh-millitary-tattoo-808013', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/808013-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTAwNDV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE0zTDJnMU9DODRPVEkyT0Rjek9EUTFOemt3THpnd09EQXhNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2OGY4ZWRhODU1MDJmMTI0MDgzOTBmMGViMTczMjM0Mzk0NWRmMjhmZDAyNjVkNWU1ZmQyNGQ2YWJlYTViMTFk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '808011', 'port_slug': 'greenock-glasgow', 'title': 'Edinburgh on Your Own', 'slug': 'edinburgh-on-your-own-808011', 'price': 159.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p>Set forth on a full-day, moderately active excursion via motorcoach to Edinburgh for four to five hours of exploration on your own! Visit historical highlights such as St. Giles Cathedral, the Sir Walter Scott Memorial, Edinburgh Castle or Holyrood Palace. Tour the Royal Yacht Britannia. Shop and enjoy a pub lunch on your own.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/808011-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU3OTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR001TDJneE1TODRPVEkyT0RjeU9ESTVPVGd5THpnd09EQXhNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmMDI1N2JhNjBlN2M0ZWNlMjZkNDgyZTJmNjBlMzZlYmRmNGU4ZTE3OWYyZjg5ZWMxNDcxNzhhNDkzYjUzNjUz', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '808007', 'port_slug': 'greenock-glasgow', 'title': 'Panoramic Lochs', 'slug': 'panoramic-lochs-808007', 'price': 149.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/808007-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY0Nzl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGRpTDJobVpTODRPVEkyTURJNE1UWTVNalEyTHpnd09EQXdOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkYjZkMWZjMzY3ZmVmNGNiYjgyOWEwNjE1ZmEzYjhkNDk4OTUxNTU0OWMxOTMxMTA1ZGMwZjYyZTE1YjI2MzVh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '808006', 'port_slug': 'greenock-glasgow', 'title': 'Loch Lomond & Inverary Castle', 'slug': 'loch-lomond--inverary-castle-808006', 'price': 254.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p>Cross the impressive Erskine Bridge, with views of the city of Glasgow in the distance, and travel through rural areas that make up the outer districts of the metropolis. Soon Loch Lomond comes into view. The famous and beautiful inland loch, known as the Queen of Scottish Lakes and noted for its fishing, is the largest in Great Britain. Stop at the exceptionally pretty village of Luss, with its flower bedecked cottages, lying on the western shores of the loch, facing a group of wooded islands. Leaving the loch behind, the drive through scenic glens and up to the “Rest and Be Thankful”, a viewing point with a name which speaks for itself. Views over glen and mountain will leave lasting impressions before the road descends and brings you to tranquil Loch Fyne. As you head around the head of the loch, along the tree lined shore, the pretty town of Inveraray can be seen in the distance. Standing in parkland at the entrance to the town is Inveraray Castle. Built on the site of a 15th century fortress, the present castle dates from 1770, the time that the town itself was constructed. It is the seat of the Duke of Argyll, the head of Clan Campbell. Inside, there is a fine collection of family pictures and superb tapestries set in painted rooms of outstanding beauty. Enjoy free time in Inveraray for lunch on your own and some shopping time before your drive back to the ship through impressive scenery encompassing lochs, glens, parkland and peaks.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/808006-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTExNjh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1U0TDJoaFlpODRPVEkyTURJM09EQTROems0THpnd09EQXdOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlZjRiOTMzZGNmNDQ5MDIzMjM4Zjc3MWQzOGE0MDcxZGM2Zjk5YmQ2ZGM4ZTZhYTZmYTU2MjFmOTUxNGFiMzU3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '808012', 'port_slug': 'greenock-glasgow', 'title': "Edinburgh and it's Castle", 'slug': 'edinburgh-and-it-s-castle-808012', 'price': 299.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 7, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/808012-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc3Mjl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE13TDJnME5DODRPVEkyT0Rjek1qZzROek0wTHpnd09EQXhNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyMjUyM2UxMDgyZDkzYTAzMzdkMDg2MjM2OTZkNWU3YzU5MDA2MWI2NzM4YzgzYmQ3NTY3NTIyOGVhNDI4MzY3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '418007', 'port_slug': 'grenada', 'title': 'Grand Etang Park, Ft. Frederick & Annandale Falls', 'slug': 'grand-etang-park-ft-frederick--annandale-falls-418007', 'price': 69.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Island Highlights:</strong> Begin your journey at the pier and board your transportation for a narrated drive through the picturesque capital of St. George’s. Travel along the scenic east coast of the island to Grenville and then on to Grand Etang in the Grand Etang Park. Take in the verdant flora along the way, from groves of banana, cocoa, nutmeg, and other spices. At the park, enjoy a complimentary beverage while taking in views of the lake, located in the crater of an extinct volcano. Then head to Annandale Falls for a short but steep walk down to a green paradise, where the rushing water is framed by hanging ferns and a variety of the island’s flowering and medicinal plants. Your return route passes through tropical countryside and several charming villages.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Complimentary beverage.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-grand-etang-park-ft-frederick-and-annandale-falls-grenada-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMDAzMTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGxNeTlvT0dJdk9EZ3hOREUxTURBNU1EYzRNaTVxY0djfDkzZDRmNTQ3NmU3OGMyZmNlZTViNjdkNzcwNWQzMjljNjk2YWE5ODgzNGJmZmU2MDAwNThmMDQ5ODk4ZTA3YjY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '418021', 'port_slug': 'grenada', 'title': 'Grand Etang, Cocoa Experience & Rum Sampling', 'slug': 'grand-etang-cocoa-experience--rum-sampling-418021', 'price': 64.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<strong>Grand Etang Lake:</strong> After boarding your air-conditioned transportation, you’ll journey through the Grand Etang Forest Reserve to Grand Etang Lake. The lake, nestled in the crater of an extinct volcano, sits 1,700 feet above sea level and offers breathtaking views.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Carlton Cocoa Station:</strong> Next, you’ll visit Carlton Cocoa Station, where a guide will accompany you as you learn about the process of curing cocoa.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Rum Tasting:</strong> Finally, on your way back to St. George’s, you’ll visit Grenada Distillers for a tour and a taste of one of the Caribbean’s finest rums.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Complimentary beverage.</li>\n\t<li>Rum Sampling.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/418021-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTUzODF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR001TDJobVlTODVNREUxT1RnNU5qazROVGt3THpReE9EQXlNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3NWYzMmU4NjMwNmI2MTExMzE0NzMyYjllMWZjNGE0ZGIyZDNlODg2MDI5ZmI2M2YxZDRlNGMxMDcxZjM5ZjI5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '418010', 'port_slug': 'grenada', 'title': 'Balthazar River Tubing & Scenic Drive', 'slug': 'balthazar-river-tubing--scenic-drive-418010', 'price': 114.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Begin with a leisurely sightseeing tour around St. George’s followed by a 1,700-foot climb up to the Grand Etang Rainforest Reserve.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Riving Tubing:</strong> Then, float down the Balthazar River on an inner tube, spinning and swirling down a series of rapids and gentle pools. Admire the lush tropical setting and be on the lookout for some of the many exotic species that make their home in this jungle. At the end of the tour, enjoy a refreshing glass of fruit juice or rum punch.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>One complimentary fruit juice or rum punch.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-balthazar-river-tubing-and-scenic-drive-grenada-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxOTYxNDF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGlNQzlvT1Rjdk9EZ3hOREUxTVRRMk56QXpPQzVxY0djfDI4YmJjYTFkNWU3MjdlMGExYTRmOWYzNmNmZGJkYWIxZjcxMmMwNjViNjIyYzUxMDA3MjNmODIxOWVjMTRjN2Q', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '418017', 'port_slug': 'grenada', 'title': 'Rumming & Relaxing: Rum Tasting & Beach', 'slug': 'rumming--relaxing-rum-tasting--beach-418017', 'price': 74.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Clark's Court Rum Distillery:</strong> Begin your tour with a brief drive to St. George’s, located in the southern part of the island. Upon arrival, proceed for a visit to the Clark’s Court Rum Distillery, founded in 1937. During your guided tour of the factory, learn about the distilling process from sugar cane, syrup, and molasses to rum, and the aging and blending processes involved in the production of rum. In addition, you’ll see the old steam engines dating as far back as 1886. Following your guided tour, sample the distillery’s award-winning rums and receive recipes describing different ways to mix and serve rum.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Morne Rouge Beach:</strong> Next, embrace the scenic beauty and Caribbean waters of Grenada during a relaxing visit to Morne Rouge Beach. Your drive continues to Morne Rouge Beach, a secluded, white-sand beach graced by crystal-clear waters and almond trees offering natural shade. You can swim, explore the beach, or simply relax with a refreshing drink and soak up the tropical sun. Afterward, re-board your coach for the brief drive back to the pier.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Rum tasting at Clarke’s Court Rum Distillery.</li>\n\t<li>One drink.</li>\n\t<li>Beach chair.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/418017-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDUxNDV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0ZqTDJoa05pODVNREEwT0RrNE5EZzBNalUwTHpReE9EQXhOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlMGFlYWUwMTNiNTBmYjFhZWNhZjc1Mzg4NTIxYjA2MWU4ZTk4MzQ3NGExNzI0NGZhYjVlYzViODc5MWQ3MTY0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '418020', 'port_slug': 'grenada', 'title': 'Spice Estate, Grand Etang Park & Annadale Falls', 'slug': 'spice-estate-grand-etang-park--annadale-falls-418020', 'price': 74.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.4, 'review_count': 12, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Spice Garden:</strong> Embark on a journey through Grenada’s delicious history and culture! Discover the secrets of the “Spice Island” as you visit Laura Herb and Spice Garden, where you’ll learn about Grenada’s role as one of the world’s most important producers of nutmeg, cinnamon, cloves, ginger, and allspice.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Grand Etang Lake:</strong> Next, travel to the picture-postcard Grand Etang Lake. Situated 1,700 feet above sea level, the lake rests inside the crater of an extinct volcano surrounded by a treasure trove of tropical flora.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Waterfalls:</strong> Head to Annandale Falls, where rushing water is framed by hanging ferns and flowering plants.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Fort Frederick:</strong> Finally, make a stop at Fort Frederick, which offers a spectacular panorama of the harbor. Capture stunning photos and take in the beauty of the island from a unique perspective.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Complimentary beverage.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-spice-estate-grand-etang-park-and-annadale-falls-grenada-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxODA0MTJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3lPQzlvTnpFdk9EZ3hOREUxTXpFM01EazNOQzVxY0djfDI1NWM3YjUzMDliNjhiZGU0OGM2OTdkMGUwMTZkMGViNjJlMDUxY2ZkYTgwMGMxZjRmN2Q4MDcxOGNmNTMxNjM', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
