    {'code': '418024', 'port_slug': 'grenada', 'title': 'Paradise Beach Getaway with Lunch', 'slug': 'paradise-beach-getaway-with-lunch-418024', 'price': 124.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/418024-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDI5NjJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJsTDJnek9DODVNREV4T0RRMk9UY3hOREl5THpReE9EQXlOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1ZTFhMjBiMTg0YTJkMzA2ZjA0NDUyNGE2OTZlYjU4ZDMwZGY5YjhjNDMzZjViYTFmMzQ4OWZiOTg5ZDljZjY4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '224045', 'port_slug': 'halifax', 'title': "Peggy's Cove & Titanic", 'slug': 'peggy-s-cove--titanic-224045', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Peggy’s Cove:</strong> Embark on a scenic journey along the Lighthouse Route to the historic Peggy’s Cove, where you can marvel at stunning coastal vistas and learn how glaciers and ocean waves have shaped its iconic granite shores. Explore local shops and galleries, and visit the legendary lighthouse and deGarthe Monument before traveling via St. Margaret’s Bay to the Fairview Lawn Cemetery.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Fairview Lawn Cemetery:</strong> Join your guide on a captivating tour as you explore the grounds and uncover the tragic story of the Great Ship’s maiden voyage, including the mysteries of the unknown child and J. Dawson, whose stories continue to resonate nearly 100 years later.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-peggys-cove-and-titanic-halifax-ns-canada-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDA0NTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJPQzlvTURNdk9EZ3hORFV5TmpNek1qazFPQzVxY0djfGE3NjI3Zjg3Y2ExNjA2YTA5NzkwYWQxMTIwZDJlMTkxZmM0MDg2N2U0MGNlMWRiYWM3YzY3NGI1YjI3YWI5NTg', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '224037', 'port_slug': 'halifax', 'title': 'Top 10 Best of Halifax Tour', 'slug': 'top-10-best-of-halifax-tour-224037', 'price': 144.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Peggy’s Cove:</strong> Journey to Peggy’s Cove, Nova Scotia’s beloved fishing village. Snap photos of the iconic lighthouse and admire the rugged coastal landscape.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Fairview Lawn Cemetery:</strong> Visit Fairview Lawn Cemetery, the final resting place of 121 Titanic victims and gain a deeper understanding of Halifax’s historical ties to the tragedy.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Spring Garden Road:</strong> Experience the dynamic energy of Spring Garden Road, the busiest street east of Montreal, famous for its restaurants, shops, and exceptional people-watching. Don’t miss out on the Public Gardens, where Victorian elegance meets urban vibrancy in the center of downtown.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Explore Halifax's heritage on a panoramic drive around the Citadel. Enjoy sweeping views and hear fascinating tales of the city's history.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-top-10-best-of-halifax-tour-halifax-ns-canada-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNjQzOTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzFOeTlvWTJRdk9EZ3hORFV5TlRrM01qVXhNQzVxY0djfDBmMDczMDlkNjQwYjMzZThjMjdjNjM1MzFlNjQ0ZjkzOTA3MmVkOGEyN2YzYTJkZTQ4MmNiMTRkMzBiYjJjMWM', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '224004', 'port_slug': 'halifax', 'title': 'Halifax City Tour', 'slug': 'halifax-city-tour-224004', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 6, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Fairview Lawn Cemetery:</strong> Visit Fairview Lawn Cemetery, the final resting place of 121 Titanic victims and gain a deeper understanding of Halifax’s historical ties to the tragedy.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Halifax Public Gardens:</strong> Stroll through the Halifax Public Gardens, a peaceful retreat in the heart of the city. Enjoy a short, guided walk among beautifully manicured paths and vibrant blooms.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Enjoy a panoramic drive around Halifax Citadel with sweeping views of downtown and the historic Town Clock, before returning to your ship.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-halifax-city-tour-halifax-ns-canada-7.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMTEzMDJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGxNaTlvTXpVdk9EZ3hORFV5TXpnd09UZ3lNaTVxY0djfDU3YzMxNmZkZDRjZTc0NzYxNjFhZWY1ZDMwYjJlN2QzZmJiYjM4YzBlNzkwZDBlYjU1ZmY5NTkxZDdlZWZlNjE', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '224003', 'port_slug': 'halifax', 'title': "Halifax & Peggy's Cove", 'slug': 'halifax--peggy-s-cove-224003', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.1, 'review_count': 45, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Panoramic Halifax:</strong> Join a narrated tour of Halifax, where you’ll explore the city's harmonious blend of history and modernity.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Peggy’s Cove:</strong> Discover the charm of Peggy's Cove, a quaint fishing village with colorful houses and a close-knit community of fewer than 60 residents. Enjoy scenic views along the coastal highway, learn about the village’s rich history, including its iconic lighthouse, the deGarthe monument and the lobster fishery, and explore local shops at your leisure.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-halifax-and-peggys-cove-halifax-ns-canada-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNjMzNDZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3lNeTlvTlRFdk9EZ3hORFV5TXpVME56WTNPQzVxY0djfDU1NmEwZDJiYzMwMTVjZWNlMGY2ZTY0Zjg0Y2Q5YWJlMGIwMjIzNzAzZmM2MWI1Y2NhZTk3ZjgxMmEwMTdlMDc', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '224007', 'port_slug': 'halifax', 'title': 'Hop on Hop Off Halifax!', 'slug': 'hop-on-hop-off-halifax-224007', 'price': 69.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.3, 'review_count': 13, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Double Decker:</strong> Embark on a colorful, vintage double decker bus and explore the city against a stunning harborfront backdrop. Your tour guide will share captivating stories about Halifax's history, including the Titanic sinking, the Halifax explosion, and the famous Titanic cemetery. With an all-day pass, you can freely discover downtown's attractions at your pace. The 90-minute round trip takes you through the historic and revitalized areas, highlighting the city's diverse charm.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-big-pink-bus-tour-hop-on-hop-off-halifax-ns-canada-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTM1OTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJNaTlvTVRRdk9EZ3hORFV5TkRNek5ERXhNQzVxY0djfDIzNzBlNTg3NTRjNjAzYjM4Nzk0ZTA1MTFhY2RjYmJmZmZhNzMwN2Y4MmU3Zjc1ODg5ODUyMDVmNTYyNzczYzA', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
