    {'code': '224032', 'port_slug': 'halifax', 'title': 'Peggy’s Cove & Hop on Hop off', 'slug': 'peggy-s-cove--hop-on-hop-off-224032', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.8, 'review_count': 23, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-peggys-cove-and-double-decker-city-tour-halifax-ns-canada-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNzQ3NzV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzFOaTlvT0dVdk9EZ3hORFV5TlRFeU1EVTBNaTVxY0djfDg5MTQ4MmFhMTU3ODE5MmNkNGVkNGJkZWU1Zjk4Yzc0MDM2ZDZiYjlhYjFjY2RlYThlNjFjOTNhYWU4MTcwMDk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '224057', 'port_slug': 'halifax', 'title': 'Halifax City & Harbour Hopper', 'slug': 'halifax-city--harbour-hopper-224057', 'price': 74.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/224057-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ2MDV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0l4TDJoa1lTODVNamcwTVRjNE5EUTBNekU0THpJeU5EQTFOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wxYWVlOWE5MjE3OTMzNDgyMjgzYjNmNjMzZDg5ZDI5M2E4Y2IyYWY5ZTBiZDhmYzNhZTBjZjRkNmIyNGZmZDYw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '810040', 'port_slug': 'helsinki', 'title': 'Helsinki by the Sea', 'slug': 'helsinki-by-the-sea-810040', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': 'Enjoy Helsinki from the sea and its beautiful archipelago. With over 180,000 islands, the Finnish archipelago is one of the world’s largest. After a short bus transfer to downtown’s Market Square, join a private boat tour taking you around the islands outside of western Helsinki. Discover how close and convenient everything is around the city. Enjoy seeing the unique urban waterfronts, beautiful nature and some well-known buildings, while your guide tells you the interesting history of Helsinki. Pass by the Suomenlinna fortification islands. Suomenlinna is a major monument of military architecture and is included in the UNESCO’s World Heritage List. The construction of the sea fortress on the islands just outside of Helsinki took place in the middle of the 18th century and was the most extensive building project during the Swedish rule. After this delightful tour on the sea, you will return to the Market Square where you have some limited time for shopping for souvenirs, before boarding your bus to be transferred back to the pier. ', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/810040-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU5MTR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREkyTDJnd1lpODRPVEkwTXpRM09Ea3hOelF5THpneE1EQTBNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkODdiYzAwNTQxNTNmYjU0NTkzYWYxMzZmODY3OWE1Zjc1ZTMyMDMwODc0ODVlZjA3NGY4YzYzNDYyZGUzYzcw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '810044', 'port_slug': 'helsinki', 'title': 'Best of Helsinki', 'slug': 'best-of-helsinki-810044', 'price': 179.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': 'The charm and style of the White City of the North awaits you on this popular tour. The city’s focal point, Senate Square, with fine 19th-century, Neo-classical buildings and the impressive Lutheran Cathedral of St. Nicholas will be your first stop. Along the way, you’ll see the Uspenski Cathedral and the North Harbour where the icebreaker fleet is stationed. Next, it’s on to The Rock Church (Temppeliaukio), a unique creation carved out of solid rock and topped with a copper dome. This truly is a striking example of modern Finnish architecture. En route, you’ll see the Presidential Palace, the colorful Market Square, and the beautiful Kaivopuisto Park, where many of the foreign embassies are situated. View the Olympic Stadium, where the Olympic games were held in 1952. Travel past the new Opera House, Finlandia Hall, the Parliament Building, the National Museum, and the Railway Station. Stop to admire the massive, stainless steel Sibelius Monument dedicated to the musical vision of Jean Sibelius and situated in the beautiful Sibelius Park. Continue to the beautiful Seurasaari Island nearby. At Seurasaari, you’ll have a guided nature walk, where you can see numerous historical buildings from outside the different provinces of Finland. The oldest building is a 1686 wooden church. ', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/810044-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDA2ODh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1ppTDJoaVpTODRPVFkzT0RjME16YzVPREEyTHpneE1EQTBOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkMDJkMDRiMzJjZjliMjNjN2MzNTA5Y2NkODBhNGQzOTIxZTYyOTYwNjEyMzk3NmM1YWQwYzM5N2IwMWYxMTYz', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '810045', 'port_slug': 'helsinki', 'title': 'Gin & WhiskyTasting at Helsinki Distilling Company', 'slug': 'gin--whiskytasting-at-helsinki-distilling-company-810045', 'price': 254.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Helsinki Distilling Company:</strong> Visit a local distillery located in the heart of Helsinki’s gastro-culture, a growing area that represents the local food culture. All the products of the Helsinki Distilling Company are hand-made from local high-quality ingredients. Enjoy a tour of the distillery and learn how whisky and gin are made, and the barrels that are used in the maturation process. This is an in-depth tour that shows you the different malts and gin ingredients which are used. At the end of the tour, you’ll enjoy a guided tasting of gin, spirits, and the refreshing Helsinki Long Drink, which is a gin-based drink mixed with grapefruit.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/810045-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU4NDd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0U1TDJneU15ODRPVFkxT0RFek1qTTVPRE00THpneE1EQTBOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzNjQwNDM0NDE5Njg0ZTI5ZWFlYWZjMGUwYmVkZTM1MGFkNjExZjc1NzUxMGFjYmNjMjAxMTk3Yzc1NzM5MWZm', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '810046', 'port_slug': 'helsinki', 'title': 'Helsinki Highlights & Finnish Food Tasting', 'slug': 'helsinki-highlights--finnish-food-tasting-810046', 'price': 224.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<strong>Helsinki:</strong> Experience the thrilling harbor city of Helsinki, with its large ferries and picturesque islands. A short coach ride brings you to the heart of this bustling metropolis – a distinct combination of both Eastern and Western influences that come together to define its charm. Despite many international influences, the Finnish essence still remains remarkable in Helsinki’s unique character. \n<br /><br />\n<strong>Sibelius Park:</strong> A this next stop, you will have time to photograph a monument made up of approximately 600 steel pipes honoring the great Finnish composer Jean Sibelius. \n<br /><br />\n<strong>Rock Church:</strong> Visit an intriguing modern-day structure built entirely into bedrock and of quarried stone. \n<br /><br />\n<strong>City Center:</strong> Explore City Hall, the President's Palace, the Opera House and the Parliament House. Take note of the location of Esplanade Street, famous for its shopping and open-air restaurants. \n<br /><br />\n<strong>Finnish Food Tasting:</strong> Nearby is Restaurant Savotta, which celebrates Finland's culinary heritage in a thoroughly modern way. Ingredients are foraged from the country's pristine forests and lakes, and carefully curated from select small suppliers. Receive a tasting menu featuring Finnish delicacies while listening to their tradition.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Roundtrip transportation.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Water/juice.\n    </li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/810046-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzgyMTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJqTDJnME1TODRPVGc1T0RVME1UTTRNems0THpneE1EQTBOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmYjM4ZjUwMTVmYzhiZTY4MTcwODZlZDU5NzZkOWY5Nzc5NzlkN2FhZmQ0YWJhNzdkODA4OWRhM2NiODc2Y2Jh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '810049', 'port_slug': 'helsinki', 'title': 'Vintage Train Ride & Porvoo Old Town', 'slug': 'vintage-train-ride--porvoo-old-town-810049', 'price': 209.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Vintage Train:</strong> Travel back in time on a private vintage train, gliding through Finland’s beautiful countryside in a classic 1960s railcar. Take in breathtaking sights of forests, rivers, and open fields along the way.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Explore Porvoo:</strong> Explore the charming cobblestone streets and vibrant wooden buildings of Porvoo Old Town on a guided walk. Afterward, enjoy free time to visit artisan shops, boutiques, and cozy cafés at your own pace.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Panoramic Drive:</strong> Enjoy a panoramic drive along Mannerheim Street, passing iconic landmarks like Parliament House, Finlandia Hall, and the modern Oodi Library.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Strike a Pose:</strong> Capture memorable shots at Senate Square, home to the neoclassical Lutheran Cathedral and Helsinki’s historic heart, before returning to port.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Private vintage train ride through the Finnish countryside (45 minutes).</li>\n\t<li>Guided walking tour of Porvoo Old Town.</li>\n\t<li>Free time in Porvoo for independent exploration.</li>\n\t<li>Panoramic sightseeing drive through Helsinki.</li>\n\t<li>Photo stop at Senate Square.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/810049-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY2OTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1kzTDJneU9TODVNVEEzTXpjME1URXlOems0THpneE1EQTBPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzY2M5OTQzNThjNGY4ZDA4ZjQ4N2Q3OTlmNDMyMWZhZjFkOTg2NmU0YWQ4NzAzODAxZDE4Mjg1Y2VkZjk5ODAy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
