    {'code': '810047', 'port_slug': 'helsinki', 'title': 'Helsinki City And Sibelius', 'slug': 'helsinki-city-and-sibelius-810047', 'price': 159.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/810047-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDI0ODN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1ptTDJneVlpODVOalF5T0RBeE5USTRPRFl5THpneE1EQTBOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wxNjM2OTNkZDQxMWY2MDlhZjU4Y2E2MTQ2ZmM5YzIzMzQ4MzRkMGIzZGM4MGM4YWM2N2U3NzIzZDU0MmZiMzg5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '190039', 'port_slug': 'hilo', 'title': 'Waterfalls Spectacular - Small Group', 'slug': 'waterfalls-spectacular--small-group-190039', 'price': 194.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Start with a drive through an ocean front rain forest and the scenic highlights of Hilo as we make our way to Rainbow Falls.<br /> <br /> <strong>Rainbow Falls:</strong> Rainbow Falls is an iconic waterfall right off a postcard featuring 80-ft.tall twin waterfall system. Take a stroll through the banyan trees or just enjoy the view of the falls before heading along Onomea Bay Scenic Drive. Look for the rainbow effect that gives the waterfall its name!<br /> <br /> <strong>Akaka Falls:</strong> Majestic Akaka Falls, a stunning 442-ft. waterfall that plunges down a sheer cliff into the water below.<br /> <br /> <strong>Local Shopping:</strong> Before heading back to the pier, enjoy some free time for shopping on Banyan Drive.<br /> <br /> <strong>What’s Included:</strong></p> <ul> \t<li>Water.</li> \t<li>Chips and a granola bar.</li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/190039-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMzg1Mzd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0ZpTDJoa1pDODRPVEF3TWpJeU56YzVOREl5THpFNU1EQXpPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w5MDdmYjc4ZDYxNmE5ZTkxZDVjNGNkOWRjZDEyMGIyODIxYjYxNTBlZmIxOGRmYzkzM2RhOGExYTIzOGQyY2Yw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '190052', 'port_slug': 'hilo', 'title': 'Kilauea Lava Fields & Hilo Bay with Lunch', 'slug': 'kilauea-lava-fields--hilo-bay-with-lunch-190052', 'price': 259.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<strong>Mackenzie State Recreation Area:</strong> This remote and beautiful 13-acre park boasts jagged lava cliffs, lava tubes and blowholes formed when hot lava met the cool sea waters. Once closed in 2018 by the marching 40-foot-tall wall of crumbly lava as it oozed its way to the sea, the park reopened to an altered coastline and a new black sand beach. <br /><br /> <strong>Isaac Hale Beach Park:</strong> Lava flows encircled this popular park on Pohoiki Bay, miraculously sparing the infrastructure while destroying everything around it. <br /><br /> <strong>Star of the Sea Painted Church:</strong> This church was built in 1927-1928 under the direction of the Belgian Catholic missionary priest, Father Evarist Gielen, who painted the upper section of the church interior. <br /><br /> <strong>Hilo Bay:</strong> Enjoy a dip in a coastal lagoon protected by a reef. Grab a complimentary snorkel set or just jump in the water and explore the unique lava rock coastline. <br /><br /> <strong>Shopping:</strong> Stock up on freshly roasted Kona coffee, Hawaiian macadamia nuts, and other local products with a stop at Hilo Bay. <br /><br /> <strong>What’s Included:</strong> <ul> \t<li>Deli-style lunch.</li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/190052-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDA1MTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREV4TDJoaE9DODRPVEF3TWpBMU1EVXhPVE0wTHpFNU1EQTFNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3Y2ZhMzU1ZDkwOThjMmM2MTZlYTE1YTQ2YWNkYzc3YjQ1MmIyMmExZDgwMDU3ZGQxOWU5NjNkMWY0NWM5M2Rj', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '190018', 'port_slug': 'hilo', 'title': 'Volcanoes National Park & Tastes of Hawaii', 'slug': 'volcanoes-national-park--tastes-of-hawaii-190018', 'price': 279.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Awaken your senses:</strong> With the best culinary treats the Big Island has to offer and explore Kilauea Volcano in a unique way, taking the road less traveled in a small group of no more than 12 travelers.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Tantalize your taste buds:</strong> With 100% Hawaii-grown coffee, wine and handmade chocolates made exclusively on this island. Start your morning right with delicious locally grown macadamia nuts at Mauna Loa en route to Hawaii Volcanoes National Park.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Hawaii Volcanoes National Park:</strong> Upon arrival at the park, enjoy a leisurely stroll with your small group and your experienced guide through lush rain forests alive with native birds and incredible foliage, as well as exploring the ‘walk-through’ lava tube. Discover hidden lookouts and witness the explosive power of the Halema'uma'u Crater. Walk across new lava formations and see the regeneration of the native Hawaiian rain forest in its first stages of life.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Jaggar Museum:</strong> Check out real-time seismographs, eruption footage, and beautiful displays of lava and Hawaiian geology and this UNESCO World Heritage Site.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Picnic lunch:</strong> A picnic-style specialty lunch and glass of wine will be served on the lush grounds of Volcano Garden Arts—a fine gallery showcasing the work of Hawaiian artists.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Big Island Candies:</strong> Finally, no gourmet adventure would be complete without a stop at Big Island Candies, known for their handmade macadamia nut shortbread cookies dipped in chocolate.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>A picnic-style specialty lunch.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/190018-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTgzMTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFl6TDJnMk9DODRPVEF6TmpVMk9ETXpNRFUwTHpFNU1EQXhPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w5NjdlYTY4N2I3ZmFkMjM5ODY1MWEyMTMxOWVlZDg5YzQ4ODY1NGIyMWM2ZDVkYTY0NDMyZjczNTQ5Yjc1Mjdm', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '190012', 'port_slug': 'hilo', 'title': 'Hilo & Volcanoes National Park', 'slug': 'hilo--volcanoes-national-park-190012', 'price': 111.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Hawaii Volcanoes National Park:</strong> Hawaii Volcanoes National Park encompasses 335,259 acres or about 523 square miles from the summit of Maunaloa to the sea. Kīlauea ranks among the world\'s most active volcanoes and may even top the list. During this visit, you\'ll experience geological features such as steam vents, sulfur banks and driving along the crater rim.<br /> <br /> <strong>Hilo Town:</strong> Drive through the historic and graceful town of Hilo, reminiscent of the charm of "Old Hawaii". Downtown Hilo was built around its crescent-shaped bay and became the seat of county government. Today, Downtown Hilo is a charming town offering museums, art galleries, shops and restaurants.<br /> <br /> <strong>Banyan Drive:</strong> Experience Banyan Drive, known as the "Hilo Walk of Fame" for the banyan trees planted by celebrities in years gone by. The trees honor movie stars, religious leaders, political leaders, famous authors, adventurers and local Hawaiians.<br /> <br /> <strong>Liliuokalani Gardens:</strong> We\'ll also drive by peaceful Liliuokalani Gardens, the largest authentic ornamental Japanese garden outside of Japan. This beautifully landscaped park features arching bridges over fishponds, rock gardens, pagodas, Japanese stone lanterns and a teahouse, it was dedicated in 1917 as a tribute to Hawaii\'s first Japanese immigrants who worked in the island of Hawaii\'s sugar cane fields.<br /> <br /> <strong>What\'s Included:</strong></p> <ul> \t<li>Entry into Hawaii Volcanoes National Park.</li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-hilo-chain-of-craters-hilo-hi-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxMzc0MzF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGtOeTlvTURZdk9EZ3hOREUwTVRVd05UVTJOaTVxY0djfDRlODEyMjYwMjQ2NDg3ZTJhMjRjNzdlNWRkYjU3NGRkMmNiYzFkMjQyZjNlNWYxNmM1MjBlZmU3Mjc1MTQyNjc', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '190011', 'port_slug': 'hilo', 'title': 'Discover Hilo, Waves & Waterfalls', 'slug': 'discover-hilo-waves--waterfalls-190011', 'price': 116.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Hilo Town:</strong> Drive through the historic and graceful town of Hilo, reminiscent of the charm of Old Hawaii. Downtown Hilo is a charming town offering museums, art galleries, shops and restaurants.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Banyan Drive:</strong> Experience Banyan Drive, known as the Hilo Walk of Fame for the banyan trees planted by celebrities in years gone by. The trees honor movie stars, religious leaders, political leaders, famous authors, adventurers and local Hawaiians.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Liliuokalani Gardens:</strong> Stop at the peaceful Liliuokalani Gardens, the largest authentic ornamental Japanese garden outside of Japan. This beautifully landscaped park features arching bridges over fishponds, rock gardens, pagodas, Japanese stone lanterns and a teahouse. It was dedicated in 1917 as a tribute to Hawaii's first Japanese immigrants who worked in the island of Hawaii's sugar cane fields.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Akaka Falls State Park:</strong> Enjoy a scenic drive along the “Old Road” through lush rainforests that will bring you to the magnificent ‘Akaka Falls, a 442-ft. free-falling waterfall plunging over the sheer cliffs of dormant Mauna Kea Volcano. A short, paved hiking trail leads to a lookout over 'Akaka Falls and smaller Kahūnā Falls.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Shinmachi Memorial:</strong> Visit to the beautiful Shinmachi Memorial, erected in honor of the many residents of Hilo who lost their lives to the Tsunami of 1946. It will be even more powerful as you understand the magnitude of the devastation.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Big Island Candies:</strong> Visit the factory where cookies and other treats are made with Big Island macadamia nuts.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/190011-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDAzNjB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE15TDJnNE5TODRPVEF3TWpFMU1URXhOekV3THpFNU1EQXhNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1OGFmYjcwYjBmNjBmODljM2I4YjEwNzdhNmFkY2QzNzczNzMwNjkxZWFhZWFjMGJkNmQ5NzRmZjUxY2YxMzUx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
