    {'code': '194037', 'port_slug': 'honolulu', 'title': "Germaine's Luau", 'slug': 'germaine-s-luau-194037', 'price': 244.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 49, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y04-germaines-luau-honolulu-hi-4.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMzAzNDZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzRZUzlvTkRndk9EZ3hOREV6TWpnNE56VTRNaTVxY0djfGRjYWEzMDJlZGNkNGVjN2QzYTY1MDRhMTFmMDZlM2FkNThmNDVlOTkxZTI0YmFmZDIxMWIzM2RiMDJmMWZkOGU&w=700&h=550&resize_profile=pdpgallery', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '701005', 'port_slug': 'icy-strait-point', 'title': 'Whale & Wildlife Cruise', 'slug': 'whale--wildlife-cruise-701005', 'price': 214.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Whale &amp; Wildlife Cruise:</strong> Marvel in the sights and sounds of one of Alaska’s premier humpback feeding areas, Point Adolphus. Water currents within this area create abundant and dense ocean nutrients, generating an ideal feeding opportunity for a variety of sea creatures including orcas, sea lions, seals, sea otters, porpoises, and the humpback whale. The area is teeming with wildlife and your pulse will quicken with your first sighting of the magnificent humpback whale. Throughout your 2.5-hour cruise, discover the pure unspoiled wilderness of Alaska and connect with her natural beauty. The onboard naturalist will provide informative and engaging commentary about the diversity of marine life. Point Adolphus is so abundant in humpback whales, it’s guaranteed you’ll see one or you’ll be refunded.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Guaranteed whale sighting.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Whale-Wildlife-Cruise5.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNzE2MjN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzVaUzlvTW1Fdk9EZ3hNalUxTXpRek56SXhOQzVxY0djfDdmNGQ2M2ZkYzc2ODRlOTA4ZWEzMjM4MzI0MDY4ZTYyNzBiZjA3MzU1OGFkYzExMDI2OWM5NjdiMDdjNDkxMWI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '701023', 'port_slug': 'icy-strait-point', 'title': 'Back Country 4X4 Adventure', 'slug': 'back-country-4x4-adventure-701023', 'price': 192.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.7, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<strong>Country Adventure:</strong> Explore the rugged, natural beauty Chichagof Island has to offer in your own Jeep&reg; vehicle. The area, which is part of the Tongass National Forest and the largest National Forest in the United States, is also home to wildlife such as Sitka black-tailed deer, brown bears, and eagles, to name a few. Be sure to keep your eyes open for sightings! You can switch drivers during one of the stops while your knowledgeable guide explains the area’s history and tells you more about the wildlife, adding to your truly unforgettable Alaska Experience. Jeep and Jeep Wrangler&reg; are registered trademarks of Chrysler Group LLC.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Back-Country-Jeep-Adventure.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjE1MDR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNPQzlvWVRndk9EZ3hORE0xTkRjNU1qUTNPQzVxY0djfGI5ZDhiZjRmMjU5ZDUwNTljMjhkZmYyN2EyODJmYzAxMTM5NzAxMDNjOTBhYzRiMzZhYmE4MGM5ZWY5ZDAwZjA', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '701016', 'port_slug': 'icy-strait-point', 'title': 'Whale, Wildlife & Bear Search', 'slug': 'whale-wildlife--bear-search-701016', 'price': 287.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': '<strong>Whale Watching:</strong> Search for Alaska’s largest mammals on this combination tour. Your half-day adventure takes you to explore the rich waters of Point Adolphus, home to whales, sea lions, seals, and porpoises. Enjoy warm, comfortable seating inside or savor the spectacular views from outside viewing decks. Your whale watching trip will depart directly from Icy Strait Point, allowing for the maximum amount of water time available. \n<br /><br />\n<strong>Bear Search:</strong> Known to have one of the largest populations of coastal brown bear in the world, the second half of your adventure continues with a trip into the wilderness of Chichagof Island. Upon arriving to the Spasski River Valley, your experienced guide will lead you over gravel and boardwalk pathways through dense forest and muskeg marsh to several viewing platforms above the Spasski River. Learn about the coastal brown bear, their habitats and why this area is ideal for their year-round foraging. Besides coastal brown bears, there is a chance to view other wildlife such as Sitka-black tailed deer, river otters, pine martens and bald eagles. \n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        100% guaranteed whale watching. \n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Bottled water, coffee, and tea.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Granola bar.\n    </li>\n</ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y04-Whales-Wildlife-Bear-Search3.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMzE1Mzh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzVOUzlvWVRBdk9EZ3hORE0xTXpFeU1UTXhNQzVxY0djfGZhM2VlMDlmNzVlOTM2M2Q0NjliZTBkZWVjZWJlNjU5Y2E2ZDc2ZWEyYzhlZTZiMmU4NTRmN2E0Y2Q1MDFhMjU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '701035', 'port_slug': 'icy-strait-point', 'title': 'Ocean Raft Adventure', 'slug': 'ocean-raft-adventure-701035', 'price': 184.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<strong>Rafting Adventure:</strong> Your Alaska-sized adventure begins right from the Icy Strait Point dock and takes you through the waters of Port Frederick and Icy Strait. Your captain will select a route that works best with the day’s weather and opportunities for wildlife viewing. The area’s nutrient-dense waters make it a prime location to spot humpback whales, orcas, seals, sea otters, and sea lions. Wildlife sightings are not guaranteed but likely. Make sure to bring your camera as your captain will expertly position the vessel for up-close views of tidal flats and point out wildlife that may be spotted along the coastline. Learn about the local history, the reasons why the waterways are important to the Tlingit people and the ocean’s continued benefit to their subsistence lifestyle.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-ocean-raft-adventure-701035-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxMjA1NzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNOeTlvTW1Zdk9EZ3hNalUxTmpBeU5UZzROaTVxY0djfDQ2OGJjMjE2ZGUwYTYwM2Q0NzExNzY5NzU2MTkyZDk2MzM4Y2MzZDkzMzZjMDYxOGJhYzc5YmRiZTNlZTc2Y2M', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '701011', 'port_slug': 'icy-strait-point', 'title': 'Skyglider & World’s Largest Ziprider', 'slug': 'skyglider--world-s-largest-ziprider-701011', 'price': 196.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<strong>SkyGlider:</strong> Elevate your Icy Strait Point experience with the only mountaintop gondola experience in Southeast Alaska and enjoy 360⁰ views! From the base of Icy Strait Point, you will ascend over 1,500 feet to the top of Hoonah Mountain with views from all sides. \n<br /><br />\n<strong>World’s Largest ZipRider:</strong> Feel your adrenaline rush on this thrilling and scenic flight adventure. Higher than the Empire State Building and towering at 1,330 feet above sea level, the ZipRider boasts speeds of up to 60 mph and a 25% grade. At 5,495 feet long and six cables side by side, this is truly an experience of a lifetime. You’ll walk to your launch platform, followed by an outfitting into your safety harness and brief safety instructions before the countdown begins. Back at sea level, a series of breaks will safely decelerate your ride at the Drop Zone in the heart of Icy Strait Point. ', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Scenic-Mountain-Ascent-Worlds-Largest-ZipRider2.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNTk3MjV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaG1PQzlvWWpJdk9EZ3hORE0xTVRnM05qRXlOaTVxY0djfGI2NWZhM2NhOTMwMDVmMDUwZjgzMzI3Y2ZiNTdkN2E2ODFmOGZjNjk1NGU5M2Q0ZDU0YjE4NGQyMWU3NWMwOGY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '701010', 'port_slug': 'icy-strait-point', 'title': 'Hoonah Sightseeing and Tribal Connections', 'slug': 'hoonah-sightseeing-and-tribal-connections-701010', 'price': 107.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-Hoonah-Sightseeing-Tribal-Dance.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTMyNTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGpOeTlvTUdJdk9EZ3hORE0xTWpFM01UQXpPQzVxY0djfGI4Zjc0ZmM2OTFkMWJjMDQ3YmVlMmE3MDQ5ZjFlMmNhYjQyMTBlNzA5NjhiYTU2Y2Q3Mjk1NmViODcxZjM0ZWU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
