    {'code': '701041', 'port_slug': 'icy-strait-point', 'title': 'Sky Peak Gondola & Forest Excursion', 'slug': 'sky-peak-gondola--forest-excursion-701041', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 6, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/701041-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc4ODZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1ZoTDJnME9DODRPVFkxT0RFeU1Ua3hNall5THpjd01UQTBNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwMWIyY2U2MjM5ZGM4ZTFjNDFhZDU4Y2ZmMGZhZmVhNjUwZmViNTBkOTAxYTY0NjQyNmMxYzY3ZWExN2MxMDkz', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '523040', 'port_slug': 'isla-tropicale', 'title': 'All Inclusive Private Beach Experience', 'slug': 'all-inclusive-private-beach-experience-523040', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.4, 'review_count': 22, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Private Beach:</strong> Picture the perfect beach getaway, as you enjoy several hours along the pristine shores of this private beach. You will have access to all the facilities that it has to offer: beach chairs, bathrooms, changing rooms, showers, restaurants, bars and fun areas on the beach. Within the Sol y Mar Beach Club, you get to enjoy snacks upon your arrival and then later, a lunch buffet of island cuisine, and a hotdog and hamburger station located in the restaurant area. You will also have access to open bars with choices of local beers, cocktails and house spirits. You get to choose how you enjoy your day, whether it’s dancing away with family and friends to the rhythm of island music or simply just relaxing on the beach soaking in the sun. Come and live the true island experience, where food, drinks and most of all fun has no limits!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Transportation: Pick up and drop off at port.</li>\n\t<li>Unlimited Drinks: Water, sodas, cocktails, juices and local beers.</li>\n\t<li>Buffet lunch and hotdog and hamburger station.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/523040-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ3MDR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFkwTDJoa1pDODVNVEEyT1RBNE1qVXdNVFF5THpVeU16QTBNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlOTQ1NWY5ZGJkYzJjZTcxNDNhMmYzYTlmZWRhZGUxOTNlMzU3MTUzYTljMzliOGUxYTkzMTlhY2FhYTIwYjYx', 'duration': '5.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '523012', 'port_slug': 'isla-tropicale', 'title': 'Jolly Roger Catamaran Sailing & Snorkel with Lunch', 'slug': 'jolly-roger-catamaran-sailing--snorkel-with-lunch-523012', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.1, 'review_count': 14, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Catamaran Sail &amp; Snorkel:</strong> Jump on a spacious catamaran for hours of fun in the sun as you cruise along the coast of this gorgeous island. Once we reach our favorite snorkeling spot, you’ll be provided with full snorkel gear for an easy and enjoyable adventure around Roatán’s coral reef. You’ll see lots of colorful coral, playful fish and maybe even a sea turtle! Our professional crew will guide you throughout your entire snorkeling adventure for your comfort and safety.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Snorkel gear.</li>\n\t<li>Lunch and open bar (local house brands) available after the snorkeling activity.</li>\n\t<li>Free digital photographs of your tour, and even free local Honduran currency to take home as a souvenir!</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-barefoot-catamaran-sail-and-snorkel-with-lunch-mahogany-bay-isla-roatan-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNDM0Mzh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGlOUzlvWVRVdk9EZ3hORE00TVRRMk5UWXpNQzVxY0djfGNjZTEwNTM2YTY0MzkxZTNjNWUxNjY0YWMzN2RjN2NlOGIxYzU3MmNmMWM3YWU1MDhiZDU1ZmYxYmU2YjE3YTg', 'duration': '4.0 Hours', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': '4'},
    {'code': '523009', 'port_slug': 'isla-tropicale', 'title': 'Isla Tropicale Beach Cabana', 'slug': 'isla-tropicale-beach-cabana-523009', 'price': 549.99, 'price_unit': 'Cabana', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Beach Cabana:</strong> You will take a chairlift ride on the Chairlift from the Main Plaza directly to Isla Tropicale Beach. From the comfort of your cabana, you can take in the beautiful view of the ocean. Your air-conditioned cabana accommodates up to four guests and includes the use of a semi-private beach area, includes free Wi-Fi service and cable TV, has a refrigerator with snacks and refreshments. It also features two lounge chairs, a hammock, shared community beach furnishings and 4 floats. You will have a concierge available for additional products you may want to rent as well as having a waiter available to order from the local menus offered by the restaurant. Also, make time to visit the stores available at Isla Tropicale Beach and the Plaza area. Carry home memories and souvenirs of a memorable day at Isla Tropicale!</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Four (4) all-day passes for the Chairlift.</li>\n\t<li>One (1) Air-conditioned cabana that accommodates up to 4 guests.</li>\n\t<li>Cable TV.</li>\n\t<li>Four (4) beach floats.</li>\n\t<li>One (1) double wooden lounge bed with covered cushions at front of beach.</li>\n\t<li>Private shower.</li>\n\t<li>Wi-Fi access.</li>\n\t<li>One (1) hammock.</li>\n\t<li>Four (4) sodas.</li>\n\t<li>Two (2) bottles of water.</li>\n\t<li>One (1) bag of chips.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/518048-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDYyOTh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGRpTDJnek1TODVNVEEyTkRFek1Ua3hNVGs0THpVeE9EQTBPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiZmVhZjhmNDdiMjJmOTlhOTc1OTZlNDVlYzU0OGFjYzc0ZjBhNDM5OGU4YzIyYWQyODI1ZWY5ZmVhNWJkYzc1', 'duration': '6.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '523059', 'port_slug': 'isla-tropicale', 'title': 'Roatan Animal Highlights: Sloths, Monkeys & Macaws', 'slug': 'roatan-animal-highlights-sloths-monkeys--macaws-523059', 'price': 87.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.6, 'review_count': 17, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Monkeys, Sloths, and Macaws:</strong> Embark on an unforgettable expedition through Roatán’s natural beauty in a comfortable air-conditioned van. Get ready to meet friendly monkeys, sloths, and macaws with your enthusiastic tour guide!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Iguana Farm:</strong> Enjoy a visit to the Iguana Farm, where hundreds of iguanas await your feed, allowing for an unforgettable wildlife encounter.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sights &amp; Shopping:</strong> Travel along a beautiful route to a small shopping center filled with distinctive Honduran crafts. Your journey continues with more sightseeing on the way back to the cruise ship pier.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Monkey, Sloth and Macaw Farm access.</li>\n\t<li>Iguana Farm access.</li>\n\t<li>Chocolate tasting.</li>\n\t<li>Shopping time.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/523059-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODU2MDZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1F5TDJobVlTODVNVEEyT0RRek9UVTVNekkyTHpVeU16QTFPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0ZWI5ODA2NzhkMGFkZDJjMjBmNDEwMGQ2ODk3NGJiOGI5YTAzNTRhZThkMWI5OGJhMWRkYzY5YjZhMTk1YjU5', 'duration': '3.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '523027', 'port_slug': 'isla-tropicale', 'title': 'Beach Horseback Ride & Swim', 'slug': 'beach-horseback-ride--swim-523027', 'price': 119.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.7, 'review_count': 7, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Horseback Riding:</strong> Take an off-road trail ride into the Caribbean Sea on your beautiful horse. Familiar with the route, these good-natured horses will immediately put you at ease so you can enjoy the nature around you. The ride begins on an off-road trail from which the beautiful blue Caribbean Sea comes into view. When you reach the end of the trail, ride your horse right into the waters of the Caribbean Sea.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Beach Club:</strong> Enjoy relaxing on a lounge chair and experience one of the best private Caribbean beaches on the island. A variety of drinks and food are available for purchase.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/518105-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNDQ0MDB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREl4TDJnMU5DODVNVEEyT0RZeE1UazFNamswTHpVeE9ERXdOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyZTU0M2FlMzQ2MzhlMGU0OTg5NzU2MTg2ZWZiODlmMTNhMjJlMDNmZjU3NGZhZmEyYmNhMDQ4ODZlOGU5MTBk', 'duration': '4.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '8'},
