    {'code': '523038', 'port_slug': 'isla-tropicale', 'title': 'Overwater VIP Private Bungalow', 'slug': 'overwater-vip-private-bungalow-523038', 'price': 576.99, 'price_unit': 'per 2 people', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/523038-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDI5MDF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJqTDJnM015ODVNVEEyT1RBM01qQXhOVFkyTHpVeU16QXpPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyYjk0YjMxMGQxYzVhODc4NjhjYTRjNDhlNzYxMDkxZTgxNTc4Y2VhNzEwNzE5ODlmMmUyMTYxNWFjMmMzNGFm', 'duration': '5.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '171050', 'port_slug': 'juneau', 'title': 'Best of Juneau:Whales, Glacier, & Orca Point Lodge', 'slug': 'best-of-juneau-whales-glacier--orca-point-lodge-171050', 'price': 302.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.4, 'review_count': 75, 'desc_html': '<strong>Orca Point Lodge Experience:</strong> Indulge in an Alaskan surf and turf meal at Orca Point Lodge at Colt Island. The sustainably crafted meal includes Allen Marine’s specialty chowder, locally sourced fish, wild game, a variety of sides, and a traditional dessert. Following your meal, enjoy the views of the remote island landscape, visit the marine life observation tank, and much more!\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Whale Watching & Wildlife Cruise:</strong> You’ll have the opportunity to view humpback whales, orcas, sea lions, seals, eagles and more. Sail on an Alaskan-built, high-speed expedition vessel with comfortable seating, wrap around windows, heated cabin, restroom, outside viewing deck, and galley.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Mendenhall Glacier Guided Coach Tour:</strong> You will take a scenic, guided coach tour to view and photograph the famous Mendenhall Glacier. At the Visitor Center, you’ll have time to explore interactive exhibits and stroll on viewpoint trails.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        2.5-hour cruise searching for whales and wildlife.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Approximately 1.5 hours spent at Orca Point Lodge for a surf and turf meal. \n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Complimentary coffee, tea, and hot chocolate.\n    </li>\n</ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-best-of-juneau-juneau-ak-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMDYxNTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGxNeTlvWmpVdk9EZ3hNalE1TlRRd05UQTROaTVxY0djfDM4YWYwZDFjMGFhYTFiZjY5MDcyNTcwNmFlNDU2YTU3ZTk3YTg2N2JiNWJkZTdkZjJkY2Q1NGNiYjMxMmM3NjE', 'duration': '6.75 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '171032', 'port_slug': 'juneau', 'title': 'Dog Sledding on Mendenhall Glacier via Helicopter', 'slug': 'dog-sledding-on-mendenhall-glacier-via-helicopter-171032', 'price': 778.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<strong>Helicopter Flight to the Mendenhall Glacier:</strong> Begin your bucket list worthy adventure aboard a state-of-the-art helicopter and absorb all the beauty Southeast Alaska has to offer. A highly trained pilot will take you over lush green rain forests, alpine ridges, and glacier valleys as you make your way to the famous Mendenhall Glacier. Before touching down, you will have a birds-eye view of the awe-inspiring blue glacier ice, deep crevasses, spectacular ice falls and jagged peaks of the Mendenhall Towers.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Glacier Dog Sledding:</strong> As you touch down at Mendenhall Glacier Dog Camp, you will be greeted by professional dog mushers and their energetic companions, the Alaskan Huskies! Experience the unique thrill as these canine athletes pull you through the snow that blankets the glacier. Take turns directing the dogs with your musher. After your exhilarating sledding experience, you will have time to cuddle with puppies and chat with your dog musher before boarding your helicopter to return.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Helicopter ride.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Dog sledding with professional musher.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Glacier overboots provided.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Complimentary lock boxes to store anything you are leaving behind.\n    </li>\n</ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/171032-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTkwNjN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREUxTDJnd015ODVOVFUxTWpBeE1qWXhOVGs0THpFM01UQXpNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzOTNlOWQ4OTFiNTIyZjNiNGIzNDdmMWE2NTQ3NjBkZTRhZjE0NmYxYjliZjAyZDljN2U5YmVlMDk1NjdiM2U3', 'duration': '2.75 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': '2'},
    {'code': '171005', 'port_slug': 'juneau', 'title': 'Mendenhall Glacier & Wildlife Quest', 'slug': 'mendenhall-glacier--wildlife-quest-171005', 'price': 263.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.1, 'review_count': 9, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Whale Watching &amp; Wildlife Cruise:</strong> You’ll have the opportunity to view humpback whales, orcas, sea lions, porpoises, seals, eagles and more. Sail on an Alaskan-built, high-speed expedition vessel with comfortable seating, wrap around windows, heated cabin, restroom, outside viewing deck, and galley.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Mendenhall Glacier Guided Coach Tour:</strong> You will take a scenic, guided coach tour to view and photograph the famous Mendenhall Glacier. At the Visitor Center, you’ll have time to explore interactive exhibits and stroll on viewpoint trails.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>3-hour cruise searching for whales and wildlife.</li>\n\t<li>1 hour and 15 minutes to explore Mendenhall Glacier.</li>\n\t<li>Complimentary coffee, tea, and hot chocolate.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-mendenhall-glacier-and-wildlife-quest-juneau-ak-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNDc0ODZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzFOQzlvWldFdk9EZ3hOREUxTXprMU56UXdOaTVxY0djfGY3NTQ3M2E1YTY3MmEyZWE0OTY2YjVlOWE2MWU0NjdhNTU3YWU1MzJiM2IwMjkwYTk4NTY3MjI4MTRkMjYwNzE', 'duration': '5.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
