    {'code': '192063', 'port_slug': 'kahului', 'title': 'Ultimate Coral Garden Snorkel Adventure', 'slug': 'ultimate-coral-garden-snorkel-adventure-192063', 'price': 230.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/192063-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDA4MjN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREl3TDJnNFpTODRPVE0zTURRMU9UVXdORGswTHpFNU1qQTJNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w5NGY1NjYxODIwN2Q1ZGY3ODgzMzFmN2FmNzc5MDlhNjRiZmFhZWZmM2Q4NmI2ZWY4NmZhMDE2NzE2ZGI5YTNh&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '192030', 'port_slug': 'kahului', 'title': 'Maui Tropical Plantation', 'slug': 'maui-tropical-plantation-192030', 'price': 114.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Maui Tropical Plantation:</strong> Stop at the Maui Tropical Plantation, a 60-acre tropical paradise. Take a 40-minute tropical tram ride and embrace the beauty of Maui's tropical side as you travel through fields of sugar cane, pineapple, coffee, papaya, bananas, macadamia nuts and tropical flowers. Smell the flowers, see the fresh fruit, and feel the Hawaiian breeze on this entertaining and informative journey.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-iao-valley-and-maui-tropical-plantation-maui-kahului-hi-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMjI4MTR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzBNeTlvTnpJdk9EZ3hORE13TmpneU1ERXlOaTVxY0djfDRlMTk0YmY3MDhmZjJiOGNkOWRhZDVhZjc5MzZlNTY2MWYyZmYyMjZlYWYxYzQ2NWRlZTUwMmJhZWIwZTAzYjY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '192066', 'port_slug': 'kahului', 'title': 'Two-Site Reef & Turtle Snorkel', 'slug': 'two-site-reef--turtle-snorkel-192066', 'price': 206.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Learn to Snorkel:</strong> Beginners are welcome! A "Learn to Snorkel" class is offered for those new to snorkeling, ensuring everyone can partake in this incredible experience.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Two Reef Locations:</strong> Dive into the crystal-clear waters at two pristine reef locations teeming with colorful reef fish and friendly green sea turtles. Get up close and personal with Maui\'s underwater residents. The Certified Marine Naturalists have over 40 years of marine research experience. They will enlighten you about the ocean and marine life, making your adventure an educational and memorable experience.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>BBQ Lunch:</strong> After your snorkeling escapades, savor a mouthwatering BBQ lunch prepared on board. Quench your thirst with filtered water, juice, sodas, and even enjoy a complimentary alcoholic drink to celebrate your underwater adventures.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Snorkel gear.</li>\n\t<li>BBQ lunch.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/192066-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTE1MzV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGcyTDJoaVppODVNREEzT0RVM05qTXhNall5THpFNU1qQTJOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzMzRjNGQwM2I1ZTRiMGYxOTlmOTk1YTFkNGI4NjY4MTBlMTMzMTlmNzlkMmJhZWE0YjY1OGVkMTgyMWZhNTAw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '192056', 'port_slug': 'kahului', 'title': "Maui's North Shore & Waterfall Nature Walk & Lunch", 'slug': 'maui-s-north-shore--waterfall-nature-walk--lunch-192056', 'price': 239.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Visit Iconic North Shore Maui Towns:</strong> Take in the highlights of the island]s spectacular North Shore, beginning with Makawao Town, where you can still see remnants of this historic hamlet's paniolo (Hawaiian cowboy). Today, Makawao is known more as a thriving arts community. You'll visit the shop of two of the leading glass blowers in Hawaii; a local art gallery displaying a wide array of works by Hawaii's most renowned artists; and the Makawao History Museum, where you'll glimpse a slice of this area's bygone past.<br /> <br /> <strong>Walk in the Rainforest to a Waterfall:</strong> Head to Ho'olawa Valley, where Maui's artists often visit for inspiration. Take a guided nature walk with a leading naturalist. Your destination is an idyllic waterfall overlook in the rainforest. Along the way you'll learn about the valley's indigenous flora and fauna.<br /> <br /> <strong>Ho'okipa Beach Overlook:</strong> Last stop is the lovely Ho'okipa scenic lookout, where some of the best waves in Hawaii, and green Hawaiian sea turtles (honu), are found. While pausing for photos, you can expect to see surfers riding the waves.<br /> <br /> <strong>What's Included:</strong></p> <ul> \t<li>Lunch</li> \t<li>Cookies</li> \t<li>Sampling of fruits and vegetables</li> </ul>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/192056-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE5NTZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREUyTDJnM09DODRPVEExT1RFMk1ESXlPREUwTHpFNU1qQTFOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmMDFlMTgyNDQ3ZGQ4Njg0MjNkNzg4ZTNlNGFiYzhiYTY5NGI2YjM4ODljY2M1ZGUzY2Y2ZDA2YWZjYjdhZWEz', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '192069', 'port_slug': 'kahului', 'title': 'Hana Coastal Drive', 'slug': 'hana-coastal-drive-192069', 'price': 204.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/192069-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDI4MDF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE0wTDJoa015ODVOVFEzTURJek5EVXdNVFF5THpFNU1qQTJPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjMTU5ODgzNmZkOTAwYTNlNmYxZDQzZTQ3ZTgyMjUyMzg1ZjVkMGUyZTk0Zjk1NTVlNGZmMjBkYmQxZDk4MzQ5&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '824012', 'port_slug': 'katakolon-olympia', 'title': 'Olympia and Archaeological Museum On Your Own', 'slug': 'olympia-and-archaeological-museum-on-your-own-824012', 'price': 84.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/824012-img2.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY2MzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0psTDJnMVppODRPVE15TlRVeU9UQXdOak00THpneU5EQXhNaTFwYldjeUxtcHdad3xmN2UzYTExYzJlMjMwNWYwYWY5NDQ4YjYyOGE1M2M3MTkwOTZhYzhmMGM2ODZhMWQwYzg1OWM4YmVkOGZhM2Fl&w=700&h=550&resize_profile=pdpgallery', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '824015', 'port_slug': 'katakolon-olympia', 'title': 'Vintage Greece, Olives & Wines', 'slug': 'vintage-greece-olives--wines-824015', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p>Discover the age-old art of making fine wines and olive oil, before testing out the local produce. Head inland through some of the small agricultural villages, which farm the fertile soils of the plains of Elis.<br />\n<br />\nDiscover one of Katakolon’s oldest established wineries, Domain Mercouri, which has a rich history in producing both wine and olive oil. You will be taken on a tour of the family-run estate with its intriguing mix of old and new equipment, including the wine cellar and the olive presses. The family museum hosts a collection of various old agricultural tools, used on the estate over the years. Continuing your journey of the winemaking process, you will see the nearby vineyards, which border the crystal-clear waters of the Ionian Sea. On your return to the main buildings, let your taste buds be tantalized by a tasting of local produce, including the estate’s wine, olive oil and a small selection of local snacks, including fresh bread and cheese.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/824015-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDMyMTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0l4TDJnM015ODRPVE15TlRVMU5ESXpOemMwTHpneU5EQXhOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmOWE3Y2MzZDMyZGUwNzMzOTE1MzljY2VhYzQ3YjkyODgwM2M1ZmU0ZTM4Njg5OWEyZjgxYWVkNGRkNTE1YzMy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '824011', 'port_slug': 'katakolon-olympia', 'title': 'Kourouta Beach Day', 'slug': 'kourouta-beach-day-824011', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/824011-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc3NDF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFl3TDJnMFlpODRPVE15TlRVeU16RXdPREUwTHpneU5EQXhNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkZDc3ZTUwODI5NTJjYTMwMzA5M2JlZTc2NWRlZmEzZDY4ZjIzOTE0MTFiMjBmNzgwMTk5NmFlY2MyZmI4YzU3&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '824017', 'port_slug': 'katakolon-olympia', 'title': 'Olympia Scenic Overlook & Countryside Drive', 'slug': 'olympia-scenic-overlook--countryside-drive-824017', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/824017-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU4Nzl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFJoTDJnd015ODRPVE15TlRVMk5qQXpOREl5THpneU5EQXhOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkZjIxOWQ1NjUxMjY0M2Q0M2Q3ZmE4YjM3NjI1MDFmYjZjZmVjNWI2YmQzNzkxNWYyZTE3ODEzM2EwOTcyZmU2&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '824014', 'port_slug': 'katakolon-olympia', 'title': 'Taste of Greece', 'slug': 'taste-of-greece-824014', 'price': 164.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p>A visit to the ancient site of Olympia is a must when you spend the day in Katakolon, and finishing your visit with the flavors of Greece and the sounds of Greek music will end your day on a happy note. Leave the small fishing village of Katakolon and travel through the countryside to reach the mystical site of Ancient Olympia, some 25 miles to the east. Visit the remarkable site where the first Olympiad was held. The most imposing monument in this area was the outstanding Temple of Zeus, one of the seven wonders of the ancient world. Today, you’ll only find the ruins of the temple and the gold and ivory statue has disappeared, but you can imagine how grand it was. Broken columns of the Temple of Hera, and remains of other monuments still rest in the once sacred grove. You can enter the famous Stadium, through a long tunnel-like passage and stand where many ancient athletes competed. You will then proceed to a local restaurant in Olympia where you will taste some of the delicious local cuisine accompanied by the merry sounds of the sirtaki, a traditional folk dance. You will then board your buses and drive back to the port.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/824014-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDUyNDF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFF3TDJobFlpODRPVE15TlRVME1ERTBOelV3THpneU5EQXhOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwMGM1OTRlOWE1MzBjY2QwMDUwNjgwNWVmNTJkOTRjNDFhOWI4NmUwNTI2ZWEyZTg4ZDc0YjNkYTMwMmNmOTQ3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '824016', 'port_slug': 'katakolon-olympia', 'title': 'A Greek Farm Experience', 'slug': 'a-greek-farm-experience-824016', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/824016-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE5OTh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREU0TDJnd1pDODRPVE15TlRVMk16UXhNamM0THpneU5EQXhOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzODE1NDhlMTYwMGM2YWFjNWQ1NmFhYjFlZTkwZjA2ZGYyZTc1YzEzODE2MGM4ODVjZmYxMjVkZjQ5YjBmNzAw&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '824019', 'port_slug': 'katakolon-olympia', 'title': 'Best Of Olympia', 'slug': 'best-of-olympia-824019', 'price': 164.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Olympic Ruins Exploration:</strong>With your expert guide, explore the historic grounds of Ancient Olympia. Witness the Temple of Zeus and Gymnasium, where athletes once competed.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Museum Discovery:</strong>Explore the Archaeological Museum, which showcases Greece's ancient treasures, including the famed Hermes sculpture.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Olive Grove Insight:</strong>Visit Agriturismo Magna Grecia, learn about olive cultivation, and enjoy local snacks with traditional music and dance.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Authentic Souvenir Shopping:</strong>Conclude with a chance to acquire unique Greek products from the family-owned estate's gift shop to bring home a piece of Greece.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/824019-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTUzMzN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1ZtTDJoaE5DODVNREkwTmpVMU1UWXpOREl5THpneU5EQXhPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3YmNlNzY0MWFiYTE4YzNiNzIyYWMwNGU4OGRiZmQ4YmY0NjFmOWM5ZGVmZjNmNjc4MDFjYjljNTg3MmU5ZWQw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '824010', 'port_slug': 'katakolon-olympia', 'title': 'Old and modern Olympia', 'slug': 'old-and-modern-olympia-824010', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/824010-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDYxMTJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFEzTDJneU1TODRPVE15TlRVeE1qWXlNak00THpneU5EQXhNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlMDJkZjdmZTFkMGI2ZTk1Yjk5OTdhOGRhMGI3MjkxOGM3YjU2NjNiYzgxN2M0ZTVmMmQ1MGVkNzkyY2I1MTMx&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '824009', 'port_slug': 'katakolon-olympia', 'title': 'Olympia and Museum', 'slug': 'olympia-and-museum-824009', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p>A classic, highly impressive itinerary that takes you through the ruins of ancient Olympia, set in a hilly landscape at the foot of Kronion Hill. The excavations, which began in 1875 by the Germans and which are still in progress, have brought to light this sacred area, which encloses within its walls an imposing complex of monuments including the Temples of Zeus and Hera, the Gymnasium and the Stadium. You'll visit the Museum where the famous statue of Hermes of the Praxiteles will be seen.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/824009-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU0NjZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0U1TDJnM1lTODRPVE15TlRVd056QTFNVGd5THpneU5EQXdPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0NWZkMDQ3NTBhNGU3MmEwZjkxOTZhY2U3NzExYzUzODMzNWQzZTJhNTQ3YzFhNjNiNzM1YjM4YTZhODk3NTRm', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '824013', 'port_slug': 'katakolon-olympia', 'title': 'Olympia & Magna Grecia', 'slug': 'olympia--magna-grecia-824013', 'price': 144.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/824013-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDcyODJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJrTDJoaU9TODRPVE15TlRVek5EVTNOamswTHpneU5EQXhNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlYTNkNTk2MDlmYjFmMThlODE1N2ZhNDM0MzQ3YmExZjRjZGRhM2IyN2FmMGEwNDExY2IzMjRlZDY5MTk4YmY1&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '735001', 'port_slug': 'keelung-taipei', 'title': 'Best of Taipei', 'slug': 'best-of-taipei-735001', 'price': 144.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Martyrs’ Shrine:</strong> Your adventure starts with a picturesque ride from Keelung City to Qing Mountain. Visit the remarkable Martyrs’ Shrine, built in 1969 to commemorate 330,000 fallen soldiers, featuring beautiful architecture influenced by Beijing’s Taihe Dian Imperial Palace.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Lungshan Temple:</strong> Travel through the bustling city of Taipei to discover the Lungshan Temple, originally built in the Ching dynasty to worship the Goddess of Mercy. Appreciate the temple's beautiful wooden doors, stone and bronze beams, and unique dragon-shaped poles.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Grand Hotel Feast:</strong> Revel in the grandeur of the Grand Hotel, built in 1952 with exquisite Chinese architecture. Treat yourself to a lavish lunch buffet with over 100 dishes that celebrate Chinese, Western, and Japanese flavors, all while watching skilled chefs in an open kitchen.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>National Palace Museum:</strong> Discover the National Palace Museum, home to a remarkable collection of ancient Chinese art and objects spanning over 8000 years. Highlights of the collection include exquisite bronze pieces, paintings, jade, ceramics, and treasures gathered by emperors from the Sung, Yuan, Ming, and Qing dynasties.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Chiang Kai-Shek Memorial Hall:</strong> Visit Chiang Kai-Shek Memorial Hall, a stunning tribute to the former President featuring a blue glazed-tile roof, gold apex, white marble and a natural red cypress ceiling. Inside, explore valuable artifacts including photographs, cars, and historical documents that tell the story of his life.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Taipei 101:</strong> Enjoy a photo stop at Taipei 101, known for its towering presence and unique design, before making your way back to the ship.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/735001-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDk4NDJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREk0TDJoaVpTODVOVEU1TURnd01UYzNOamswTHpjek5UQXdNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiMzAyNDAzZjNjZmQ1NzU1YWZlMGM2M2Y1ODgxZmRmMDQ1MjRhYTcyMTZiMzIwYjk5ODQ1ZGE4ZGI2MzYzMDM1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '735008', 'port_slug': 'keelung-taipei', 'title': 'Taipei by Night', 'slug': 'taipei-by-night-735008', 'price': 119.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/735008-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTgwMzJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGxtTDJnM05TODVOVEU1TURnME5qQXhNemMwTHpjek5UQXdPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2MWFjY2MyZDQ2MzU1ODEyZjE1YTFlNDg1NDMzNDQ1MzgwMTkzMmM3MWExYmQxNGQwMTljZTZjOTZlM2M3YThl&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '735003', 'port_slug': 'keelung-taipei', 'title': 'Taipei On Your Own', 'slug': 'taipei-on-your-own-735003', 'price': 59.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Independent Explorations:</strong> Enjoy an independent exploration of Taipei with this motorcoach transfer from the ship. You will be dropped off at the Taipei 101 building, a centrally located landmark, where you will be given around six hours to shop and explore at your leisure. The coach escort will advise you on the return pick-up time.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/735003-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTk2NDl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREptTDJoa05TODVOVEU1TURneE1qSTJNamN3THpjek5UQXdNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3NmQ4N2Q4OGE1MDk2M2ZlZDNmMDRmNGUxNGYzZThlMDI5Y2YyYmMzYzk3Mzk2N2Y1MjY3ZGE2NWJhMGI5Yzg5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '735009', 'port_slug': 'keelung-taipei', 'title': 'A Splendid Night Out in Taipei', 'slug': 'a-splendid-night-out-in-taipei-735009', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/735009-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTczMDZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFUzTDJoa01pODVOVEU1TURnMU1qVTJOek0wTHpjek5UQXdPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhMzliNzgzODg1N2YyYjQ2MTFiZGRkODVjNzFmNWZkOGYwMGIyZjIyOTEyNjVjNmJhMjgxNjRjZjM5YzhhMDg5&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '735002', 'port_slug': 'keelung-taipei', 'title': 'Taipei Highlights', 'slug': 'taipei-highlights-735002', 'price': 69.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Taipei 101:</strong> Travel along a scenic highway surrounded by lush green hills to reach Taipei's city center. Pause for a photo stop at Taipei 101, one of the tallest skyscrapers in the world, which is designed to resemble a bamboo stalk with elegant ribbons.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Chiang Kai-Shek Memorial Hall:</strong> Visit Chiang Kai-Shek Memorial Hall, a stunning tribute to the former President featuring a blue glazed-tile roof, gold apex, white marble and a natural red cypress ceiling.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>National Palace Museum:</strong> Discover the National Palace Museum, home to a remarkable collection of ancient Chinese art and objects spanning over 8000 years.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Martyrs’ Shrine:</strong> Experience the Martyrs' Shrine, dedicated to those who fought in the Chinese Civil War and the War of Resistance against Japan. Be captivated by the hourly changing of the guard, an impressive display of ceremony and discipline.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/735002-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjA4NTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR000TDJoallpODVOVEU1TURnd05UY3dPVEV3THpjek5UQXdNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiODA0NzNkNTM2Njg5ODU4NDBhNjkwMWE2ODQyNzRkNmYwNGFkODVmZGM3YjcxYmUwNWQxNWE1YWE2ODRhNDNl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '735004', 'port_slug': 'keelung-taipei', 'title': 'Wellness: Landscape & Hot Springs', 'slug': 'wellness-landscape--hot-springs-735004', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Natural Wonders:</strong> Experience the beauty of Taiwan's natural landscapes with towering mountains, mystical forests, hot springs, and deep gorges. Your knowledgeable guide will lead you on a scenic journey through the countryside, sharing insights into the area's culture and geological features.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Tienlai Hot Springs:</strong> Visit Tienlai Hot Springs Resort in the scenic Yangmingshan National Park to relax in soothing sulfuric hot springs enriched by volcanic activity. Enjoy a gourmet lunch featuring local dishes and seasonal offerings in this breathtaking environment. Discover the unique geology of the area, positioned on the Pacific ring of fire, as you unwind amid stunning natural beauty.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Yehliu Geo Park:</strong> Journey to Yehliu Geo Park, a remarkable lunar landscape filled with unusual rock formations sculpted over millions of years. Walk with your guide to discover the iconic Queen's Head Rock alongside honeycomb rocks resembling ginger roots, candles and mushrooms, teeming with ocean life.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Lunch: Appetizers and a main course of local dishes and seasonal menu, including beverages.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/735004-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTk0MTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREV3TDJoak1DODVOVEU1TURneE9EZ3hOak13THpjek5UQXdOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlNmQ1MWI4YzYzYTI0OTkwNjRkODQzYmU3ODE2YTY5YzUyZWYwYjUxZDU2ZDFhODdmMDJiODJlZGViOTYwYzQw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '735005', 'port_slug': 'keelung-taipei', 'title': 'Historical Taipei & Temples', 'slug': 'historical-taipei--temples-735005', 'price': 64.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Pao-An Temple:</strong> Experience the beauty of Pao-An Temple, a 230-year-old site dedicated to Pashen Tati, the medicine god. Observe the ornate carvings, including ferocious dragons on the columns and intricate woodcarvings of lions, flowers and mythological figures on the ceilings.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Confucius Temple:</strong> Witness the Confucius Temple, honoring the influential philosopher whose principles are still relevant in contemporary Chinese life.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Lin An-Tai:</strong> Journey to Lin An-Tai, Taipei’s best-preserved Chinese-era house built in the 18th century by the wealthy Lin family. This traditional residence features a charming courtyard and a crescent-shaped pond that served crucial roles in feng shui, fire prevention, and daily use.\n<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Dihua Street:</strong> Stop by Dihua Street, a 150-year-old marketplace in Taipei. This lively area is known for its wide variety of snacks and sweets, especially popular among locals during the Chinese New Year.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/735005-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTk3NTJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREE1TDJnMk1TODVOVEU1TURneU5UTTJPVGt3THpjek5UQXdOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4ZDY0ZDYyNGE0MjJkMTVjZWMyOTMxNjZhYmMxYjhlM2M5YmI0YzgwZGY4ZDhiZTI4YWVjODZjNzg2MTQ1Nzhm', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '735010', 'port_slug': 'keelung-taipei', 'title': 'Night Sky Lanterns & Keelung Highlights', 'slug': 'night-sky-lanterns--keelung-highlights-735010', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/735010-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTUxMDd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1ZsTDJobU5pODVOVEU1TXpZeE16a3lOamN3THpjek5UQXhNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzZGRmYjczM2I5YmVkZTg0ZmMyNjMxMmI5YTY5NDM4NDMyNWE1OWI0MTA3NjY2NmRlYTE0NDc0OTQ3ODEwYjQy&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '168027', 'port_slug': 'ketchikan-ward-cove', 'title': 'UTV Safari, Cruise, Crab & Kraft Beer', 'slug': 'utv-safari-cruise-crab--kraft-beer-168027', 'price': 349.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>UTV Safari:</strong> Buckle up for an exhilarating off-road safari as you drive a UTV through the mountainous traverse and hidden beauty of George Inlet Fjords. Explore old logging roads, conquer thrilling bridges, and get up close to the breathtaking Mahoney Glacial Cirque. Immerse yourself in the rich history and charming atmosphere of Ketchikan as you make your way to the UTV Base Camp.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Coastal Cruise:</strong> Sail aboard a 46-foot enclosed catamaran and journey to George Inlet Lodge, an old cannery bunkhouse. Enjoy a captivating 7-mile coastal ride where you'll witness the magnificent Mahoney Glacial Cirque, nestled miles below the very trails you were just exploring. Keep a lookout for wildlife, particularly eagles, soaring through the skies!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Beer &amp; Crabs:</strong> Indulge your senses with culinary delights at the lodge, beginning with a local craft beer tasting and a mouthwatering crab meal. Savor five craft beers from three esteemed local breweries, perfectly complemented by delectable dishes such as crab chowder, smoked salmon dip, steaming hot Dungeness crab and a delicious blueberry topped cheesecake. Immerse yourself in the rustic ambiance and warm Alaskan hospitality, truly embracing the essence of this remarkable destination.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Local craft beer tasting.</li>\n\t<li>Crab dinner including crab chowder, smoked salmon dip, Dungeness crab and a piece of blueberry topped cheesecake.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/170081-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTkzODl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGhpTDJoaE55ODRPVEkyT0RBd01qZ3hOak13THpFM01EQTRNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkOGJkOGYwYjhmN2M3OTJmY2Y4ZGNkNDlmZTBhZDM0OWQ0OWIyNGI5MTI0NzczYTdmZWRiODU0MWNiZTIwNDUx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '168029', 'port_slug': 'ketchikan-ward-cove', 'title': 'Mahoney Lake UTV Off-Road Safari', 'slug': 'mahoney-lake-utv-off-road-safari-168029', 'price': 280.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/170083-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDA5ODd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFptTDJnM1lTODRPVGN6TWprNU16VXhOVGd5THpFM01EQTRNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w5MDRlMDY2NTMyN2NiZDVmMGUwYjM0ODdiNmY3Yzc3NTg4OWRjOTYwN2IyMjkzMjFjN2RiZWJiODA4NjM4OTdk&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
