    {'code': '168022', 'port_slug': 'ketchikan-ward-cove', 'title': 'Totem Bight Park and Rainforest Canoe Adventure', 'slug': 'totem-bight-park-and-rainforest-canoe-adventure-168022', 'price': 192.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-170073-Totem-Bight-Park-Rainforest-Canoe-Adventure-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNDQ5MDN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3haUzlvTkRrdk9EZ3hOREU1TURJNU56RXhPQzVxY0djfGYyZmRkYmE2ZjI2ZjM2MjkzNjBkZmYwMzdmMmM5ZTk1YWRkMjE5NmYwMDdkYWNjYmFhYmYxYWRiM2I3ZWYyYTU&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '168010', 'port_slug': 'ketchikan-ward-cove', 'title': 'Rainforest Wildlife Sanctuary & Totems Park', 'slug': 'rainforest-wildlife-sanctuary--totems-park-168010', 'price': 140.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/168010-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDUyMjV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGd4TDJneU5pODVNVEV4TURrd09USXhOVEF5THpFMk9EQXhNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0Yzc4YzFmOTJkNzUyMGNmOThlYWQ2NjkzYWQwZWEyYjUwZTViZjFlOGUzYzI3NTg0OTZiNDQ5NGQxMmEwMGRm&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '170070', 'port_slug': 'ketchikan', 'title': 'Great Alaskan Lumberjack Show & Crab Feast Lunch', 'slug': 'great-alaskan-lumberjack-show--crab-feast-lunch-170070', 'price': 149.0, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Lumberjack Show:</strong> Prepare for an unforgettable experience at the Great Alaskan Lumberjack Show Arena and Harbor Haus Pavilion. Your adventure begins at the historic Spruce Mill, the world's largest Sitka Spruce Mill, and now home to the world-renowned Lumberjack Show. Witness World Champion athletes compete in 14 thrilling events, including chopping, climbing, sawing, axe throwing, and log rolling. Hang on to the edge of your seats for a rowdy good time!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Crab Feast:</strong> Just a short walk away, the Harbor Haus awaits, offering the freshest Dungeness Crab feast you'll ever taste. Hosted by a commercial fishing family, you'll dine while overlooking a bustling harbor filled with fishing boats bringing in the day's catch. Afterward, explore downtown Ketchikan, where totem poles, Creek Street, and jumping salmon are just some of the sights you'll see.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Lumberjack show.</li>\n\t<li>Photo opportunities with the lumberjacks.</li>\n\t<li>One alcoholic beverage.</li>\n\t<li>Unlimited soda and water.</li>\n\t<li>Lunch.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Great-Alaskan-Lumberjack-Show-2.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxMzY3MTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGtPUzlvT1Rndk9EZ3hOREU0T1RNM09UWXhOQzVxY0djfGMwZTU3OGFmYjkzODMxZWIyZDk2NTljNGNiMjY5MzMyZDk5YzIxNGEyYjc1NTcwMjRjYzI1NWY5NDkyNDk0Njc', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '170060', 'port_slug': 'ketchikan', 'title': 'Alaskan Lodge Adventure & Sea Feast', 'slug': 'alaskan-lodge-adventure--sea-feast-170060', 'price': 214.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Alaskan Lodge Adventure:</strong> Experience the best of Alaska's first city during a scenic drive to a secluded lodge, before setting sail on a boat tour through the mesmerizing Inside Passage. Marvel at the sights of an active eagle's nest, a U.S. naval submarine facility, and the region's stunning landscapes. Wrap up your adventure at Silverking Lodge, where you'll stroll through a lush rainforest filled with native plants and discover the Tongass National Forest's magnificent red cedar.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sea Feast:</strong> Treat your taste buds to an unforgettable family style seafood boil experience as you enjoy a bountiful spread of Dungeness crab, prawns, mussels, sausage, corn on the cob, baby red potatoes, garlic, warm bread, and luscious melted butter.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>All ground and sea transportation.</li>\n\t<li>Guided narration on coach, boat and at destination site.</li>\n\t<li>Family style seafood boil meal, coffee, tea, lemonade, and cookie.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y02-16ALA-FHM-Trail-019.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjgzNzh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGxOUzlvT1dJdk9EZ3hNalE1TXpJM05URTJOaTVxY0djfDY3MmRiMWZiOGQ1ZTc3Y2E4Y2E0OTU1NzhlMzBmMDZmZDI0YTNkNzgwODdlODU1NjYxMTYzZjQxMjc5NGI3NjA', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '170022', 'port_slug': 'ketchikan', 'title': 'Wilderness Adventure & Crab Feast', 'slug': 'wilderness-adventure--crab-feast-170022', 'price': 237.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.6, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Coastal Cruise:</strong> Experience the beauty of Alaska on a 30-minute scenic transfer to the lodge where you’ll board an enclosed heated marine vessel and set sail on a captivating 7-mile coastal ride. Pass the historic George Inlet Cannery and learn about fish traps from your knowledgeable guides. Reach a remote estuary, the habitat of the esteemed Dungeness Crab Fishery, and witness the excitement of crab pot pulling while gaining insights into the crab's life cycle. Keep your eyes peeled for magnificent eagles soaring through the sky as you head back to the George Inlet Lodge.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Crab Feast:</strong> Delight your taste buds and immerse yourself in rustic Alaskan charm at the George Inlet lodge. Savor the exquisite flavors of a steaming hot Dungeness Crab feast, accompanied by unlimited beverages. With its unique location, perched over the fjords on stilts, this experience guarantees a truly unforgettable culinary journey.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Dungeness Crab feast, unlimited beverages (soda, wine and beer).</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-02-Miss-Patricia-and-Cannery.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMjY2Njl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3dPUzlvTmprdk9EZ3hOREU0TkRRek1UWTBOaTVxY0djfDBlMjNlYWI4MjkzYjUzMjRkYzAwY2MxZjQxZDQ2OGE5YWViYTM2NDQ2N2JhYjVlMDNhMTEwYmY1ZGU3ZWJhZDI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '170066', 'port_slug': 'ketchikan', 'title': 'Alaska Fishing & Wilderness Dining', 'slug': 'alaska-fishing--wilderness-dining-170066', 'price': 424.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 7, 'desc_html': "<strong>Fishing:</strong> This tour is customized for any interest and skill level with just five to six guests per skiff. Your guide leads you to secluded locations for wildlife viewing and remote fishing. This trip is focused on catching rockfish for a unique seafood meal. Rockfish are humble but plentiful, offering consistent action and delicious table fare, with multiple species often found in the same school.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Dining:</strong> The best fish you'll eat in Alaska is the fish you catch yourself. You will disembark on the shore of a spruce and cedar rainforest and settle in while the camp cook prepares your meal, the bottom-feeders that you have caught will be served atop a saffron-infused bouillabaisse, seasoned potatoes in a homemade fish broth, warm sourdough rolls, and rhubarb-blueberry bread pudding round out the menu.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Fishing gear.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Rain gear including bibs, jackets, hats, gloves, socks, and boots.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Fresh catch meal.\n    </li>\n</ul>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Alaska-Fishing-Wilderness-Dining-HERO.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0MTMxMTh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzROeTlvT0Rndk9EZ3hOREU0T0RjMU56QXlNaTVxY0djfDlkMDM0MGNhODM5MzIyMzM3ZmI4NTk0MzYyZDU1NWY1NjE2Mzg2ZWEzMjBmYTFiM2UxYzYzYmQ0MjQ0M2NlOGY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '170081', 'port_slug': 'ketchikan', 'title': 'UTV Safari, Cruise, Crab & Kraft Beer', 'slug': 'utv-safari-cruise-crab--kraft-beer-170081', 'price': 349.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.8, 'review_count': 6, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>UTV Safari:</strong> Buckle up for an exhilarating off-road safari as you drive a UTV through the mountainous traverse and hidden beauty of George Inlet Fjords. Explore old logging roads, conquer thrilling bridges, and get up close to the breathtaking Mahoney Glacial Cirque. Immerse yourself in the rich history and charming atmosphere of Ketchikan as you make your way to the UTV Base Camp.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Coastal Cruise:</strong> Sail aboard a 46-foot enclosed catamaran and journey to George Inlet Lodge, an old cannery bunkhouse. Enjoy a captivating 7-mile coastal ride where you'll witness the magnificent Mahoney Glacial Cirque, nestled miles below the very trails you were just exploring. Keep a lookout for wildlife, particularly eagles, soaring through the skies!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Beer &amp; Crabs:</strong> Indulge your senses with culinary delights at the lodge, beginning with a local craft beer tasting and a mouthwatering crab meal. Savor five craft beers from three esteemed local breweries, perfectly complemented by delectable dishes such as crab chowder, smoked salmon dip, steaming hot Dungeness crab and a delicious blueberry topped cheesecake. Immerse yourself in the rustic ambiance and warm Alaskan hospitality, truly embracing the essence of this remarkable destination.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Local craft beer tasting.</li>\n\t<li>Crab dinner including crab chowder, smoked salmon dip, Dungeness crab and a piece of blueberry topped cheesecake.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/170081-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTkzODl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGhpTDJoaE55ODRPVEkyT0RBd01qZ3hOak13THpFM01EQTRNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkOGJkOGYwYjhmN2M3OTJmY2Y4ZGNkNDlmZTBhZDM0OWQ0OWIyNGI5MTI0NzczYTdmZWRiODU0MWNiZTIwNDUx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
