    {'code': '790018', 'port_slug': 'kiel-hamburg', 'title': 'Beatles, Beer & Bratwurst', 'slug': 'beatles-beer--bratwurst-790018', 'price': 294.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': 'Your guide will collect you in Kiel and take you on an approximate 1.5-hour, guided transfer to Hamburg along the Autobahn. Follow in the famous footsteps of The Beatles and discover where the band first found fame in the early 1960s. Have your camera at the ready as you pass by many of the city’s highlights including the century old Warehouse Quarter, Speicherstadt, City Hall and partly the Aussen-Alster, the top address in Hamburg, where numerous consulates are located. You’ll also see the infamous Reeperbahn, also known as St. Pauli, Hamburg’s red-light district as well as the theatre and nightlife mile. Your guide will host you on a tour to discover where the band first found fame and where they played their first concert at the Indra Club, which your guide will show you (from the outside only). Pass by the statues that commemorate them. Then, enjoy a brief stop at a typical German imbiss (stand-up/take-out restaurant), where you’ll sample a tasty traditional bratwurst. Have a German beer at a local pub/brewery before you return to Kiel.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/790018-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE2NTh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGxpTDJoak15ODRPVEl5TXpJNU1EZzRNRE13THpjNU1EQXhPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlMmI0NDA1ZTEzOTM2N2FjNWVjMjZiZmQ5OGU1NTcwMzA5Nzc2ODVlZTEyZDFkOTI2MjdhYzM3MDMzNTc1M2Vi', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '790023', 'port_slug': 'kiel-hamburg', 'title': 'Mighty Maritime & Naval History', 'slug': 'mighty-maritime--naval-history-790023', 'price': 229.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "The Baltic Sea reaches into the heart of the city of Kiel, capital of the state of Schleswig-Holstein, creating a truly traditional maritime city. A drive with panoramic views will take you past the city's highlights including the impressive Kiel Canal that connects the North Sea with the Baltic Sea. Be on the lookout for submarines that frequent this marine highway. Next, you'll continue along the eastern shore of the Kiel Fjord to the lovely town of Laboe. The Laboe Naval Memorial offers visitors a chance to view a monolithic memorial dedicated to the fallen sailors of all nationalities during the battles of World War I and II. Next to the memorial you'll find a U-995 — the world's only remaining Type VII U-Boat (submarine), which is also a museum. Time at leisure affords you the choice of either exploring the inside of the submarine U-995 on the beach below or perhaps climbing the main memorial tower, which offers terrific views from the observation deck of the Bay of Kiel, the Baltic Sea and surrounding Schleswig-Holstein. End your tour in Laboe to stroll along the shore of the Baltic. You may want to try a delicious local fish roll, a typical snack in Kiel (not included).", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/790023-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE5Mjl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGd3TDJoa1l5ODRPVEl5TXpNMk5Ea3pOVGs0THpjNU1EQXlNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjY2U1ZjQ1MzA0OGZmNzQxNGYwOWNlMDdkNjRjZWQ5Njg2OTVjOWQ4YzJjZGEzNjVkZWU4YWQ2ZGQ0MTAzODU5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '790022', 'port_slug': 'kiel-hamburg', 'title': 'UNESCO World Heritage Site - Medieval Lübeck', 'slug': 'unesco-world-heritage-site--medieval-l-beck-790022', 'price': 254.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "A 90-minute journey by coach brings you to the Old Town of Lübeck, once known as the Queen of the Hanseatic League. Today, this Free Imperial and Hanseatic City is steeped in history and tradition. An English-speaking escort will accompany you during the coach ride from Kiel to Lübeck, where you will meet your local walking guide. You’ll start your walking tour in Old Town Lübeck. Located on an oval-shaped island, this is one of the most impressive, intact collections of medieval Gothic architecture. You'll also enjoy the medieval ambiance of the Altstadt, with its well-known Holsten Gate. Lübeck’s historic patrician houses and redbrick churches are a UNESCO World Heritage Site. You will walk past the Gothic Rathaus (City Hall) and the Heiligen Geist Hospital. You’ll also see Buddenbrooks House — home of the famous writers Heinrich and Thomas Mann. Your guide will also point out some of the city's 82 quaint alleyways. You’ll then visit the Niederegger Café to sample coffee or tea as well as Niederegger's popular marzipan gateau. Lastly, you'll enjoy some free time to explore the shops in Lübeck or to visit St. Mary's Church on your own before returning to the ship.", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/790022-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDUyNTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR015TDJnMllpODRPVEl5TXpNMU1qZ3hNVGd5THpjNU1EQXlNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhYjAzZTU5YWMxYmZlMjFmMzQzM2M5NzU3NjIzMTU5YjI3MDBhMGY1YjAxYzJmMTczOWMyNTc4OWQ4ZjViNjVi', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '790025', 'port_slug': 'kiel-hamburg', 'title': 'Panoramic Schleswig-Holstein - by Land & by Lake', 'slug': 'panoramic-schleswig-holstein--by-land--by-lake-790025', 'price': 279.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': 'Enjoy the scenic countryside of Schleswig-Holstein. You will travel through quaint rural areas and pass the village of Plön, where you will see Plön Castle in the distance, nestled majestically on a hill between two lakes. Then, step aboard a nearby day boat for a ride across five different lakes to the village of Malente. These lakes are very popular because of their clear waters and lovely shorelines. The surrounding forests create a tranquil and relaxing atmosphere. Once you arrive in Malente, continue travelling by coach to the town of Eutin, also called the City of Roses. Explore the gardens of Eutin Castle and stroll the narrow streets to a local marketplace with your guide for an orientation. After this orientation, you can enjoy approximately 45-60 minutes of free time in this lovely village before returning to Kiel.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/790025-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU3MzB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFkwTDJnM1l5ODRPVEkwTWpVeU5qTTFNVFkyTHpjNU1EQXlOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlN2I5ZTAxY2RkY2NlYzlhYWQ4ZGMxNzhhYzkxYzRkMjgwYmIwZWFhZmJlMjZmYzNiZDhlOTg2M2U5MjgxNzQ3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '790017', 'port_slug': 'kiel-hamburg', 'title': 'Snapshot of Hamburg', 'slug': 'snapshot-of-hamburg-790017', 'price': 229.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': 'This trip presents an ideal insight into Hamburg, the Free and Hanseatic City and Germany’s second largest city after Berlin. Hamburg is one of Europe’s biggest ports. Elegant and cosmopolitan, it is a city of palatial office buildings, magnificent promenades, international musicals and extravagant shopping malls as well as the famous Reeperbahn. Hamburg is also Germany’s greenest city with many spacious lawns and lovely parks. Your guide will collect you from your ship in Kiel and take you on an approximate 1.5-hour, guided transfer to Hamburg along the Autobahn. Once you’ve arrived in Hamburg, enjoy a panoramic tour showing you the highlights of this bustling city, such as the City Hall, Germany’s oldest stock exchange, the Speicherstadt, as well as the Jungfernstieg, one of the elegant and luxury shopping areas. Travel around the Aussen-Alster, which is one of the top addresses in Hamburg. Continue your journey along the world famous Reeperbahn, where at the beginning of the 17th century, the Reepers made rigs. Nowadays, this street, together with the Grosse Freiheit and Herbert Strasse, are referred to as “the mile of sin”. Visit St. Michael’s Church, also known as the “Michel” by the locals. This is the largest north German Baroque church and Hamburg’s main landmark. St. Michael’s has four organs, one of which is said to be the largest in the world inside a church. Before continuing your tour, you’ll take a leisurely stroll through the Kramer Amtsstuben, which was an earlier form of widow housing. Your next stop will be at the city center where you can spend some time at leisure to taste some typical bratwurst (grilled sausage) at one of the local imbiss (stand-up, take-away restaurants) at your own account or just experience Hamburg\'s "Oxford Street" with its beautiful town hall. Return to Kiel along the Autobahn again.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/790017-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzA4OTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGRqTDJnM1l5ODRPVEl5TXpJM05qRXpORGN3THpjNU1EQXhOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyODY4NWMyMGIzNmUzZjRlMzdjY2ZhNjYxZjkwMmNkYWRkMTE1NmNmYjI3OTVkZTlkMGY0MDFmZjNjMmExM2Nk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '790019', 'port_slug': 'kiel-hamburg', 'title': 'Panoramic Kiel', 'slug': 'panoramic-kiel-790019', 'price': 144.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/790019-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTgxMjh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREptTDJnMllpODRPVEl5TXpNd056STJORE13THpjNU1EQXhPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlMGY3YTA1YWIyYjE1OWU0M2QzNzhiY2U4MmE5ZGJmYWVkMzkzMTFlYzViYjMzNmVkYjI2MGJkN2ZkZDE1Yzg3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '790024', 'port_slug': 'kiel-hamburg', 'title': 'Lübeck On Your Own', 'slug': 'l-beck-on-your-own-790024', 'price': 204.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/790024-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDYyMTJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGN4TDJoaU1DODRPVEl5TXpNM056QTJNREUwTHpjNU1EQXlOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlYjM1OGJjZGI1YzcwZjk1NTEzYmU3NzZlZTQ0MTJmZmMxYzhjNTVjMDYxN2IzMDY1MDMxNDVlMjc5ZjljNDY2', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '790020', 'port_slug': 'kiel-hamburg', 'title': 'Hamburg On Your Own', 'slug': 'hamburg-on-your-own-790020', 'price': 179.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/790020-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDI5MDd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGc1TDJnd1ppODRPVEl5TXpNNU1UZ3dOVGMwTHpjNU1EQXlNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzZGZiMThiOGIwYWQ5NDEyMWY5OWEzNjM5OThhZjBhOTAwZjJiYzkxODFjNmFmMTM5NjAxNWFlMDYwMjQ0ZGMx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '191008', 'port_slug': 'kona', 'title': 'Atlantis Submarine', 'slug': 'atlantis-submarine-191008', 'price': 209.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 22, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic Tour:</strong> Enjoy a short boat ride along the scenic coastline of the historic town of Kona to the Atlantis underwater site.<br /> <br /> <strong>Submarine Adventure:</strong> Transfer to the submarine and descend over 100 ft. underwater in Kona’s crystal-clear waters to explore 25 acres of coral reef gardens inhabited by hundreds of tropical fish species, coral, and other sea life. Get access to Hawaii’s sea life from this spacious, one-of-a-kind submarine with air-conditioned interior, large viewports, and comfortable front row seating.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-atlantis-submarine-kona-hi-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNDExMTh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzFOUzlvWkRVdk9EZ3hOREUzTkRVd01qazBNaTVxY0djfDJlY2NkNTI3ZjAwMGY5NGVkYjdhOWZiOGU4MGNjZjlhNjNhYmZkMTZmMTE3OWI1NThjZGIyODBhODVlOWEyODE', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '191016', 'port_slug': 'kona', 'title': 'Captain Zodiac Snorkel Adventure', 'slug': 'captain-zodiac-snorkel-adventure-191016', 'price': 164.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.8, 'review_count': 68, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Ocean Rafting:</strong> Enjoy a thrilling ride along the scenic Kona Coast in a high-speed Zodiac inflatable boat. Search for wildlife with your naturalist captain and hear the history of the Captain Cook Monument in Kealakekua Bay.<br /> <br /> <strong>Snorkeling:</strong> Snorkel in the pristine waters of Kealakekua Bay and discover marine sanctuary on a guided snorkel safari. On the way back, view dramatic lava tubes and sea caves while enjoying the island’s unique landscapes.<br /> <br /> <strong>What’s Included:</strong></p> <ul> \t<li>Snorkeling gear.</li> \t<li>Water noodles.</li> \t<li>Chips, cookies, and tropical fruits.</li> \t<li>Water, soft drinks, and tropical refreshments.</li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-captain-zodiac-snorkel-adventure-kona-hi-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMjgyOTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzVOaTlvWmpBdk9EZ3hOREUzTkRnNU5qRTFPQzVxY0djfDYyMjgxYzJiN2ZlZDQwZWRhMWIwYTljMzVmMjA0YjE5ZTkwZWQ1ZTM4YzM3ZjliZDY1NjNmYzY4MGQ3ZDkxMWY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '191020', 'port_slug': 'kona', 'title': 'Kona Historical Tour', 'slug': 'kona-historical-tour-191020', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.2, 'review_count': 56, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Ali’i Drive:</strong> Learn about Hawaii's folklore as you travel along Ali’i Drive that traverses through the quaint village of Kailua-Kona.<br /> <br /> <strong>Keauhou Bay:</strong> Continue your island journey south along the slopes of Mount Hualalai and catch a view of Keauhou Bay, the birthplace of Kamehameha III.<br /> <br /> <strong>Kona Coffee Factory:</strong> Get a peek behind the scenes as we give you a tour of our Coffee Center in Kona, and show you the mill where we process the coffee cherry that goes into your favorite 100% Kona coffees and Kona blends! Join a farm tour, and sample world renown gourmet Kona coffee.<br /> <br /> <strong>Pu’uhonua O Honaunau:</strong> The Place of Refuge or Pu’uhonua O Honaunau is a highlight for many guests visiting the island and learning about Hawaiian history. Here, guests will be able to walk on royal and sacred grounds that are part of a U.S. National Historical Park and take pictures of Hawaiian temples, Ki’i (tiki statues) and learn about their purpose, history and present-day use.<br /> <br /> <strong>St. Benedict’s “Painted” Church:</strong> Perched on a hill, overlooking the historic panorama of Kealakekua Bay and the Pu’uhonua o Honaunau National Park known as “A Place of Refuge,” you can experience Saint Benedict Church, better known as The Painted Church.<br /> <br /> <strong>What’s Included:</strong></p> <ul> \t<li>Coffee sampling.</li> </ul>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-kona-historical-tour-kona-hi-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxODc1MTJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzRZaTlvWWpjdk9EZ3hOREUzTlRReU1EUTBOaTVxY0djfGVhZTdiNTMxZmJkMTBiNjdjNDNhM2JkNzAwNWMxMzFlODYxMzQ1ZGI4NjMxZjI5YjgyM2ZjNTJhZjE1NWVmNTM', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '191042', 'port_slug': 'kona', 'title': 'Kona Reef by Glassbottom Boat', 'slug': 'kona-reef-by-glassbottom-boat-191042', 'price': 94.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>On Board:</strong> Cruise aboard the Marian, a 36-ft. glass-bottom boat specially designed for viewing the clear waters of Kona. Gliding over the reef, you will see and learn about the vibrant tropical fish, coral colonies, and other underwater wonders. The onboard naturalist and friendly crew share their love of the sea. This tour is a marvelous choice for those interested in a relaxing way to learn about and see Hawaii’s aquatic wonders.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-kona-reef-by-glassbottom-boat-191042-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTM1MjJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJZeTlvWXpNdk9EZ3hOREUzT1RFeU16SXpNQzVxY0djfGJkZjBmNDY4OGNhZTJmNTk4MjBjN2RlOGMyYmZjYThhZGVlODJhNWJmMzRmNDRiMGZiODFkNjlmMDI1NzIwZTc', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
