    {'code': '901009', 'port_slug': 'kotor', 'title': 'Panoramic & Flavors of Montenegro', 'slug': 'panoramic--flavors-of-montenegro-901009', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/Panoramic-Culinary-Montenegro-HERO-.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTkyMzF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaG1NUzlvWmpFdk9EZ3hPREF6TVRFNU9ESXpPQzVxY0djfDQ4NzdiMTBjNTBiMTg2ODE0MTlkY2M4ZjEwMGUwYjEwNTgyNjE3M2I0MjE0NjlkYWViM2U5MTA2ZjUxMWRlYjk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '880015', 'port_slug': 'la-coruna', 'title': 'Discover Galicia', 'slug': 'discover-galicia-880015', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>A Coruña Unveiled:</strong> Set off on a picturesque motorcoach ride that showcases La Coruña's vast views, known as “The Crystal City” for its glistening waterfront windowed galleries.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Tower of Hercules:</strong> Explore a historic Roman creation and the only lighthouse of its age still operational for maritime guidance.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Pause in Pontedume:</strong> Enjoy some free time strolling the charming village of Pontedeume, exploring the 14th-century Tower of Andrade, or enjoying a leisurely coffee break amidst local life.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Pazo de Mariñan:</strong> Wander through the exquisite French-style gardens, concluding with a picturesque motorcoach return to the ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>City tour.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/discover-galicia-880015-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTc1NTJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaG1OeTlvTnpZdk9EZ3pNamt6TXpRMk1qQTBOaTVxY0djfGY4OTE3M2RlMWUzNzRjYjhhYTNkZWRmZWYxZTQyNjUwYjg2MzNmNTdkM2ZkYWVmNGMzZmJjM2Q4YWYxN2VkNWI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '880004', 'port_slug': 'la-coruna', 'title': 'Camino de Santiago', 'slug': 'camino-de-santiago-880004', 'price': 164.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Camino de Santiago:</strong>&nbsp;Embark on a picturesque journey along the Camino de Santiago, a renowned European pilgrimage leading to St. James' tomb. Discover scenic meadows, charming farms, a lush eucalyptus forest, and an ancient stone bridge, as you immerse yourself in the beauty that surrounds you.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cathedral of Santiago:</strong> Once you arrive at a nearby village, you will board your motorcoach and head to the Cathedral of Santiago de Compostela and be welcomed with some tasty tapas. Afterward, your guide will take you around the cathedral and explain the interesting details inside. You will have some free time to explore the church on your own, and then you will return to your ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Tapas.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/camino-de-santiago-880004-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM5MjZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGhNQzlvTm1Vdk9EZ3pNamt6T1RRNU1UTTFPQzVxY0djfGMyYTUzNzdkNjg3ZTQ4YjdlYzhjNzg1MjJlYzkwNjAwMWIwZWQ2ZjI2Y2ZjMzYxZGMxNTMyNTczZTk1ZWU3MjI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '880012', 'port_slug': 'la-coruna', 'title': 'La Coruna & Betanzos', 'slug': 'la-coruna--betanzos-880012', 'price': 144.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Coruña City Tour:</strong> Begin your adventure with a panoramic motorcoach ride through La Coruña’s vibrant streets. Immerse yourself in the enchanting galleries of Crystal City and soak in the breathtaking views of Europe's longest coastline-hugging promenade.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Hercules Tower:</strong> Gaze upon this ancient Roman beacon, still standing tall and guiding sailors.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Betanzos Historic Walk:</strong> Explore narrow streets lined with ancient homes and discover the Church of San Francisco, which boasts 14th-century Gothic architecture and the tomb of Fernán Pérez de Andrade.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Lunch Local:</strong> Enjoy a delicious tapas lunch at a local restaurant before returning to the ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Motorcoach tour.</li>\n\t<li>Tapas.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/coruna-and-betanzos-880012-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQwMDF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGpNQzlvWVRrdk9EZ3pNamt3Tnpjd05qTTVPQzVxY0djfDdiM2Q3Mjg5ZWU4Zjg4NmEyODhjZDUyMDg3NjY2NWU5ZDA5OTRhZTA3M2M4ZTI2N2YxY2E1N2ZjYzczNjBiNDY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '880020', 'port_slug': 'la-coruna', 'title': 'Discover Historic Lugo', 'slug': 'discover-historic-lugo-880020', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Discover Historic Lugo:</strong> Explore Galicia's walled capital, where centuries of history from the Celts to the Romans unfold amidst stunning natural landscapes.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Wall Walk:</strong>Roam the ancient Roman Wall on foot with your guide for breathtaking views, then meander through the old town's quaint squares and vibrant gardens.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Leisurely Lugo:</strong> After the tour, you can explore Lugo’s Old Town at your own pace. Relish the local cuisine in bustling tapas bars, where standout seafood, game, and regional wines enhance the experience.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Guided walking tour and the Roman Walls.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/880020-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNDI2MzN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFV6TDJnMFpTODVNREkwTmpjd09USTBPRE13THpnNE1EQXlNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiYmJkNjEwZjhhZjM0ZGJlYWZjMzc4OGZmZWM4ZDRjYjlmZDg4NDIzNmRkMzg4YzVkN2JlYTk5MTcyZjk3ZTlh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '880026', 'port_slug': 'la-coruna', 'title': 'Santiago de Compostela Highlights', 'slug': 'santiago-de-compostela-highlights-880026', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>María Pita Square:</strong> Start your walking tour from María Pita Square, where tales of heroism meet the majestic Town Hall.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Glass Vista Walk:</strong> Stroll along Calle Real, famed for its glass façade splendor, and indulge in the local favorite, chocolate and churros.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Pontevedra Square:</strong> Explore the picturesque Pescadería district, home to the city's most beautiful streets, flanked by historic buildings and lush greenery.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Local Flavors Market:</strong> Dive into the vibrant municipal market, a hub of fresh seafood and Galician gastronomy, offering an authentic taste of local life. Continue exploring independently or return to the ship with your guide.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>María Pita, Market, and Pontevedra Square.</li>\n\t<li>Chocolate con churros.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/880026-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjE0MDd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREZpTDJobU1pODVNREkwTmpjeU16WTJOakl5THpnNE1EQXlOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3NmM5OGY5ZjRhNmJjOWFiMGQ3ZTdjMDY2OTRlNzVkYmEzYTEwMzI4ZmJlYzIyZmJkNDRjZjlkMWNkMmEwZWQy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
