    {'code': '880022', 'port_slug': 'la-coruna', 'title': 'Exploring La Coruna and its Flavours', 'slug': 'exploring-la-coruna-and-its-flavours-880022', 'price': 114.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/880022-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTg3NDd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGcwTDJoaU1TODVNREkwTmpjeE56UTBNRE13THpnNE1EQXlNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlMzVjZDMwMzg4ZjE0Nzk1OGFlNjEyODUyMzcwNDJmM2RlOGUxOWMxY2M1NzkyNzYxN2Y5YzZiM2Y2YzZkNWYw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '880016', 'port_slug': 'la-coruna', 'title': 'Unique Galician Beer Factory', 'slug': 'unique-galician-beer-factory-880016', 'price': 174.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/880016-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzk3NTB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1l4TDJneFlpODRPVFk1TmpRek1qSTVNakUwTHpnNE1EQXhOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlNzhiMmYyMjE5MWZkOTAxOTAyNTBiMmNlYmJjNDViMjZkNTFlYzZmZmZlZGQ1YWFmODlmZDVjYjEyMGJmNDIx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '318006', 'port_slug': 'la-paz', 'title': "Nature Lover's Kayak Adventure", 'slug': 'nature-lover-s-kayak-adventure-318006', 'price': 138.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Kayak Adventure:</strong> Embark on an unforgettable kayak adventure in La Paz, where an expert guide will take you through the region's pristine waters. Explore one of the hidden wonders of the Sea of Cortez while enjoying the tranquil beauty of crystal-clear bays.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Beach Break:</strong> Return to the idyllic La Concha Beach, where you'll have some time to unwind and relax on the sandy shores. Feel the gentle breeze and take in the tranquil surroundings, or venture out to explore the captivating shoreline, discovering hidden treasures of your own.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Bottled water and sodas.</li>\n\t<li>Life vests.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/ComingSoonEurope-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTkzNTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFF4TDJoak9TODRPVEV4T0RVMk5UQXdOelkyTDBOdmJXbHVaMU52YjI1RmRYSnZjR1V0YVcxbk1TNXFjR2N8OTQwYzM1ZTMxNWE5NmViNjI1N2E5OTNlZWUxNGI4NGU5ZmIyYjg3MDY5ZTNhOWM1NDNjNzQxNzI3M2ZiZDNhMg', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '318010', 'port_slug': 'la-paz', 'title': 'Balandra Bay Snorkeling', 'slug': 'balandra-bay-snorkeling-318010', 'price': 155.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Bay Snorkel:</strong> Experience the wonders of the eastern Baja Peninsula as you discover Balandra, where impressive volcanic rocks meet the Sea of Cortez. Snorkel in the clear waters, surrounded by extraordinary biological abundance. Visit the famous Mushroom Rock formation and eight attractive inlets on beautiful beaches. Travel 30 minutes by boat to Gaviota Island for more snorkeling among vibrant sea life. Relax on sandy beaches or hike for breathtaking island views.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Water and soft drinks.</li>\n\t<li>Snacks.</li>\n\t<li>Mask.</li>\n\t<li>Fins.</li>\n\t<li>Snorkel.</li>\n\t<li>Life vests.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/318010-img4.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzEzMDV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFF3TDJnMk55ODRPVGd4TVRRME5EQXpPVGs0THpNeE9EQXhNQzFwYldjMExtcHdad3w5OGNkZmRiM2FkNDRkZjdkN2Y2NjMwMzhlODZiNDFjNTlhNjRhMGJjYTdkOWNjYjQ1YTYwOTQwMjg4NjhjNTY4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '318016', 'port_slug': 'la-paz', 'title': 'La Paz Cultural Highlights With Lunch', 'slug': 'la-paz-cultural-highlights-with-lunch-318016', 'price': 135.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Historic Journey:</strong> Experience the unique beauty of the desert ecosystem as we depart from Pichilingue to La Paz. Journey through centuries of evolution that created the fascinating flora and fauna, including endemic cacti and thorny chollas. In La Paz, explore the thriving downtown area with colonial-style houses, learn about Sea of Cortez pearls, and delve into the city\'s history, visiting the Cathedral and main square. Discover the art of pottery at Ibarra\'s Pottery House and explore a diverse Artisan Center showcasing local crafts and textiles.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Malecon:</strong> Enjoy free time at the Malecon with a stunning bay view, indulge in shopping, and savor local seafood at "Bismarksito" restaurant. Finally, relax on the scenic motor coach ride back to the pier, cherishing the memories of your adventure-filled day.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/318016-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODE2ODB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREl3TDJnd055ODRPVGd4TVRRMU1UVTNOall5THpNeE9EQXhOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyOWMyMTg5M2I3NjQzNGZmMjM2YzZmODllZjU2MjFjODIyYjEzNjgxZDU5NWFhM2JkNmMzOGNlZDlhNGU5MTI3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '318023', 'port_slug': 'la-paz', 'title': 'Exploring El Triunfo: Historical Mining Town', 'slug': 'exploring-el-triunfo-historical-mining-town-318023', 'price': 94.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Panoramic El Triunfo:</strong> Experience the natural wonders of El Triunfo on a one-hour scenic drive along La Baja, where you'll be treated to breathtaking vistas of towering cacti and rugged desert landscapes. Once in town, dive into its storied past with visits to museums, admire the town's architecture, and enjoy shopping opportunities that capture the essence of this charming mining town.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Museo Ruta de Plata:</strong> Step into the past at the Museo Ruta de Plata and learn about the significant role of silver mining in El Triunfo's history. Spend 45 minutes exploring the museum's captivating exhibits and uncovering the town's rich cultural heritage.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cowboy Museum:</strong> Immerse yourself in the vibrant history of the Wild West at the Cowboy Museum of the Californias. Discover captivating exhibits that bring to life the tales of vaquero families and the pioneers of ranchero culture.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Independent El Triunfo:</strong> Explore the charming streets of this once thriving hub of gold and silver mining in Baja California Sur. Admire the town's preserved architectural beauty and peruse the souvenir stores for unique finds. Be sure to explore the Old Mine, featuring the iconic chimneys designed by Gustave Eiffel himself.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/318023-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzYxMjF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1poTDJnd1lTODVNRFF3TXpnNU9EWTFOVEF5THpNeE9EQXlNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjZTJmNzkyYzU3NWIyMTA1NzkyZTJlY2UwNTJmNDBmY2I2YTA3N2EzYzEzMzQyMmNhNzg2YmQ3YTRkNTJlZGNh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '318020', 'port_slug': 'la-paz', 'title': 'Magical Todo Santos: Tequila Tasting & Lunch', 'slug': 'magical-todo-santos-tequila-tasting--lunch-318020', 'price': 123.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Set out on a one-hour scenic bus ride to Todos Santos, a "magical town" that has captivated travelers for generations. Here, you\'ll explore its historic Mission church, the iconic Hotel California, and vibrant art murals that adorn the main square. As you wander, you\'ll uncover the heart and soul of this charming town.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Camel Encounter:</strong> Visit an Oceanside ranch, Tierra Sagrada Oasis, where you\'ll meet some friendly camel companions. Get up close, interact, and capture priceless moments with these gentle giants, including the chance to receive a delightful camel smooch.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Buffet Lunch with Tequila Tasting:</strong> Let your taste buds take center stage. Indulge in an unlimited Mexican buffet lunch at a restaurant overlooking the Pacific Ocean. Savor the flavors of Chicken with Mole, Ribs, Handmade quesadillas, and more. Plus, there\'s a tequila tasting that promises to add a touch of excitement to your culinary journey.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What\'s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Camel encounter.</li>\n\t<li>Buffet lunch.</li>\n\t<li>Tequila tasting.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/318020-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDAyNTJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0U1TDJnMU1DODRPVGt5TnpVM05UUTNNRE00THpNeE9EQXlNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4MDE4MzFiNGExY2MzMWZkZjM4NjU4MDcwMTg5MjQ5ZWEyODBiMWE3ZWU4N2IzNzk4ZDM3MGQ4ODcxYzFjMmM0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
