    {'code': '318031', 'port_slug': 'la-paz', 'title': 'Balandra Hike & Beach Break', 'slug': 'balandra-hike--beach-break-318031', 'price': 74.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.7, 'review_count': 26, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/318031-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjExMjJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR00zTDJneE5TODVNRFl6TnpjNU9ESTNOelF5THpNeE9EQXpNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3MTgwM2Q3NzYyNmE4ZDRiODUwYjBhYzQyMThiOGExM2RiZjc1Y2ZhMGUxMGQ3YjhhZDRmNzM4ODlkMDIwNGE2', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '318030', 'port_slug': 'la-paz', 'title': 'Authentic Cantina Crawl: Craft Beer, Mezcal & More', 'slug': 'authentic-cantina-crawl-craft-beer-mezcal--more-318030', 'price': 84.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.8, 'review_count': 72, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/318030-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjA5NTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1ZsTDJobVpTODVNRFl6Tnpnd056YzRNREUwTHpNeE9EQXpNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwN2FjNDA1MjA1YzE5MDk1OGRiZmNjYzRhOWEyNWYzZGU4NjM2OGM3OGQ3NDEzYjM1ZWRiOWFjMDI4YmZlYzI0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '811037', 'port_slug': 'le-havre-paris', 'title': 'Mont Saint Michel With Inside Visit to Abbey', 'slug': 'mont-saint-michel-with-inside-visit-to-abbey-811037', 'price': 249.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p>Experience one of France’s most beloved sites on this full-day tour and indulge in the beauty that surrounds this area. On this full-day tour of historic Mont Saint Michel, known as the “Wonder of the West,” the spectacular megastructure comes into view near the end of your relaxing 3-hour drive from port. Venture back in time as you explore this stunning UNESCO World Heritage Site that dates to 709 A.D. From the parking structure, a shuttle bus will take you to the base of the rock, which is crowned by the abbey. Walk up a steep flight of stairs and enjoy a narrated tour of the Gothic abbey, the cloister with spectacular views, the austere dining quarters and the Romanesque foundation. Afterward, enjoy some free time on your own. Explore the church, the medieval town with cobblestone streets and the charming shops where you can purchase lunch and shop for mementos and souvenirs. When your tour is over, you’ll enjoy a relaxing ride back to port.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/811037-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzMzODl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGcwTDJnMVpTODRPVFF6TXpjMk5qazFNekkyTHpneE1UQXpOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwOGI2YjA5OGI2NmZkMWY0MmNlMDRjMDUxYzAxOGM4NmVhNGVhMzVlMDMxYzA4YmE3Mjg5ZGEzNGMwMGFhYzNj', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '811042', 'port_slug': 'le-havre-paris', 'title': 'Rouen & Notre Dame Cathedral of Rouen', 'slug': 'rouen--notre-dame-cathedral-of-rouen-811042', 'price': 179.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p>Your tour begins with a scenic drive through the Norman countryside, heading inland to Rouen. There, you’ll begin your walking tour through the old section of Rouen, down narrow, cobbled streets lined with timbered houses, some dating from the 15th century. Continue down the bustling Rue Saint Romain to the Rue du Gros Horloge and you’ll see the Gros-Horloge, the city’s great 14th-century clock, which is housed in a Renaissance arch. It is one of the oldest clocks in France. You’ll then be able to see the beautiful Notre Dame Cathedral, a superb example of French Gothic architecture that took 300 years to complete. Next on your itinerary is a photo stop at the historic Place du Vieux Marché (Old Marketplace), home of St. Joan of Arc Church. After your tour, you’ll have an hour of free time to explore the city center on your own. After a well spent day in this beautiful city, you will head back to the ship.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/811042-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM2MTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREV5TDJnNVlpODRPVFEwTlRjNE5EazBORGswTHpneE1UQTBNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1MTNmOGIyOTIyN2ZkYzc3MGQ5NTQzZmM1Mzg3YmRiOGQ1NWNhYTRjYzdiNzA4ZDM1ZjEzYmVhZWU3ZWMxOTI4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '811051', 'port_slug': 'le-havre-paris', 'title': 'Normandy Landing Beaches - with Arromanches 360°', 'slug': 'normandy-landing-beaches--with-arromanches-360-811051', 'price': 314.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p>Travel to historic D-Day landing beaches on this all-day tour. Your tour begins with a scenic drive to Courseulles-sur-Mer, passing the Juno and Gold landing sites along the way. You'll arrive at Arromanches, where you’ll see remnants of Mulberry, the artificial harbor where thousands of troops came ashore. At the Arromanches 360° Circular cinema, located on Arromanches clifftops, you will be shown a 20-minute movie, produced by the authors of the hugely successful French television series, projected in high definition on nine screens that tells the story of the terrible Battle of Normandy. Afterwards, enjoy a lunch at a local restaurant. Next, you’ll travel to Colleville-sur-Mer, home of the Normandy American Cemetery and Memorial. Just above Omaha Beach, the American Cemetery is the final resting place of nearly 10,000 servicemen who died during the Normandy campaign. You’ll walk between the rows of marble crosses and Stars of David and witness a memorial and chapel that flank the sea of graves. Before departing for the pier, you’ll make a stop at Omaha Beach and Pointe du Hoc, a strategic position captured during D-day.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/811051-img1-v1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNjI2MDF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFJqTDJnMk5DODRPVEl5TWpJek1URTJNekU0THpneE1UQTFNUzFwYldjeFgzWXhMbXB3Wnd8MmJkNzk5NmU1MTZkYTVlNGJjNTNkMjU0YzM1YzliYmNjNzZlMWM1NThjNDQzN2NiZmRjNzNkMjc0OWQwOTZiMg', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '811054', 'port_slug': 'le-havre-paris', 'title': 'Etretat and Benedicne Distillery', 'slug': 'etretat-and-benedicne-distillery-811054', 'price': 229.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Distillery Tour:</strong> Embark on a scenic drive along the coast to the charming fishing port of Fecamp, home of the Benedictine liquor. One of the main highlights of Fecamp is the Benedictine Distillery housed in a unique building with a combined design of neo-Gothic and neo-Renaissance styles. Enjoy a guided tour of the distillery and cellars followed by the opportunity to sample some of the different liquors and visit the gift shop.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Etretat at Your Leisure:</strong> Continue to the picturesque town of Etretat, whose grand high cliffs and crashing waves are unforgettable whatever the season. Boasting elegant timber-framed houses, a medieval church and a charming marketplace; it is hardly surprising that the town has inspired many writers, artists and film directors. After a brief introduction to the town, you’ll have some free time to explore independently. Take a stroll along the seafront promenade to view the magnificent cliffs or browse the gift shops for that all important souvenir of your visit.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Benedictine distillery tour and sampling.</li>\n\t<li>Free time in Etretat.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/811054-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDcyOTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGRpTDJoa1lTODRPVGN3TXpVM01URXlPRFl5THpneE1UQTFOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0YWU4YmRjZGI1NjQ2MzYyOTBhYzM4YTAyZWYzN2IxNjQ0ZDg2ZTFlMGI5OTBhNGExYTNkMjE2ZjVjYTY2MmQy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '811053', 'port_slug': 'le-havre-paris', 'title': "Monet's Home & Rouen", 'slug': 'monet-s-home--rouen-811053', 'price': 269.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p>Enjoy a scenic drive through the Norman countryside on the motorway to Monet\'s home at Giverny on the Seine. Claude Monet spent the last four decades of his life creating a magnificent garden at his home and memorializing it in oil on canvas. Upon arriving, you’ll embark on a guided walking tour through a flower garden called Clos Normand, that is ablaze with colors of tulips, roses, dahlias, sunflowers and nasturtiums in the summer. Inside the pink crushed-brick house, adorned with green shutters through the garden entrance, you will visit the salon, Monet’s bedroom, his Nympheas Studio, the yellow dining room and the tiled kitchen. You will notice the Japanese prints and the work of his artist friends lining the walls throughout. Spend some time to shop in the gift boutique offering books, cards, reproductions and souvenirs before continuing to the water garden. You’ll marvel at the Japanese-inspired water garden as you witness the Japanese bridge surrounded by wisteria and azaleas as you look over the lily pond. Enjoy some free time for lunch on your own in Giverny before a drive to Rouen to begin your walking tour. You’ll visit the Cathedral Notre-Dame de Rouen, a superb example of French Gothic architecture that took 300 years to complete. The cast iron spire is the largest in France and the central portal features an elaborately painted "Tree of Jesus." Your guide will escort you into the interior, which features a Lady Chapel, the tombs of Rouen\'s archbishops, secure behind wrought iron gates, and impressive 15th-century stained glass windows. Then visit Place du Vieux Marché, the Old Marketplace, the site where the English burned Joan of Arc at the stake. Today, the square boasts the Great Cross of Rehabilitation erected in tribute to the Maid of Orleans.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/811053-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNjUzNTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGMzTDJnM1l5ODRPVEl3T0RRNE5UWTBNalUwTHpneE1UQTFNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2NTM3ZGJkM2E3NDE1NzdkZTYzYWUwNzk5ZTRkNzg3ZWNjYjYyNjUyNTgzMGQxYmRjOGRlYTY3MTI5NGVmODRk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
