    {'code': '727004', 'port_slug': 'le-verdon-bordeaux', 'title': 'Highlights & Bordeaux on your own', 'slug': 'highlights--bordeaux-on-your-own-727004', 'price': 179.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/727004-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDczNTh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0UwTDJnek9TODVNRFkyTURreU5Ua3pNVGd5THpjeU56QXdOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkYjUzOTk2ZWRmYzQ2YjdlYjIzZjE4MTI2YWMzYWYzZGY2N2MxZWMxMDQ4MjhjMjI4M2YwMjBjOWQ0NTVmY2E1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '727006', 'port_slug': 'le-verdon-bordeaux', 'title': 'WWII the remains of the German Army Atlantic Wal', 'slug': 'wwii-the-remains-of-the-german-army-atlantic-wal-727006', 'price': 184.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Atlantic Wall:</strong> Explore the remnants of the Atlantic Wall by visiting 25 meticulously restored German bunkers with stunning views of the Atlantic Ocean. Renowned restorer Jean-Paul Lescorce will provide a compelling narrative about the bunkers' WWII history and their role as coastal defenses under Hitler’s orders. This site serves as one of the few preserved examples of the German occupation's impact in the Médoc region.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Guided visit of the German bunkers with an experienced local historian.</li>\n\t<li>In-depth insights into the construction, function, and historical significance of the Atlantic Wall.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/727006-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDIyOTB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGd4TDJnellTODVNRFkyTURreE1qZ3lORFl5THpjeU56QXdOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2MDc5MDE2Y2FlMDI1Yzc0Y2NhNjk1MThjMzMyN2E0NGM4OGI1MjA0OTQ5M2E1OWY5ZDk5ZTBhZGEwYjk3OGEy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '727010', 'port_slug': 'le-verdon-bordeaux', 'title': 'BORDEAUX CITY TRANSFER', 'slug': 'bordeaux-city-transfer-727010', 'price': 164.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/727010-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDcyODB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1UyTDJnMVlpODVNRFkyTURnNU9UY3hOelF5THpjeU56QXhNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1ZDlkZjYzZWJiNzM3NzdjMjBlOTc2NjE2Y2ZkOWRmYTNmMjVjYjVjNjlmN2UyOTRkZmM3YWIzNTk2MjhlZmU5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '727001', 'port_slug': 'le-verdon-bordeaux', 'title': 'Best of Bordeaux', 'slug': 'best-of-bordeaux-727001', 'price': 259.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Discover the stunning landscapes of the Bordeaux region as you journey along the iconic 'Route des Chateaux,' surrounded by lush vineyards and magnificent chateaux.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Château Wine Estate and Cellars:</strong> Experience the enchanting world of winemaking at a stunning chateau, learning about local grape varieties and savoring acclaimed wines such as Cabernet Sauvignon and Merlot.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Bordeaux Highlights:</strong> Explore the neo-classical architecture of Bordeaux, a UNESCO World Heritage Site, as you visit iconic landmarks like the Place des Quinconces and soak in the lively atmosphere of the city.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Brasserie-Style:</strong> Delight in a seated lunch at a bistro reflecting the charm and heritage of the 1890s Dubern, offering an authentic taste of traditional French dining.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Wine tasting at a renowned Médoc chateau.</li>\n\t<li>Seated lunch in a local restaurant.</li>\n\t<li>Free time to shop along Rue Sainte-Catherine.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/727001-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTI2NzZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0ZpTDJnNU9DODVNRFkyTURrek1qUTROVFF5THpjeU56QXdNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0YzRhMjU0MWZmMjY0M2M1ZjJlYzgwODBlNzJjNjdlNjljMjhkZmM4MWQwMzY0NGIwODQxNzJkN2YyZmU5ZDAx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '727007', 'port_slug': 'le-verdon-bordeaux', 'title': 'Medoc Château & Wine Tasting', 'slug': 'medoc-ch-teau--wine-tasting-727007', 'price': 169.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 1.3, 'review_count': 8, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Experience the Médoc wine region on the illustrious "Route des Châteaux," featuring iconic vineyards such as Château Margaux, Château Latour, and Château Lafite Rothschild.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Chateau &amp; Wine:</strong> Journey through the magical Médoc Peninsula, visiting iconic châteaux like Château Mouton Rothschild or Château Cos d’Estournel. Enjoy a guided tour of the estate cellars followed by a tasting of distinguished Bordeaux wines, including Cabernet Sauvignon and Merlot. Don’t forget to click stunning photos and take home a cherished bottle of your favorite wine.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Guided tour of a renowned Médoc château, including a visit to the cellars.</li>\n\t<li>Wine tasting featuring the region’s signature varietals.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/727007-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY4Mjh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFJqTDJnNU55ODVNRFkyTURrd05qSTNNVEF5THpjeU56QXdOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3ZDkyNzc3Mzc3ZGEzZTc5NzVhMzIxZjIzYzFhODg1ZmEyYTNlZGNkNWI2ZTUyMjc2Y2I0Y2UxYzIyZjRmOTEy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '727012', 'port_slug': 'le-verdon-bordeaux', 'title': 'Costal Boat Cruise and The Cordouan Lighthouse', 'slug': 'costal-boat-cruise-and-the-cordouan-lighthouse-727012', 'price': 169.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Coastal Cruise:</strong> Embark on a memorable 2.5-hour boat cruise along the picturesque Gironde Estuary. Discover the "Versailles of the Sea," France\'s oldest functioning lighthouse, and witness charming resorts, pine- and oak-covered coastline, and stunning beaches. Don’t miss the dramatic cliffs and historic troglodytic caves of Matata and Regulus.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>2.5-hour guided boat cruise along the Gironde Estuary.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/727012-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ3NTJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREptTDJnMFlTODVNRFkyTURnNU5ERTBOamcyTHpjeU56QXhNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w5NzFmMjgxY2NiMjM2MjA4OTAzZDk2YTg3MzBmZWRhMzlhOWQ1NDU1MjkwYjFmZjI1NDUyZjkzYmQ4NTY1NjMx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '727005', 'port_slug': 'le-verdon-bordeaux', 'title': 'Bordeaux on Your Own & Cite Du Vin', 'slug': 'bordeaux-on-your-own--cite-du-vin-727005', 'price': 189.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/727005-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDAzNzF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREkyTDJneU15ODVNRFkyTURreE9UTTNPREl5THpjeU56QXdOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2N2VhZmEwZTU4MTJmZTIyYjNiM2NhM2YxNGUzOWE4MjAzNGVlODJhODY0NjFmMGExNTFkZTc4ODNkYzE2NWY4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '727014', 'port_slug': 'le-verdon-bordeaux', 'title': 'Soulac Walking Guided Visit', 'slug': 'soulac-walking-guided-visit-727014', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Soulac-sur-Mer:</strong> Discover the charm of a picturesque seaside resort, where rich history meets beautiful streets and breathtaking ocean views.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Notre-Dame-de-la-Fin-des-Terres Basilica:</strong> Delve into the fascinating history of this UNESCO-listed basilica, a site rich with stories that showcase the region\'s religious and architectural legacy.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Soulac Village:</strong> Take a leisurely stroll through Soulac, where 19th-century villas line the streets, earning the village its charming nickname, the "village of the 500 villas".<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Independent Explorer:</strong> Take some time to unwind at the seafront, enjoying shopping, dining, and the delightful atmosphere of this charming seaside resort, on your own.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>One-hour guided walking tour in English with a local guide.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/727014-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY3OTR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR016TDJnNE15ODVOalExT0RBd05UVTBOVEkyTHpjeU56QXhOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0OWE0OTY2MmEwMWZiMTFhZTViYjk2NzYzMWIyMjFiMGM5NTMwYmFlODhjY2RlZmQyMmU3NDRlNTc3NGJmODUx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '899008', 'port_slug': 'leixoes-porto', 'title': 'Porto Highlights', 'slug': 'porto-highlights-899008', 'price': 149.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p>Visit Porto Cathedral, one of the most notable sites in Porto, which features beautiful Baroque architecture. You’ll leave the pier by motorcoach and drive to the cathedral, whose interior reveals eclecticism through a wealth of diverse materials. Although this was originally a Gothic church, it has been transformed throughout the years and features a mix of different architectural styles. Then, visit the Stock Exchange Palace, a 19th-century gem of Arab and European design with a fantastic Moorish Hall. After, cross the Douro River and step into a well-known port wine cellar, where you will taste this legendary local product. After your tour is complete, you will return to the pier.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/porto-highlights-89908-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc2MDZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGhNeTlvWXpZdk9EZ3lPVGMyTXprM056STBOaTVxY0djfDY2NDZjY2U4MTYwZWFmZThmNGM4M2YwMjQ1OTMxZTY0NzY1MTZjNTA1NjFhNWJiNzQ2NTI1OGE3NzYxNWUwMTY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '899010', 'port_slug': 'leixoes-porto', 'title': 'Guimaraes: Birthplace of a Nation', 'slug': 'guimaraes-birthplace-of-a-nation-899010', 'price': 169.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p>You&rsquo;ll leave the pier by motor coach for a 1-hour drive to Guimar&atilde;es&nbsp;&mdash; the birthplace of the Portuguese nation. The original capital of Portugal, Guimar&atilde;es offers a wealth of historic architecture and history to discover. You will see the medieval Guimar&amp;atilde;es Castle, built in the 10th century, this castle served as a secure place to escape Viking raids. Then, visit the 15th-century Palace of the Dukes of Braganza. This palace houses a museum and art gallery featuring portraits, tapestries, fine furniture and porcelain. Afterward, embark on a walking tour through the Old Town; the tour showcases quiet corners and narrow streets, a former manor house situated in the central town square and a 10th-century church dedicated to the Virgin Mary. Once your walking tour is over, you&rsquo;ll be given some free time to explore the town on your own. Browse the local shops for treasures or stroll around town square. Before you return to your coach for the drive back to Leix&otilde;es, stop to take pictures at the Customs Tower, which is adorned with the slogan, &ldquo;Portugal was born here.&rdquo;</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/guimaraes-birthplace-of-a-nation-899010-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTQyMjV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGlNaTlvWXpndk9EZ3lPREkzTmpNeE1EQTBOaTVxY0djfDg1N2YzMTgwNTA4ZjUwODIxYWM3NGM3ZTFhM2Y5YmM2MmEyNjk2OWFlMjRlY2FjNGZhZGIxZmY0NDdkODEzZjI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '899013', 'port_slug': 'leixoes-porto', 'title': 'Fado & Tapas', 'slug': 'fado--tapas-899013', 'price': 179.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p>Step into the ambiance of old Portugal and its rich culture. The highlight of your visit will be your exposure to a type of local folk music known as fado. Fado is a popular type of Portuguese folk music that has been named a UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage of Humanity treasure. During the show, you'll see performances by some of the city’s greatest singers accompanied by mandolins or guitars. You will also enjoy some tapas, prepared with local flavors especially for you, as well as a glass of red or white Douro port wine. Along with the tapas, you'll have a chance to experience old Portugal and the traditions of the Douro region when you taste the port wine at the cellar. The cellar panels lining the room showcase the most significant and iconic aspects of port wine. Local handicrafts are also on display and available for purchase.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/fado-and-tapas-899012-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODQzNzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzVOUzlvT1RNdk9EZ3pNRFl3TkRBeE56WTVOQzVxY0djfDM1NjQ4NzA0NzUyZWJmNmEzYWNkNjdkMmU5MmJhMDUyMDE4OWY1ZWEzZTA2NDVlNWI1NGRiNGYzOTgwMTNkNWI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '899006', 'port_slug': 'leixoes-porto', 'title': 'Oporto City Tour & River cruise', 'slug': 'oporto-city-tour--river-cruise-899006', 'price': 179.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p>Porto, the economic and cultural capital of northern Portugal, is a city with ancient origins that gave its name to the entire country. Its architectural heritage and enviable position near the mouth of the River Douro have made it a UNESCO World Heritage site. Your tour of this fascinating city will begin with the Porto Cathedral (in Portugese: S&eacute; do Porto), originally a 12th-century Romanesque building adorned with works of art by some of the greatest Portuguese artists. You will then proceed to Ribeira, where you will board a &quot;rabelo&quot; &mdash; a boat specially built for navigating the River Douro, and used in earlier times to transport wine to the wineries. You will cruise along the Douro, sailing under some of the many bridges that connect the two parts of the city. Admire scenic views of the historic district with its narrow streets, houses and buildings that beautifully slope down towards the riverbanks. After your cruise, you will have the opportunity to visit one of the wineries that produce the city&rsquo;s world-famous port wine, and enjoy a wine tasting. When you&rsquo;re done, you&rsquo;ll return to the ship.&nbsp;<br /> &nbsp;</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/oporto-city-tour-and-river-cruise-899006-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzM3NjB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3hNeTlvWXpndk9EZ3pNalEwT1RBeE9Ua3pOQzVxY0djfGJkNWFiNWU5ZGEyOWMzMGRhOGFhZDQ3NTE3NjQyNTkwZmMxNTJhYzZjNDUzN2FkMGQwMjMzZWY0OTU2ZDhmNjc', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '899016', 'port_slug': 'leixoes-porto', 'title': 'Sweet City of Aveiro', 'slug': 'sweet-city-of-aveiro-899016', 'price': 184.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p>Once a seaweed-harvesting boat and now your transportation for this fun excursion, a moliceiro boat is unique to Portugal&rsquo;s Aveiro region. Step onboard and set&nbsp;sail to explore the inland Aveiro channels, which boast calm waters and offer a &ldquo;road&rdquo; through the city from a waterside perspective. Then, you&rsquo;ll come ashore for an interesting workshop at the Oficina do Doce that will show you how a local pastry, &ldquo;ovos moles,&rdquo; is made. It&rsquo;s difficult to translate this name, but is often described as &ldquo;sweet, soft eggs.&rdquo; This confection features an egg-based center encased in a thin crust of delicious pastry. Learn more about ovos moles and other local pastries by watching a fascinating short movie about Aveiro&rsquo;s history and culinary traditions. After the movie, visit the production process &mdash; where a couple of volunteers will be able to join in and assist with filling and cutting these tasty treats. Of course, samples are offered to everyone!</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/sweet-city-of-aveiro-899016-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc2NTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzFOUzlvWW1Jdk9EZ3lOamN6TnpRNU1UazVPQzVxY0djfGYwYmIwYjU5NGZjYjBhMThiYmEzMDdmNDI3NjViOTRhYjRmMDI3NGNiNTQ1ZWFjZmQ1MDY5YTIwNjhhOTNlYTY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '899007', 'port_slug': 'leixoes-porto', 'title': 'Oporto Panoramic', 'slug': 'oporto-panoramic-899007', 'price': 119.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/oporto-panoramic-899007-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTYwODZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3lZaTlvTVRRdk9EZ3pNalEwTXpnd09UZ3lNaTVxY0djfGFmNTNlMmQ0YmExNjNlNmVhNjQzNGRkOGMxMzA0OTM1NGUwNWNkZWJkMjFlMmMyMGI2ZTlkZTM1NDI2YzMzMjA', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
