    {'code': '899015', 'port_slug': 'leixoes-porto', 'title': 'Ancient Braga', 'slug': 'ancient-braga-899015', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/ancient-braga-899015-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTQ5NzJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNOUzlvWWpFdk9EZ3lOall5TWpZd056TTVNQzVxY0djfGE3ZTZjOWNhMWNiNGZlZTlkNzkyNjNiYjBkMjczZDMyMzY3OWJmMmQ0YWMxMjFlYzEzNWNkYWUwZTBmMTU1Nzk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '899004', 'port_slug': 'leixoes-porto', 'title': 'Oporto Walking Tour', 'slug': 'oporto-walking-tour-899004', 'price': 119.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/oporto-walking-tour-899004-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM0OTB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGtOQzlvTVdFdk9EZ3lPVGMwT0RZd09UQTFOQzVxY0djfDljYWE0MmI5NTZlYTAxNmI5MzhiYjA4OTE5MTM5NmRiYzNiMDY2NTA4MmUxODBmNjcyMGNiNDU3OGJjZDlkMmQ', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '515072', 'port_slug': 'limon', 'title': 'Train Jungle Views & Limon Sightseeing', 'slug': 'train-jungle-views--limon-sightseeing-515072', 'price': 64.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.7, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Historic Jungle Train:</strong> Travel into Costa Rica’s exciting past on a vintage train that takes you through the lush jungle, passing banana plantations. Be sure to keep an eye out for wildlife that frequent the tracks. This open-air historical train made its first trip in 1940 and allowed coffee producers to export their “golden bean” to European ports. It also is responsible for the start of the banana industry here.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Limón’s Countryside Views:</strong> Board your air-conditioned transportation for a drive around the city of Limón. Pass by lush tropical forests, plantations, and small towns while you are immersed in the history, culture and heritage of Limón. A brief photo stop will be made along the road and your guide will explain the importance of banana plantations in Limón’s economy.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Transportation in air-conditioned motor coaches.</li>\n\t<li>Transportation in vintage open-air train wagons.</li>\n\t<li>Certified English-speaking guides.</li>\n\t<li>Stop at a demonstrative banana plantation to learn about this valued fruit.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/515072-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY1NjR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFZsTDJnek1TODRPVFExTXprMk5qUTFPVEU0THpVeE5UQTNNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wxZDNlMjg5MzBhN2RmZmE5Y2E4OGU4MGM5NjQ2MGQ5ZGFlMjUyMTFiZmVlY2M5NWIwZjFhODVmMDQ0MzUwODhi', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '515014', 'port_slug': 'limon', 'title': 'Sloth Sanctuary & Tortuguero Canals Tour', 'slug': 'sloth-sanctuary--tortuguero-canals-tour-515014', 'price': 124.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.6, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': '<strong>Sloth Sanctuary:</strong> Get to know and love the charming, ever smiling sloths at the Aviarios del Caribe Sloth Sanctuary, an attraction made famous by the popular series “Meet the Sloths” on Animal Planet, learn about the rescue center and the important work done by members of the Arroyo Family, founders of the Sanctuary. See these enigmatic animals up close and learn about their living habits and unique personalities.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Tortuguero Canals:</strong> After a short drive, board an open-air boat for a trip through the Tortuguero Canals, a system of natural & man-made water channels with over 300 species of trees and other species of plant-life as well as a wide array of birds. Take a walk inside the rainforest along gravel trails, enjoy bottled water and fresh fruits to replenish your energy.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Entrance fee to Sloth Sanctuary.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Bottled water and natural fruits.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Bilingual certified guide.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Transportation using air-conditioned motor coaches.\n    </li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-sloth-sanctuary-and-canoe-adventure-limon-costa-rica-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNzM0MTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNaUzlvWkRJdk9EZ3hOREl3TXpZMk5qUTJNaTVxY0djfGI2MmQyMmQzZmJlZGU5Mjc1MzI0NmVmZDY3OTk4Yzk5OTc3YmFjMjI2ZTlhNDEzMmMxMmM2ODc4YjIwNTAzMTU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '515078', 'port_slug': 'limon', 'title': "Costa Rica's Amazon, Cocoa Show & Chocolate Making", 'slug': 'costa-rica-s-amazon-cocoa-show--chocolate-making-515078', 'price': 119.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.9, 'review_count': 15, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Tortuguero Canals:</strong> Explore “Costa Rica's Amazon” on a gentle cruise as your naturalist guide points out the flora and fauna. As you drift past orchids and water lilies, keep an eye out for toucans, sloths, howler and spider monkeys, crocodiles, river otters and turtles. Nature enthusiasts and chocolate lovers will relish this half-day in an ecosystem that is home to 300 birds, 57 amphibians, 111 reptiles, and 60 mammal species.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cocoa Artisanal Show:</strong> Learn about cocoa and chocolate production from an expert who will reveal the secrets of this native plant in an interactive show. Enjoy a sample of fresh cocoa.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Tropical Garden:</strong> Take a stroll with your guide through tropical fruit trees in the garden. Keep your camera ready for colorful birds while listening to the sounds of nature.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Chocolate Tasting:</strong> Delight in a hands-on chocolate tasting led by a local artisan chocolate maker! Taste the flavors of different types of chocolate.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Shopping Time:</strong> Take the opportunity to purchase local cocoa, chocolate, and souvenirs in the gift shop, with proceeds going to local producers.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Chocolate tasting (two types of artisanal chocolate).</li>\n\t<li>Water.</li>\n\t<li>Seasonal tropical fruit.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/515078-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTc4ODN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0ptTDJoa01DODVNREV3TkRNNE5EQTJNVGMwTHpVeE5UQTNPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyZTIwMDM1NWQ3YjZlZGU4ZGQzN2Q4YmM3OThmMjEyZjFhN2FlMjVmYzM1YjU1MjEzYTI1YTAyMDJlNzkzZWQ1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '515021', 'port_slug': 'limon', 'title': 'Caribbean Train, Boat & Bus Experience', 'slug': 'caribbean-train-boat--bus-experience-515021', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.1, 'review_count': 10, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Limon:</strong> Limon is prized for its vibrant Caribbean culture, stunning scenery, and intricate waterway systems. Join us as we explore the city and the region and learn about its history culture and heritage. Board your air-conditioned transportation for a drive around the city of Limon and its countryside.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Tortuguero Canals:</strong> Embark on a tour of the Tortuguero Canals a network of natural and man-made water ways. As you cruise the canal in your covered boat, keep your eyes open as you might be able to spot wildlife, such as sloths, howler monkeys, crocodiles, and many waterfowl species. At the dock, you’ll be served a seasonal fruit buffet and tropical refreshments.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Caribbean Train:</strong> Depart on an open-air train that made its first trip in 1920 and gave birth to the banana industry. Upon arrival at the stop, you will re-board your transportation and head back to the ship via a scenic coastal road.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Bilingual, certified English-speaking guide.</li>\n\t<li>Natural fruits, tropical refreshments.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-caribbean-train-boat-and-bus-experience-4.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMzExMjZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGlZeTlvWm1Rdk9EZ3hOREl3TkRBMU9UWTNPQzVxY0djfGMxNzliNjY3NDcwNTI4OTM2OTlhMThjY2IzOTNjMmNmZTA1MzQ5NDk2NjQwZmViZmQzOGMzM2Q3OTIxMmUxMDE', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '515068', 'port_slug': 'limon', 'title': 'Costa Rica Triple Adventure', 'slug': 'costa-rica-triple-adventure-515068', 'price': 209.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 30, 'desc_html': '<p>Discover the richness of the rain forest while you walk along beautiful trails, and the most amazing shapes of green vegetation will appear before your eyes. Your adventure begins when you arrive to the first of three suspended bridges, exploring a unique and thrilling way to observe the beautiful rainforest canopies. Each of these bridges stretch between 55 and 200 feet and up to 165 feet above the ground. As you continue, your tour guide will point out the most outstanding features of this lush forest, filled with exuberant wildlife including monkeys, sloths, several species of birds, butterflies, the beautiful blue jean frog, the green and black frog and some others. After, board a jungle pontoon boat specially designed to navigate comfortably through the Tortuguero’s impressive network of canals, where waterfowls, sloths, caimans, white-faced and spider monkeys, as well as many other animal species are easily spotted. Enjoy some delicious snacks while a group of friendly local dancers will greet you with colorful costumes followed by a live dance performance with Caribbean rhythms with beautiful stories behind each song! This will be the perfect opportunity to learn about their traditions. Finally, you will visit a rural tourism project. Here, you will have the opportunity to walk through easy trails surrounded by some of the most important crop plantations for the Costa Rican economy. Your tour guide will explain everything about coffee, cocoa and bananas.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/515068-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ5MjR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREprTDJnMk15ODVNVEl3TlRjeU9ETXpPREl5THpVeE5UQTJPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwYjY0MGEzNTJkZjdhYWNhZjg0NGNjODFkMDg3ZTYxY2MwYTY3N2ViODY0M2RhOGVhMWEwMzFiYzRiM2M4NzMz', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
