    {'code': '813071', 'port_slug': 'malaga', 'title': 'Kayak & Caves', 'slug': 'kayak--caves-813071', 'price': 174.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-813071-G-Kayak-and-Caves-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNjE2NzZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGxaQzlvWkdVdk9EZ3hNemc1TlRZME56STJNaTVxY0djfDg4YWZkMTQwYTdlZDZjY2M0M2FmYmE0N2ZhNTRiZmFiMjZhZjYwODY2N2NhY2RlY2NlNTMwY2Q3NGUzMDhmODY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '813085', 'port_slug': 'malaga', 'title': 'Granada & Albaycin with Lunch', 'slug': 'granada--albaycin-with-lunch-813085', 'price': 184.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/813085-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTYzMjd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFE0TDJobVpTODVNREV4T0RRNU9EVTFNREEyTHpneE16QTROUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmMWNiNDlkNWYzNmRkMzZmYmMwZWM0YmMwODRkYmI1Mjg0ODQzNmYzNjgzNzczZTAyMjU4Y2U3OTBiMmIxOTk4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '367021', 'port_slug': 'manta', 'title': 'Isla Corazón: Nature’s Heartbeat & Lunch', 'slug': 'isla-coraz-n-nature-s-heartbeat--lunch-367021', 'price': 279.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Isla Corazon:</strong> Travel north to Bahia de Caráquez, an intriguing city in the Manabi region. Discover Isla Corazón, a natural treasure located in the Chone River estuary. A 30-minute motorboat ride will take you to this heart-shaped mangrove island. Enjoy the ecotourism trail and observe an array of mangrove species and wildlife. Together with the Frigate Islands, Isla Corazón is a protected area and part of Ecuador's commitment to conservation.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Lunch at Bahia de Caraquez:</strong> Return to the city to enjoy a mouthwatering local lunch inspired by the New Ecuadorian Gastronomy School. Discover how traditional ingredients are transformed with international cooking styles for a memorable meal.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>A bottle of water per person.</li>\n\t<li>Entrance fee to Isla Corazon.</li>\n\t<li>Lunch at a local restaurant.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/367021-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDUwMDh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFExTDJobE9DODVNVE13TkRNeU5ETXdNVEV3THpNMk56QXlNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiYmExMmU4ZThmMjIwNjMzZGFlOWRmNTQ3MzliZjJkOTdkZGYzYWQ5N2YzZDQ4YjkxMGM5MTQxYTMyMTdiZjEw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '367020', 'port_slug': 'manta', 'title': 'Machalilla National Park & Authentic Lunch', 'slug': 'machalilla-national-park--authentic-lunch-367020', 'price': 259.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Agua Blanca:</strong> Experience Machalilla National Park on the picturesque southern coast of Ecuador in Manabí province. As one of the largest protected areas in the region, it offers both marine and terrestrial landscapes. Stroll along the community trails in Agua Blanca and discover the On-Site Museum. Connect with the rich culture and history of this small coastal town amidst beautiful natural surroundings.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Los Frailes Beach:</strong> Explore Los Frailes Beach, a treasure within Machalilla National Park. With its unspoiled beauty, this beach invites guests to swim, walk, or sunbathe on 3-kilometers of soft white sand. Adventure seekers can hike a trail to two additional beaches along the way and enjoy a spectacular viewpoint. Enjoy the natural beauty and tranquility of this remarkable location.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Local Flavors:</strong> Savor a delightful local lunch at a nearby restaurant, providing a satisfying conclusion to your day before returning to the port.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Lunch - Appetizer: Local black pudding, Main: Salad of raw vegetables, grilled chicken or fish dish with rice and local vegetables, Dessert: Seasonal fruit.</li>\n\t<li>A bottle of water per person.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/367020-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY4ODZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGMxTDJnM1lpODVNVE13TkRReE5qTTNPVEU0THpNMk56QXlNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4MGM2ZTEwNTI0ZDZhNzEwZjk4OGIyZWVkNTYyZWJiY2VkYmY3NzNmZDc3NTg0MWU3NWNkYmYyMDdmODk1MWNi', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '367015', 'port_slug': 'manta', 'title': 'Walking Ancient Paths: Cerro Jaboncillo', 'slug': 'walking-ancient-paths-cerro-jaboncillo-367015', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/367015-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY5NDN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREV6TDJnNFl5ODVNVE13TkRReE1UYzVNVFkyTHpNMk56QXhOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1MTliNmIzN2Y2MThmODQyN2Q4YmZiYjZjNWEwZTlmZWJiY2JkYTg4YTYxNzMzMmY1OTk0ODFlYWI0ZTg3YWEz', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '367014', 'port_slug': 'manta', 'title': 'Crafts & Culture of Coastal Ecuador', 'slug': 'crafts--culture-of-coastal-ecuador-367014', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/367014-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjA0Mjd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE16TDJobFl5ODVNVE13TkRRd05ESTFOVEF5THpNMk56QXhOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwNGY1YTkwODEzOTJlY2MxMTViN2ZmZDZiOTdiNGY4N2EyZDlkZTM3N2ViMzAzMzE5ZDNkYTlhMzcxNWUxZjNj', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '367018', 'port_slug': 'manta', 'title': 'Pacoche: Monkey Trail Adventure', 'slug': 'pacoche-monkey-trail-adventure-367018', 'price': 189.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/367018-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDI1MDN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0ZoTDJoaVlpODVNVE13TkRRME5EZzROek0wTHpNMk56QXhPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyZjc0Y2Y5ZWIwMTVmOTlkMmQ0YmM2MTBjMzk1YTllM2M4Y2JkNmM1NjQ5YTgxZjkzMTMzMzUzOGU2M2MxYTVm', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '367019', 'port_slug': 'manta', 'title': 'Manta & Montecristi: Artisans, Culture & Craft', 'slug': 'manta--montecristi-artisans-culture--craft-367019', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Fish Market:</strong> Enjoy a ten-minute drive to the Manta promenade with views of the city, commercial areas and the city's largest park. At the fish market, discover a variety of marine wildlife and watch local fishermen in action while birds gather nearby in hopes of a bite to eat.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cancebi Museum:</strong> Visit the Cancebí Municipal Ethnographic Museum to explore the rich traditions of Montubio culture and ancient Manabí. Discover a replica of a traditional Manabí home built entirely from guadúa cane and admire artifacts that reflect the everyday lives of farmers and fishermen.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Tagua Workshop:</strong> Explore the intriguing process of tagua production, from raw seeds to beautifully carved pieces. Learn how this vegetable ivory serves as a sustainable and ethical alternative to elephant ivory while reflecting cultural heritage.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Toquilla Hats:</strong> Discover the art of toquilla straw hat weaving, a traditional Ecuadorian craft with deep cultural roots. Observe skilled artisans transform toquilla fibers into beautiful hats and even try weaving your own.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Entrance Fee to Cancebi Museum, Ivory Nut Workshop.</li>\n\t<li>Sample: Chocolate pairing with banana, papaya pineapple and seasonal fruits.</li>\n\t<li>A bottle of water per person.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/367019-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDAwODJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGMwTDJneE1TODVNVE13TkRReU5qVXpOekkyTHpNMk56QXhPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmMTM4NTY2MDJkMTA2MDhhMmMwOWNhYWRkM2RkOGRlYjFhOTViYmNiYmE2OGZjZDdjYjBiZTdkNDU5YjQ3NzA4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '367017', 'port_slug': 'manta', 'title': "From Tree to Truffle: Manabi's Cacao Experience", 'slug': 'from-tree-to-truffle-manabi-s-cacao-experience-367017', 'price': 159.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/367017-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU0MTZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREl5TDJnMU9DODVNVE13TkRRek5qTTJOelkyTHpNMk56QXhOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3YTE5MGEyOTdiZGNlMmExNmZmNTc2YTliZDgzYzIwZmE5YWU1MWQ0MjE0OGI4NjU0NzQzYzQzMmFmMmM2NWQy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '367016', 'port_slug': 'manta', 'title': 'Ceviche Heritage Experience: Expo, Tasting & Lun', 'slug': 'ceviche-heritage-experience-expo-tasting--lun-367016', 'price': 169.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>City Views:</strong> Take a short drive through Manta, a bustling port city that offers a glimpse into the cultural heritage of coastal Manabí.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Fish Market:</strong> Explore Manta’s iconic fish market, a lively hub of local activity and fishing tradition. Witness the daily routines of fishermen and vendors as fresh seafood shines in this essential part of Manabí’s cultural landscape.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Shipyard &amp; Promenade:</strong> Walk the scenic seaside promenade and enjoy expansive ocean views. At the traditional shipyard, observe artisans at work as they bring to life the centuries-old tradition of wooden boat building, a testament to Manabí's maritime culture.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Chorrillo Workshop:</strong> Visit Chorrillo, the last remaining workshop where artisans create fishing nets from cabuya. Observe the intricate process of hand-twisting and knotting this natural fiber into strong nets and discover other cabuya crafts that reflect the enduring legacy of this skill.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cancebí Museum:</strong> Immerse yourself in coastal traditions with a tour of the Cancebí Museum. This guided visit highlights the rich heritage of Manabí through exhibits on the cholo, montubio, and agricultor, along with an array of cultural artifacts.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Ceviche Demonstration &amp; Lunch:</strong> Complete your experience with a guided ceviche-making demonstration by local specialists. Learn how to craft this signature dish and enjoy its refreshing flavors as a tasty lunch before your return drive to the pier.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Entrance fee: Chorillo &amp; Cancebi.</li>\n\t<li>Ceviche Demo &amp; tasting.</li>\n\t<li>Local beers or soft drinks.</li>\n\t<li>A bottle of water per person.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/367016-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ4NTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREF4TDJneFppODVNVE13TkRReU1qWXdOVEV3THpNMk56QXhOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3MzA0MDI4YzEzNmE2YzgyNGEzOTU1MWNhOTJlNGVmODgxYjk3MWNhZDQzYTcwNDRhMDBmMDJhYTM2ZTI2YjVh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '367022', 'port_slug': 'manta', 'title': 'Manta Uncovered: History, Forests & Gastronomy', 'slug': 'manta-uncovered-history-forests--gastronomy-367022', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Archaeological Museum of Manta:</strong> Journey to the Museo Arqueologico de Manta located near Murciélago Beach. This cultural hub explores the rich heritage of Manabí and showcases its diverse cultures. It fosters community involvement through ongoing programs such as artistic workshops, thematic and temporary exhibitions, educational mediation programs, and a variety of other cultural activities.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Toquilla Hat:</strong> Visit a local venue to learn about the toquilla straw hat also known as the jipijapa hat. This traditional craft reflects the culture of the Montuvios on the Pacific coast. Guests will have the chance to see the detailed weaving process and watch skilled artisans create fine hats from toquilla fibers.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Forest Walk:</strong> Experience the vibrant Pacoche rainforest, a rare gem on the Manabí coast. This semi-dry forest is home to unique plant species including Guadúa cane, Toquilla, and Cady. Enjoy an easy walk on scenic trails surrounded by the lush greenery. Discover the captivating beauty and wildlife that thrive in this verdant oasis.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Manabita Gastronomy:</strong> After the walk, learn about the Manabita oven, a cornerstone of the New Manabita cuisine. This traditional oven is used throughout Manabí province. You will enjoy tasting local foods and learning about the ancient cooking techniques that have been passed down through generations.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Snack: Bolones (green plantain balls), Patacones (green plantain tostones), tonga (chicken and rice on banana leave) sal prieta (Peanuted salt) among others.</li>\n\t<li>A bottle of water per person.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/367022-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDYxNzZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGhsTDJnNFlpODVNVE13TkRNek1EZzFORGN3THpNMk56QXlNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkYzE2ZTc4NmE3MGM1NTQ3ZjRjZjIxYWQ5ZmY3YmVhZDRlZmRlNTA1NmE4YzM4YWU3MDQ1NGE2N2U1ZmVlNGVi', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '319046', 'port_slug': 'manzanillo', 'title': 'Eco-Adventure at Palo Verde Lagoon', 'slug': 'eco-adventure-at-palo-verde-lagoon-319046', 'price': 115.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Palo Verde Lagoon:</strong> Embark on an eco-adventure starting at the pier, where a 40-minute air-conditioned motorcoach ride through a tropical and lush landscape leads to Palo Verde Lagoon. Here, you'll learn about the local flora and fauna, receive safety instructions, and enjoy a 12-seater boat ride, identifying resident and migratory birds from a provided pamphlet. The tour also highlights nesting areas within the ecosystem.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Mangrove Tunnel:</strong> Journey to the dark mangrove tunnel, where you'll explore this unique ecosystem teeming with diverse wildlife and capture stunning photographs at every turn. &nbsp;<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Coconut Plantation:</strong> Discover the secrets of a local coconut plantation where you'll learn about the various uses of coconuts, the harvesting process, and enjoy a delectable tasting session. &nbsp;<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sip &amp; Snack:</strong> Relax at a local restaurant on the black sand beach, where you'll enjoy a complimentary drink and light snack while taking in the stunning ocean view and refreshing sea breeze, before returning to the ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Safety vests.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/319046-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDAxOTB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFppTDJnME1DODVOVGM0TlRFNU9USXdOamN3THpNeE9UQTBOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhYTM5NThlYjFkY2I1MDcxNmEwNWExZGIwNDdkM2YyMGY1ZmJiZDJjMjMyYzBjYWM0ZTdhNGJmNjU4YWQ1NjIw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '319044', 'port_slug': 'manzanillo', 'title': 'Colima to Chiapa Rum, Sites & Bites', 'slug': 'colima-to-chiapa-rum-sites--bites-319044', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Journey 90 minutes inland to Colima experiencing tropical landscapes, Sierra Madre mountains, and local culture along the way.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Rum Factory:</strong> Visit the Classic Rum Factory for a guided tour showcasing the entire production process, from fermenting to bottling, and enjoy a welcoming experience from the Classic Rum staff.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sip &amp; Shop:</strong> Enjoy a tasting of two Classic Rum selections and conclude with a visit to the logo shop for unique souvenirs.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Ex Hacienda:</strong> Explore Chiapas, a quaint community at the base of Volcan de Fuego, and visit the beautifully restored Ex Hacienda de Chiapas, where you can enjoy a traditional light regional snack on the patio.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Chocolate Factory:</strong> Experience a sweet and educational visit to the family-owned rural chocolate factory, where you'll learn about artisanal chocolate-making with Creole Cacao, sourced locally.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/319044-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDI1MjZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR016TDJobE1TODVOVGM0TlRFM05qSTJPVEV3THpNeE9UQTBOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4ZTEzYTliMzA4MzRkYTgyZGEyMzA0ODQ5ZjIzMzA5OTg2MDE5ZDBkZWFlMDc4YjE1ZTY5MDY2MzU1ZDY3ZWY3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '319036', 'port_slug': 'manzanillo', 'title': 'Colima & Comala with Lunch', 'slug': 'colima--comala-with-lunch-319036', 'price': 86.5, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Countryside Drive:</strong> Enjoy a glimpse into the region's rural life as you journey through the lush countryside and make your way to Colima.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Plaza Principal:</strong> Arrive in Colima City, where you'll explore the vibrant Plaza Principal, surrounded by historic architecture. Admire the stunning 19th-century cathedral and immerse yourself in the traditional Mexican atmosphere of this charming city.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>La Campana:</strong> Journey to La Campana archaeological site, where you'll discover ancient pyramids and ruins from the first century, providing a captivating glimpse into the region's pre-Hispanic history.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Comala:</strong> Experience Comala, a 500-year-old town at the foot of two volcanoes, known for its white buildings and tranquil ambiance. Stroll around the central plaza and immerse yourself in the authentic local rhythm.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Local Flavors:</strong> Indulge in a traditional Mexican dining experience at a laid-back restaurant, featuring a classic snack and refreshing beverage, providing a perfect glimpse into the flavors of the region.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Visit Colima City main square (Plaza Principal).</li>\n\t<li>Visit La Campana archaeological site.</li>\n\t<li>Visit Comala.</li>\n\t<li>Snack &amp; one beverage (beer or soft drink).</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/319036-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDA4MTR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE16TDJnME5DODVOVFEzTnpJd056VXpNVGd5THpNeE9UQXpOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4YmExMTJjNDVhYTMzNjdlYzMzZDVmZDRjMzVlMDQ3NGMwYTE4YmMwMDZjMmNhMTkyNWYwY2NhNDZmNzJhY2U1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '319040', 'port_slug': 'manzanillo', 'title': 'Magical Pueblos', 'slug': 'magical-pueblos-319040', 'price': 90.0, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Coastal Drive:</strong> Embark on a scenic coastal tour, traversing lush landscapes and coastal wetlands.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Nogueras:</strong> Discover Nogueras, a historic town with traditional charm, and explore its narrow streets and the 18th-century Hacienda de Nogueras museum, an estate turned museum featuring exhibits on regional history, archaeology, and architecture.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Gravity Illusions:</strong> Journey to the "Magic Zone," where an optical illusion makes vehicles appear to roll uphill on their own, delivering a memorable and unique experience.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Comala:</strong> Explore the picturesque town of Comala, renowned as the "White Village of America." Admire its whitewashed structures and red-tiled roofs, wander through cobblestone streets, and savor the tranquil atmosphere of the central plaza.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sip &amp; Snack:</strong> Indulge in a traditional snack at a local restaurant, accompanied by a refreshing beer or soft drink, before the return journey to your ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Visit Nogueras &amp; Comala.</li>\n\t<li>Visit Hacienda de Nogueras Museum.</li>\n\t<li>Stop at the Magic Zone.</li>\n\t<li>Snack and one beverage (beer or soft drink).</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/319040-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDgxMDh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGcwTDJoaFlpODVOVFEzTnpFNU9UazVOVEU0THpNeE9UQTBNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3NTc2OWI0ZjM1NTM2NWExODAyNjA0ZWZmMmZmYjcyZGYyZjU3ODg4ZmRkODg1Y2I5Yzk2MzdhNDM0Y2ZjNDM3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '319039', 'port_slug': 'manzanillo', 'title': 'Cuyutlan Salt & Sea Turtle Discovery', 'slug': 'cuyutlan-salt--sea-turtle-discovery-319039', 'price': 84.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Countryside Drive:</strong> Experience a peaceful countryside drive, passing through vibrant coconut and banana plantations, as you witness the captivating scenery between the Pacific Ocean and Cuyutlan Lagoon.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Salty Savior:</strong> Visit the Museo de Sal, where you'll explore the fascinating history of salt in Cuyutlan. Delve into its importance for food preservation, silver processing, and the intense 200-year conflict over salt flats during the Spanish colonial era.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Turtle Tales:</strong> Experience the Tortugario Ecological Center, the largest turtle sanctuary in Mexico. A biologist-led guided tour provides insights into the sanctuary's conservation practices and ongoing research to safeguard endangered sea turtles.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sip &amp; Snack:</strong> Unwind at a nearby restaurant offering a complimentary drink and snack, providing the perfect end to your day.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/ComingSoonEurope-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTkzNTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFF4TDJoak9TODRPVEV4T0RVMk5UQXdOelkyTDBOdmJXbHVaMU52YjI1RmRYSnZjR1V0YVcxbk1TNXFjR2N8OTQwYzM1ZTMxNWE5NmViNjI1N2E5OTNlZWUxNGI4NGU5ZmIyYjg3MDY5ZTNhOWM1NDNjNzQxNzI3M2ZiZDNhMg', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '319038', 'port_slug': 'manzanillo', 'title': 'Manzanillo: Sights, Shopping & Beach', 'slug': 'manzanillo-sights-shopping--beach-319038', 'price': 52.5, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/319038-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDg0MjF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFJqTDJnMk9TODVOVFl3TnpjNU1qVTVPVE0wTHpNeE9UQXpPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlN2Y3MmZhNGM1ZTk0NTk3YzQwMWU5YTM5NGFjYjA4ZTcxMjlkMTkzMWNlNzg3YTRmMWI5NDZmODQxZTlhMGIy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
