    {'code': '820041', 'port_slug': 'marseilles-provence', 'title': 'A Tale of Two Provençal Cities: Arles & Aix', 'slug': 'a-tale-of-two-proven-al-cities-arles--aix-820041', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.6, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/820041-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDcyNDd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJpTDJneU1TODVOakUzTWpBek56VTNNRGcyTHpneU1EQTBNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiZjBiNGQ1YjZiNWNjYTcwNjYwOTk0YmFkMTUyNzhiMTQzM2RmNTA4ODIyZTQ4M2FmYTE2NjM1NzE1OTRmYzJj', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '422036', 'port_slug': 'martinique', 'title': 'Diamond Rock by Catamaran with Lunch', 'slug': 'diamond-rock-by-catamaran-with-lunch-422036', 'price': 189.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Diamond Rock:</strong> Enjoy a boat trip to Diamond Rock where you can capture stunning photos while learning about its history. Situated near Le Diamond on Martinique's southern coast, this iconic rock is a must-see.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Snorkel &amp; Sights:</strong> Snorkel among stunning coral reefs abundant with marine life, complete with informative signs about the fish you can encounter. If you'd rather keep your feet dry, the small, inflatable zodiac boat can take you to the nearby pier where you can capture iconic views of the famous church.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Local Delights:</strong> Visit Anse Abricot or Pointe Burgos, renowned for its scenic cliffs and transparent waters. Savor lunch and dive into an extra snorkeling adventure.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Turtle Snorkel:</strong> Discover the beauty of Anse Noir or Anse Dufour with a swimming stop and turtle snorkeling. Your guide will choose the best spot to keep you away from the crowds.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Lunch - Appetizer: Local black pudding, Main: Salad of raw vegetables, grilled chicken or fish dish with rice and local vegetables, Dessert: Seasonal fruit.</li>\n\t<li>Snack: Cakes and fruits.</li>\n\t<li>Drinks: Spring water, juice, soda, rum, rosé wine, red wine.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/422036-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDUxNDl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0l6TDJoa09TODVNVE13TkRJNU1qZzBNemd5THpReU1qQXpOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3NWFhMzAxNzE0Yjk1NzIzNDY1OTU2YmFmMjY3NmM5NGZiMTkyMjEyZGU3NTRjNmJjYzhlMTNmYzM3NmVkZDgy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '422035', 'port_slug': 'martinique', 'title': 'St. Pierre and Historic City', 'slug': 'st-pierre-and-historic-city-422035', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Balata Church:</strong> Start your tour at Balata Church, a stunning replica of Paris’s Sacré-Cœur, located on a hilltop above Fort-de-France. Surrounded by lush tropical greenery, it offers breathtaking views of the bay and the city.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Depaz Distillery:</strong> Travel along the picturesque northern roads to Depaz Distillery at the base of Mount Pelée. Discover the island's rum-making heritage influenced by volcanic soil and enjoy a tasting of their renowned agricultural rums.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Saint Pierre Ruins:</strong> End the tour in Saint-Pierre, once known as the Little Paris of the Caribbean before its destruction in 1902. Stroll through the ruins and take some time to explore or shop in the town center before returning to your ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Rum tasting at Depaz Distillery.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/422035-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTUwNTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1UxTDJoalppODVNVE13TkRJNU5UUTJOVEkyTHpReU1qQXpOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwMzY2N2UxZjk2ZTRjYTNhMTI5YThiYjQzZGFkOWM3YTY1ZDM2ODM2Njc2N2YwNjg2ZDM0NTYwNDk0NzU1NjZh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '422031', 'port_slug': 'martinique', 'title': 'Ilet Chancel Bay Ride & Sandbar by Boat', 'slug': 'ilet-chancel-bay-ride--sandbar-by-boat-422031', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Ilet Chancel:</strong> Cruise across the bay to Îlet Chancel, the largest islet nearby. Explore its dry coastal landscape and catch a glimpse of the rare endemic iguanas that inhabit this protected location.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Trapeze Beach:</strong> Journey to the peaceful Le Trapeze, a shallow sandbar that invites you for a refreshing sea bath. Relax in the warm waters and engage in some gentle exploration.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Snacks and drinks on board.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/422031-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTE1NDZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1E1TDJoaVlpODVNVE13TkRNMk16WXlNamN3THpReU1qQXpNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0Nzc3MDZkZTRlMmUwNTY4NTQyYzAwNzE4MWE0YmQ2YzE2YjI5MDVjZjYxYWI4NWM0Nzg3MmVmNmZiMDYyNjMw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '422037', 'port_slug': 'martinique', 'title': 'Discover Martinique’s Mangroves by Boat', 'slug': 'discover-martinique-s-mangroves-by-boat-422037', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Join your knowledgeable guide on a scenic drive to the Village of les Trois Ilets. During the journey, enjoy stunning views of the Carbet peaks, recognized as a UNESCO World Heritage site.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Mangrove Journey:</strong> Embark on a morning boat journey to observe an exquisite and delicate ecosystem teeming with distinctive flora and fauna. With a knowledgeable local guide, guests will explore an islet that reveals indigenous history and enjoy a snack with a local drink.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Soft drinks, rum punch and water.</li>\n\t<li>Snack: Local cake.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/422037-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDEzNzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1ZoTDJoall5ODVNVE13TkRJNE56STNNekkyTHpReU1qQXpOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzZTJhYTUzNjY2ZjU1ZjU3ZTYxMDQ4YWUwOGNmNTJlMDIzMjJkMWZmODcxMTQyNTNkYTY2Zjc3OGNjMzc2ZGFi', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '422034', 'port_slug': 'martinique', 'title': 'Anse Mitan Beach Bliss', 'slug': 'anse-mitan-beach-bliss-422034', 'price': 49.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Anse Mitan Beach:</strong> Relax at Anse Mitan, a sun-kissed beach in the heart of Trois-Îlets. Its soft golden sand and calm turquoise waters are ideal for swimming and unwinding. With a nearby selection of cafés, restaurants and boutiques, it combines beach relaxation with vibrant village life.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/422034-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODc0NjZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFZoTDJoaU5DODVNVE13TkRNMk1UQXdNVEkyTHpReU1qQXpOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3MzQ5ZjAxMDM3ZTRmYTZjOWZiMGIzYWZlNjBlNDJlZjdkYTA3ODExOTkzNWE0ZDExYmUyMjBjZTFiNzFhOWZm', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '422038', 'port_slug': 'martinique', 'title': 'Scenic South Coast & Seaside Relaxation', 'slug': 'scenic-south-coast--seaside-relaxation-422038', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/422038-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDcxMzN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0ZoTDJnMk15ODVNVE13TkRJM056YzNNRFUwTHpReU1qQXpPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmYTgyZjVkM2ZmNjc0MmJmODc2Y2ZhMjA4ZDk4OTc2ZTk0M2EwY2MzMjExZTEyMTFhZDI5MjRhZjcyOTM4ZTRl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '422033', 'port_slug': 'martinique', 'title': 'Martinique: Botanical Garden & Clement House', 'slug': 'martinique-botanical-garden--clement-house-422033', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/422033-img3.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTkwNTh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREZsTDJnM1lpODVNVE13TkRNNE1ETXpORE00THpReU1qQXpNeTFwYldjekxtcHdad3xiY2EyOTNhMzdlZTg2MmY3NTljNDVmYjE3MTZhYzc1OGEzY2M4MjZkMDVjMzdmZjdlZGY3MTc3ODc3NjljOGEz&w=700&h=550&resize_profile=pdpgallery', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '422032', 'port_slug': 'martinique', 'title': 'North Panoramic Tour', 'slug': 'north-panoramic-tour-422032', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/422032-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTg0NDh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREZtTDJobE5TODVNVE13TkRNM01ERTNOak13THpReU1qQXpNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w5MWU2YjJmOWM0ZmZmZmJmZjc1ZGE2Njc5MjZhZDE1OWUyN2RlYjYwMzZlNzA3ODMyNGI0YjEwNDRiMjQxMzEz&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '306056', 'port_slug': 'mazatlan', 'title': 'Mazatlan Highlights, Town & Shopping', 'slug': 'mazatlan-highlights-town--shopping-306056', 'price': 52.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.7, 'review_count': 9, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Discover Mazatlán by Land:</strong> Board a bus for an informative narrated tour of Old and New Mazatlán. The bus will stop for some wonderful picture opportunities.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cathedral Basilica of the Immaculate Conception:</strong> Visit this towering cathedral, which sits right in the center of Old Town. This Moorish-inspired landmark houses a magnificent organ, built in Paris, as well as spectacular stained-glass windows.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Playa Norte:</strong> As you drive by, see the area where fishermen sell their catch of the day.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Malecón:</strong> Drive past the famous Mazatlán Malecón. It’s 13 miles long and considered one of the longest seafront walkways in the world.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cliff Divers:</strong> Watch expert cliff divers plunge fearlessly from a cliff top platform into six feet of water below.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Las Changueras (The Shrimp Ladies):</strong> Observe how these ladies sell their fresh daily wares, mostly shrimp, right on the sidewalk of the street for a full block. Be amazed by the different sizes of shrimp.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Golden Zone:</strong> After the excitement of cliff diving, you'll relax with a little stroll in the Zona Dorada, or Golden Zone, where you can browse souvenirs, jewelry and handcrafts amidst palm-lined beaches and luxury resorts.<br />\n&nbsp;</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-mazatlan-highlights-town-and-shopping-306056-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTUxMTJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGlOeTlvTVRndk9EZ3lNelE0TmpnME1EZzJNaTVxY0djfGFiYTljYTUyNWVmNDdjMGE3NTE4YmU2MDU2OTg2N2UzOGVjZDIxNzQ0ZjAwYzNmMjQwYzNhMTFhNmQxNGFjODA', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '306007', 'port_slug': 'mazatlan', 'title': 'Charming Villages of Sierra Madre & Mexican Lunch', 'slug': 'charming-villages-of-sierra-madre--mexican-lunch-306007', 'price': 77.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.6, 'review_count': 19, 'desc_html': '<strong>Sightseeing through Mountains:</strong> Rising behind Mazatlán is the Sierra Madre range of mountains, which separates the coastal area of Mexico from the interior. Rich in minerals and extremely rugged, these mountains have become the subject of spectacular legends. <br /><br /> <strong>Brickyard:</strong> Your exploration will take you from historic Mazatlán to the Durango Highway, stopping at a brickyard where adobe bricks are handmade and fired, much as they have been for several centuries. <br /><br /> <strong>Malpica:</strong> You will continue your tour by visiting a village family home bakery with a chance to try some typical Mexican sweet bread baked in an adobe oven. <br /><br /> <strong>Concordia:</strong> Stop to enjoy a refreshing drink at one of the many colonial furniture and pottery workshops where roof tiles, jars, flowerpots and dishes, typical of this region, are produced. <br /><br /> <strong>Copala:</strong> A once-thriving Spanish gold and silver mining town that dates back as far as 1565. Today, it is a ghost town. During the walking exploration, view ornate colonial houses, a jail and an impressive church. <br /><br /> <strong>Golden Zone:</strong> Once you return to Mazatlán, enjoy a stroll in the Zona Dorada, or Golden Zone, the modern resort area where you can browse souvenirs, jewelry and handcrafts amidst palm-lined beaches and glamorous hotels. <br /><br /> <strong>What’s Included:</strong> <ul>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Mexican Platter: Beef or chicken fajitas, rice and beans, chips and salsa, and tortillas.     </li>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Beer, hibiscus water, soda, or bottled water.     </li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-colonial-village-of-sierra-madre-carnival-cruise-line.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxOTQ2OTJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzBOaTlvTnpFdk9EZ3hOREkxTkRBMk16WTBOaTVxY0djfGQ5YzU1ZDljZmE5NjI0YjM2YzliZGQyZWU2MjUyMzhmNmY3MzU3ZjlkODRiNDRhMmE3ZDk1ZmE3NzBkMzIzNzY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '306021', 'port_slug': 'mazatlan', 'title': 'Top 10 Best of Mazatlan & Mexican Show with Lunch', 'slug': 'top-10-best-of-mazatlan--mexican-show-with-lunch-306021', 'price': 69.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.9, 'review_count': 396, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Pacifico Brewery Drive-by:</strong> Take a short drive from the pier and pass by the Pacifico Brewery founded in 1900 by German immigrants who wanted to brew a pilsner-style beer in Mazatl&aacute;n.<br /> <br /> <strong>Playa Norte:</strong> Drive by the beach where locals gather to purchase the daily catch. The shallow water and calm waves of Playa Norte work as a natural pool, where yachts are constantly setting their anchors for lively boat parties.<br /> <br /> <strong>Cliff Divers:</strong> See a very special performance by the incredible local cliff divers while remaining in the vehicle. Prepare to be thrilled by these highly trained extreme sport athletes.<br /> <br /> <strong>Cathedral Basilica de la Inmaculada Concepci&oacute;n:</strong> Your Mazatl&aacute;n sightseeing is not complete without letting the towering double spire of the Basilica guide you to the very center of the Pearl of the Pacific. This magnificent church is considered the most beautiful cathedral in Mexico&rsquo;s Northwest and occupies an entire city block.<br /> <br /> <strong>Venados Baseball Stadium:</strong> Drive by the stadium where Mexico won its first at home Caribbean Series championship.<br /> <br /> <strong>Aquarium:</strong> Enjoy sightseeing on the north of Mazatl&aacute;n, your guide will point the newly renovated city aquarium.<br /> <br /> <strong>Malecón:</strong> Continue driving north along the Malecón, one of the longest seafront walkways in the world. You will have an unobstructed view of the ocean as well as remnants of the city&rsquo;s history that may conjure up ghosts of Mazatl&aacute;n&rsquo;s pirate past.<br /> <br /> <strong>Mexican Show:</strong> Stop at private Theater &lsquo;&rsquo;Spectaculare&rsquo;&rsquo; for a local cultural show that features music and dancing from the different regions of Mexico.<br /> <br /> <strong>Golden Zone Visit:</strong> Enjoy free time on your own at the Hotel area and shopping district, or simply relax on the beach.<br /> <br /> <strong>El Faro:</strong> Pass by and get to know El Faro (Spanish name for The Lighthouse), the tallest lighthouse in the Americas and one of the tallest operating lighthouses in the world.<br /> <br /> <strong>What&rsquo;s Included:</strong></p> <ul> \t<li>Mexican lunch: chicken and pork Fajitas, rice and beans, salsa and chips.</li> \t<li>Choice of one margarita or soda.</li> \t<li>Bottle of water.</li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/top-10-best-mazaltan-mexican-show-306021-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTMwMjh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGxZaTlvTVRFdk9EZ3pNamMxT0RBeU1qRTNOQzVxY0djfGQxNDg0YjZhMzEyMmI2NDdkMjlkNWYwYzQ2NWExYjU2ZjJiZGU4NzkzODM2ZjliM2NhMjMzYzQwZjYwMTE3ZGI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '306032', 'port_slug': 'mazatlan', 'title': 'City, Malecon, Cliff Divers & Scenic Harbor Cruise', 'slug': 'city-malecon-cliff-divers--scenic-harbor-cruise-306032', 'price': 83.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.9, 'review_count': 12, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Discover Mazatlán by Sea:</strong> Embark on a scenic cruise observing the majestic offshore islands and one of the world’s tallest lighthouses. Admire the local wildlife, including pelicans, cormorants, frigate birds and sea lions (when in season).<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Discover Mazatlán by Land:</strong> Board your bus for an informative, narrated tour of Old and New Mazatlán, as your bus stops for picture opportunities.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cathedral Basilica of the Immaculate Conception:</strong> Drive by this towering cathedral, which sits right in the center of Old Town and across the main city square, Plazuela de la Republica.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Playa Norte Coastline:</strong> Drive by Playa Norte to see where local fishermen sell their catch of the day.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Malecón:</strong> Drive along one of the longest seafront walkways in the world.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Golden Zone:</strong> After the excitement of cliff diving, stroll in Zona Dorada, or Golden Zone, where you can browse for souvenirs, jewelry, and gifts amidst palm lined beaches and luxury resorts.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cliff Divers:</strong> Stop and watch divers jump from a lookout point at the Taboada Ocean front Esplanade.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Las Changueras (The Shrimp Ladies):</strong> Observe how these ladies sell their fresh daily wares, mostly shrimp, right on the sidewalk of the street for a full block.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>During Catamaran Sailing: Select open bar (margaritas, tequila sunrise and beer), soda and water.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y010-city-malecon-cliff-divers-cruise-open-bar-306032-10.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTYwOTh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3hOUzlvTnpFdk9EZ3lNelE0TkRJeE9UUXlNaTVxY0djfDM0OWEwZDQzYTExODg3MzQ0ZmUyN2NkYWExOGJjZTAxMTlmNzIxODgwNzU2OWM1NzA4OTQwZjVhYmE1Y2M2ZjQ', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '306020', 'port_slug': 'mazatlan', 'title': 'Salsa & Salsa', 'slug': 'salsa--salsa-306020', 'price': 92.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.1, 'review_count': 8, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Sightseeing Tour:</strong> Explore Mazatlán as you take a scenic drive along the Malecón, admiring the local sights and iconic monuments.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Royal Villa Beach Resort:</strong> Visit this exclusive resort in the Golden Zone called “Royal Villa”, where you will be welcomed with a tropical drink and a warm and festive atmosphere.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Salsa Making &amp; Margaritas:</strong> Put on your apron and chef hat and engage in an interactive cooking demonstration. All pertaining equipment and vegetables will be provided to start your sauce creations. Mix your own ingredients to the beat of your own taste, learn how to prepare mouthwatering margaritas and enjoy limitless beverages.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Salsa Dancing:</strong> Get ready for an easy-to-follow, spectacular salsa dancing lesson. Make your way around the dance floor, learning all the proper steps, to shake your body to the sound of this Afro-Latin tropical dance.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Enjoy Free Time:</strong> At the end of the day, indulge in the amenities of a beautiful beachfront hotel where you can take a dip in the pool, relax in a lounge chair or a walk along the beach.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Drinks: bottomless margaritas, hibiscus tea or bottled water and free recipes.</li>\n\t<li>Chips and salsa.</li>\n\t<li>Mexican lunch: taquitos and quesadillas.</li>\n\t<li>Complimentary Wi-Fi.</li>\n\t<li>Interactive class to make various Mexican sauces and margarita drinks.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-salsa-and-salsa-mazatlan-mexico-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxODAyMDh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJPQzlvWWpNdk9EZ3hOREkxTkRJMk1ESTFOQzVxY0djfDc2NmIyODI0NjJlZmM3ZWViMjNlYWE0YWZjZDY2MzFmM2ExYTEwMjg1NjdjZjQ5OTQzNzdjMzU1OWVhYTA4ZDY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
