    {'code': '101039', 'port_slug': 'miami', 'title': 'Everglades Tour: FLL Airport Transfer', 'slug': 'everglades-tour-fll-airport-transfer-101039', 'price': 74.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.5, 'review_count': 8, 'desc_html': '<p> </p> <div id="ContentWrapper"></div> Adventure into South Florida\'s unique ecosystem, unlike any other in the world. After a scenic bus ride arrive in the Florida Everglades. Experience a once in a lifetime adventure on a breathtaking airboat ride and encounter wildlife up close as you glide across a river of grass. In addition witness an exciting and daring alligator presentation featuring Animal Planet\'s Gator Boys team in their famous pit! After the show, you will have some free time to visit the gift shop and enjoy a small meal at the park&rsquo;s cafe (at your own expense). Afterwards, you will be transported to the Ft. Lauderdale Airport.&nbsp;', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-with-mia-airport-transfereverglades-tour-2.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNjk5NDZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaG1ZeTlvWmpRdk9EZ3hOREl5TlRnMU1ETTVPQzVxY0djfDljMmY4YmMyMTQ5ODIxZjQ3OTA4NmMxODI1ZjI5MDNlNGE0NjliZGI3ZDYxOWM4ZDQ1YzUzZGEwZGNlMjJhZGE', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '101003', 'port_slug': 'miami', 'title': 'Everglades Tour: MIA Airport Transfer', 'slug': 'everglades-tour-mia-airport-transfer-101003', 'price': 64.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.6, 'review_count': 9, 'desc_html': "<p>Adventure into South Florida's unique ecosystem, unlike any other in the world<strong>. </strong>After a scenic bus ride arrive in the Florida Everglades. Experience a once in a lifetime adventure on a breathtaking airboat ride and encounter wildlife up close as you glide across a river of grass. In addition witness an&nbsp;exciting and daring&nbsp;alligator presentation featuring Animal Planet's Gator Boys team in&nbsp;their famous pit!&nbsp;After the show, you will have some free time to visit the gift shop and enjoy a small meal at the park&rsquo;s cafe (at your own expense). Afterwards, you will be transported to the Miami Airport.&nbsp;</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-with-mia-airport-transfereverglades-tour.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNzc2ODd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3pNaTlvWkRjdk9EZ3hOREl5TkRrek1qZzVOQzVxY0djfGQ4N2QzNzZmMTAwNzQwYzcxZjNlMTY1MzgzOTcyNmExNmNkMjY2NWNlODVhZmI1NWUwNTZiMDA1YTc0MWI0NWY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '101048', 'port_slug': 'miami', 'title': 'Top 10 Best of Miami: MIA Airport Transfer', 'slug': 'top-10-best-of-miami-mia-airport-transfer-101048', 'price': 59.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.9, 'review_count': 194, 'desc_html': '<p>For guests whose flights depart from Miami International Airport after 3:00 PM on debarkation day.</p>\n<p>Enjoy a guided adventure in the comfort of an air-conditioned sightseeing vehicle, discovering the TOP TEN BEST OF MIAMI! While leaving the Port you will see the panoramic skyline of Downtown Miami. On the way to "South Beach" you will get a glimpse of the Artificial Islands where Al Capone resided. Enter the colorful district of South Beach, home to the largest concentration of Art Deco Architecture in the world.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Pass by the former Versace Mansion the only private residences on Ocean Drive. South Beach is also the home to some of the richest and famous celebrities and socialites. Your tour continues to "Little Havana" where the Cuban culture is a part of everything. There will be a stop in the heart of Little Havana where you will immerse yourself in the cultural of the Cuban people. You will see the Eternal Flame representing the Cuban Americans that lost their lives during the Bay of Pigs. Try sugar cane juice in a sub-tropical fresh fruit market. Enjoy walking through the Walk of Fame and arrive at Famous Domino Park. &nbsp;</p>\n<p>Next we will visit one of the most famous Cigar Factory’s in Little Havana. You will have the opportunity to try authentic Cuban coffee while watching the rolling of Cigars. Last but not least you will enjoy live Cuban music and visit the famous Ice Cream shop to have a taste. The tour will continue to one of the newest and trendiest areas of Miami,”Wynwood”. This former historic warehouse district has been transformed into the world\'s largest open aired street art installation. This installation covers over 800,000 square feet of painted walls. There is no other place in world like this. You have never seen anything like it.</p>\n<p>There will be a stop at Wynwood Walk for a photo opportunity. Last but not least we will cross the causeway over to South Beach where there will be a short stop before heading to the airport.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/top-ten-best-of-miami-with-mia-airport-transfer-101048-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODc4Mjd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNOeTlvWWpFdk9EZ3pNamM0TVRBNU1EZzBOaTVxY0djfDVhYTllNmNiNWQ1OWZkODhhZWU5MGQyZDE2NTVhZDQ1ZGU0NjMwZDBhZjRhMmUzNDExYjMyNTY2MjQ1NDU1ZTg', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '101052', 'port_slug': 'miami', 'title': 'Transportation MIA Airport to Port Miami', 'slug': 'transportation-mia-airport-to-port-miami-101052', 'price': 22.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 16, 'desc_html': "<p>You focus on vacation, we’ll keep our eyes on the road. Take advantage of our transportation from Miami International Airport to Port of Miami on the day of embarkation. Guests may purchase transfers up to two days prior to their sail date.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Flight and Transfer Times:</strong><br />\nTo purchase Carnival's transportation service, your flight must arrive at Miami International Airport no later than 12:00 PM on the day of your cruise. Transfer service will run hourly and will be provided from Miami International Airport between 10:00 AM and 12:30 PM.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Transportation Instructions:</strong><br />\nAfter collecting their luggage, guests should proceed to one of the meeting points listed below. Once there, a representative will escort guests to the pier transportation.<br />\n<br />\nArriving into Miami International Airport (MIA):</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Terminal D: Near baggage claim #22</li>\n\t<li>Terminal J: Near baggage claim #1</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><br />\nGuests who arrive prior to their sail date must return to the airport to one of the following meeting locations no later 11:00 AM:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Miami International Airport (MIA): Near baggage claim #1 or #22</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><br />\nTransfer service will be provided by Americas Transportation. Should guests have questions regarding the transfer service, the transfer provider can be reached at the following contact number <strong>on the day of the sailing only:</strong> 305-859-9000.</p>\n\n<p>Guests who purchase their own airfare tickets are required to provide flight information via Online Check-In when purchasing transfers. Changes to flight details are the responsibility of the guest and must be entered into Online Check-In no later than two days prior to their cruise. Carnival is not responsible for providing transfers to guests who schedule flights outside of the service times or provide incorrect flight information.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Conditions and Restrictions:</strong><br />\nThe vehicle operator is an independent contractor. Carnival assumes no liability for losses, damages or injuries in connection with the use of the operator. Carnival reserves the right to discontinue transportation service at any time. Prices and acceptable flight times are subject to change without notice and unsuse services are non-refundable.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-carnival-transportation-bus.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0MDMyNDB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3dOUzlvTURJdk9EZ3hOREl5TnpneE5qUTNPQzVxY0djfGJlOTlmZGE0NjNjZmIzOGJjYjRjYzBlMGU4OWE5NDExZWFmYzkwYWY4NWQ2NjllYzNiMzVhOGFiZjU5MTE1ZTY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '101054', 'port_slug': 'miami', 'title': 'Transportation FLL Airport to Port Miami', 'slug': 'transportation-fll-airport-to-port-miami-101054', 'price': 36.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 2.5, 'review_count': 6, 'desc_html': '<p>You focus on vacation, we’ll keep our eyes on the road. Take advantage of our transportation from Ft. Lauderdale International Airport to Port of Miami on the day of embarkation. Guests may purchase transfers up to two days prior to their sail date.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Flight and Transfer Times:</strong><br />\nTo purchase Carnival’s trasnportation service, your flight must arrive at Ft. Lauderdale International Airport no later than 11:30 AM on the day of your cruise. Transfer service will be provided from Ft. Lauderdale International Airport, one departure, at 12:00 PM.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Transportation Instructions:</strong><br />\nAfter collecting their luggage, guests should proceed to one of the meeting points listed below. Once there a representative will escort guests to the pier transportation.<br />\n<br />\nArriving into Fort Lauderdale International Airport (FLL):</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Terminals #1 &amp; 3: Near baggage claim #3</li>\n\t<li>Terminals #2 &amp; 4: Near baggage claim #1</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><br />\nGuests who arrive prior to their sail date must return to the airport to one of the following meeting locations no later 11:00 AM:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Fort Lauderdale International Airport (FLL): Terminal #2 near baggage claim #1</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><br />\nTransfer service is provided by Americas Transportation. Should guests have questions regarding the transfer service, the transfer provider can be reached at the following contact number <strong>on the day of the sailing only</strong>: 305-859-9000.</p>\n\n<p>Guests who purchase their own airfare tickets are required to provide flight information via Online Check-In no later than two days prior to their cruise date.Changes to flight details are the responsibility of the guest and must be entered into Online Check-In no later than two days prior to their cruise. Carnival is not responsible for providing transfer services to guests who schedule flights outside of the service times listed above or provide incorrect flight information.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Conditions and Restrictions:</strong><br />\nThe vehicle operator is an independent contractor. Carnival assumes no liability for losses, damages or injuries in connection with the use of the operator. Carnival reserves the right to discontinue transportation service at any time. Prices and acceptable flight times are subject to change without notice and unused services are non-refundable.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-carnival-transportation-bus.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0MDMyNDB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3pNaTlvWmpjdk9EZ3hOREl5TnpnME9USTBOaTVxY0djfDYzZDY4YmJjNDQ3YTk4ZjJjNjJlNzQ5ZjM5OWZkNWY1NzNjYTM3YjY4YWFmOWE1N2E0NTQ0ZmIwNTAzMzIzMjk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
