    {'code': '101055', 'port_slug': 'miami', 'title': 'Transportation Port Miami to FLL Airport', 'slug': 'transportation-port-miami-to-fll-airport-101055', 'price': 36.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 22, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-carnival-transportation-bus.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0MDMyNDB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJaQzlvWlRFdk9EZ3hOREl5TnpnNE1qQXhOQzVxY0djfDFkZmE0NDViMDI4NjA5Y2IyNTdmZjg0ODhhMmNhYjZmNjI4OWZkZmQ2NTY5ODNjMDEyNWU0OTYwMGRlM2I1M2Q&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '423042', 'port_slug': 'montego-bay', 'title': 'Mystic Mountain Adventure', 'slug': 'mystic-mountain-adventure-423042', 'price': 155.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Sky Explorer:</strong> Soar above the treetops on the Sky Explorer Chairlift at Mystic Mountain. This scenic ride takes you 700 feet up through the vibrant rainforest for breathtaking views.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Jamaica Bobsled:</strong> Zoom through the rainforest on the Jamaica Bobsled, a custom ride that twists and turns over 3,280 feet of track.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Raggamuffin:</strong> Ascend the mountain in suspended chairs on the Raggamuffin ride, then twist and turn through 14 curves on a high-speed descent over scenic cliffs.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Savor &amp; Swim:</strong> Relax at the top of the mountain with a satisfying lunch and a swim in the scenic infinity pool.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Lunch.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-tranopy-adventure-montego-bay-jamaica-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNzkwMjR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJOeTlvTkRFdk9EZ3hOREl6T0RreU5EZ3pNQzVxY0djfDAyNTE2YmNmYWFlMmM0MzAzMDI5ZTQ5Y2Y1ZTM4ZDRkZDM3MTlkMWRiNzU2MjA4YjY1MWYyNmY2NzcwMmM2MTc', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '423068', 'port_slug': 'montego-bay', 'title': 'Ocho Rios & Dunns River Falls with Lunch', 'slug': 'ocho-rios--dunns-river-falls-with-lunch-423068', 'price': 84.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.2, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': '<strong>Dunn’s River Falls:</strong> Don\'t miss the opportunity to visit Dunn’s River Falls, an amazing tropical adventure for a spectacular experience. On this excursion you will embark on an island tour in air-conditioned comfort, travelling through Jamaica\'s beautiful countryside. You will drive pass some historic sites and districts on the way to the world-famous waterfall which is described as a living and growing phenomenon, as the waterfall continuously regenerates itself from deposits of travertine rock as it flows over the falls. Experience the thrill of climbing the waterfall, in a human chain led by an experienced guide and pause at the \'massage parlour\' to experience the soothing effects of the water as it cascades over the rocks, to the sea. The less adventurous and those who enjoy Mother Nature’s gifts could stroll through the lush tropical foliage of ferns, bamboos, ginger lilies, and a variety of palm trees. After visiting the falls, you will be treated to a delicious Jamaican lunch at Almond Tree Restaurant by the sea. <br /><br /> <strong>Shopping Stop:</strong> Time permitting, you could browse through the items on display at Taj Mahal Shopping Plaza, where you may find exquisite gemstones, spectacular jewelry, bold and beautiful watches, scarves, handbags and pendants. Get your fill of Blue Mountain Coffee, Jamaican rums and more. <br /><br /> <strong>What’s Included:</strong> <ul>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Guided tour.     </li>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Entrance fee.     </li>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Lunch at Almond Tree Restaurant.     </li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-ocho-rios-and-dunns-river-falls-with-lunch-montego-bay-jamaica-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNDk1ODR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJaaTlvTUdRdk9EZ3hOREkwTVRVME5qSTNNQzVxY0djfDgxYmMzZjg2NWQwNTBjMWNhNDhmMzE4MzNlN2E4ZDUwZGE3OTg5Mzg1ZTUxOTQ2MTljNDVhNmUyMzhmM2Y4YTU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '423070', 'port_slug': 'montego-bay', 'title': 'Dolphin Encounter & Doctors Cave In Montego Bay', 'slug': 'dolphin-encounter--doctors-cave-in-montego-bay-423070', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Your excursion kicks off with a coastal drive showcasing Jamaica’s lush scenery and ocean vistas.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Dolphin Cove:</strong> Discover Dolphin Cove and its stunning natural setting. After a quick briefing, step onto a shallow platform to meet the dolphins. Enjoy gentle interactions and playful moments with these amazing creatures.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What the Doctor Ordered:</strong> Visit the legendary Doctor's Cave Beach, known for its white sand and crystal-clear waters. Locals believe the beach has natural healing properties.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-dolphin-encounter-and-doctors-cave-in-montego-bay-montego-bay-jamaica-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNjA1NTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3pZaTlvWVRNdk9EZ3hNalV5TlRVMU1UWTBOaTVxY0djfGE3NGRjMDA1YzgxOTg4OWFjMWUzNjhjODg4MGI4NDViOTk3YjY0ZjIxZTU1OThlN2E2NDkxNmMxNDZiMGZkNjQ', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '423006', 'port_slug': 'montego-bay', 'title': 'Jungle River Tubing Experience', 'slug': 'jungle-river-tubing-experience-423006', 'price': 74.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': '<strong>River Tubing:</strong> What better way to kick off Jungle River Tubing than to drive through the pristine jungle terrain of Jamaica’s interior? Your adventure begins at the water’s edge where you will be assigned your tube. Sit back, relax, and enjoy Jamaica’s natural beauty!', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-jungle-river-tubing-experience-montego-bay-jamaica-3.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMTc2ODJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGtNeTlvTmpBdk9EZ3hOREl6TmpFd05qYzRNaTVxY0djfGVmYjg4NTQ2MjQ2MWU2YTAzYzUyYzg1YjRmY2JiMThhZmNmYzU3YWJhMzgwMjk1OTlkNmNmMGMwNWYxNzkxODU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '423162', 'port_slug': 'montego-bay', 'title': 'Ocean Outpost: All Access Park-Pass', 'slug': 'ocean-outpost-all-access-park-pass-423162', 'price': 164.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>All Access Adventure:</strong> Unleash your adventurous spirit with the Ocean Outpost Pass in Jamaica! Engage in endless activities like an ATV safari, or a unique Horseback Ride ‘N’ Swim. Experience the over-the-ocean hammock zipline, take a truck safari, set sail on a lively Party Catamaran &amp; Snorkel tour, or simply relax at the infinity pool complete with a swim-up bar.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Safety gear for activities such as helmets and gloves.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/423162-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODgwMTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJsTDJnMlpTODVNVEU0T0RrNU5ETTNOVGs0THpReU16RTJNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzZTBjYzNmZWYzYWU5YTExOTFmYmY0YWM5ODFlYzNhZmM1YzhkZjkwMDMzNDk0ZmU4NGQ0NTAxOWEyMGMwMzk3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
