    {'code': '423156', 'port_slug': 'montego-bay', 'title': "Jammin' Journey: Bob Marley's Nine Mile", 'slug': 'jammin-journey-bob-marley-s-nine-mile-423156', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/423156-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc5NzB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGxtTDJnME9TODVNRFl6TnpFMk1USTJOelV3THpReU16RTFOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhZjA1ZmNmOTM1YzdhY2ViNDgzYmVjMjM4MWMyMzY2NGFjODUxMTQyMjk2YjQwYmU2OGFmNjJjZjAwM2Q3YWI2&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '791002', 'port_slug': 'mykonos', 'title': 'Mykonos Sightseeing & Beach Day', 'slug': 'mykonos-sightseeing--beach-day-791002', 'price': 179.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/791002-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU1ODR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGRtTDJoalppODRPVE15TlRZeU9Ua3pNVGd5THpjNU1UQXdNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkMTNlYTU5MWNlZmY5YzIyZjBkMGU2N2ZjYTJkYmM4MWQ1YjIwY2E2YWU0YmY1ZGQ0NWQzMmRiZTg4YjMyZGYw&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '791006', 'port_slug': 'mykonos', 'title': "Sailing Trip Around Mykonos' Famous Beaches", 'slug': 'sailing-trip-around-mykonos-famous-beaches-791006', 'price': 159.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.1, 'review_count': 7, 'desc_html': '<p>One of the most well-known characteristics of Mykonos and one that helped make Mykonos a world-famous summer destination is its many beautiful beaches. Golden sand and azure waters will satisfy even the most demanding visitor and there are beaches for every taste and mood. Cosmopolitan, party, family, nude, remote ones and even beaches in town, seemingly endless for such a small island. Board a traditional sailboat and cruise along the southern coast of Mykonos, where the most famous beaches are found. Sail past Ornos, Psarrou, Platis Gialos and Super Paradise beaches, then anchor off one of the beaches for a refreshing swim. Later, relax on deck with a cool drink in hand as you sail the Aegean and enjoy the island’s beauty from a different perspective. A hearty snack also be offered before the return sail to Mykonos.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/791006-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU0NTR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREpqTDJoa055ODRPVE15TlRjd09EVTNOVEF5THpjNU1UQXdOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1ODRjZjZmMTZiZjEyNWNkN2Q2ODA5ZDg3Y2JmMmJjMTE1OWZlODU4OTk5ZDA5Y2JiNGU5MzFiYjQ2NGNlZjEy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '791003', 'port_slug': 'mykonos', 'title': 'Mykonos Town Walking Tour', 'slug': 'mykonos-town-walking-tour-791003', 'price': 74.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/791003-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDI0NjF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1F6TDJnMU1TODRPVE15TlRZMU1USXpNVEF5THpjNU1UQXdNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4MDY2YzhiNTY3NTY5MmE4ZmEzMTJiM2VjZDZlYzlkMzEyYWJjZjBjM2YxOGFkYmIyMTE4OGU3MDdjZDkyOTM2&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '791005', 'port_slug': 'mykonos', 'title': 'Mykonos Drive & Panagia Tourliani Monastery', 'slug': 'mykonos-drive--panagia-tourliani-monastery-791005', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p>Depart by motorcoach from the port and follow the road inland to the village of Ano Mera. Here, visit the Panagia Tourliani Monastery dedicated to the Virgin Mary. The Monastery was originally built in 1542 by monks from the nearby Island of Paros. From an architectural point of view the structure is impressive with its spare, linear lines, whitewashed exterior and colored dome which makes it typical of the Greek Island style. Observe the marble belltower and the water spigot in the courtyard which are elaborately decorated with carvings, typical examples of traditional marble sculpture. The monastery’s collection includes many old tools and utensils, important religious relics, priests’ robes furnishings, post-Byzantine icons, and various other offerings. Then in the village square, enjoy a welcome refreshment and snack before continuing towards the island’s south eastern coast to the beach of Kalafatis. Mykonos is famous world-wide for its beaches and Kalafati beach is a prime example. A short stop offers the opportunity to photograph the beautiful views. Mykonos buzzes with activity and your guide will walk you through some of the most famous landmarks such as the windmills and Little Venice, with its plethora of cafés and restaurants. The town is filled with exclusive boutiques and stores, for that all-important souvenir or special gift. At the end of the guided tour, feel free to stay in town and return to Tourlos Port with the shuttle at your own expense. Order of the site visits may vary due to operational reasons.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/791005-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc2NDJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE5sTDJnd055ODRPVE15TlRZNU5UYzVOVFV3THpjNU1UQXdOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkMWIyMGQ1MGQyMTc4YThmZjFmNzRkYmQ2ZjdkZmIyYWEwZDcyYjJiYmNiY2I2NTRhMzJlMDNmMDJjYWVmYWUz', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '791004', 'port_slug': 'mykonos', 'title': 'Delos: The Sacred Island of Antiquity', 'slug': 'delos-the-sacred-island-of-antiquity-791004', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p>In ancient times, the heart of the Cyclades group of islands was considered to be the most sacred island in Greece, Delos. On board a local boat, set sail towards this mythical island, where legend says the twin gods Apollo the god of music, light, harmony and beauty and Artemis goddess of the hunt, wilderness, and the moon, were born. Pilgrims from around the Aegean Sea would come to Delos to worship Apollo and offer their prayers and gifts. In the 5th C BC, the Athenians passed a decree proclaiming that it was forbidden to be born or to die on the island, as birth and death were considered a terrible desecration of the land that had given birth to two important deities. Delos was also a major trading center, especially during the Roman era, and today archaeological evidence of its glorious past can still be admired. At the beginning of the 19th C AD, remains of the ancient town were discovered on the island, other finds included the famous marble lions of Naxos, three temples dedicated to Apollo and houses with splendid mosaic floors. Re-join the local boat for the short sail back to Mykonos Town and enjoy exploring this famous vacation island on your own returning to Tourlos Port on the shuttle at your own expense.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/791004-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDYyNDZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGsxTDJnMlpDODRPVE15TlRZNE1qQXpNamswTHpjNU1UQXdOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkY2I0YjBjYmRhYzVjOGU0NTY5Yjk0ZmEzMzYwNzgzMjVkZDhlYTkxNmQ5ZWIzNzA4YTcxMmVmYzg1NzEzYjNi', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '791007', 'port_slug': 'mykonos', 'title': 'Highlights of Delos & Mykonos', 'slug': 'highlights-of-delos--mykonos-791007', 'price': 184.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.8, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/791007-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMzY2NTZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0UwTDJnM055ODRPVE0xTkRJeU5qSXpOemMwTHpjNU1UQXdOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmMTBmMzM0NTRjYWQzNzc5YTJjOTM2OTYxMjBhNmE3NjRhMzExMTA1ZTY5OTBlZGMzM2Q5OTM0OGM5YWQzMjMy&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '791012', 'port_slug': 'mykonos', 'title': 'The Mykonian Cheese - Small Group Experience', 'slug': 'the-mykonian-cheese--small-group-experience-791012', 'price': 179.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<strong>Cheese-Making Experience:</strong> Learn the art of crafting Mykonian cheese and signature dishes, culminating in your own cheese creation to take home. Indulge in a gourmet pairing of your culinary creations with homemade wine, enhancing the flavors and overall authentic experience. Finish your tour with your own handmade cheese and a set of Mykonian recipes, bringing home a piece of the island's gastronomic soul.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Cheese class.</li>\n</ul>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/791012-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTc4ODJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFEzTDJnMFlpODVNRE0yTXpBME16ZzBNRE13THpjNU1UQXhNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmNWY3YTQ0NTg4MmJmMzg4OTY5NjcxZjkwMDJmYmQyOTZlOWY1YzUzMGZmNTlkZDllODU5YWIzMDBhZmRlYjY4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
