    {'code': '791001', 'port_slug': 'mykonos', 'title': 'Mykonos Beach Break', 'slug': 'mykonos-beach-break-791001', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p>Enjoy a journey towards the center of the island to catch 360-degree breath-taking views across the whole town of Mykonos. Arrive at the beautiful Elia beach to enjoy a few hours of total relaxation, far from the hustle and bustle of the town. With crystal-clear waters of the Aegean Sea and pristine golden sand, this is one of the famous beaches of Mykonos. This little corner of paradise is an open invitation to dive into the sparkling blue waters and to sunbathe, truly a wonderful way to restore body and mind. Elia Beach offers a variety of equipment for water sports for the more active guests at extra cost.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/791001-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY1NDV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFpqTDJobFpTODRPVE15TlRZeU1EYzFOamM0THpjNU1UQXdNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjYzA5N2Q4MmI1NTM2NTBjMjhkMjFiNWVlMDMwZDdkOWViYzg5NzczNzk0OTg2OWY3ODc1YzI3MjJhMTgwMWU1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '816008', 'port_slug': 'naples-amalfi-pompeii', 'title': 'Easy Naples City Sightseeing tour', 'slug': 'easy-naples-city-sightseeing-tour-816008', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.2, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y04-Leisurely-Naples-21.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w5MTYxMTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGtPQzlvT0Rjdk9EZ3hOREkyTWpJeU1qZzNPQzVxY0djfGQ1NDA3M2RjOTkwNzA3YWMxZTc5YTNiYmE1ZDk0NGQ1ZjgxYjgyNTM3ZWUxNjgwNGIyZGM3MzE0M2IyMGUyZGU&w=700&h=550&resize_profile=pdpgallery', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '816009', 'port_slug': 'naples-amalfi-pompeii', 'title': 'Pompeii, Sorrento & Capri', 'slug': 'pompeii-sorrento--capri-816009', 'price': 309.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Capri:</strong> Take an hour-long Jetfoil trip to Capri and enjoy a funicular ride to Capri Town. With 1.5 hours of free time, explore the town’s vibrant shops and cafes, and don’t miss the gorgeous Augustus Gardens for breathtaking views of the Faraglioni Rocks.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sorrento:</strong> Hop back on a jetfoil to Sorrento, where you can spend time wandering the vibrant streets and shopping, followed by a delightful lunch at a local eatery.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Pompeii:</strong> Journey by private coach to Pompeii and enjoy a walking tour with a knowledgeable guide. Gain insight into the historical events that led to the tragic fate of the city’s 20,000 inhabitants as you roam its ancient streets.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Headphones for your time at Pompeii and Capri.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Pompeii-Sorrento-and-Capri-1HERO.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w1NzA0NzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNOaTlvWVdZdk9EZ3hOREkyTWpRMU1qSTFOQzVxY0djfDA0NTQ4OTdkNjlmMDc3MTczMGJiYmM1MDNlOWRhOGE1Mjc0ZTc1MmQxMDdiODIzNWYzNzQxZWVlZmU0MmE1MjE', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '816065', 'port_slug': 'naples-amalfi-pompeii', 'title': 'Best of the Amalfi Coast - Positano and Sorrento', 'slug': 'best-of-the-amalfi-coast--positano-and-sorrento-816065', 'price': 164.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/816065-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ0ODd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFZqTDJnMVlpODRPVGd4TWpVeE5qZzJORE13THpneE5qQTJOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4NzA5MmZlYWE4OGM3YjcyOTdhOTQ2MzhhN2IxYWU4NmMzOTdiMWJkODIxYmJiZDgzYWZmYTY1OTFkOTYxMzVk&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '816070', 'port_slug': 'naples-amalfi-pompeii', 'title': 'Cruise along Capri & Amalfi Coast with Lunch', 'slug': 'cruise-along-capri--amalfi-coast-with-lunch-816070', 'price': 269.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<strong>Private Cruise:</strong> Unwind and indulge in a day of relaxation on a private cruise aboard a vintage ship, as you glide along the picturesque Gulf of Naples. Marvel at the breathtaking vistas of the iconic Island of Capri, adorned with its enchanting Faraglioni rocks, and catch sight of the charming village of Positano along the way. Delight in a delicious onboard lunch while enjoying the scenic views of the Sorrento and Amalfi Coast. As you sail along the city's promenade towards the captivating island of Capri, a refreshing welcome drink awaits you on board, setting the perfect tone for your day at sea.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Capri:</strong> Upon reaching Capri, take a leisurely break and indulge in a refreshing swim at Marina Piccola, surrounded by picturesque yachts and the magnificent backdrop of the Faraglioni rocks. The tour will then proceed, offering enchanting sights of Villa Malaparte, the white cave, the Tiberius Cliff, Ieranto Bay, Nerano, the Bay of Dreams, Ischia Island, Positano, and the Galli Islands. Immerse yourself in the breathtaking panorama as you sail past these captivating landmarks, creating lasting memories of your journey.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n    <ul>\n        <li>\n            Welcome drink.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            Lunch.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            Liqueur and pastry tasting.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/816070-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU4NDN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGM1TDJobFppODRPVGM1TkRBeU1USTVORE00THpneE5qQTNNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzYzE2YTAxY2YwZjdhMmVhNGFiMGRkOWFiNWUyNzkzOWQxYjc4ODNmNzc0MDFjOTcxZTQ0MGY2OTBhYzNkMGMw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
