    {'code': '816075', 'port_slug': 'naples-amalfi-pompeii', 'title': 'The Royal Estate of Carditello with food tasting', 'slug': 'the-royal-estate-of-carditello-with-food-tasting-816075', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<strong>Royal Retreat:</strong> Step back in time and immerse yourself in the grandeur of the Royal Estate of Carditello, a jewel in the province of Caserta. Originally commissioned by Ferdinand IV of Bourbon in 1787, this site was meant for royal horse breeding and agricultural endeavors. As you wander through the grounds, marvel at the charming fountains and temples dating back to the 1700s. Explore the stables and the recently restored royal apartments, which showcase opulent frescoes and decorations from the era. After a leisurely walk in the picturesque gardens, indulge in a tasting of refreshing soft drinks and a delightful local dessert called "la polacca." Finally, take some time to appreciate the beauty of the gardens before heading back to the port.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/ComingSoonEurope-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTkzNTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFF4TDJoak9TODRPVEV4T0RVMk5UQXdOelkyTDBOdmJXbHVaMU52YjI1RmRYSnZjR1V0YVcxbk1TNXFjR2N8OTQwYzM1ZTMxNWE5NmViNjI1N2E5OTNlZWUxNGI4NGU5ZmIyYjg3MDY5ZTNhOWM1NDNjNzQxNzI3M2ZiZDNhMg', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
