    {'code': '816030', 'port_slug': 'naples-amalfi-pompeii', 'title': 'Sorrento & Amalfi Coast by Land & Sea', 'slug': 'sorrento--amalfi-coast-by-land--sea-816030', 'price': 239.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.3, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y05-Amalfi-Coast-by-Boat-and-Sorrento-6.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNTA5ODI0fGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmcwTXk5b09URXZPRGd4TWpVMk16QXpPREl6T0M1cWNHY3w0MjZiMTlmZjZiMzc3ZjIzYzliYzIzNGFiNzdkNzEwMDlkMWRjYzVjMTQ5ZGNlZGI5ZGFlZjIyN2E3ZjdiNDQ4&w=700&h=550&resize_profile=pdpgallery', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '816068', 'port_slug': 'naples-amalfi-pompeii', 'title': 'UNESCO Water Museum & Naples Panoramic Drive', 'slug': 'unesco-water-museum--naples-panoramic-drive-816068', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<strong>Spaccanapoli:</strong> Head towards the historical center of Naples and embark on a visit to the lower decumano, famously known as Spaccanapoli (Naples splitter). This renowned street earned its name as it appears to divide the city into two almost symmetrical halves when viewed from a certain perspective. Immerse yourself in the vibrant atmosphere of this bustling area as you explore its captivating sights and landmarks.<br />\n    <br />\n    <strong>Pietrasanta:</strong> Discover the remarkable Catholic Pietrasanta complex and delve into its underground floors, offering a valuable glimpse into the history of the city. As you descend, you'll have the opportunity to witness preserved floors and wall structures, including sections of opus reticulatum walls, tuff blocks, Roman-era mosaics, and remnants of ancient domus.<br />\n    <br />\n    <strong>UNESCO Water Museum:</strong> Next, visit the home to the first archaeological elevator in the historic city center, showcasing the UNESCO Water Museum. This collaborative project with the Neapolitan water company has successfully restored the Greco-Roman cisterns, providing a captivating opportunity to delve into the history of the ancient Roman aqueduct that once supplied water to Neapolis. Immerse yourself in this evocative setting, where the preserved cisterns serve as a fascinating backdrop for discovering the rich past and engineering marvels of the city's water supply system. \n    <br />\n    <br />\n    <strong>Panoramic Tour:</strong> Return to your transportation and embark on a panoramic tour of the iconic landmarks in historic Naples, all from the comfort of your coach. Immerse yourself in the rich history of this city, which dates back over 2,800 years, as you pass by classical ruins and majestic medieval structures, such as the Castel Nuovo. Explore the expansive Piazza Plebiscito, adorned with magnificent architectural marvels. Take a moment to capture the breathtaking panoramic views of the city and bay from Posillipo Hill. As you continue your drive, make a delightful stop at a local chalet for a refreshing treat before concluding your journey back to the pier and your ship.<br />\n    <br />\n    <strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Soft drink or ice cream</li>\n    </ul>\n    ", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/816068-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDYyMTB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGd4TDJobFl5ODRPVGt3T0RJek5ERTFPRE00THpneE5qQTJPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0NmU4NzdhMGViMTEwOGI3YWYyZjY1ODgwZjFjMmNmZDU1OTJjMWM3NmY1OTE2MGQxNGM0MmRjOGUyNjA2ZTU4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '816045', 'port_slug': 'naples-amalfi-pompeii', 'title': 'Pompeii On Your Own', 'slug': 'pompeii-on-your-own-816045', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-Pompeii-On-Your-Own-HERO.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMzMxNTJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzROUzlvTnpFdk9EZ3hOREkyTXpNek5qazVNQzVxY0djfDY5YjQwNDFmZDgxOGZlZDc1ZDI5YzlhZjcwNjIwYTlhNDQxZjVmZWQ4MjBhMzAxMTdkMGZhNGE4NjhhOTlkNDE&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '424235', 'port_slug': 'nassau', 'title': 'Bahamian Bucket List: Pigs, Snorkel & Beach', 'slug': 'bahamian-bucket-list-pigs-snorkel--beach-424235', 'price': 159.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.8, 'review_count': 50, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Swimming Pigs:</strong> Experience a 45-minute adventure with the world-famous Bahamian swimming pigs, where you’ll meet, feed, and play in the turquoise waters while capturing memorable photos and videos.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Reef Snorkel:</strong> Explore a stunning coral reef on a 45-minute snorkel through crystal-clear waters filled with colorful tropical fish, vibrant coral formations, and fascinating marine life.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Beach Escape:</strong> Relax on a secluded island beach, where soft white sand and crystal-clear turquoise waters invite you to swim, soak up the sun, or simply unwind.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Authentic Flavors:</strong> Savor the flavors of The Bahamas with a delicious island style lunch, featuring BBQ chicken drumsticks, crispy fish fingers, peas ’n’ rice, and fresh coleslaw.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Bahamian lunch.</li>\n\t<li>45-minute pig encounter.</li>\n    <li>45-minute guided snorkel tour and gear.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/424235-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY2Nzl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFF6TDJoaU5TODRPVFF3TURNek9EWTNPREEyTHpReU5ESXpOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1ZmE1ODlhOWNiMmU0ZWRhYjIwMDRmOGQ2MjFmYTM3Zjc2OTc4YTU3MTMyMzJiYWZhOGM0NjZmZmQ3ZTQ0ZjAw', 'duration': '5.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '8'},
    {'code': '424228', 'port_slug': 'nassau', 'title': 'Baha Bay Luxury Beachfront Waterpark', 'slug': 'baha-bay-luxury-beachfront-waterpark-424228', 'price': 199.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Baha Bay Water Park:</strong> Experience the perfect mix of island tranquility and family fun across 15 acres of beachfront. Enjoy diverse food and beverage options, an exclusive outdoor casino pavilion, and over 30 thrilling water attractions for all ages, including:<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Thrill Rides:</strong> Get your heart racing with exciting dueling water coasters, group raft rides, and exhilarating waterslides that free fall into the shimmering Baha Bay Lagoon.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Action Waters:</strong>Catch some waves on the Flow Curl Simulator, unwind in the serene 1,400 ft. Action River, or cool off in the 500,000-gallon Wave Pool, complete with complimentary beach chairs and umbrellas.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Stingray Cove (Kid’s zone):</strong> At Stingray Cove, children can enjoy twisting slides, splash in the water battle zone, and feel the rush of being drenched by a giant tipping bucket!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Turtle Beach (Toddlers):</strong> Turtle Beach offers a delightful splash zone for toddlers, featuring appropriately sized slides and shallow pools for safe, all-day fun.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Beach Bliss:</strong> Guests can enjoy exclusive access to the beach, complete with a personal beach chair and umbrella awaiting them by the oceanfront.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Beach chairs and umbrellas (first-come, first-served basis).</li>\n\t<li>Lunch: Choice of one meal per person from either Cleo Grille, Sam’s Crispy Chicken, or Umami Burger.</li>\n\t<li>Life vests and inflatable vests.</li>\n\t<li>Beach Towels.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/424228-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTYyNDR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGhtTDJneU1DODVOVGswTVRNMk5EazBNVEV3THpReU5ESXlPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkODcwZDljMWYxMzY0YWVjNjA0MmZiYTgyODM0MDRiYzQxMjFiYzczOTI5ZTM4NGYzNmQ5ZmQ0OWRjNTUyNzBm', 'duration': '5.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '424174', 'port_slug': 'nassau', 'title': 'Blue Lagoon: Private Island Fun Day & Lunch', 'slug': 'blue-lagoon-private-island-fun-day--lunch-424174', 'price': 98.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.1, 'review_count': 33, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Privately Owned Paradise:</strong> Retreat to a family-owned island sanctuary where turquoise waters, white-sand beaches, and lush tropical beauty surround a protected lagoon perfect for swimming, floating, or unwinding in a lounge chair beneath a shaded umbrella.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Additional Adventures:</strong> Make the most of your island escape with complimentary beach volleyball and soccer, board games, water tubes and noodles, nature trails, and a buffet lunch featuring, burgers, hot dogs, chicken, veggie selections, BBQ chicken, Bahamian peas n’ rice, fresh salads, corn, French fries, and tropical fruit. Choose to enhance your day with optional add-on adventures such as the thrilling Aqua Park, dolphin, sharks, stingray and sea lion encounters, plus kayaks, paddleboards, water bikes, and snorkel gear for rent.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Bahamian Treasures:</strong> Browse the island’s gift shops and open-air market for handcrafted Bahamian goods, local crafts, and unique keepsakes.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Island buffet lunch.</li>\n\t<li>Free Wi-Fi.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/424174-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjA4MzN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1k0TDJnMU1TODVNRFF3TXprek5ETTNNakUwTHpReU5ERTNOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiNjQ1NTJkNzlmODcyOGI0Y2VjYTZmNWY5NTIzM2M2ZWNiNjNmYTQzMTFmYzhhOTgyOTY0NzdmZTZhY2Q3YThj', 'duration': '5.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '424208', 'port_slug': 'nassau', 'title': 'Blue Lagoon: Dolphin Encounter, Beach & Lunch', 'slug': 'blue-lagoon-dolphin-encounter-beach--lunch-424208', 'price': 142.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 38, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Privately Owned Paradise:</strong> Retreat to a family-owned island sanctuary where turquoise waters, white-sand beaches, and lush tropical beauty surround a protected lagoon perfect for swimming, floating, or unwinding in a lounge chair beneath a shaded umbrella.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Dolphin Encounter:</strong> Step into waist-deep water on a submerged platform for a memorable dolphin encounter and a heartwarming interaction you’ll never forget.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Additional Adventures:</strong> Make the most of your island escape with complimentary beach volleyball and soccer, board games, water tubes and noodles, nature trails, and a buffet lunch featuring, burgers, hot dogs, chicken, veggie selections, BBQ chicken, Bahamian peas n’ rice, fresh salads, corn, French fries, and tropical fruit. Choose to enhance your day with optional add-on adventures such as shark, stingray and sea lion encounters, plus kayaks, paddleboards, water bikes, and snorkel gear for rent.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Bahamian Treasures:</strong> Browse the island’s gift shops and open-air market for handcrafted Bahamian goods, local crafts, and unique keepsakes.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Island buffet lunch.</li>\n\t<li>Free Wi-Fi.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/424208-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODY0NzF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0ZtTDJoak9TODVNRFF3TXprNU16WTRNakl5THpReU5ESXdPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w5NTkxMGIzNGQ5ODI2NWE0YjZiMDRiYWViMzM4NjU5MDNmNTg0M2RjMjRmZGFhMTExMTFkY2Y3OGZiZjc4ZDNm', 'duration': '5.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '424231', 'port_slug': 'nassau', 'title': 'Catamaran Sail & Snorkel with Tropical Cocktails', 'slug': 'catamaran-sail--snorkel-with-tropical-cocktails-424231', 'price': 93.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 27, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Sail Bahamian Waters:</strong> Sit back and enjoy the warm tropical breeze as you glide through the crystal teal-colored waters of Nassau aboard an open-air, custom-built sailing catamaran. Enjoy the shaded lounge area, covered bar and spacious deck for sunbathing. Take in the stunning views of Nassau as you cruise to one of Bahamas world famous reefs.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Reef Snorkeling:</strong> As you approach the reef, snorkeling gear and instructions will be provided by the knowledgeable crew who will also accompany you into the waters to ensure your safety and enjoyment. Discover the underworld that thrives beneath the surface, filled with vibrant tropical fish and marine life.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Dance and Drinks:</strong> After snorkeling, enjoy the island music and 1-hour of complimentary tropical drinks, punch, soda, and water as the sails are raised for the voyage back to port.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Snorkeling gear.</li>\n\t<li>One hour our of complimentary beverages onboard.\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Alcoholic: Rum Punch, Bahama Mama, Goombay Smash, Hurricane, Rum &amp; Coke, Island Breeze, Dark &amp; Stormy.</li>\n\t\t<li>Non-Alcoholic: Fruit punch, sodas, citrus spritzer (orange juice with sprite), pineapple ginger (pineapple juice and ginger ale), and water.</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/424231-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDMwMjh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0l3TDJoak1TODRPVFEzTXpFMU9UQXdORFEyTHpReU5ESXpNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjNDJjZTkzZWUxMTU5MjNiYjRhMDI1MzJhZGRlMjcwYTQyZjY5YjAzODk4Mjg4MGVhMmU2MTQ3NThkMjUwZWE5', 'duration': '3.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
