    {'code': '193036', 'port_slug': 'nawiliwili', 'title': 'Waimea Canyon & Wailua River Tour', 'slug': 'waimea-canyon--wailua-river-tour-193036', 'price': 174.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 29, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Waimea Canyon:</strong> Visit the Waimea Canyon, also known as the Grand Canyon of the Pacific, and take a scenic ride up the Wailua River. Begin with a drive to a lookout point at 3,400 feet for an amazing view of the canyon. Marvel at the array of colors created by the exposed volcanic rock and lush tropical vegetation.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Spouting Horn Blowhole:</strong> At Opaeka'a Falls, capture a splashy photo before boarding a riverboat.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Wailua River Valley:</strong> Learn of the area's historic significance as the Valley of the Ali'i (Kauai Royalty) and enjoy local musicians who will perform Hawaiian songs and hula. Your river journey will conclude with a performance of the Hawaiian Wedding Song dedicated to those guests who are celebrating their honeymoon or an anniversary.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Lunch:</strong> Enjoy a lunch stop at a local restaurant before returning to the ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Lunch at a local restaurant.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-waimea-canyon-and-wailua-river-tour-kauai-nawiliwili-hi-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjMyMDN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGhaQzlvT0RZdk9EZ3hOREU1T0RreE5URXdNaTVxY0djfDMyYTlkMmJlOTFmMzkwNjAwZWJjN2EzZGJiOGYyODc4ODAyZDVlNzNkYzAzZTZhMzhhZWYzMGJlOWE1ZWI0N2Y', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
