    {'code': '891009', 'port_slug': 'nynashamn-stockholm', 'title': 'Vasa Museum & Time On Your Own', 'slug': 'vasa-museum--time-on-your-own-891009', 'price': 199.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/891009-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU1NDZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFl4TDJoallTODRPVEl3T0RRME1qQTJNVEV3THpnNU1UQXdPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1OWFmNDcyN2Y0MTRkMzFkNTRkZTUwMjViZTA1MmEzNjY0ZjdkZTM4NTRjNmRkNGM0NmM2MGFkODRmMmFjMzg4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '891016', 'port_slug': 'nynashamn-stockholm', 'title': 'Nobel Prize Museum & City Hall', 'slug': 'nobel-prize-museum--city-hall-891016', 'price': 249.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p>Your tour begins as you board your motorcoach for a drive through the country towards Stockholm and Gamla Stan, the Old Town where Stockholm began over eight centuries ago. Upon arriving, you’ll join your guide for a narrated walking tour, strolling the narrow, cobbled streets, witnessing buildings from the 16th to 19th centuries. Your first stop is the Nobel Museum, located in Stockholm's original Stock Exchange building. The museum, opened in 2001 to celebrate the 100th anniversary of the Nobel Prize, features the portraits and prize citations of all the 700-plus winners. Together with your guide, you’ll walk through the history of the 20th century Nobel Laureates and learn more about the Nobel Prize and its founder. You’ll also have time to browse in the museum shop for souvenirs. After having a typical Swedish lunch (included), your tour continues with a scenic drive to Stadshuset, Stockholm’s City Hall. The massive, fortress-like red brick structure is crowned with a tower and a cupola topped with the three golden crowns of historic Sweden, the Swedish national coat of arms. Behind the magnificent facades are offices and session halls for politicians and officials, as well as assembly rooms and unique works of art. You’ll make your way to the Blue Hall, scene of the annual Nobel Award banquet, and the Golden Hall, with its 18 million gold mosaic tiles illustrating Swedish history. Before departing, you’re free to shop for specially designed souvenirs and presents that commemorate City Hall and Stockholm. Following the visit there will be free time to enjoy the city on your own. Next, you’ll travel to Fjällgatan, one of Stockholm's highest points, offering panoramic views of the city skyline and its graceful waterways. Here, you’ll marvel at the breathtaking scenery as you capture a photo or two. Your tour concludes with a relaxing drive back to the pier. With Stockholm behind you, you leave with a myriad of unforgettable memories of a lifetime.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/891016-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDcxODV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFppTDJobE1pODRPVEkwTWpVMk1qY3lOREUwTHpnNU1UQXhOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzNjY4NzBiY2JkYjIyNmQ0ZjBhNmMyNjRiYmJkMjlkZTkyMWNhY2JhMjZjNGMyYmNkOTk5YTg2ZmE4YWIzNTI4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '891001', 'port_slug': 'nynashamn-stockholm', 'title': 'The Best of Stockholm', 'slug': 'the-best-of-stockholm-891001', 'price': 254.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p>Your panoramic tour begins with a motorcoach ride to Stockholm. Cross the Western Bridge en route to the City Hall, renowned for its architecture, the two courtyards and the Blue Hall, where the Nobel festivities unfold each year. Perhaps the most interesting sight in Stockholm is the 17th-century warship perfectly preserved and on display at the Vasa Museum. Raised from Stockholm's inner harbor in the 1960s and painstakingly restored, Vasa and the salvage exhibits speak eloquently of Sweden's inspired maritime heritage, and of its rare losses. Next, get to know Stockholm on your own, with an hour of free time. Dine at an outdoor café in the city (at your own expense), or simply spend your time shopping. Meet up with your guide for a visit to the Royal Palace – this relatively young, stately monument of grace and symmetry dates only from the 1800s. The Royal Palace boasts no fewer than 608 rooms, and you will visit the State Apartments, displaying magnificent Baroque and Rococo interiors. Wander through the streets of the Old Town, savoring the Bohemian atmosphere among houses dating from the 16th and 17th centuries, with Baroque doorways and regal Coats of Arms. See the exterior of the Coronation Church and the Stortorget (Great Square) – the hub of the Old Town.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/891001-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzgyNzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1ZpTDJoaU15ODRPVEkwTWpVMU1qZzVNemMwTHpnNU1UQXdNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjYTZjYjQ1YmI3M2FmN2I4MzNmYzk2MzE5ZjhmYjQzOWY2Y2NjNjE2ZjE0N2NlNzY2YTZiODA3MDVjNzBlODAx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '891005', 'port_slug': 'nynashamn-stockholm', 'title': 'Stockholm Sights & Vasa Museum', 'slug': 'stockholm-sights--vasa-museum-891005', 'price': 189.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/891005-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE1OTB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR014TDJnd05DODRPVEl3T0RReU5qTXpNalEyTHpnNU1UQXdOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhODA1NDBjYTBlYzcyMTk2OGY0Y2NiZGIzYzMwYzU3OGFiNmZmOGRkZWQ4NmVjOTlkYTg5MTZmYjg5NWY4ZDlm', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '425101', 'port_slug': 'ocho-rios', 'title': 'Dolphin Swim and Dolphin Cove', 'slug': 'dolphin-swim-and-dolphin-cove-425101', 'price': 134.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Dolphin Cove:</strong> Experience Dolphin Cove, a one of a kind eco park where you will meet and swim with dolphins. The tour includes a short briefing followed by 30 minutes in the water with these fascinating creatures.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Independent Explorations:</strong> Explore the surrounding tropical jungle and spot local wildlife, then unwind with a swim in a serene cove. Cap off your adventure with a sample of Blue Mountain Coffee.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-dolphin-swim-and-dolphin-cove-ocho-rios-jamaica-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxODYwMjB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGpZeTlvWW1Zdk9EZ3hOREk1TnprM01qYzJOaTVxY0djfDhmZmUwNWQwZGE4YjhhZGY1NzNlZGIyMDI4ZWVkNDRmYTAzMmJkMmExZTYxMDAyNjhkODYyN2VkOGM2OWM2ZTg', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '425201', 'port_slug': 'ocho-rios', 'title': 'Reggae Rhythms: Sail, Snorkel, & Rum', 'slug': 'reggae-rhythms-sail-snorkel--rum-425201', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Reggae Sail and Snorkel:</strong> Immerse yourself in Jamaica's heart and soul on a reggae-infused catamaran cruise. Sail the Caribbean waters, groove to iconic tunes, and indulge in swimming, snorkeling, and sunbathing.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Rum and Jerk Tasting:</strong> Experience Jamaica's flavors with authentic jerk cuisine and world-famous local rum. Then savor velvety-smooth rums from Appleton Estate, a historic distillery dating back to the 18th century, at Island Village.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Snorkel gear.</li>\n\t<li>Jamaican patty.</li>\n\t<li>Rum tasting.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/425201-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNjU5ODh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJoTDJneU1DODRPVGt6TWpRd056YzJOek0wTHpReU5USXdNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmZTVlMDQyNGJlMTQ0MDIzM2YzNjY1ZDRmNjlkZTA0YTY1MzU5NWJhOGNmMWI1ZjdmMzBkMWM3YTg4MzhlOGQ1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '425066', 'port_slug': 'ocho-rios', 'title': 'Bobsled, Ragga Ride, Mystic Mountain & Dunns River', 'slug': 'bobsled-ragga-ride-mystic-mountain--dunns-river-425066', 'price': 125.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Sky Explorer:</strong> Soar above the treetops on the Sky Explorer Chairlift at Mystic Mountain. This scenic ride takes you 700 feet up through the vibrant rainforest for breathtaking views.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Jamaica Bobsled:</strong> Zoom through the rainforest on the Jamaica Bobsled, a custom ride that twists and turns over 3,280 feet of track. You control your own descent with an in-sled handbrake, allowing for either a leisurely tour through the forest or a pulse-quickening dive to the bottom of the mountain.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Raggamuffin:</strong> Ascend the mountain in suspended chairs on the Raggamuffin ride, then twist and turn through 14 curves on a high-speed descent over scenic cliffs.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Dunn’s River Falls:</strong> Scale the 600-foot Dunns River Falls and feel the rush of cascading water on your way up. This popular Jamaican landmark offers a unique blend of adventure and natural beauty.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-bobsled-jamaica-and-dunns-river-falls-425066-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTU5Mzd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3haQzlvWm1Jdk9EZ3hOREk1TkRjeU9EY3pOQzVxY0djfDI0NjM0ZTRkMjNhNjRjYTYzODk2ODMwMGIyOWQ3MDgyMmM3NWEyZTBlMDI2MzFmODlmYjJiN2NlNDNhMmJiMTI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '425006', 'port_slug': 'ocho-rios', 'title': "Dunn's River Party Cruise with Open Bar", 'slug': 'dunn-s-river-party-cruise-with-open-bar-425006', 'price': 119.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.4, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Party Cruise:</strong> Cruise along the Jamaican coast aboard a sleek catamaran and soak up the sun on your 25-minute ride to Dunns River Falls. Enjoy the lively onboard atmosphere and scenic views.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Dunns River Falls &amp; Beach:</strong> Scale the 600-foot Dunns River Falls or soak up the sun on a beautiful Jamaican beach.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sip &amp; Sail:</strong> Unwind on the return journey with tropical fruit and some cool rum punch.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-dunns-river-party-cruise-ocho-rios-jamaica-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxMTcwODV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGxZaTlvTmpJdk9EZ3hOREk1TVRRMU1Ua3pOQzVxY0djfDZhMjg4ODhkNjMxZmMzZDIxN2NhOWMyNTFhZGYyNDI5MTg4ZDFiZmE1MGY0MWM2Y2JiMjNmNDQ2ZGM0NTE1YmE', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '425191', 'port_slug': 'ocho-rios', 'title': 'Discovery Bay Beach Break with Lunch', 'slug': 'discovery-bay-beach-break-with-lunch-425191', 'price': 62.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 12, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Beach Club:</strong> Visit Puerto Seco Beach Club, a spectacular facility and the only one of its kind in Jamaica. You will be greeted with a warm Jamaican welcome and a tropical fruit punch. This facility offers 1,000 ft. of white sand beach, a 150-ft. long swimming pool, adequate shade options along the beach, beach lounge chairs, first class restroom/changing room facilities with locker rentals and shower stalls, as well as comfortable dining facilities with buffet service and a beach bar and grill. A shop on property offers a variety of options to satisfy your shopping needs. A ¼ acre floating water park system is included in your beach experience.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What's Included</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Lunch.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/425191-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU5NjJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFE0TDJnMk5DODRPVEF6TmpZMk56WXhOelU0THpReU5URTVNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjMjI0OTE5NzE0NTcyZTQ1ZGNiODQyMzczMzU4MzZiOTg1YWFhN2I0ZmRiYTQ4MDZhNjFmOWRhNTJkYzczY2E3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
