    {'code': '973015', 'port_slug': 'phu-my-ho-chi-minh', 'title': 'Best of Ho Chi Minh City for Small Groups', 'slug': 'best-of-ho-chi-minh-city-for-small-groups-973015', 'price': 169.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/973015-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc2NzJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1V6TDJnM1ppODRPVGt5TnpRMk9ETXhPVEF5THprM016QXhOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1NDIxOTA2OTkzOTYwZGFmNzlhMjcyZThiNmFkMTIzNGVmOGEyYTFhZjMxMjI3YWZjMWNhZjhjMTQ5MGYxMzE3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '973018', 'port_slug': 'phu-my-ho-chi-minh', 'title': 'Lotus Tea Culture & Vegan Experience', 'slug': 'lotus-tea-culture--vegan-experience-973018', 'price': 159.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/973018-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDUwMzd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFl3TDJoaVppODVOVFE0TWpZME56QXhPVGd5THprM016QXhPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wxNWEzNTE0Y2MxODQ5NWU2Mzk3ZjM0MWRmOWY0YzZjYTJlZmU4MTE1ZDA4ODljMTBjZjcxOTI3ZmIwZjJjMjJh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '973004', 'port_slug': 'phu-my-ho-chi-minh', 'title': 'The Mekong Delta', 'slug': 'the-mekong-delta-973004', 'price': 189.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Mekong Delta Transport:</strong> Start your journey with an air-conditioned coach ride to Mỹ Tho. From there, embark on a delightful sampan ride into the heart of the Mekong Delta, known for its fruit plantations. Enjoy a tasting of various tropical fruits.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Traditional Delta Home:</strong> Your next stop is a traditional Delta home, where you\'ll gain insights into local customs. Here, it\'s common for three generations of a family to share the same roof.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Candy Factory:</strong> Tour a Vietnamese coconut candy factory to witness the candy-making process and explore the production house. Discover various flavors of coconut candy, ideal as souvenirs. Relish traditional Delta cuisine at a local restaurant for lunch, accompanied by locals singing Vietnamese folk songs with musical accompaniment featuring the "dan bau," a one-string Vietnamese instrument.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/973004-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTMyOTB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGd6TDJnNE5pODRPVGt6TWpJMU5EQTROVFF5THprM016QXdOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w5ZTI1ZDRjODgxOWUyMjM1YjcxYTc1ZTBlMDYwMzkzYTM4NThhMThlMTYyOTJjYTljZDc2YWU3ZGI3YTNkNGI0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '973002', 'port_slug': 'phu-my-ho-chi-minh', 'title': 'History Museum, Lacquer Factory & Dong Khoi Street', 'slug': 'history-museum-lacquer-factory--dong-khoi-street-973002', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>History Museum:</strong> Explore Ho Chi Minh City\'s cultural highlights on this guided tour in Vietnam. Begin your journey at the Vietnam History Museum, delve into Vietnam\'s rich heritage through stone artifacts, Champa art, ceramics, and traditional costumes.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Lacquer Factory and Scenic Drive:</strong> Visit the Dat Viet Lacquer Factory before embarking on a scenic drive past iconic landmarks such as the Botanical and Zoological Gardens, Notre Dame Cathedral, French Colonial Post Office, and Ho Chi Minh Park. Pause for photos at the Reunification Palace, City Hall and the Rex Hotel, known for the "Friday Night Follies." Savor a buffet-style lunch with American and Vietnamese cuisine at a deluxe hotel restaurant downtown, complete with Vietnamese entertainment.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Dong Khoi Street:</strong> Conclude your day with leisure time to explore Dong Khoi Street\'s charming shops before returning to the pier.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/973002-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY0NDR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGMyTDJobFlTODRPVGt6TWpJMk1qa3pNamM0THprM016QXdNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3MWYyNTg0NzllYzlhMWRjN2QwNmI5OWE5ZGY2ZmQ4NmMzMmQ5ZGRiOGUwNjMwMzQ3Y2ZhNTQxOGIxY2M5NzA0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '973017', 'port_slug': 'phu-my-ho-chi-minh', 'title': 'Saigon Street Food & Coffee Culture', 'slug': 'saigon-street-food--coffee-culture-973017', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/973017-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjE1MDB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1l4TDJoaE55ODVOVFE0TWpZME1EUTJOakl5THprM016QXhOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyNTZiNDNkODM1ZDE0ZTZhZjY1OTU2MDgzMmQ2ODYzMTA5YmRkMGIyNTkzODI2MDU5YzZmNDI2ODhiZDkzOTMy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '973008', 'port_slug': 'phu-my-ho-chi-minh', 'title': 'Saigon - War Relics & Shopping', 'slug': 'saigon--war-relics--shopping-973008', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Saigon Scenic Transport:</strong> This tour begins with a drive from Phu My port to Saigon, once called “The Pearl of the Orient.” Passing the countryside and Saigon River, you will arrive in a bustling city crowded with a sea of motorbikes.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Reunification Palace:</strong> In Saigon, start at the Reunification Palace, where the Saigon regime fell on April 30, 1975. Explore the second floor and the former South Vietnamese Army headquarters in the basement.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>War Remnants Museum:</strong> Next, explore the War Remnants Museum for a detailed account of the French Colonial and Vietnam wars. Drive by the Notre Dame Cathedral and Central Post Office before visiting the Ho Chi Minh Campaign Museum, showcasing the final NVA assault in South Vietnam.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Vietnamese Delicacies:</strong> Proceed to one of the local deluxe hotels in town for a lunch of Vietnamese delicacies, accompanied by live traditional music. Your tour concludes after your free time in downtown Saigon, where you can shop and explore the city on your own.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/973008-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM1NjB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0psTDJoak55ODRPVGt5TnpReU16UXlOamcyTHprM016QXdPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhYjc3M2NkZjU3Yjk0YzM0MWZiMWFjNmZlMjliNzZjMTA5MTlhYzBjM2I2YTVmYjNkNThmZGYxMmEzYTdhMzEw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '973003', 'port_slug': 'phu-my-ho-chi-minh', 'title': 'Vung Tau, Lang Ca Ong Whale Temple & Home Visit', 'slug': 'vung-tau-lang-ca-ong-whale-temple--home-visit-973003', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Vung Tau:</strong> Discover Vung Tau's natural beauty and local culture on a full-day guided adventure. Enjoy a picturesque drive through lush countryside to this stunning resort town.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Lang Ca Ong Whale Temple:</strong> Explore the Lang Ca Ong Whale Temple, dedicated to guardian whales. Capture photos and shop at Front Beach, known for its restaurants and shops. Enjoy a delightful buffet lunch at Binh An Village Resort with serene gardens and stunning coastal views of the East Sea.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Home Visit:</strong> Explore the countryside, visiting a village temple and a family-owned market, known as the Old House. Witness demonstrations of traditional rice wine and rice paper production. Finally, delight in fresh seasonal fruits at a farmer's fruit garden before returning to the ship.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/973003-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODE2OTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFpoTDJnNU1TODRPVGt6TWpJMU56WTRPVGt3THprM016QXdNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkYjUwODVmNWFkYzgyZTk4YTdkMmRhN2IwMTAyNGI3MjJmZjI5OWNhZDVlMmM0M2I2ZjNiNDIxOWIyNzYxMzZl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '973012', 'port_slug': 'phu-my-ho-chi-minh', 'title': 'Best of Ho Chi Minh City', 'slug': 'best-of-ho-chi-minh-city-973012', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Most Visited Sites:</strong> Embark on a countryside journey along the Saigon River to Ho Chi Minh City. Explore the Reunification Palace and the National History Museum. Visit Thien Hau Temple in Chinatown and drive past iconic sites like the Botanical and Zoological Gardens, Notre Dame Cathedral, and Central Post Office. Capture photo opportunities and savor a buffet lunch at a deluxe hotel downtown. Witness a lacquer demonstration at Dat Viet Lacquer Factory, known for Vietnam's popular exports and enjoy shopping before returning to the pier.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/973012-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQzNTZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0ZpTDJnMk1TODRPVGt5TnpRME5EQTNNRGN3THprM016QXhNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiYjdkODhmMmVmNDY3YzE2ZjI4ZjQ2OGQ1ZTc5ODY3NWU1Y2Y4OTYzZDVjZjM2NDE1ZGU4OTU4ZmI5MDMyYmM3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '823039', 'port_slug': 'piraeus-athens', 'title': 'Cape Sounion & Acropolis', 'slug': 'cape-sounion--acropolis-823039', 'price': 239.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.4, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': '<p>Experience the natural beauty of the embroidered Athenian coastline, the magnificence of the ancient Temple of Poseidon at Cape Sounion, perched majestically on the coast, and the grandeur of the Acropolis of Athens. Relax on your scenic drive by motorcoach to Cape Sounion, along the beautiful coast of Athens. Pass the yacht harbor of Zea and along Mikrolimanon’s waterfront lined with inviting al fresco restaurants. Enjoy magnificent panoramic views over the Saronic Gulf and the Cyclades from the famous Temple of Poseidon. Have a guided tour of this beautiful historical site where Athenians worshipped Poseidon and Athena as far back as the Geometric period. Enjoy some Greek cuisine for lunch after your motorcoach journey of approximately 90 minutes from Sounion into cosmopolitan Athens. Arrive at the Acropolis and marvel at the breathtaking view of the Parthenon perched up above. Climb up the pathway and steps leading through the massive Propylaia onto the rock of the Acropolis itself.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/823039-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTgwNTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0V6TDJnMk5pODRPVE15TlRVM05qRTVNak13THpneU16QXpPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyOTNjMmI3NzE2MDEzODUwYmM4NmJjNDM1NWRiNmVmOTJmYTc5NDY3NmIwZmZlOWFkMWEwZDYyODVhNDA2YzQx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '823044', 'port_slug': 'piraeus-athens', 'title': 'Panoramic Athens & Plaka', 'slug': 'panoramic-athens--plaka-823044', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/823044-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQyNjB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1U0TDJnelpTODRPVEk1TXpNMk5qVTFPVEF5THpneU16QTBOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlYjhlNzJhZjU5Y2IwYjdhMjMyNDllZjk5OTQzMDVmOWJhMTQ3ZGIxNDQ3MTZiY2YwY2Y2NWIzYmQyZWU4ODEx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '823045', 'port_slug': 'piraeus-athens', 'title': 'Acropolis & National Archaeological Museum', 'slug': 'acropolis--national-archaeological-museum-823045', 'price': 159.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/823045-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc4ODZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGd6TDJneFppODRPVE0xTkRJMk5qZzNNREEyTHpneU16QTBOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlZTA3ZWQwMTMyNTZiODI5MDMzMDcyNDUyMGQ0OTRiNWQ0ZTk4MmU3OGZjZGUzMWE0ZDU1M2VkZWI2N2U5MGQ4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '823040', 'port_slug': 'piraeus-athens', 'title': 'Crossing the Corinth Canal & Acropolis', 'slug': 'crossing-the-corinth-canal--acropolis-823040', 'price': 204.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.7, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p>Admire the highlights of the city, including a visit to the historical rock of the Acropolis, and take a cruise through the unique Corinth Canal on this combination excursion. Leave the port of Piraeus in your motorcoach and enjoy a panoramic drive into the heart of Athens. Arrive at the Acropolis for a breathtaking view of antiquity as you look upwards, towards the marvelous structure of the Parthenon. Climb up the pathway and steps leading through the massive Propylaia onto the rock of the Acropolis. Relive the glory that was Greece and view the Parthenon, the delicate temple of the Wingless Victory and the Erectheion. See magnificent views of the entire city of Athens at your feet. Relax on a panoramic tour out of the city. Pass the Temple of Zeus, the Panathenaic Stadium, the House of Parliament, Constitution Square, the Monument of the Unknown Soldier, the National Academy, the library, the university and the Presidential Megaron. Depart the city and travel towards the village of Isthmia.<br />\n<br />\nEnjoy traditional Greek cuisine for lunch in a local restaurant before driving to nearby Corinth canal. Embark on a boat to sail along the canal that measures only 3.7 miles long, 63 ft. wide and has sloping sides reaching 173 ft. Enjoy a complimentary refreshment on the deck during your crossing. Spend some free time afterwards to take photos of this remarkable canal and shop for souvenirs.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Crossing-the-Corinth-7HERO.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0NzgwNTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJNaTlvWTJRdk9EZ3hNemt4TkRZNE5UUTNNQzVxY0djfGY5ZDljZDcwM2QzYjMwMzM2Y2I2NjgyOTJhNTUxNjc1MjY3YmRkMzBmYTczYWM4NzBiNDAyZGZiMWExY2VjMjc', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '823054', 'port_slug': 'piraeus-athens', 'title': 'Corinth Canal, Lunch & Local Flavors', 'slug': 'corinth-canal-lunch--local-flavors-823054', 'price': 159.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.7, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p>Enjoy a scenic drive along the Saronic Gulf coastal road to the Corinth Canal. Admire views of the Corinth Canal from the bridge before reaching the Isthmia Pier where you will board your boat for a one-hour cruise along this unforgettable marvel of 19th century marine engineering. Learn about this great mechanical project with history dating back to 600 B.C. and identify the numerous geological levels visible on the two sides of the canal. After your cruise, you will walk to a nearby seaside tavern for a traditional Greek dinner accompanied by live music before returning to your ship.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/823054-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNjExOTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGswTDJneU5DODRPVE0yTWpjM016RXhOVEU0THpneU16QTFOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1MTc0ZjkwY2M4N2M3N2UzZTlkN2M3ZTEyY2M3N2VkMWY4OTRjODM2MGZhODc3ZDgyZjdkYWI0NWUzMDg2YmZk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
