    {'code': '823064', 'port_slug': 'piraeus-athens', 'title': 'Pnyx Hill, Plaka Walking Tour w. a taste of Greece', 'slug': 'pnyx-hill-plaka-walking-tour-w-a-taste-of-greece-823064', 'price': 94.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/823064-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE1MDF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJoTDJoaU5DODVNREl5TVRVNU1qa3dNems0THpneU16QTJOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiNzQ0NTUzZmJhZGJhY2U4ODJhODMyNzQxYjQ3ZWEwMTFkMjkyMDBhZDFjZDIwMWY0ODkwZjI4OTZjM2U4YTQz', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '823066', 'port_slug': 'piraeus-athens', 'title': "Wine Tasting & The Queen's Tower", 'slug': 'wine-tasting--the-queen-s-tower-823066', 'price': 134.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/823066-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc4NzV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0pqTDJobFppODVNREkwTVRreU56QTROak00THpneU16QTJOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmYTdhZTYxY2U4MGE1Mjk1Yjc2ZWE2NWJkNDg4Mzg0N2FjOTVlNzlmNDk1ZTk3YWQzN2Y3MjIyZDQ1M2JhMGVk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '823053', 'port_slug': 'piraeus-athens', 'title': 'Exclusive Acropolis for Small Groups', 'slug': 'exclusive-acropolis-for-small-groups-823053', 'price': 204.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-823053Acropolis-Parthenon-Details-01.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxOTI5OTR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNZUzlvTjJRdk9EZ3hNemt4TmpRNE56Y3hNQzVxY0djfGRkODI4NmE2NWZjOTQ4OTU5MWEzNWVlNTIxM2U1ZTRmZDgxZDg3NjAzNTdlNjU0ZGE2YmQ4NDU5ZDQ4YmU0OWU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '823046', 'port_slug': 'piraeus-athens', 'title': 'Acropolis & Plaka', 'slug': 'acropolis--plaka-823046', 'price': 159.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p>Experience the highlights of Athens while exploring the Acropolis and the old traditional city of Plaka. Take a short drive by motorcoach into cosmopolitan Athens. Pass the yacht harbor of Zea and Mikrolimanon’s waterfront. Arrive at the Acropolis for a breathtaking view of antiquity as you look upwards towards the marvelous structure of the Parthenon. Climb the pathway and steps with your guide as you’re led through the massive Propylaia onto the rock of the Acropolis itself. Begin to relive the glory that was Greece as you walk over this masterpiece. View the Parthenon, the delicate temple of the Wingless Victory and the Erectheion. Proceed to the heart of Plaka, where your guide will orientate you with the area before you enjoy some free time on your own exploring its back streets for souvenirs or maybe stop for a beverage in one of its many taverns.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/823046-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzA5Mjl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1F6TDJnNFlpODRPVE0xTkRJM056QXlPREUwTHpneU16QTBOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwMmQ3MTkyM2I2OTQ4OTFhYmYxMWE5ZDc1MzM4ZjdkOTUwMGE1NmRiYjNkODljYTM0MjA4OGY0NDBlODU0MDk1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '823063', 'port_slug': 'piraeus-athens', 'title': 'Athens On Your Own', 'slug': 'athens-on-your-own-823063', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/823063-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ0NjJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFF3TDJnMU55ODVNREl5TVRVNE5qTTFNRE00THpneU16QTJNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiMDllN2MwOGUzOTkwMjQzNDI2NTQ1MTI2YTM1YWM4OTNjZmI5Y2UwNjFkYTM2Mjg0NWFlMTI2NjM5N2VmMWQ2', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '823042', 'port_slug': 'piraeus-athens', 'title': 'Top 10 Best of Athens', 'slug': 'top-10-best-of-athens-823042', 'price': 234.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p>Depart the port of Piraeus and take a scenic drive by motorcoach into cosmopolitan Athens, where you will experience a breathtaking view of antiquity as you look upwards towards the marvelous structure of the Parthenon. Follow your guide for approximately 10 minutes uphill, walking to the entrance of the Acropolis. From there, you will be led up the pathway and steps leading through the massive Propylaia onto the top of the rock of the Acropolis itself. Relive the glory that was Greece as you walk over this masterpiece. View the Parthenon, the delicate temple of the Wingless Victory, the Erectheion, and the entire city of Athens below. Your guide will walk you from the Acropolis into the old districts of Athens, in Plaka, where you will enjoy a Greek lunch in a local restaurant. Then, take a short walking tour of the Plaka area and enjoy free time. Continue with a panoramic drive of the city on your way to the famous National Archaeological Museum. Pass the Temple of Zeus, the Panathenaic Stadium, the House of Parliament, Constitution Square, the Monument of the Unknown Soldier, the National Academy, the library, and university. Stop at the National Archaeological Museum which is considered one of the most important museums in the world. Tour the splendid galleries displaying art from the most brilliant periods of Athenian ancient history.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Best-of-Athens.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w5NTU0NzU3fGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmhoTUM5b1pqZ3ZPRGd4TXpreE5UQTNPRFk0Tmk1cWNHY3wzY2YyYjZmZWJmNDE1N2Y4OGZjZjU4NThlMzg4NGRjYmVmNmE1NzA5ZjY5MjUyOTEzOTM2NGI1NjY3NTRkMjBl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '829015', 'port_slug': 'ponta-delgada', 'title': 'Whale & Dolphin Watching', 'slug': 'whale--dolphin-watching-829015', 'price': 154.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Whale &amp; Dolphin Watching RIB Adventure:</strong> Witness the beauty of whales and dolphins of the Azores on this Eco Adventure, ideal for those who want to feel close to nature. Your RIB (rigid inflatable boat) will venture out into the open sea to search for these fascinating mammals. Prior to setting off, you will be given a short briefing by one of the whale-watching experts. The crew on board are available during your excursion to answer any questions you may have on marine life and the rich history of the Azores. The Azores attracts 24 species of cetaceans with sperm whales being the most common. Other marine mammals that you might encounter include humpback whales, pilot whales, orcas, bottlenose dolphins, striped dolphins, and more!</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/829015-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTY3NDV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR016TDJobFpDODRPVFkwT1RBME9EUTFNelF5THpneU9UQXhOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0Y2JiMTgyMThmYWM1Nzg4ZjJlNmVmMzQ1ZjQ2OWQ5YzJiMzc5MTJkZTgwZWJlMzM5ZDBjOGYyZWFiM2ViODIz', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '829019', 'port_slug': 'ponta-delgada', 'title': 'Terra Nostra Gardens Furnas Hot Springs', 'slug': 'terra-nostra-gardens-furnas-hot-springs-829019', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p>Experience São Miguel's botanical and geothermal wonders during this active, half-day guided excursion via motor coach. View the island’s oldest town, the picturesque colonial Ribeira Grande. Stroll through the breathtaking grounds of Terra Nostra Botanical Gardens, which feature lovely trails circling beautifully groomed lakes and streams, plantations of hydrangea and camellia, extensive grottoes, and century-old trees. Visit Furnas Valley, a geothermal wonderland of hot springs, mud pools, and geysers that emit steam with the heavy smell of Sulphur. See Caldeiras venting and the mineral waters flowing from spigots scattered across the volcanic landscape. Learn how locals use these steam pools for cooking. Enjoy a photo opportunity at the summit of Pico do Ferro Belvedere, which offers spectacular panoramic views of the volcanic Furnas Valley. Your scenic drive back to Ponta Delgada will take you past the village-port of Vila Franca do Campo, the first capital of Sao Miguel.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/terra-nostra-gardens-furnas-hot-springs-829019-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNzk3MjF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzROQzlvWm1Jdk9EZ3pNalkzTURneU5qVXlOaTVxY0djfDE1NTkzMWM0ZTRmYWYyMTM1ZmRjZDljMDE4ZTM5NGRjZjUyYTlkZThjYWJhNTFhMGE1YWE1ZDMyOGQ5NGU1MDQ', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '829017', 'port_slug': 'ponta-delgada', 'title': 'Ribeira Grande & Pineapple Greenhouse', 'slug': 'ribeira-grande--pineapple-greenhouse-829017', 'price': 124.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-000aChurch-City-Ribeira-Grande-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxMDkxODU2fGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmcwT0M5b01qY3ZPRGd4TkRNeU1qUTFNRFEyTWk1cWNHY3w0Mjg0OTRjMWY1MWM4NDg0OTFjZjhiZTczNjM3NzI5YjI0NmE4Y2Q1NzA1ZWNiZjk2NWE4MjNkOTMxODJiNDY4&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '829018', 'port_slug': 'ponta-delgada', 'title': 'Crater Lakes, Gardens & Pineapple Greenhouse', 'slug': 'crater-lakes-gardens--pineapple-greenhouse-829018', 'price': 144.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p>Indulge in a moderately active, half-day guided excursion via motor coach to see the highlights of Sao Miguel. Enjoy a scenic drive past small picturesque villages and farmhouses built of undecorated lava. Visit Antonio Borges Botanical Gardens, the largest municipal garden on the island. Stroll the grounds which feature magical fern gullies, grottos with fantasy bridges, and exotic semi-tropical flora from all over the world. Travel to a volcanic rim to take in breathtaking vistas of Crater Lakes, two lakes (one green and one blue) that inhabit an extinct volcanos caldera. According to legend, this caldera was once the site of the legendary Sete Cidades (Seven Cities), utopian cities settled in the early eighth century. Tour a pineapple greenhouse to see first-hand how this luscious fruit is cultivated and marketed. Peruse the greenhouse gift shop for delicious pineapples, tasty liqueurs, and local souvenirs available for purchase.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Crater-Lakes-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxMDE2MTI3fGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmd6WWk5b1lUTXZPRGd4TkRNeU1qVTBPRGMyTmk1cWNHY3wzZDI3ZmRkZWNhYTJhODdmZjJjZDgxNDQyYzczMTdmNWIxYjYwMmRjNGVmYTNhZDIyOGJhMWI2YTIyMzM1MWEw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '829020', 'port_slug': 'ponta-delgada', 'title': 'Crater Lakes Scenic Drive', 'slug': 'crater-lakes-scenic-drive-829020', 'price': 122.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p>Get acquainted with Sao Miguel’s rugged beauty on this leisurely, 1.5-hour scenic drive through the island via motorcoach. Learn about the island’s sights, history, and culture from a knowledgeable guide as you travel past sparkling lakes, stunning gardens and picturesque villages. See houses built on rough, undecorated lava. Take in the majesty of Forte de Sao Bras, a 16th-century Renaissance fortress. Drive 2,000 feet to the rim of a volcanic crater for a panoramic photo stop. See Crater Lakes, two lakes (one with green water and the other with blue), that inhabit an extinct volcano’s caldera, believed to have been the site of the legendary Sete Cidadas (Seven Cities).</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-scenic-drive-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxMjgzMTI1fGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmhsTkM5b1kyUXZPRGd4TkRNeU1qUTRNekl6TUM1cWNHY3xiM2U2MGI2YzgwOTI5YTVkYWRlODdkY2I1YTJhOGU2ZjE1YWVkNDIxZjg3N2E4MGNkMGUxNDQ2Y2M5N2YxNjNl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
