    {'code': '829028', 'port_slug': 'ponta-delgada', 'title': 'Walking Tourthrough Ponta Delgada', 'slug': 'walking-tourthrough-ponta-delgada-829028', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/829028-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTg4NjR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFJpTDJoa015ODVNREkyTVRZNU5EY3hNREEyTHpneU9UQXlPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2YjUzZWFjMmU3MDViNDAwMWYxNzEwZmZhZjQ2MmM2MmRhMDhiN2MxZDhjOWM1NGQ2OTQxYTZjYWIxZjQ3Zjkx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '128029', 'port_slug': 'portland', 'title': 'Kennebunkport & Scenic Cruise', 'slug': 'kennebunkport--scenic-cruise-128029', 'price': 134.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': "See - by land and by sea - the historic and charming village of Kennebunkport, summer home of former President George Bush. Begin with a drive through Kennebunkport passing the Federal and Victorian-style mansions built by wealthy sea captains and merchants in the late 1700s and 1800s. Stroll the picturesque streets of Kennebunkport lined with shops, galleries, unique boutiques, antique stores, restaurants and pubs.&nbsp; <p>Following your land tour, you ll embark on a 50-minute scenic cruise to enjoy panoramic views of Walker's Point and Maine's rugged rocky coast, as few people have experienced by sea! Continue past Walker's Point, the Bush estate and former summer White House, where world leaders often gathered. A beautiful scenic drive takes you back to Portland and your ship.&nbsp;</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Kennebunkport-and-Cruise-Main.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNDc4NDAyfGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmd6Tmk5b1pHUXZPRGd4TkRNM05ERTFPRE0yTmk1cWNHY3xjN2MzY2E2NDhlYzcxZWRiNzZmOWFiZTQ3YWVlMWM1ZTBiNzk1YjE4NDYyYzFlNzU1ZGY5YmI1MWVlZTJlMzlh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '128020', 'port_slug': 'portland', 'title': 'Best of Portland & Kennebunkport', 'slug': 'best-of-portland--kennebunkport-128020', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 47, 'desc_html': "This excursion of the city's highlights, Portland Head Light and the charming seaside town of Kennebunkport offers a fantastic overview of the Portland area. A scenic drive takes you through the quaint streets of the old port, with its gracious mix of architectural styles, and charming pubs, restaurants and shops. View Casco Bay and the Calendar Islands from the East End Promenade and pass through the arts district, and the commercial and business districts.&nbsp; <p>In Kennebunkport, pass by stunning Federal and Victorian-style mansions built in the 1700s and 1800s, and Walker's Point, the Bush estate and former summer White House. Free time is afforded for shopping along the picturesque streets of Kennebunkport's Dock Square, with its unique boutiques, galleries, antique shops, restaurants, and pubs. &nbsp;A scenic drive takes you along Maine's beautiful coast to Cape Elizabeth and for a visit to Maine's oldest lighthouse, Portland Head Light, first illuminated in 1791.&nbsp;</p> <p><br /> </p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Best-of-Portland-and-Kennebunkport-M.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w2MTcyNTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzVPUzlvTXpBdk9EZ3hORE0zTXpBeE1UUTROaTVxY0djfGQ5ZTFjMzkzOWE1N2Y3YTYxZGNmNGUwY2UwNWNmMTQzYWE2YWYwODExN2UzYWUyMzNkMWMzOWE3YjhiYTY2Nzk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '128025', 'port_slug': 'portland', 'title': 'Portland by Land & Sea', 'slug': 'portland-by-land--sea-128025', 'price': 169.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.8, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': "Enjoy a scenic drive of Portland, a visit to the oldest commissioned lighthouse in the United States, and a 2-hour harbor cruise. &nbsp;Drive through the quaint streets of the Old Port where street lanterns highlight a gracious mix of architectural styles. Once the home of the warehouse district, the brick buildings have been transformed into charming restaurants, pubs and galleries.&nbsp; <p>Just outside the city center and along the beautiful rocky coast of Cape Elizabeth is Fort Williams, once a military defense outpost and now site of America's oldest lighthouse, Portland Head Light. Embark an authentic wooden schooner for a leisurely sail on Casco Bay, and experience the beauty of Maine's rugged coastline featuring lighthouses, seals, and seabirds. &nbsp;Join the crew as they hoist the sails, take command at the ship's wheel, or simply relax and enjoy the calm waters of Casco Bay. &nbsp;Under full sail, glide past Portland's bustling waterfront, secluded islands, and historic forts perched along the bay.&nbsp;</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Portland-by-Land-and-Sea-Main.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNDc4MDg5fGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmhtTkM5b05tWXZPRGd4TkRNM016VXdNekF3Tmk1cWNHY3wwNDBjMGRjMDU0ODQ1Zjc5ZmRiNmEzNjg3NmYxOTU0MjYxMDhkYzQxNGI5OGJkZGEzY2JjY2E0MmRjZjA4NzJl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '128027', 'port_slug': 'portland', 'title': 'Lighthouses of Maine', 'slug': 'lighthouses-of-maine-128027', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.4, 'review_count': 8, 'desc_html': 'Portland\'s spectacular rocky coastline is studded with lighthouses dating back over 200 years. Visit three prominent lighthouses and the Museum at Portland Head Light. &nbsp;Drive through historic Portland, passing by the Eastern Promenade with its panoramic view of Casco Bay, the Portland Observatory, the new Arts District, and the thriving commercial and business districts. &nbsp; <p>Stop at "Bug Light", a steel structure lined with brick that was first lit in 1875 as an aid to navigation for this busy port. See the Liberty Ship Memorial dedicated to the 266 ships built on the site during WWII. &nbsp;Visit the typical "sparkplug" style Spring Point Ledge Lighthouse constructed of brick on a cylindrical cast iron caisson. &nbsp;Drive along Cape Elizabeth\'s rocky coast to Fort Williams, once a military outpost for coastal defense and now home to Maine\'s oldest lighthouse, Portland Head Light. &nbsp;Explore the grounds and the impressive museum located in the former lighthouse keeper\'s quarters. &nbsp;</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Lighthouses-of-Maine-M.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0Nzg2OTk5fGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmhsWXk5b1pEUXZPRGd4TkRNM016ZzJNelExTkM1cWNHY3xhYjFjOTgzNzAxZjBjY2Q1ZDQyYmI1ZWE5MTkyZGVmY2YxZjU0ODYzZGM2ZTFlNTYzNDBkY2NhMzFiMjFhMDRj', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '128021', 'port_slug': 'portland', 'title': 'Kennebunkport', 'slug': 'kennebunkport-128021', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.3, 'review_count': 6, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-Kennebunkport-Main.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNDc4MDI0fGltYWdlL2pwZWd8YVcxaFoyVnpMMmcyTWk5b01XUXZPRGd4TkRNM01qYzBPVE0wTWk1cWNHY3wwZDJhMmRhNjRmOGE2ZDBlOGUyNzgyMTNhNmQ4OTQyZmE5MzA4OTU1ZmRmYWI0OTBiOGIzMDBhNjc3ZjhjMDY5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
