    {'code': '235012', 'port_slug': 'prince-rupert', 'title': 'Best of Prince Rupert, City Highlights & Museum', 'slug': 'best-of-prince-rupert-city-highlights--museum-235012', 'price': 90.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<strong>Prince Rupert’s Must-See Sights:</strong> Learn about the history, heritage, and culture of the city as you travel with a knowledgeable guide. The city's highlights are a reminder of the many peoples and cultures who founded Prince Rupert, including adventurers and entrepreneurs. From the British gentleman who founded a dairy at Cow Bay to the Chinese gold miner who started Prince Rupert's longest-running grocery, and from the many shop owners who set up their first businesses in tents to the people who invested in the Grand Trunk Pacific Railway and its fleet of ships. The stories are as varied as they are interesting. You'll stop at a scenic viewpoint and look out over Prince Rupert's harbor and Metlakatla Pass. This is where the Tsimshian Natives made their winter villages with great cedar houses and canoes and thrived in the rich coastal landscape. Stop at the waterfront Kinsmen Park and visit the Kwinitsa Railway Station Museum, where you will learn about the building of the trans-Canada Grand Trunk Pacific Railway.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Visit the Amazing Museum of Northern B.C.:</strong> Visit the Museum of Northern B.C., known for its important First Nations collection, impressive exhibits, knowledgeable guides, and stimulating tours. Connect with the ancient past, exploring the art, history and living culture of the Tsimshian people.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Guided city highlights.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Must-see locations of Prince Rupert.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Entrance to Kwinitsa Railway Station Museum.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Entrance to Museum of Northern B.C.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Optional shopping.\n    </li>\n</ul>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/235012-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDcwNjR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFkyTDJnMllpODRPVFl6TURjeU56ZzJORFl5THpJek5UQXhNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlZmVjM2JjZjZhMTZhNzZhY2YxMTY2YzJjZTUxYjYyNGJjZWM4YmYxOTgwNTFkMjhjODViNjA1NzBlNDA5YzJk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '235008', 'port_slug': 'prince-rupert', 'title': 'Prince Rupert by Vintage Trolley', 'slug': 'prince-rupert-by-vintage-trolley-235008', 'price': 64.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/235008-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTg2NDF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREE1TDJnMFpDODRPVFl6TURZeE16VXdORE13THpJek5UQXdPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2NmExYzY5NjUwODFmNWM0Y2ZiNGYzZGZiYWUyYjY1ZjgxMzcyMGFhMWFjZTUzN2Q4OWRjYzBmN2IyMzQ2ZDI1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '235017', 'port_slug': 'prince-rupert', 'title': 'Chef Guided Gastronomy & Scenic Trolley', 'slug': 'chef-guided-gastronomy--scenic-trolley-235017', 'price': 188.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic Trolley:</strong> Join a local ambassador on a trolley ride through the historic coastal city, unique for being nestled in the Great Bear Rainforest. Experience the vibrant culture of the Tsimshian Nation and Sm’algyax speaking people as you hear stories that date back over 10,000 years.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Local Delights:</strong> Experience a delightful Mediterranean mezze gastronomic experience where the chef will guide you through an array of delicious toppings like halloumi and labneh, alongside traditional manousheh and zaatar. Afterward, you can either take the trolley back or walk the beautiful 40-minute waterfront Rushbrook Trail to your ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Meal.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/235017-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTcyNjF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFUxTDJnMlppODRPVFl6TURjM01UUTBOakEyTHpJek5UQXhOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzNTg1ODkxM2JlMGY1NDdlZTkyY2RhNTgzMDE0ODBkMTIyZWYzZGFmODI1NmEzZWI0NTBmYjg3NGMxOWM5YjI1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
