    {'code': '235028', 'port_slug': 'prince-rupert', 'title': 'Prince Rupert by Vintage Trolley Wheelchair Access', 'slug': 'prince-rupert-by-vintage-trolley-wheelchair-access-235028', 'price': 64.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/235028-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM0OTF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFExTDJoa1lTODVNVEV4T1RNek1qSXlPVFF5THpJek5UQXlPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkN2ZjNWYxMDEwYjI0MjQxYzViNDVmNjIxOTk1ZDdkNzM4MDU3ZWNjM2VlYWU3ODM0ZmYyMjAwYWE3ODAwNTY3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '235019', 'port_slug': 'prince-rupert', 'title': 'Trolley Highlights & Scenic Seal Cove Picnic', 'slug': 'trolley-highlights--scenic-seal-cove-picnic-235019', 'price': 132.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Trolley:</strong> Experience Prince Rupert on a narrated trolley tour, visiting its historic neighborhoods while learning about the 10,000-year-old Tsimshian Nation, the Sm’algyax speaking people and the city’s connection to the Great Bear Rainforest. Explore the fascinating stories of boom and bust that shaped this remarkable coastal community.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Picnic:</strong> Delight in a delicious, boxed snack at picturesque Seal Cove, selecting a cozy spot among the picnic tables or benches. After your picnic, you can either ride the trolley back or opt for a peaceful 40-minute walk along the stunning Rushbrook Trail to your ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Guided sightseeing tour by trolley.</li>\n\t<li>Visit to Seal Cove.</li>\n\t<li>Boxed snack.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/235019-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ5OTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFUwTDJnd05TODRPVFl6TURjNE1UWXdOREUwTHpJek5UQXhPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wxNGM5ZmZkMzI2MjgxODFlNTllMmQ5NTNmMGUyMjE0MDYwZDQxZjEzODYxY2FkNGVmMTE5OTJmOTMxMDBiMDhm', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '439033', 'port_slug': 'princess-cays', 'title': 'Clear-Bottom Kayaking Adventure', 'slug': 'clear-bottom-kayaking-adventure-439033', 'price': 54.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 11, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Kayaking Adventure:</strong> Calling all nature enthusiasts! Enjoy a guided kayak ride through the island’s lagoon while exploring the flora and fauna of this unique habitat. See marine life through the clear bottom of the kayak, including unique jelly fish, crawfish, sea urchins, baby conch, and tropical fish. Learn how the lagoon provides a safe place for various species of fish to breed and grow, and how the mangroves supply a natural home for birds and other marine life.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Locker to use during tour.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/439033-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTI4MjF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGt3TDJoa09TODRPVGMzTmpZek1UazNNakUwTHpRek9UQXpNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiMmZmMDU5YmE5Njk4Y2VhOTI2ZmQ0ZjljOGJiYzFiMDBlNDMxMzYxYmM2MjkxZmIxMjNlOWViMjEwNzBjM2Zh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '439008', 'port_slug': 'princess-cays', 'title': 'Snorkeling Adventure by Boat', 'slug': 'snorkeling-adventure-by-boat-439008', 'price': 69.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': '<strong>Sightsee:</strong> Take in the sights along the southern coast of Eleuthera on a custom-built, spacious, 42-foot boat as you make your way to the snorkel site. <br /><br /> <strong>Snorkeling:</strong> Explore the crystal-clear, shallow waters, the intricate coral reef and its colorful sea life with professional snorkeling guides, available to assist if needed. Observe the old and new strands of coral, gorgonians (soft coral-like sea fans), sponges, various fish life and, if you are lucky, an occasional turtle or stingray. <br /><br /> <strong>What’s Included:</strong> <ul>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Snorkel gear.     </li>     </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/439008-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDA5NzZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzBNaTlvTURndk9EZzNPRGc0TlRRek56UTNNQzVxY0djfDdhMTIzNGE1OWJlMmYyODYxOWMxMzcxMDczMjVjMmIyMmRkMmRjYmYyZjJlMGRiMGE1ZWU3YmNmZWM5MTZjMTM', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '439007', 'port_slug': 'princess-cays', 'title': 'Surf Fishing', 'slug': 'surf-fishing-439007', 'price': 49.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.4, 'review_count': 13, 'desc_html': '<strong>Fishing:</strong> The Bahamas is known for its great fishing, and avid anglers will want to try their luck on a stretch of rocky coastline at Princess Cays. Spend time with a fishing rod in your hand overlooking the blue Caribbean Sea where you may catch Nassau grouper, snapper and grunts.<br /> <br /> <strong>What’s Included:</strong> <ul>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Rod and reel, bait (squid).     </li>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Expert Bahamian fishermen to assist, if requested.     </li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/439007-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc1Nzh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0V3TDJnd05TODRPVGMzTmpZeE1UWTFOVGs0THpRek9UQXdOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3MjRiMzMyMWU4MjQwYzk2MmIxYjBkNDgwY2U2NTdiNGY2MTJjNDQ0MGJhNTQxNDI4YTc5YmRhYzQ4ODA1Zjc5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '439006', 'port_slug': 'princess-cays', 'title': 'Glass-Bottom Boat Cruise', 'slug': 'glass-bottom-boat-cruise-439006', 'price': 49.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<strong>Cruise and Learn:</strong> Board a state-of-the-art glass-bottom boat and experience the beautiful underwater world of Eleuthera without getting wet. Cruise to one of the area\'s pristine coral reefs with an experienced guide who will introduce you to schools of rainbow-hued fish, corals and sponges that make their home here. Spend some time feeding the fish as you view the marine life through the glass panels. Don’t miss the opportunity to check out the fish identification cards on the vessel and try to name the fish you see. <br /><br /> <strong>What’s Included:</strong> <ul>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Fish food.     </li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/439006-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNjYwNjR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3hNaTlvWldFdk9EZzNPVE0xTlRNek1EVTVNQzVxY0djfDU5ZTc5OTEwNjIyY2Y1NWZlZjYyYTgzYWQ2NjkzMTVlNzQwMTBlMjkwZDJkNGQwYjgxOThjNTFhOWJlMmUyNTI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '439032', 'port_slug': 'princess-cays', 'title': 'Stingray Beach Encounter', 'slug': 'stingray-beach-encounter-439032', 'price': 49.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': '<strong>Stingray Adventure:</strong> Get up close and personal with stingrays in the pristine waters of Stingray Beach where you will see and interact with these incredible, docile creatures. Feel their silky-smooth skin as you feed them and learn about their behavior, habitat and life cycle. Snorkel in the crystal-clear water where you will have an amazing view of the various rainbow-colored marine life. It’s an amazing experience with nature you will never forget! <br /><br /> <strong>What’s Included:</strong> <ul>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Snorkel gear.     </li>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Locker to use during tour.     </li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/439032-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE2MjN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR014TDJoaE5TODRPVGMzTmpZME9EQXlPRFEyTHpRek9UQXpNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2MzlhMTdiNDVhYzY2ZTBjNjkwYmM1Y2FhMTc0ZDQxMGI3M2JkNTRiYmQzNTZhNzVkNWI0YjFjMDUwZjFiOWZj', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
