    {'code': '320135', 'port_slug': 'progreso', 'title': 'Ake Ruins, Hacienda & Cenote Swim with Lunch', 'slug': 'ake-ruins-hacienda--cenote-swim-with-lunch-320135', 'price': 107.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 29, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/320135-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ0MDd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0kzTDJnMllpODVNREF3TnprNE9EUTNNREEyTHpNeU1ERXpOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwMWRmNzQxNDBjOTY3YTFlZmZjMzM0Y2JhOTE3YTZiNGM3NjVkZjIxMDFhNjU5MDRkOWRlZGZkZTRhMjdhMjJj&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '320108', 'port_slug': 'progreso', 'title': 'Horseback Ride at Spanish Hacienda with Lunch', 'slug': 'horseback-ride-at-spanish-hacienda-with-lunch-320108', 'price': 123.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.8, 'review_count': 53, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/320108-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc0NTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1l4TDJobE5TODRPVEUyTURZek9ERXpOall5THpNeU1ERXdPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiZTM0OTIxOWE1NjM1YjQ0M2MyNjk4ZGVmZDYwYjFmZDRiYjg2YmYzM2VhMDIzZTYwYWYzN2I3NDU0Zjg1ZmFl&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '320095', 'port_slug': 'progreso', 'title': 'Natural Pool, Wildlife, Ruins, Beach & Buffet', 'slug': 'natural-pool-wildlife-ruins-beach--buffet-320095', 'price': 117.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.9, 'review_count': 170, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Ecological Reserve – Swim in Open Cenotes:</strong> Enjoy a short boat ride through rivers surrounded by mangroves that conceal breathtaking natural pools of freshwater, famously known as cenotes. The Ecological Reserve has 3 cenotes, ideal for nature lovers and those who prefer tranquility, ideal for observing a wide variety of plants and birds. You may even come across tortoises, fish, and possibly even a small crocodile or snake!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Xcambo Mayan Site:</strong> Visit an archaeological zone that features hidden treasures that your guide will be sure to share with you. Xcambo dates to 150 BC and it served as a critical port for the nearby Mayan city of Izamal. The city was also known for its handcraft production and its role as a salt distributor in the region.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Boutique Beach Hotel:</strong> Relax at a private beach club, enjoy an authentic Mexican buffet and a welcome drink. You are also invited to relax or play in the pool or sea, walk on the beach, or cool off on a beach chair and be pampered by the staff.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Authentic Mexican buffet.</li>\n\t<li>Entrance fee to the natural reserve.</li>\n\t<li>Access to the archaeological site.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/320095-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE3ODh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREk0TDJoak5pODVOalExT0RJME5qTTVNREEyTHpNeU1EQTVOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0ZGQ1YjA2ODZjYWE3ZWI5NTBjODU5MmE1YWRiY2I2ZWE0NzdjMzVmZDI0MGMwNjIxZjA3YTUzYmFiMDVkYzJl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '320134', 'port_slug': 'progreso', 'title': 'Lazy River Tubing, Cavern Swim & Ake Ruins', 'slug': 'lazy-river-tubing-cavern-swim--ake-ruins-320134', 'price': 128.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.4, 'review_count': 61, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Ake Ruins:</strong> A comfortable motor coach whisks you from your ship to the Ake archaeological site. Explore the remnants of the Late Preclassic Period Mayan City, where the 16th-century clash between the Mayans and Francesco de Montejo unfolded. Witness the fascinating convergence of two civilizations—the Maya and the Spanish—etched in the Aké Ruins, offering a vivid glimpse into this historical chapter.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Underground River Caverns &amp; Snorkeling:</strong> Enjoy a wonderful lazy river tube float, open air cave swim and cavern snorkeling in the crystal clear, fresh waters of the cenote water system (deep, water-filled sinkholes in limestone that create natural pools filled by rain and water from underground rivers) and amazing stalactites and stalagmites.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Authentic Lunch:</strong> A tasty Mexican-Mayan lunch will be served at a local restaurant.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What's Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Lunch.</li>\n\t<li>Snorkel gear.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/320134-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc4NTh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGN6TDJobU5TODVNREV6TVRFMk9EWXlORGswTHpNeU1ERXpOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3M2NlYzc3YzJiOTc1NDkyODI4M2U2NDA1MTMzMDUwZjZkYzQwNmU1MzA0MjE0ZjdiOGVhNmU1MjUwOGU3NzU5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '305056', 'port_slug': 'puerto-vallarta', 'title': 'Mexican Fiesta, Dancing Horse & Buffet', 'slug': 'mexican-fiesta-dancing-horse--buffet-305056', 'price': 81.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.3, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Hacienda Dona:</strong> Stop at this beautiful third generation Hacienda, located in the countryside of Puerto Vallarta. On the beautiful property you will find a chapel, family-run tequila factory, operating horse ranch. The resident chef will prepare a traditional Mexican feast.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Mexican Fiesta:</strong> Enjoy Mexican folkloric dancers, music, dancing horses, and a delicious Mexican lunch. This show is full of excitement with colorful pinatas, tortilla making contest and more.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Tequila Tasting:</strong> Try unlimited samples of Blanco, Reposado and Añejo Tequilas, along with three liquors made at the Hacienda.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sightseeing:</strong> Experience the charm of Puerto Vallarta as you travel in an air-conditioned coach through downtown, visiting iconic sites like the Malecón, Seahorse Statue, Lady of Guadalupe parish, and the romantic zone. Complete your tour with an opportunity to shop for Huichol art, artisanal candies, and handcrafted goods at a local market.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Mexican lunch: Mexican salsas, chips, and handmade corn tortillas, salad bar, chile con carne chicken fajitas, nopales salad, beans and rice, chicken with mole, fried tacos with potatoes and dressings.</li>\n\t<li>Bottled water.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-305056-Mexican-Fiesta-Tequila-Tasting10.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTMwOTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGlNUzlvTURndk9EZ3hORE0yTXpRME16SXpNQzVxY0djfDZkMjRiODhhOTYxZGYwMDE3NjM2NWY5NDJkOTY2ODM1NTVkMjM2OTg0ZDYyMzFmZjJhODRhZWRiNGU3ZTg2OGM', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '305047', 'port_slug': 'puerto-vallarta', 'title': 'Dolphin Swim with Unlimited Food & Drinks', 'slug': 'dolphin-swim-with-unlimited-food--drinks-305047', 'price': 141.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Learn About Dolphins:</strong> The staff will provide an informative presentation about these amazing mammals, and you will spend time learning about the Pacific Bottlenose’s unique anatomy and behaviors.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Dolphin Experience</strong> Enter the water under the supervision of a trainer on a shallow platform and enjoy the opportunity to play, learn and swim with the dolphins as you engage in different activities. Gaze into your dolphin’s eyes, rub its smooth skin, and become so familiar with its quirks that you’ll feel like you’ve made a new friend.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>All Inclusive:</strong> After your dolphin program, indulge in a complimentary lunch at the dolphin center and enjoy drinks from a selected menu.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Lunch: Mixed salad, avocado salad, fruit salad, nachos and cheddar cheese, chicken nuggets, grated grilled veggies, rice, pizza, fried onion rings, enchiladas with cheese sauce, chicken breast with poblano sauce and a breadbasket.</li>\n\t<li>Domestic open bar.</li>\n\t<li>Complimentary lockers.</li>\n\t<li>Towels.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y05-dolphin-swim-experience-with-lunch-puerto-vallarta-mexico-5.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzQzMjd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGhZaTlvTm1Zdk9EZ3hNalV3TkRrd056Z3dOaTVxY0djfGMyNzk1NTFhOTI2MmQxNWQ4ZmQ5OGJhNDhkMzk1MjdmYTA1MDk0ZjA2NzJmZjNlNmNiMGE1YjVjMjY3MjRiNDI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '305011', 'port_slug': 'puerto-vallarta', 'title': 'All Inclusive Las Caletas Beach Hideaway', 'slug': 'all-inclusive-las-caletas-beach-hideaway-305011', 'price': 177.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.7, 'review_count': 13, 'desc_html': '<strong>Las Caletas Beach:</strong> Las Caletas, Puerto Vallarta, is one of the top four private beaches in the world, accessible only by boat. Rich in tropical wildlife and filled with scenic vistas, this secluded nature preserve is a paradise unlike any other. Choose from pure relaxation (easy to do in shaded hammocks strung between towering palms) or thrilling exploration! <br /><br /> <strong>Beach Activities:</strong> Spend time out at sea on a kayak or marvel at the area’s many underwater wonders while snorkeling or paddle boarding just offshore. <br /><br /> <strong>Parrots:</strong> Take a guided nature walk and meet some of the permanent residents of Las Caletas, the beautiful parrots. <br /><br /> <strong>Classes:</strong> Learn more about the culture and traditions of the region by participating in hands-on activities including clay modeling, mezcal tasting and cooking classes. <br /><br /> <strong>Kids Adventure Park:</strong> Add excitement to the day with face painting. <br /><br /> <strong>What’s Included:</strong> <ul>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Gourmet lunch.     </li>     <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Open bar.     </li>      <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Snorkeling gear, kayak or stand-up paddleboard.     </li>      <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Clay modeling class.     </li>      <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Parrot encounters.     </li>      <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Nature hike.     </li>      <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Mescal tasting.     </li>      <li style="list-style: disc !important; list-style-position: inside !important;">         Cooking class.     </li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-all-inclusive-las-caletas-beach-hideaway-305011-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNzMwNDF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaG1ZUzlvTURNdk9EZ3hORE0xTnpjME1UVTVPQzVxY0djfGZkOTgxNzA4NzM4MmQ4MmYxM2VhYjNkMmNlYTRmNzRiMWRkOGE5ZDg4Y2E0NmY3MDM4YjY4MzBlZGU1OTc2MWI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '305022', 'port_slug': 'puerto-vallarta', 'title': 'Rhythms of the Night!', 'slug': 'rhythms-of-the-night-305022', 'price': 174.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.7, 'review_count': 17, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic Cruise:</strong> Your afternoon begins with a scenic cruise, where you\'ll take in stunning views of the Sierra Madre mountain range. Plus, enjoy great music and an open domestic bar on your way to Las Caletas.<br />\n    <br />\n    <strong>Outdoor Theater:</strong> Hidden deep in the heart of the tropical rainforest at Las Caletas is a mystical amphitheater under a starlit sky, where the excitement will be waiting for you.<br />\n    <br />\n    <strong>The Show "Alma":</strong> Believed to have a protective soul, the Pyramid of the Sun is one of the most important and iconic landmarks in Mexico.  However only a handful of souls are aware of the existence of a hidden pyramid with magical energy that is discovered only by those willing to embark on an inspirational journey. <br />Welcome to Alma, a unique and immersive show that highlights the wonders of what happens when we connect with nature, animals and the ancestral spirits of the surrounding jungle.  <br /> Our story follows the legend of the quirky keeper, the protector of this hidden pyramid and sacred object, a character whose only job is to stop anyone from touching the most precious and spiritual symbol on the island.  This hidden pyramid has the power to open portals between the gods and humanity. <br /> Our playful and whimsical keeper makes a connection with the pyramid that triggers a series of awakenings, embarking him on a rite of passage that transforms his soul. He soon learns that restoring the balance in the world can only be achieved by respecting and accepting the offerings of this special place. <br />A surreal and perfectly curated natural amphitheater, nestled in the heart of the jungle, is where you will see this story come to life, through a mixture of incredible acrobatics, original music and unique special effects. \n    <br /><br />\n    <strong>Candlelight Dinner:</strong> After the show, enjoy a gourmet-style dinner by candlelight with tropical palms swaying gently overhead.<br />\n    <br />\n    <strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Gourmet candle-lit dinner.</li>\n        <li>Open bar.</li>\n    </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/305022-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDYyNDV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR00yTDJnelppODRPVEkyTURFNE5qWTJOVEkyTHpNd05UQXlNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmOGE1YzNlNmI2MTg1ZDAzYjQ4ZDQ1ZmQxZDU5MTUwODEzNDFlNDAzNTFjM2VjN2ZiMGJhZGM4ZTE2ZDY3M2Iy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '305038', 'port_slug': 'puerto-vallarta', 'title': 'The Greatest Outdoor Adventure with BBQ Lunch', 'slug': 'the-greatest-outdoor-adventure-with-bbq-lunch-305038', 'price': 164.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.8, 'review_count': 18, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Speedboat Ride:</strong> Start your adventure and let the thrills begin as you fly across the bay on a speedboat ride to Boca de Tomatlan in the heart of the Sierra Madre Mountains.<br /> <br /> <strong>4 x4 Off Road Fun:</strong> Hop on one of an iconic yellow Unimog truck and ride to base camp.<br /> <br /> <strong>Mule Ride:</strong> Mount a mule for a steady trek into the sub-tropical forest under the canopy.<br /> <br /> <strong>Rollercoaster Zipline:</strong> This is the #1 rated tour for outdoor activities, a bucket list adventure of a lifetime. Be one of the first to experience a NEW roller coaster zipline, one of the few of its kind in the world! This unique zipline fuses the fast free-flying sensation of a zipline with the ups, downs, and turns of a roller coaster, giving you the ultimate thrill of flying and a pump of adrenaline in every turn!<br /> <br /> <strong>Rappel:</strong> Rappel steep rock faces and descend suspended platforms into cool, natural pools.<br /> <br /> <strong>Treetop Adventure:</strong> Prepare yourself for a breathtaking rush of adrenaline as you fly through a thrilling series of 9 ziplines, rappel waterfalls, traverse canopy tour jungle bridges, and finally splash through streams and natural river pools on this specially designed outdoor adventure.<br /> <br /> <strong>Waterslide Splash:</strong> Finally, splashdown from the highest water slide drop in Mexico for a refreshing end to your journey.<br /> <br /> <strong>What&rsquo;s Included:</strong></p> <ul> \t<li>BBQ Lunch: Mexican chips and salsa, fresh fruits, grilled sirloin steak, grilled chicken breast, grilled spicy sausage (chorizo), Mexican beans, hand-made tortillas, quesadillas, guacamole and fresh flavored water.</li> \t<li>Complimentary lockers.</li> </ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-greatest-outdoor-adventure-bbq-lunch-305038-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTMwMDd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGxZaTlvWXpjdk9EZ3hORE0yTURjeU16UTROaTVxY0djfGY2MWI3NjkwNDdjZDk0MjYwOTJkNzY1NjMzZTJlNjY3ZmE0MGRlMDgwNjY5Njc5ZmM0OWNlNWM4ZGFjMDM5ODI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
