    {'code': '305099', 'port_slug': 'puerto-vallarta', 'title': 'UTV to Jorullo Point Glass Platform - 4 Passengers', 'slug': 'utv-to-jorullo-point-glass-platform--4-passengers-305099', 'price': 404.99, 'price_unit': 'Per Vehicle', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/305099-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTkwNzV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREF6TDJneVlTODVNVEEzTlRrd05EUTNNVE0wTHpNd05UQTVPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzNWFiYjAxOTNlNWNjODJlNTk3YzUzMGYxZWM3ZWMzMGI1MDUzNzk1MWU1NjZkYzY2OTQ0N2I0MDY0OTA4ZjFl&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '517049', 'port_slug': 'puntarenas', 'title': 'Tarcoles River Crocodile & Wildlife Cruise', 'slug': 'tarcoles-river-crocodile--wildlife-cruise-517049', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.6, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Eco Adventure:</strong> Discover the Tarcoles River, home to some of Costa Rica's largest crocodile populations and a rich variety of wildlife. Witness the beauty of over 50 colorful bird species, including the endangered Scarlet Macaw. A complimentary bird guide will be provided to enhance your experience as you keep an eye out for egrets, herons, and kingfishers among others.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Costa Rican Treats:</strong> Relax with fresh seasonal fruits, natural refreshments, and rich Costa Rican coffee while enjoying the sounds of local Marimba music. Browse unique arts and crafts created by talented local artisans before returning to the port.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Bird watching guide.</li>\n\t<li>Seasonal Tropical Fruit Snacks served at store.</li>\n\t<li>Natural refreshments.</li>\n\t<li>Coffee.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Crocodile-3.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0MzEyNDJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGhPUzlvWkRFdk9EZ3hOREUwTnpnMk1qVTFPQzVxY0djfDhhZGQ5MjE3ZWEyZjE3YjBhZjhmNjgwODMxNWQxODdlZjQ0MzczZTc4ZGFiZWEyMDVmYTYzOTYwZWJkZDAyZjE', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '517068', 'port_slug': 'puntarenas', 'title': 'Rainforest Jungle Wagon', 'slug': 'rainforest-jungle-wagon-517068', 'price': 134.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.6, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Scenic Rainforest:</strong> Embark on a 60-minute scenic bus ride to a tropical rainforest, where you'll be surrounded by breathtaking sights and sounds. Lose yourself in the serenity of colorful flora and the refreshing allure of crystal-clear waters.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Rainforest Jitney:</strong> Experience the thrill of exploring a tropical rainforest on a tractor-drawn wagon. Traverse the crystal-clear waters of the Tarcolitos River and delve into the Villalapas Private Reserve with your knowledgeable guide. From colorful toucans and macaws to intriguing spiders, lizards, and monkeys, witness the diverse wildlife that thrives in this magical rainforest setting.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>One with Nature:</strong> Unwind amidst the tranquility of the rainforest, where you'll have leisure time to enjoy the soothing sounds and picturesque scenery. Capture breathtaking photos of the lush environment and, if weather allows, take a refreshing swim in the river.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Santa Lucia Village:</strong> Step into the past in Santa Lucia, a town that showcases the authentic lifestyle of Costa Ricans from previous centuries through its carefully constructed historic buildings. Immerse yourself in the town's traditional ambiance while enjoying a tropical fruit buffet and cold beverage.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Park entrance fee.</li>\n\t<li>Live commentary from an experienced nature guide.</li>\n\t<li>Tropical fruit buffet &amp; cold beverages.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/517068-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODgxNDR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFpqTDJoaU5DODVNRE0yTmpJMU9UTTJOREUwTHpVeE56QTJPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0MjhkMTMzYmYxZDgzOWUwYjM5MTkxNWRiMjMwOWNiY2E5NjBhMjI3NGMyMzE4YjYyMTU5YTVkMDFhMGU3Yzcy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '517070', 'port_slug': 'puntarenas', 'title': 'Colorful Traditions & Jungle Adventures', 'slug': 'colorful-traditions--jungle-adventures-517070', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.8, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Esparza:</strong> Journey to the enchanting town of Esparza, a picturesque gem of Costa Rica's Central Pacific region, where local dancers in vibrant costumes welcome you at the Central Park. Interact with traditional masquerades and discover handmade souvenirs that reflect the rich cultural heritage of the area.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Tarcoles Estuary:</strong> Discover the Tarcoles estuary on a relaxing pontoon boat tour, navigating through lush mangroves that host a diverse array of birds, including herons, egrets and pelicans, as well as impressive crocodile colonies. A must-do for any nature enthusiast!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Shop &amp; Sample:</strong> Cap off your experience with a visit to a local souvenir shop, offering a chance to browse for souvenirs, sample tasty tropical fruits, and enjoy authentic Costa Rican coffee.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/517070-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM3MTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE5pTDJnek55ODVNVEl4TXpFd016RXdORE13THpVeE56QTNNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmMDBhNTU4OTVjZTNiNWRjZDhiMjM5MmQzOTg3NDZiNWM3ZTVmNDdlNWRhZjJlMjIyYTM0MTU0N2U2ZTA0ZGEx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '517067', 'port_slug': 'puntarenas', 'title': 'A Walk in the Clouds', 'slug': 'a-walk-in-the-clouds-517067', 'price': 114.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 8, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Embark on a scenic 90-minute transfer to Costa Rica's breathtaking cloud forest, where you'll be accompanied by a seasoned guide. As you traverse through the verdant vegetation and experience the invigorating climate, you'll gain a deeper appreciation for the natural wonders that abound in this remarkable destination.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Hummingbird Haven:</strong> Immerse yourself in nature and excitement at San Luis Park, starting with a leisurely stroll downhill to an enchanting hummingbird garden. Witness the vibrant colors and captivating aerial displays of these remarkable birds as they zip around in their natural habitat. Continue your journey along nature trails, taking you to the next level of excitement.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Bridges, Biodiversity &amp; Bites:</strong> Begin your journey through the misty forest with a short walk, leading you to a mesmerizing network of suspended bridges. These impressive structures, ranging from 95 to 253 feet long, will take you on an exhilarating adventure, offering panoramic views of the cloud forest below. With the guidance of your expert nature guide, uncover the hidden gems of this enchanting ecosystem, from winding rivers to magnificent cascades. Keep your eyes peeled for the diverse array of bird species, butterflies, and small mammals that call this biodiverse paradise home. Afterward, indulge in a traditional Agua Dulce and savor a hearty Costa Rican lunch, completing your unforgettable nature experience.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Keepsakes, Blooms &amp; Butterflies:</strong> Wrap up your tour with a brief visit to a local souvenir shop, where you can browse for one-of-a-kind items and keepsakes to remember your adventure. Enjoy a walk through the beautifully manicured gardens, appreciating the vibrant colors and fragrant blooms. Alternatively, step into the enchanting world of the butterfly farm, witnessing a kaleidoscope of tropical butterflies fluttering amidst lush greenery.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Park entrance fee.</li>\n\t<li>Live commentary from an experienced nature guide.</li>\n\t<li>Traditional Costa Rican Lunch.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/517067-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTg3MTR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGs0TDJoa01pODVNRE0yTmpJMU1EZzBORFEyTHpVeE56QTJOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2MjBhMjJkNWI1YzI2YTBiNzYyZDZkOGFkM2NhMjU0M2U1Mzc0ZGJiOTgwYWQ0ZWQyNThmODY0Y2VmMDk0Nzg4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '517047', 'port_slug': 'puntarenas', 'title': 'Rainforest Canopy Zip line & Aerial Tram Combo', 'slug': 'rainforest-canopy-zip-line--aerial-tram-combo-517047', 'price': 154.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Aerial Tram:</strong> Take a scenic drive to the Pacific Aerial Tram and embark on a thrilling gondola ride through a living backdrop of giant trees, hanging gardens, and cascading waterfalls, offering breathtaking panoramic vistas of the Pacific Ocean. Keep your camera ready for potential sightings of the elusive Scarlet Macaw.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Zip Line:</strong> Prepare for an adrenaline-fueled experience as you zip-line through the lush landscapes of Costa Rica's tropical dry forest. Begin with a thorough safety briefing and gear setup on the ground, followed by a captivating 30-minute aerial tram ride that will offer panoramic views of the surrounding scenery. Once you reach a higher elevation, take a short stroll to the first platform and embark on a thrilling journey as you glide along nine different cables with lengths of up to 720 feet, soaring above the ground and witnessing the striking beauty of the Mid Pacific coast from a unique perspective. With an intricate system of twin cables, double harnesses, and a braking system for added safety, you can soar through the treetops with ease.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Entrance Fee to Rainforest Adventures.</li>\n\t<li>Lunch (Chicken, Salad, Vegetables, Rice, Beans, Water &amp; Juice).</li>\n\t<li>Visit to Butterfly Garden.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-019-Tranopy-Pacific-CR.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0NDgyMzd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzVNeTlvTlRJdk9EZ3hOREUwTnpZd01EUXhOQzVxY0djfGE1OGU1MDU3NjQ0NmJkNDFlNDY3MzM3YTA3MDVkN2NkZWU1MjExY2Y3ZWYwM2UzZjJiODEyOTQ4YmJiNWRkMmU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
