    {'code': '447017', 'port_slug': 'relaxaway', 'title': 'Beach Cabana Rental', 'slug': 'beach-cabana-rental-447017', 'price': 720.99, 'price_unit': 'Cabana', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/420026-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU0ODN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzBZUzlvTURRdk9EZzNNVGN5TlRRMk5UWXpNQzVxY0djfDFiZDY3Y2UyYmQ3YjUwNjY3OWI2ZjA1N2ZmZmMzZjM5ZGU2MzNjMjY1OTdlNjgwYmYzNDgxMTdiOTA3NmU4MzA&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '5.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '359033', 'port_slug': 'rio-de-janeiro', 'title': 'Rio from the Sky', 'slug': 'rio-from-the-sky-359033', 'price': 479.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Journey from the pier to the base of Corcovado Mountain and visit the stunning Jardim Botanico. Nestled under the arms of Christ the Redeemer, this 140-hectare garden is home to an impressive collection of exotic tropical and subtropical plants.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Nature’s Wonders:</strong> Enjoy a guided stroll through 1.37 miles of peaceful pathways adorned with over 6000 plants and trees. Admire the impressive Royal Palms and listen to the gentle calls of native birds, like the curió and sabiá, throughout your journey. This site presents cultural and educational experiences highlighting Brazil's botanical heritage. Visitors can enjoy stunning views of Corcovado and a peaceful ambiance that contrasts with the city's vibrant energy.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Entrance to the Botanic Garden.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/359033-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY4MTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1U1TDJnd055ODVNVEk1TXpJME9UY3dNREUwTHpNMU9UQXpNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlZTUwOWJjOTYyOTgxMjNiYjY0NmEwMjk2ZmRiNTc2ZmJjNmJiZDE0OTMyYmY1YTdlYTFjN2VjMDdiMmE3MGM5', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '359031', 'port_slug': 'rio-de-janeiro', 'title': 'Tijuca Rain Forest By 4x4: Wildlife & Waterfall', 'slug': 'tijuca-rain-forest-by-4x4-wildlife--waterfall-359031', 'price': 114.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Journey to Tijuca:</strong> Start your adventure with a coach trip from the pier to Tijuca National Park. Covering more than 3300 hectares, this unique rainforest is a green oasis filled with diverse flora and fauna right in the city.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Forest Adventure:</strong> Immerse yourself in a two-hour adventure that combines scenic Jeep rides and guided strolls through the park. Witness lush greenery and enchanting waterfalls along with breathtaking vistas of Rio de Janeiro.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>History &amp; Ecology:</strong> Uncover the intriguing history of the forest and its 19th-century efforts to restore ecosystems impacted by deforestation. Then, learn about the diverse species that inhabit this extraordinary UNESCO-designated biosphere.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Bottle of water per person.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/359031-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMzgzOTZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1EzTDJnM01TODVNVEk1TXpJMU9UZzFPREl5THpNMU9UQXpNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkNTUzODA3ODg2NzE1NDg4ZTQ3ZDViOWNlODQxZTAxNjcwNGRkYmFkNTYzNjk0ZmNiMWFkNjE3NzNjMzUwM2Y2', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '359035', 'port_slug': 'rio-de-janeiro', 'title': 'Maracana Stadium, Ipanema Beach & Brazilian BBQ', 'slug': 'maracana-stadium-ipanema-beach--brazilian-bbq-359035', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Maracanã Stadium:</strong> Kick off your journey at Maracanã Stadium, an iconic venue in football history. See where legends like Pelé and Zico played. Walk through the museum, visit the locker rooms, and feel the passion of the fans from the stands.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Ipanema Beach:</strong> Make your way to Ipanema Beach celebrated by the iconic song The Girl from Ipanema. Spend time unwinding by the water or wandering along the promenade while embracing the local beach life.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Brazilian Barbecue:</strong> Conclude your Rio adventure with a traditional churrasco lunch at a local steakhouse. Enjoy a variety of slow-cooked meats served rodizio-style with classic Brazilian sides and salads.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Entrance and guided visit to Maracanã Stadium.</li>\n\t<li>Traditional Brazilian barbecue lunch.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/359035-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDYzMzF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREF6TDJneE55ODVNVEk1TXpJME1EVXlOVEV3THpNMU9UQXpOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlNjRhYWRkNDhhYWY0NDRiODI2NmQzYmY4NmUxNThhNjEyZTM4YTQ3ZWJiNWI1MGMxYjE2MTlmMzk1NzY4OTI1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '359028', 'port_slug': 'rio-de-janeiro', 'title': 'Best of Rio: Sugarloaf, Christ & BBQ Fast Pass', 'slug': 'best-of-rio-sugarloaf-christ--bbq-fast-pass-359028', 'price': 289.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Sights &amp; Heights:</strong> Start your tour with a scenic drive along Guanabara Bay and through Rio's famous neighborhoods. Then board a cable car to Sugar Loaf Mountain for breathtaking views of Corcovado, Niterói, and the city’s coastline from 1,299 feet above sea level.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Beachfronts &amp; Brazilian BBQ:</strong> Pass through the breathtaking beachfronts of Ipanema and Leblon then indulge in a satisfying lunch at Assador Brazilian barbecue restaurant. Relax and enjoy the lively ambiance and exquisite flavors.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sugarloaf Fast Pass:</strong> Skip the crowds and head straight to Sugarloaf Mountain with a smooth ride on the iconic glass cable cars. At the summit, enjoy breathtaking panoramic views of Rio de Janeiro and Guanabara Bay, including the famous Copacabana Beach. Capture breathtaking photos, feel the refreshing ocean breeze, and savor the experience at this iconic viewpoint.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Cable car ride to Sugar Loaf Mountain with fast pass tickets.</li>\n\t<li>Visit to Christ the Redeemer by cogwheel train or minivan.</li>\n\t<li>Traditional Brazilian BBQ: This is all-you-can-eat steakhouse, the price includes unlimited barbecue with a variety of meats, side dishes, and salads.</li>\n\t<li>One drink per person (water, soft drink, or beer) and one ice cream for dessert.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/359028-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjAzODh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJoTDJnNE1DODVNVEk1TWpnMk5ETTBPRFEyTHpNMU9UQXlPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkMTZmNmNlMmVhYjY5MjY3NDYxNDVhZDRhZWZhMWVmYjc5MjY0NWJhYTUyODZmYTQ4OWRhNDE5NTg5ZGRkZTZk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '359025', 'port_slug': 'rio-de-janeiro', 'title': 'Rio & Sugarloaf: Fast Pass Access', 'slug': 'rio--sugarloaf-fast-pass-access-359025', 'price': 159.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Scenic Rio:</strong> Enjoy a scenic drive through Rio's lively downtown. Discover the unique blend of colonial architecture and modern skyscrapers that define this vibrant city.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sugarloaf Fast Pass:</strong> Skip the crowds and head straight to Sugarloaf Mountain with a smooth ride on the iconic glass cable cars. At the summit, enjoy breathtaking panoramic views of Rio de Janeiro and Guanabara Bay, including the famous Copacabana Beach. Capture breathtaking photos, feel the refreshing ocean breeze, and savor the experience at this iconic viewpoint.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Fast pass cable car ride.</li>\n\t<li>Professional guide.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/359025-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTU4Nzd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREpsTDJoaFl5ODVNVEk1TWpnek9UUTBORGM0THpNMU9UQXlOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkM2UxMzA3NGYzMDI2NGJiNzBlYjRmYzhlNmYwNGUxMjg5YzI0MzJhOTdkMjA4MjkxN2M3MGQxYWY2M2UzMTMw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
