    {'code': '359024', 'port_slug': 'rio-de-janeiro', 'title': 'Rio & Sugarloaf Cable Car Ride', 'slug': 'rio--sugarloaf-cable-car-ride-359024', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/359024-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTM5MTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE5pTDJobFlTODVNVEk1TWpneU9UWXhORE00THpNMU9UQXlOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhZGE1OWJhM2RhYmViODRiZmYxYzVkM2I3M2ZiMjFlMDg5ZjY4NGRlMDQxYWM2NjkzNGM0OGRjNDJmMWMwMzhj&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '226046', 'port_slug': 'saint-john', 'title': 'Top 10 Best of Saint John', 'slug': 'top-10-best-of-saint-john-226046', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 61, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Ultimate Discovery:</strong> If you want to see and do it all in one day, this is the tour for you! Combining the best of the region's rich history and heritage with the natural beauty of the world-famous Bay of Fundy, you'll discover the favorites of locals and visitors alike on this tour that features the Top 10 things to see and do in Saint John and the Bay of Fundy. Highlights include the famous Reversing Falls Rapids, where the highest tides in the world battle the Saint John River and force it to flow backwards; St. Martins, a traditional fishing village on the shores of the Bay of Fundy; a rugged Bay of Fundy Beach; charming Covered Bridges; the vibrant Saint John City Market; Place Fort La Tour; the Victorian architecture of the historic district; and much more.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/226046-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY4MTB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR00xTDJnME5pODRPVFkzT1RFeE1UYzRNamN3THpJeU5qQTBOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzNTMyZGY5ZWE1OGMzZTA0OTg5MjRiMjNjMTA3NjVmZjNiOWZmOGM3NzI3ZDQ2ZTc1ZjhmOTIzZjU2OTVlNGRl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '226009', 'port_slug': 'saint-john', 'title': 'Saint John Highlights', 'slug': 'saint-john-highlights-226009', 'price': 54.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.6, 'review_count': 19, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>City Discovery:</strong> This sightseeing tour offers a comprehensive exploration of Saint John, Canada's oldest incorporated city. Experience the awe-inspiring Reversing Falls Rapids at Fallsview Park, where the Bay of Fundy challenges the Saint John River's flow. Discover the vibrant Old City Market, a beloved spot for locals and visitors alike, and enjoy free time to engage with vendors and browse the offerings. Gain insights into the city's military history at the Carleton Martello Tower, while admiring panoramic views of the port and Bay of Fundy from the Fort Howe lookout. Delve into the historic district, witnessing stunning Victorian architecture and learning about the captivating personalities that shaped Saint John's past and present.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/226009-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDUyNTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0l4TDJoaU9DODRPVFkzT0RjNU1ETXlPRFl5THpJeU5qQXdPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyODdiOGFhYjE3ZDMzOWE0ZDczNTY5ZTU2ODc3ZjU1ZjhlMTVkNTljODA0MThiYTU1MmM4YmVlZDdmYTk3ZDE4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '226048', 'port_slug': 'saint-john', 'title': 'St. Martins & The Bay of Fundy', 'slug': 'st-martins--the-bay-of-fundy-226048', 'price': 69.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<strong>St. Martins:</strong> Embark on a scenic drive from Saint John to St. Martins, where you’ll explore the village’s fascinating shipbuilding history. Discover the stunning Sea Caves, shaped by powerful tides, and enjoy the picturesque harbor featuring a lighthouse, lobster traps, fishing boats and covered bridges. Capture the charming views favored by artists and photographers and browse local handcrafted country crafts.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/226048-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDUxNDB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1JqTDJoa05DODRPVFkzT1RFNE1UVTNPRFUwTHpJeU5qQTBPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4OTQ3ZjdiZTE4MWYzMWQ1M2Y1YTdmY2IzNmZjZjU5NDlmZTU1MzVkMWJkOTUyYmRiOGJiMmY3NWQxYjIxZTkw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '226041', 'port_slug': 'saint-john', 'title': 'The Big Pink Bus - Hop On Hop Off', 'slug': 'the-big-pink-bus--hop-on-hop-off-226041', 'price': 69.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<strong>Double Decker:</strong> Hop aboard a vibrant pink London Double Decker bus, dressed in your best pink attire in support of breast cancer awareness! Enjoy the flexibility of an all-day pass as you explore key attractions in Saint John. Highlights include the Reversing Falls Rapids, Saint John City Market, New Brunswick Museum, Martello Tower and more. With a 90-minute loop and designated stops, it's an easy way to experience the best of the city. Start your adventure today!", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-The-Big-Pink-Bus-Hop-on-Hop-Off-6.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMzYwNzd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3hOeTlvTXpVdk9EZ3hORFV6TURJNU56ZzROaTVxY0djfGFjNjQ5MDk5MmU2YjQzZGJiZDEyMGM4MDkwNzdhNmZiNWJlYWZhZWQzOTE0YzI3NzZkOTkxMDQ2NWQ0Y2MyOWM', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '226015', 'port_slug': 'saint-john', 'title': "Trolley 'Round Saint John", 'slug': 'trolley-round-saint-john-226015', 'price': 59.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.4, 'review_count': 30, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Trolley Tour:</strong> Immerse yourself in Saint John's history and culture aboard a motorized trolley, reminiscent of century-old streetcars. Your knowledgeable local driver-guide will captivate you with engaging narratives.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Reverse Falls and Bay of Fundy:</strong> Experience the awe-inspiring Reversing Falls Rapids from Fallsview Park, offering the best vantage point where the powerful tides of the Bay of Fundy reverse the flow of the Saint John River. Marvel at the panoramic views of the Bay of Fundy and Saint John Harbour from Fort Howe lookout.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Historic Treasures and Market Delights:</strong> Discover the unique architecture of the historic district and other notable landmarks. Conclude your tour at the vibrant Old City Market, nestled in the heart of Saint John's premier attractions and shopping area. Enjoy the freedom to explore at your own pace or opt for a return drive to the ship.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/226015-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQxMjB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREF6TDJoak9TODRPVFkzT0RneE1EWTBORGM0THpJeU5qQXhOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmMDY1MDdhMzcxZjUyZjM1MjYwNjY0YThkY2I4MWQ4MTFmN2Y1Yzk4NWQ3OTE1ZGVmODhmMmMxMTkxZjU2YTdm', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
