    {'code': '226076', 'port_slug': 'saint-john', 'title': 'Traditional High Tea and Historical Walking Tour', 'slug': 'traditional-high-tea-and-historical-walking-tour-226076', 'price': 124.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/ComingSoonEurope-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTkzNTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFF4TDJoak9TODRPVEV4T0RVMk5UQXdOelkyTDBOdmJXbHVaMU52YjI1RmRYSnZjR1V0YVcxbk1TNXFjR2N8OTQwYzM1ZTMxNWE5NmViNjI1N2E5OTNlZWUxNGI4NGU5ZmIyYjg3MDY5ZTNhOWM1NDNjNzQxNzI3M2ZiZDNhMg', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '427162', 'port_slug': 'san-juan', 'title': 'Isla de Cabra Beach Day: Sun, Snorkel & Lunch', 'slug': 'isla-de-cabra-beach-day-sun-snorkel--lunch-427162', 'price': 94.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Beachfront Bliss:</strong> Enjoy a short transfer across the bay from Old San Juan to Isla de Cabra, where a beachfront hotel featuring chairs, umbrellas, refreshing breezes, turquoise waters, and unforgettable views of El Morro create an easygoing escape. Enhance your day with optional snorkeling, right off the beach.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Local Flavors:</strong> Savor a lunch of chicken, meat, or shrimp mofongo with one bottled water or one soft drink or opt for a cheeseburger with fries as an alternative.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Independent Explorations:</strong> Enjoy free time to stroll along the shoreline or explore the nearby remains of a small historic fort, all while experiencing Puerto Rico’s relaxed local charm before returning to the ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Beach chairs and umbrellas.</li>\n\t<li>Snorkel equipment.</li>\n\t<li>Authentic Lunch.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/427162-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTk0MzF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFEwTDJoaVlpODVOVFl3Tnpnek1Ua3lNRGswTHpReU56RTJNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1MzA5Zjg3ZjUzMWU1NDA2YzBhNmUwMzBmODY4ZjE5YzZkMDdhNjQ1NjI5MzcwOTBlMTdlZDkxZjY1NGY1OTM1', 'duration': '3.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '427031', 'port_slug': 'san-juan', 'title': 'PR Favorite: Rainforest, Fortress & Old San Juan', 'slug': 'pr-favorite-rainforest-fortress--old-san-juan-427031', 'price': 118.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.9, 'review_count': 229, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>El Yunque Rainforest:</strong> Explore the enchanting El Yunque National Rainforest, the only tropical rainforest in the U.S. National Forest System. It boasts extraordinary exotic bird and animal species living among lush, jungle-like vegetation, and a breathtaking observation area for panoramic rainforest views.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>San Cristobal Fortress:</strong> Uncover the rich history of Fort San Cristobal on a self-guided tour of its vast grounds. Explore the largest fortress Spaniards ever built in the New World. Traverse the extensive tunnel system, climb up to watchtowers for panoramic views, and venture into the dungeons to experience the fort's intriguing past.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Panoramic San Juan:</strong> Take in the architectural beauty of the Capitol Building and delve into the history of San Juan on a panoramic tour through the city. Venture into the vibrant Condado District, with its luxurious resorts, glamorous casinos, and picturesque beaches, as you experience the modern charm of New San Juan.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>El Yunque admission fee.</li>\n\t<li>Fort San Cristobal admission fee.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/puerto-ricos-favorites-427031-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc4NzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGxaQzlvWlRZdk9EZ3lPRGsxTlRNNU5EQTNPQzVxY0djfDM1YWVhZGFlMGU2YTM3Yjc4N2IxNDg1M2YxNzIwYjhmMGYxODVlYTc5NjI3ZjQ4N2JiYWNiMmNlNzE3YTNlZTg', 'duration': '4.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '427079', 'port_slug': 'san-juan', 'title': 'Beach Escape At Vivo Beach Club with Lunch', 'slug': 'beach-escape-at-vivo-beach-club-with-lunch-427079', 'price': 82.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.2, 'review_count': 12, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Beach Club:</strong> Relax on San Juan's pristine Caribbean beach at VIVO Beach Club. Just a 20-minute transfer away, this exclusive beach oasis offers sunbathing, swimming, and beachside dining. Take in the stunning views from the beach bar with friendly staff onsite ensuring your visit is highly enjoyable. This deluxe package offers round trip transportation, entrance to beach facilities, and a delicious Puerto Rican-style buffet.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What's Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Puerto Rican-style buffet (chicken, green salad, pasta salad, beans, and fruits).</li>\n\t<li>1 fruit juice.</li>\n\t<li>Showers and bathrooms.</li>\n\t<li>Umbrellas (subject to availability).</li>\n\t<li>Lounge chairs (subject to availability).</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Vivo-Beach-Club-HERO.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMzc2MDJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGtZeTlvTVRrdk9EZ3hNalV6TlRReE5EZ3hOQzVxY0djfGEwMjQwMzQ5YTI2YTg2NzZiZTc4YjVmYTlhZTJjNTRhOTIwZDk3YTAxNTIxNmY3ZjZhNDIyMjQ0YmYxNGEwNDg', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '427126', 'port_slug': 'san-juan', 'title': 'Ultimate San Juan Collection: Landmarks & Beauty', 'slug': 'ultimate-san-juan-collection-landmarks--beauty-427126', 'price': 66.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.9, 'review_count': 40, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic San Juan:</strong> Explore the best of San Juan on a relaxed, in-depth journey through historic streets, modern districts, and scenic coastline, with time to soak in the city’s beauty, culture, and charm.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sights &amp; Strolls:</strong> Take in the Capitol District and Old San Juan on a panoramic drive, then explore colorful streets, local shops, and iconic landmarks on a guided walk.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Contemporary Condado:</strong> Discover Condado and New San Juan with oceanfront views, contemporary city life, and a scenic photo stop at La Ventana al Mar.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Picturesque Pinones:</strong> Experience the laid-back fishing village of Piñones, enjoy its beachside atmosphere, take photos, sample local snacks or refreshing drinks available for purchase, and return on a scenic drive to the pier.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/top-10-best-must-see-of-san-juan-427126-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODc0Mjl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJaUzlvTUdVdk9EZ3pNek16TWpRM056azRNaTVxY0djfDQ4M2U1ZmZkNmY5OTQzZjhkY2JkZDg4MjFmNThmMDY2NzZlNjkwOTgyYjY4NWZjMGVmOTZjMWNmMzQ2NDk2ZGM', 'duration': '4.0 Hours', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '427140', 'port_slug': 'san-juan', 'title': 'Into the Rainforest: El Yunque Scenic Escape', 'slug': 'into-the-rainforest-el-yunque-scenic-escape-427140', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.8, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Countryside Drive:</strong> Escape the city on a scenic 45-minute drive through Puerto Rico’s lush countryside while your guide shares stories of the island’s culture, history, and natural beauty.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Visitor Center:</strong> Discover El Portal Visitor Center, the official entrance to El Yunque National Forest, with interactive exhibits, panoramic views, and a short film about this one-of-a-kind tropical ecosystem.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Observation Tower:</strong> Journey deeper into the forest to Yokahú Observation Tower and climb to the top for sweeping views of the rainforest canopy, mountains, and coastline.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Puente Roto:</strong> Unwind at peaceful Puente Roto, where dense greenery, fresh mountain air, and flowing water create a serene setting, before a comfortable drive back to port with time to explore Old San Juan or head to the ship.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/427140-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTU3ODN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGRoTDJnME1TODVOak0yTkRZek9EQTBORFEyTHpReU56RTBNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjNGU0MjFlYmFhMDlkZTY5ZmYzMzI2YzkzZjQ2MDBhMWVhMjhhZDk4MTUyMmYzMzA4MzE0NmJjYjgxNThiYmFj', 'duration': '4.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '1'},
