    {'code': '792004', 'port_slug': 'santorini', 'title': 'Volcano the Caldera and Hot Springs', 'slug': 'volcano-the-caldera-and-hot-springs-792004', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': 'See two of Santorini’s biggest attractions on this tour. You will be taken by boat to the Volcanic Island of Nea Kameni, where you will step out onto the Daphni lava flow - the oldest lava on the Island. Climb to the top over volcanic sand and lava fragments and once there, enjoy some time to take in the views of the island of Santorini and the amazing cliff of the Caldera. Following the same route in reverse, you will return to your boat and sail to the thermal springs of Palea Kameni. The boat will anchor in the deep green sulfur springs and you’ll have a chance to swim in the mineral-rich, warm waters (max 95°F) of the Hot Springs. On your return boat trip, you will be dropped off at the harbor of Fira where you can catch the cable car to the town at the top to enjoy some free time to browse around. Your return to the ship’s water shuttle will be at your own leisure. ', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/792004-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDM1OTh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFl5TDJnek55ODRPVE0yTVRnM01qTXlNamcyTHpjNU1qQXdOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwMWEyMzFhZWYxMGJmNDE5ZGZmOWIyOTc5NjgzZjM2NDFhMDhjMWZhM2I3NDZkOTc3NDgyMWM1OGViNzVmMTM3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '792005', 'port_slug': 'santorini', 'title': 'Santorini Beach Day', 'slug': 'santorini-beach-day-792005', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/792005-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY3MzJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFJpTDJoaE1DODRPVE0yTVRnNU16azBPVGMwTHpjNU1qQXdOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjN2ZhNGJjZTA2NmI2ZjMxNjEyYWFjZmE5MzJhNmY1YTVlNDk0Y2M4MTNjYzY2ZjlkYTZlOWZmYzNkMDA2ODNm', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '792006', 'port_slug': 'santorini', 'title': 'Sailing the Caldera', 'slug': 'sailing-the-caldera-792006', 'price': 144.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': 'This tour will introduce you to one of the most amazing geological phenomena of the world. The caldera of Santorini, created after one of the largest volcanic eruptions the planet has ever seen, occurred 3500 years ago. After boarding the traditional sailing boat, relax and enjoy the sailing which will take you first to the 7 Pedes spot for a ½ an hour swim. Continue sailing to the island of Thirassia which holds only 350 inhabitants in the main village, Manolas. After passing Thirassia the local boat sails close to the beautiful Ammoudi beach with the reddish caldera walls and underneath picturesque Oia village as well as the Armeni Bay where you will have the opportunity to take photos of this magnificent view. Tour will end at the Old Port of Fira from where you will have the possibility to go into town or take the water shuttle back to the ship.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/792006-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ2ODF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR016TDJneE5pODRPVE0yTVRreE1ETXpNemMwTHpjNU1qQXdOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlN2RkZDg2ZjlmZGMxZjQ3OWRlNmUwYTBiNjEyZGIzMDJmYTNmYTY0MGEzNDM5ODE5OTZmNTdkOThiYTBlNmYy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
