    {'code': '792014', 'port_slug': 'santorini', 'title': 'Exclusive Santorini with Lunch', 'slug': 'exclusive-santorini-with-lunch-792014', 'price': 229.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/792014-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc3ODl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR00xTDJneFppODVNREkwTmpJME56VTBOekU0THpjNU1qQXhOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w5Y2QwZjI2NTQ2ZTAzMTg4NTBiYTk3YmRmNDBmNzkwYmJlMDQ5MDY5NjdhZjJlMDg2MzgwMjJjMzI4MTc5MjVh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '792015', 'port_slug': 'santorini', 'title': 'AKROTIRI & OIA VILLAGE', 'slug': 'akrotiri--oia-village-792015', 'price': 169.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/792015-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDc0NjV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREZqTDJnNFlTODVNREkwTmpJek56QTJNVFF5THpjNU1qQXhOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3M2RjNjBiZGU2NWM4OGZlNWQ3ZGY3M2YxOTkzN2RkZDFlN2U5ODJjNDBhMzU1YzgwMDAwNDgzNzJiNWZkMmYy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '792002', 'port_slug': 'santorini', 'title': 'Oia & Thira', 'slug': 'oia--thira-792002', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.3, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': "As you come ashore to the port of Athinios you will be captivated by the hues of deep blue in the sea and by the vista of the graphic island of Santorini ahead. Enjoy a scenic ascent via the colorful rocky sides of the caldera, affording a spectacular panorama of the island.\n<br><br>\nDrive to Oia, passing by many traditional villages, the crowning glory of peace and tranquility. Built on the northern part of the caldera rim, it is here where many artists have been inspired due to its magnificent location. Walk through the village along cobblestoned streets marveling at the wonderful panoramic views and admiring the traditional architecture. Enjoy some free time on your own, and browse in tiny shops selling ceramics, paintings, and jewelry.\n<br><br>\nThe tour ends at Fira, the picturesque capital of Santorini perched on the volcano's caldera. Here you will have the option to either stay in town for further exploration or climb Fira’s narrow lanes to the cable car station and descend to the pier where water shuttles will take you back to the ship.", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/792002-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTkwMzZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGhoTDJnek55ODRPVE0yTVRneU56RXdNekF5THpjNU1qQXdNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3ZjgxNzk0NWQ4NWJlZjNmNzM1ZDg0OGNkMTJmNWExZGI5MzVhMWI0ZDM4OTI5YmEwZTkyZmJkMzE5MDEyZDFl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '792009', 'port_slug': 'santorini', 'title': 'Megalokori the White Houses, the Blue of the Sky', 'slug': 'megalokori-the-white-houses-the-blue-of-the-sky-792009', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 2.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/792009-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDA1NTh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGsxTDJnell5ODRPVE0yTVRrMk5qWTVORGN3THpjNU1qQXdPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmODYzZTg4YzM4ZWE2MzUyMzg1NTExOGFhZDUwM2ExMWY3YTZjNDNjYWRmZmE1MzVhMmZmODViYzNmMTEzMWYz', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '792003', 'port_slug': 'santorini', 'title': 'Pyrgos, Panagia Episkopi,Thira, Prehistoric Museum', 'slug': 'pyrgos-panagia-episkopi-thira-prehistoric-museum-792003', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': 'Board your motorcoach and start a journey along the rocky sides of the caldera and visit Pyrgos. Pyrgos village was built on the top of a hill, and until the early 1800s, was the capital of the island. The village is composed of traditional houses built around the Venetian Castle and the small streets follow the shape of the hill. Climbing from the square up to the castle of Pyrgos, the stone houses crowd more densely together and the labyrinth of narrow vaulted lanes becomes more tortuous. The village has many churches, around 33. Pyrgos is a place that is certainly worth a visit and dedicates enough time to the most fabulous panoramic view of the island. Next is Panagia Episkopi church, which was built in the late 11th Century by Emperor Alexios A’ Komninos. The church is an important Byzantine monument. It houses the icon of Panagia Glikofilousa, one of the third most priceless portable icons in the world. The church is not only known for its ecclesiastical architecture. It is also admired for its remarkable Byzantine paintings and hagiography. A number of important icons can be seen in the church, although it bears to mention that 26 of the finest works were stolen in 1982 and have never been found. A short journey brings you to Fira town, where the new Prehistoric Museum is located. In this remarkable museum, you will see artifacts, which were excavated at the site of Akrotiri, including the recent discovery of gold Ibex. Here you will have the option to either stay in town for further exploration or climb Fira’s narrow lanes to the cable car station and descend to the pier where water shuttles will take you back to the ship.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/792003-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ0NDF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1poTDJnNVlpODRPVE0yTVRnME56QTVNVFV3THpjNU1qQXdNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyMTBiN2MzMTcyZjYxMTJlOGQwZDViZTZkZGU0ODRjNWQ0ODg3NTI2ODc2MzZjMzQ0NmQ2NTYzY2U3MGRmODA4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '792010', 'port_slug': 'santorini', 'title': 'Catamaran, Sail and Swim & BBQ', 'slug': 'catamaran-sail-and-swim--bbq-792010', 'price': 319.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "From your ship, a short boat trip will bring you to the port of Athinos. Board the catamaran and start your trip passing by Thirassia, Aspronissi and Akrotiri. Your first swimming and snorkeling stop will take place at the Red Beach. Continue sailing to the White beach for your second swimming stop. After a delicious BBQ lunch served on board, your catamaran continues sailing towards the thermal springs of Palea Kameni. The water temperature is about 35 degrees Celsius and contains a high content of sulfur, which is thought to have healing properties. Minerals in the water alter its color, which displays every hue from green to deep orange. The waters are quite shallow, but your boat will stop as close to the springs as possible for a photo opportunity. Weather permitting, anyone who wishes to go swimming can jump in and feel the water gradually changing temperature as you get closer to the ashore. View the Volcano and the Caldera before your return trip to the port. On arrival board your awaiting vehicle which will bring you to the island's capital, Thira, for leisure time. ", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/792010-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDI2MTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1l4TDJobE5TODRPVE0yTVRrNE9UTXdORFl5THpjNU1qQXhNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wxZmYxYmFjNTQxZTYwMGYyNWM1M2ViNTVmOGM4MDdmYWZjMmY1YmRmMDg2MTI3NzhjZGRmZjBkY2ZlZDc3OWUy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '792007', 'port_slug': 'santorini', 'title': 'Greek Style Fiesta', 'slug': 'greek-style-fiesta-792007', 'price': 154.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.7, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/792007-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE3Njh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFEyTDJnNVppODRPVE0yTVRreU9UTXpPVEU0THpjNU1qQXdOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhNDJhZWZhNjVhNzFlZjkzMDQ0Nzg0YWZjZmNmZjk0MmVjMGZiNWU1ZWIwOTE5NTAxNTNlZmU4MDM0MmYxNzVj', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '792001', 'port_slug': 'santorini', 'title': 'Oia Village, Winery and Thera Town', 'slug': 'oia-village-winery-and-thera-town-792001', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/792001-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDIwODV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1JrTDJobU5DODRPVE0yTVRnd056RXhORFUwTHpjNU1qQXdNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4YzY4Mzg3MThhNmM0N2QzMTI3OTgxZTBjM2ZlN2ZhMmYyZDE1ZGM0Njc4YzExODIzOWFiZjNmZjMzNzI5NDIx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '734001', 'port_slug': 'seogwipo-jeju', 'title': 'Breathtaking Waterfall & Temple', 'slug': 'breathtaking-waterfall--temple-734001', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/734001-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMzQ3MDF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREU1TDJnd05DODVOVEU1TVRVMk5ESTRPRE13THpjek5EQXdNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2NzU4MWI1MWJhMWM2NDFiNzNjNjk2MDE0OWRiOWExNzc0MmFiM2MxYTc0OTlhY2VhNzgzMWIwY2JkZjRjN2U2', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '734003', 'port_slug': 'seogwipo-jeju', 'title': 'Gotjawal Nature & Tea Heritage', 'slug': 'gotjawal-nature--tea-heritage-734003', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/734003-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDg3NzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFV4TDJoak5pODVOVEU1TVRVME9UVTBNamN3THpjek5EQXdNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1ODU0YzY3Mzg4OTkwZmIzMjI3NTA3Y2RlYjRhZWRhODU0YjhiOTgzNTNiNzc5MDBmZDRmNmVmNTk3ZDdjZDVm', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '734004', 'port_slug': 'seogwipo-jeju', 'title': 'Stone Cultural Park & Forest Trail', 'slug': 'stone-cultural-park--forest-trail-734004', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Jeju Stone Cultural Park:</strong> Journey to Jeju Stone Cultural Park in Jocheon-eup and explore the island's cultural essence rooted in stone. The park highlights myths such as the creation story of Seolmundae Halmang and features the legendary stones of Obaek Janggun. With its rich collection and cultural displays, it offers a fascinating glimpse into Jeju's history and traditions.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Saryeoni Forest Trail:</strong> Experience the enchanting Saryeoni Forest Trail, a serene 550 m path between Mulchat Oreum and Saryeoni Oreum. Surrounded by majestic Japanese cedar trees and diverse flora including oak, birch, and cypress, this trail is celebrated as one of Jeju's 31 hidden gems. It's a perfect escape for hikers and nature lovers looking to immerse themselves in tranquility.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/734004-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ3Nzl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR013TDJoa1pDODVOVEU1TVRVME1qazRPVEV3THpjek5EQXdOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhN2RlYjAzYWI5YTQ5NTg2ZDJlNWE1YTc5MGViZDYzMWMwNTg5ZGI3ODgxMzljODJkNDZkOTQwMzZiYjI4ODhl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '734008', 'port_slug': 'seogwipo-jeju', 'title': 'Volcanic Crater & Seongeup Folk Village', 'slug': 'volcanic-crater--seongeup-folk-village-734008', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Sangumburi Crater:</strong> Experience the volcanic origins of Jeju Island at Sangumburi Crater a rare and remarkable natural site. Formed by a powerful eruption this wide crater is surrounded by lush greenery and diverse plant life. The rim trail offers peaceful walking, panoramic views, and memorable photo opportunities.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Seongeup Folk Village:</strong> Discover Seongeup Folk Village, a traditional village that preserves Jeju’s distinctive culture and daily life. Walk among thatched roof houses built with volcanic stone, narrow alleys, and courtyards maintained over generations. This is also a chance to learn about Jeju’s customs, local governance during the Joseon Dynasty, and explore local handicrafts and regional specialties.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/734008-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTY4ODZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR05tTDJoaFppODVOVFEzTmpBNU9EazVNRE00THpjek5EQXdPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wxYTczNjgxNGM0MTI4MjNjYTU0YWFhOGM0NWZjYTgwMDAyMGRmMTIyOGZlOGU5NWIwZmMxYzQwOTYxMjAwMWY2', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '734009', 'port_slug': 'seogwipo-jeju', 'title': 'Iconic Women Divers And Tea Fields', 'slug': 'iconic-women-divers-and-tea-fields-734009', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/734009-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDIyNzB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGszTDJnM01DODVOVFEzTmprNE56QXdNekU0THpjek5EQXdPUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4OGE5ZjA1ZDE4ZThlM2JjOWIxNDkyNzAzZTk1NzNmOTM4YmUwYTg5OThkZmRmOGVmN2Y4YTFlYzZiOGY2NmVh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '734005', 'port_slug': 'seogwipo-jeju', 'title': 'UNESCO World Heritage of Jeju', 'slug': 'unesco-world-heritage-of-jeju-734005', 'price': 154.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Haenyeo Museum:</strong> Explore the Haenyeo Museum, dedicated to Jeju’s legendary female divers. Through exhibits donated by the haenyeo themselves, learn about their history, traditions, and daily lives. You can also visit a replica of a traditional haenyeo home to discover more about their food, culture, rituals, and way of life.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Seongsan Ilchulbong:</strong> Discover Seongsan Ilchulbong a majestic volcanic tuff cone rising 180 m above sea level. This UNESCO World Natural Heritage site was formed more than 5,000 years ago by an underwater volcanic eruption and features a wide summit crater, approximately 600 m wide and 90 m deep. From the top enjoy expansive views of the coast and Udo Island.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Local Flavors:</strong> Conclude your tour with a local lunch before returning to the pier.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/734005-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTk0MTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE5pTDJnelppODVOVFEzTmpBM01EZ3dPVGt3THpjek5EQXdOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1MTMyNjNkODBhZjMwYWRhZmI4MGY5MDg1ZDBiM2VlMzFlOGM4N2JhMTRhNGMzMGFkZDJjMDZmZjRkOWMxNDRh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '734006', 'port_slug': 'seogwipo-jeju', 'title': 'Hallasan Scenic Trek & Temple', 'slug': 'hallasan-scenic-trek--temple-734006', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/736006-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzI5NTl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1JtTDJneU55ODVOVFEzTmpBM056TTJNelV3THpjek5qQXdOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w4NmYyMTEwY2U4ZGZiZTgyOWUxMmIwNGQwNTQwYzVmMmUyNDRiMzEyY2EzZGJiYjdhMDFkNGZkOWMxNDkzNTAy', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '734007', 'port_slug': 'seogwipo-jeju', 'title': 'Healing Nature & Local Life', 'slug': 'healing-nature--local-life-734007', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Healing Forest:</strong> Your journey begins with a peaceful visit to the Healing Forest where lush scenery, towering trees, and a calming atmosphere create the perfect place to unwind. As you walk slowly through the woodland you can enjoy the soothing sounds of nature and experience Jeju's restorative natural beauty.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cheonjiyeon Waterfall:</strong> Experience Cheonjiyeon Waterfall, one of the islands most beloved natural landmarks. See water flowing from volcanic cliffs into a calm emerald pool and enjoy the lush plant life and beautiful surroundings. It is a perfect stop for photography and quiet reflection.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Olle Traditional Market:</strong> Your final stop is Olle Traditional Market, a lively place to explore local products, street snacks, and handmade goods. Browse fresh Jeju produce and island made treats while sampling local specialties and experiencing everyday island life.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/734007-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTA1MDB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1l5TDJnNU15ODVOVFEzTmpBNU1EUTNNRGN3THpjek5EQXdOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xmNmM4YWM2MDJmMTA4ZmUzMzBiZmQyM2VmYzI0Yjk5ZTU4OGRiMmJjNDBlOTIyYzQ1ZWJhZTliY2ZjNGRiZjMw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '734002', 'port_slug': 'seogwipo-jeju', 'title': 'Jeju Island Discovery', 'slug': 'jeju-island-discovery-734002', 'price': 109.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Sun Rise Peak:</strong> Experience the beauty of Seongsan Ilchulbong Sunrise Peak, recognized by UNESCO as a World Heritage site. Once a volcanic mountain island, it is now linked to the mainland and features a steep trail leading to the crater's edge. Many hikers climb before sunrise to witness breathtaking views as the sun rises over the horizon.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Jeju Traditions:</strong> Explore a traditional folk village that showcases the ancient common homes of Jeju. This protected area preserves the island's cultural heritage, including folk songs, games, food, crafts, and the local dialect.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Seogwipo Maeil Olle Market:</strong> Visit Seogwipo Maeil Olle Market, the largest traditional market in Seogwipo, established in the early 1960s. Stretching over 620 , this market is a vital part of the local economy and features an easy-to-navigate layout for exploring various shops and vendors.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/734002-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDQ2ODZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFJoTDJnMk55ODVOVEU1TVRVMU5qQTVOak13THpjek5EQXdNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyY2M4NWYyYzBkNWQ5MjNmOTcyNTA0NzdkMjFhNDI1NzRiODI4N2M5MzMwNTBiZTUyYzUxYjAwYzA3ZDc4ZTEw', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '173020', 'port_slug': 'sitka', 'title': 'Tongass Rain Forest Nature Hike', 'slug': 'tongass-rain-forest-nature-hike-173020', 'price': 137.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Nature Hike:</strong> Embark on a guided hiking adventure through the natural wonders of Sitka and its surrounding area. Accompanied by a knowledgeable guide, set off on foot to explore the rich flora, fauna, and history of the region. Enjoy stunning mountain views (weather permitting) as you descend gradually for half a mile to Starrigavin Creek. Traverse a peaceful half-mile boardwalk through the Starrigavin Estuary bird viewing area. Cross the road and continue your journey on the Mosquito Cove Loop Trail, a 1½-mile path that offers a gain of approximately 300 feet in elevation. Complete your hike by strolling along the beautiful beach back to Old Sitka, where you will be conveniently taken back to the dock.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Rain gear and a water bottle.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-tongass-rain-forest-nature-hike-sitka-ak-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDU0Mzl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzVZUzlvWlRjdk9EZ3hORFF3TkRJM01qRTFPQzVxY0djfDRlODY2M2I2NWJkODE1YWQwN2ExMzJjZTRlNzRjYWZkYzFiYjIzNzgzYTFhNmM3NTk5YjExNWYzNDZjNDliNmY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '173024', 'port_slug': 'sitka', 'title': 'Sea Otter & Wildlife Quest', 'slug': 'sea-otter--wildlife-quest-173024', 'price': 169.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Sea Otter &amp; Wildlife Quest:</strong> Set sail on an Alaskan-built, high-speed expedition vessel with comfortable seating, wrap around windows, and heated cabin. Sitka Sound is home to the greatest variety of wildlife in Southeast Alaska – sea otters, whales, sea lions, porpoises, harbor seals, brown bears, puffins, bald eagles, and more! This tour offers a 99.9% wildlife viewing success rate.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Hot cocoa, coffee, and tea.</li>\n\t<li>Snacks: smoked salmon on crackers.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-sea-otter-and-wildlife-quest-sitka-ak-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNjY1MzJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzBNaTlvTVRndk9EZ3hORFF3TkRZek1qWXdOaTVxY0djfDY2N2MyZDZmMDEyM2I5YmM4YzQ2YjNhMDZjNWMyNjRiODM5MDYyZWFiZTcyZDBkN2MzNjhlODk4MDFlYzc2Y2M', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '173032', 'port_slug': 'sitka', 'title': 'Sitka Cultural Tour with Alaska Raptor Center', 'slug': 'sitka-cultural-tour-with-alaska-raptor-center-173032', 'price': 134.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Panoramic Sitka:</strong> Discover the storied past of Alaska on a panoramic drive through the historic district. Admire Totem Square and Castle Hill, where the land transfer ceremony of Alaska took place in 1867. Cruise by the Alaska Pioneer Home, the Russian Bishop's house, and the World War II seaplane base Fort Ray, gaining insights into the area's fascinating heritage.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Raptor Center:</strong> Immerse yourself in the world of Alaska's majestic bald eagles at the Alaska Raptor Center. This volunteer-run facility rescues and cares for injured birds, with the goal of releasing them back into the wild. Experience the thrill of a bird-on-a-glove presentation, explore the clinic and outside deck habitat, and visit the eagle flight center. Don't forget your camera, as you'll have plenty of opportunities to capture stunning photos of these magnificent creatures.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Historic Park:</strong> Step into the enchanting world of the Tlingit people at Sitka National Historic Park. Follow the scenic paths through the lush forest, where majestic totems stand as powerful symbols of their rich culture. Opt for a leisurely walk to discover the secrets of the rainforest, from the edible and medicinal plants to the life cycle and traditional uses of various salmon species.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Visitor Center:</strong> Marvel at the intricate pieces crafted by local native artists and immerse yourself in the ancient and contemporary displays. Gain a deeper understanding of Sitka's captivating past through a compelling audio-visual presentation.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Stories &amp; Songs:</strong> Delight in the immersive experience of visiting a traditional-style clan house, where the ancient stories and songs of the Tlingit people come alive. Engage with Tlingit storytellers and musicians who will share their cultural heritage through captivating performances. Your tour concludes with a choice of returning to the ship or being dropped off in town.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Admission into St Michael’s Russian Cathedral.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-explore-sitka-cultural-tour-and-alaska-raptor-center-sitka-ak-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxMTg1MjR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzRPUzlvTVRNdk9EZ3hORFF3TmpFM01qY3dNaTVxY0djfDM2YTUzNzA4MzBjYzZhYjc2NmI3NDg0M2M0OGYwN2JiZmFkNTgwMWQzYjUxNTk4ZTMwMzY4OTdjNWQwODRkNDA', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '173038', 'port_slug': 'sitka', 'title': 'VIP Wildlife Quest & Fin Island Lodge', 'slug': 'vip-wildlife-quest--fin-island-lodge-173038', 'price': 279.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Wildlife Cruise:</strong> Set sail on an Alaskan-built, high-speed expedition vessel with comfortable seating, wrap around windows, and heated cabin. Sitka Sound is home to the greatest variety of wildlife in Southeast Alaska – sea otters, whales, coastal brown bears, and more.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Fin Island Lodge:</strong> Enjoy a delicious feast of Alaska crab, wild salmon, and prime rib. Enjoy the warm hospitality of the staff at the new and exclusive Fin Island Lodge. Explore the beautiful beaches and grounds of the private island, relax next to the cozy beach fire while roasting s’mores, and take in the stunning sights of Sitka Sound.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>2 hour 15 minute wildlife cruise.</li>\n\t<li>1 hour 15 minutes at Fin Island Lodge.</li>\n\t<li>Coffee, tea, hot cocoa available on board vessel and at lodge.</li>\n\t<li>Lemonade and water at Fin Island Lodge.</li>\n\t<li>Feast for guests to enjoy at Fin Island Lodge.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/173038-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDczOTN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0U1TDJnNVpDODVNREl5TVRBNU1ESTBNamcyTHpFM016QXpPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkNWQ4NjcyZTM5NWQwN2ZkOGNjZDk2OTk3NTJiYjk4OTQwY2I5NjA4OTk4NjBlMDU2ZmI3YzAwNWU0MzgyYTIx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '173037', 'port_slug': 'sitka', 'title': 'Marine Expedition & Fin Island Lodge', 'slug': 'marine-expedition--fin-island-lodge-173037', 'price': 214.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Marine Vessel Adventure:</strong> Explore Sitka’s beautiful network of rainforest islands and diverse wildlife on an open-air vessel excursion! The nimble open air expedition vessels provide an opportunity for exploration of shallow water areas not accessible to larger crafts, giving you a unique and up-close view of Sitka’s amazing biodiversity.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Fin Island Lodge:</strong> Enjoy a delicious feast of Alaska crab, wild caught Alaskan fish, and prime rib. Enjoy the warm hospitality of the staff at the new and exclusive Fin Island Lodge. Explore the beautiful beaches and grounds of the private island, relax next to the cozy beach fire while roasting s’mores, and take in the stunning sights of Sitka Sound.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Rain gear and life jackets.</li>\n\t<li>Coffee, tea, hot cocoa, and lemonade provided at the lodge.</li>\n\t<li>Feast for guests to enjoy at Fin Island Lodge.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/173037-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDEzMzV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR05tTDJnellTODVNREl5TVRBNE1qTTNPRFUwTHpFM016QXpOeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwZWJkYjE4ZWM4NDI3ZjE1NWVlZDE4NmExYjQ5NTE1ODQzZmJkYTUyZjBhNTM2YjcyZDk0YjQ3N2E2YTYzMzlh', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '173019', 'port_slug': 'sitka', 'title': 'Sitka Bike & Hike', 'slug': 'sitka-bike--hike-173019', 'price': 127.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-sitka-bike-and-hike-sitka-ak-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNTQ0MTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGlZaTlvWlRNdk9EZ3hORFF3TkRFM016ZzFOQzVxY0djfGM2ODUzN2U0ODIwNzM2MjAyZDRlZTlhMGJiZjNlYTFmMmFhNjhlNDU3NDdjNzg2ZTMxZTlhMTU2YWRmNDQyZGE&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
