    {'code': '173036', 'port_slug': 'sitka', 'title': 'Wilderness Sea Kayaking Adventure', 'slug': 'wilderness-sea-kayaking-adventure-173036', 'price': 162.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-wilderness-sea-kayaking-adventure-sitka-ak-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNzA5NzZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzBPQzlvTXpjdk9EZ3hORFF3TnpFeU1qazNOQzVxY0djfDc1NTViYTFhZjA4MDFjZjc4MGQ1MDE3ODMyZDdkZTViMTA3Yzk0ZmM2NWJhMDFkYmU5YjE5YzczYjYwOTQ1ZTU', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '173033', 'port_slug': 'sitka', 'title': 'Explore Sitka Cultural Tour', 'slug': 'explore-sitka-cultural-tour-173033', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.8, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-explore-sitka-cultural-tour-173033-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNjQ3Njl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGlZeTlvT0Rrdk9EZ3hORFF3TmpNd016YzNOQzVxY0djfDllMzlkNjI0YmYyMjg1ZjY0ZmQ4NTM4ZGI3NjM1Zjk3N2QwMmE1N2RjNDcyZTRhMGFjNjlkNDFjNTk3MzEyNjI', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '172036', 'port_slug': 'skagway', 'title': 'Glacier Discovery by Helicopter', 'slug': 'glacier-discovery-by-helicopter-172036', 'price': 484.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<strong>Glacier by Helicopter:</strong> Embark on an exhilarating adventure as you take a short drive to the heliport and get ready to soar high above the breathtaking Alaskan landscape. Upon arrival, you will watch a safety video and be outfitted with sturdy glacier over boots before taking off on your helicopter tour. Your journey will take you deep into a rugged region of sheer mountains, majestic valleys, and massive glaciers. Jagged peaks towering over the Chilkat Glacier, cascading waterfalls surrounding the Ferebee Glacier, or the spectacular “river of ice” known as the Meade Glacier, may be among the wonders you’ll encounter.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Glacier Walking Exploration:</strong> You’ll land on the glacier and get up close and personal with these ice giants. Enjoy a walking exploration, while experienced glacier guides answer your questions and explain the awesome forces at work.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Helicopter ride.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Guided walking tour on the glacier.\n    </li>\n</ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-glacier-discovery-by-helicopter-skagway-ak-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w1OTgyMjV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3hNUzlvT1dNdk9EZ3hORFF5TmpjeE9ESXpPQzVxY0djfDdlZGU1NTE0MTQ4MDdkODBkYzMwZmQzNWFiN2ZjNDljNDgwNjQ1NjhjZmRlZGM1MWIyMjY1MDNkNGZjOTk0NGY', 'duration': '2.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '172052', 'port_slug': 'skagway', 'title': 'Ultimate Yukon & White Pass Railroad Adventure', 'slug': 'ultimate-yukon--white-pass-railroad-adventure-172052', 'price': 298.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.5, 'review_count': 10, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>White Pass Scenic:</strong> Hop aboard a vintage rail car for a 95-minute narrated journey on the historic White Pass &amp; Yukon Route. Experience a remarkable engineering feat as the iron trail winds through rugged terrain, climbing 3,000 feet over 20 miles with steep grades and cliff-hanging turns.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>South Klondike Highway:</strong> Board your motorcoach and journey across stunning views, passing Tormented Valley and Pitchfork Falls en route to Skagway. Enjoy breathtaking mountain and waterfall scenery along the way. Visit the village of Carcross, home to exceptional handicrafts.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Wild Adventure Yukon:</strong> Delight in a delicious BBQ Chicken Lunch and savor “Granny's famous homemade donuts,” followed by an exploration of the Wildlife Museum's captivating displays of local wildlife and an impressive Ice Age Wooly Mammoth. End your tour on a heartwarming note by interacting with various animals and meeting adorable puppies at the Petting Farm, courtesy of the Whitehorse Humane Society.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What's Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>BBQ Chicken Lunch or Vegetarian Dahl (Red Lentil Stew) and Basmati Rice, baked potatoes, coleslaw, roll and dessert.</li>\n\t<li>Coffee and tea.</li>\n\t<li>Multiple photo stops along the South Klondike Highway.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-ultimate-yukon-and-white-pass-railroad-adventure-172052-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxOTAzMjl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzVaQzlvWmpBdk9EZ3hORFF5T1RVd016VXhPQzVxY0djfDRiZmVlYjhjOGE1YmViOWUzNGM3YWIwMTkyNjI0YWJhNGIwYmFiYTM2NDhmYzNiMGRhOGVmZDMwZGRjNzliOTQ', 'duration': '8.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '172027', 'port_slug': 'skagway', 'title': "Sled Dog Adventure & Musher's Camp", 'slug': 'sled-dog-adventure--musher-s-camp-172027', 'price': 229.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<strong>Sled Dog Adventure:</strong> Immerse yourself in the wondrous world of dog mushing! After the bus ride to camp, board a 4x4 military vehicle for a wild ride up the mountain where you will be greeted by mushers and ecstatic Alaskan huskies! Then, you’ll enjoy a summer sled ride on our custom-built sleds and cruise through the forest, being hauled by these professional athletes. After, learn about the history of dog mushing and soak up some puppy love before perusing the gift shop and returning to town.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Sled ride.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Roundtrip transportation.\n    </li>\n</ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-dog-sled-discovery-and-mushing-camp-skagway-ak-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTkxMzF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzROUzlvT0RNdk9EZ3hORFF5TmpBMk1qZzNPQzVxY0djfDVmMDc2ZTYzOTNmNWQwYjYzMTZlZjZkYjY1YzMxNTNjZGRiMmY3ZjY0MDdkYWFhMWI0ZDhhZGZjNDAyYTFiYmI', 'duration': '3.25 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '172092', 'port_slug': 'skagway', 'title': 'Gold Panning, Sled dogs & Exclusive Scenic Railway', 'slug': 'gold-panning-sled-dogs--exclusive-scenic-railway-172092', 'price': 318.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 8, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>White Pass Railroad Adventure:</strong> Board a private vintage rail car and join an unforgettable journey with your costumed guide aboard the world-famous narrow gauge White Pass and Yukon Route Railroad to the 2,865-ft. White Pass summit. Enjoy a toast and snack at the summit and a rollicking good time on the way back down to Skagway.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sled Dogs Demonstration:</strong> Meet canine athletes that have run the world-famous sled dog race. Hear about the history of this breed, interact with the dogs, and watch them in action as a musher hooks the dogs up for a fast practice lap around the track. The next generation of puppies are there for you to cuddle and hold.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Gold Fever Fun:</strong> Your costumed guide who “lives” in 1898 takes you back in history to reenact the life of 100,000 prospectors during the Gold Rush. Feel the lure of gold and experience how to extract paydirt, help sluice it, and assay the results. Learn the art of gold panning with a humorous and educational show. Practice your technique in heated water troughs. Gold is guaranteed and so is a good time!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Narrated bus trip.</li>\n\t<li>Private railway car ride on the White Pass and Yukon Route Railroad.</li>\n\t<li>Sled Dogs Demonstration.</li>\n\t<li>Opportunity to hold the puppies.</li>\n\t<li>Gold! It’s yours to keep!</li>\n\t<li>Costumed personal guide.</li>\n\t<li>Snack.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/172092-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDUwMjJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREJtTDJnMU5pODRPVGMyTVRrek56Z3hOemt3THpFM01qQTVNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkMDhlN2NkYWY3MDVkMTZjYTU0MjIwNTFlMzFlYmEwZWVmNDE1NTZjODkxZDlmM2M3ZGQxZjhmMmZiYjZjNzE4', 'duration': '6.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': '1'},
    {'code': '172006', 'port_slug': 'skagway', 'title': 'White Pass Summit Excursion', 'slug': 'white-pass-summit-excursion-172006', 'price': 190.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.4, 'review_count': 18, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>White Pass Train:</strong> Embark on the historic White Pass &amp; Yukon Route Railway, tracing its origins to the 1898 Klondike Gold Rush. Journey through rugged terrain on a vintage parlor car, witnessing the breathtaking Alaskan wilderness and notable landmarks like Rocky Point, Bridal Veil Falls, and Inspiration Point. Ascend the steep grade to the White Pass Summit, marking the U.S.-Canada border, before retracing the route back to Skagway. Experience over 120 years of history on this enduring narrow-gauge railway.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What's Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Bottled water.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-white-pass-summit-excursion-172006-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNTg5NDZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3dOUzlvTTJFdk9EZ3hORFF5TXpNeE1ETTJOaTVxY0djfDkwZTZlNDI1YjVhMmQ2M2E4MGMyMTFiYTBkMzk0NTExZDcxY2JkYWNjNTFkNWUyYzdlMmFjOTUxNTEyNzFhNmE', 'duration': '2.45 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
