    {'code': '430004', 'port_slug': 'st-croix', 'title': 'Historical Walking Tour of Christiansted', 'slug': 'historical-walking-tour-of-christiansted-430004', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-historical-walking-tour-of-christiansted-st-croix-usvi-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMzExNzJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNNQzlvT0RFdk9EZ3hORFEzTXpjd056VTFNQzVxY0djfDc4ZDgxYTU2NGEyMDFjYzMyNjI2OTAxNDk4M2Q1NmM2YjE2NGE3NGIxOWE1YjBlNTIzOTFkODk0NTViZTRjYzc&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '227012', 'port_slug': 'st-john-s', 'title': 'Wild Newfoundland: Sea, Sky & Sea Life', 'slug': 'wild-newfoundland-sea-sky--sea-life-227012', 'price': 229.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Sea &amp; Sky:</strong> Travel from the port to Bay Bulls on a scenic drive with informative commentary, then after a brief orientation, board your boat for a memorable wildlife cruise where seabirds dive for food, Bald Eagles soar overhead, sunlight glints off towering icebergs, and marine life can be seen in its natural habitat with guidance from knowledgeable staff.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Witless Wonders:</strong> Cruise through Witless Bay Ecological Reserve, home to North America’s largest Atlantic puffin colony with more than 500,000 puffins, plus millions of seabirds including Common Murres, Black-legged Kittiwakes and Razorbill Auks. Watch for Humpback whales as they breach, frolic and slap their pectoral fins, and take in stunning coastal views.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>A visit to Witless Bay Ecological Reserve.</li>\n\t<li>Wildlife Cruise.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/227012-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMjEyMzJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0UwTDJneVpTODVOalUwTXpZMU1EWXhNVFV3THpJeU56QXhNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2NzIzZjEzZTZmYjBlZGU0Y2Q1MmJhNDA5OGFlYTk5NDZjMzY2OGNkN2E4YTliODA5ODgwODZlNDJkYmUyZTM0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '227010', 'port_slug': 'st-john-s', 'title': 'Picture-Perfect St. John’s', 'slug': 'picture-perfect-st-john-s-227010', 'price': 104.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/227010-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTA5Nzl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREl4TDJobE55ODVOalUwTXpZek9EUTROek0wTHpJeU56QXhNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhZjY5MjRjZDk5YTEwYWQ3MDllZTdjOTYyZmM1Nzc1ZjliODFlN2ZmNTRiMmRmY2NhYTU0ZWI2MzRhYjE4MWU4', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '227011', 'port_slug': 'st-john-s', 'title': "St. John's Sip, Savor, & Stroll", 'slug': 'st-john-s-sip-savor--stroll-227011', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Coastal Flavors:</strong> Taste authentic Newfoundland cuisine on a guided culinary walk through the heart of St. John’s, featuring local culture, warm hospitality, and beloved dining stops. Kick off the experience at a contemporary eatery with a thoughtfully prepared appetizer, such as cod tongues or mussels, showcasing coastal flavors with a modern twist.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Pub Grub:</strong> Enjoy a brief stroll to a quaint local pub, renowned for its cozy ambiance and hearty comfort food. Indulge in the city's signature fish and chips while enjoying the lively atmosphere and traditional charm.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Signature Sweets:</strong> The journey continues at a top-tier eatery, featuring a dessert that reinterprets classic Newfoundland flavors with a fresh, creative touch.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Bold Brews:</strong> Cap your day at a locally acclaimed craft brewery nestled in a historic building. Savor a flight or pint of small-batch beers, expertly brewed onsite, and toast to Newfoundland’s vibrant culinary legacy and innovative flavors.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included: </strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Downtown walking tour with local food and beer tasting (three stops).</li>\n\t<li>Small group experience.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/227011-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTQ2Njh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREEyTDJnNE9DODVOalUwTXpZME5UQTBNRGswTHpJeU56QXhNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w1YTFkMjA2ZDBmMWY5NTBiOTY5ODg3MWQ2OTM1N2RkNDliMmZhYTk3MTFkNDc4MTk1NGU0OGMwNjEzMTdmN2Ez', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '431001', 'port_slug': 'st-kitts', 'title': 'St. Kitts by Rail & Scenic Drive', 'slug': 'st-kitts-by-rail--scenic-drive-431001', 'price': 124.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Double-deck Railcars:</strong> Hop on double-decker railcars for an enriching ride along the Northeastern coastline, where sweeping views of sugarcane fields, farms and quaint villages await. Enjoy the comfort of air conditioning as you gaze through the expansive vaulted windows below or the open-air observation deck with panoramic views above, complete with complimentary drinks and snacks. Let the sound of island music and engaging narratives guide you through this beautiful journey.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Scenic Drive:</strong> Journey along the stunning Southwestern coast aboard the Scenic Railway’s sightseeing buses, passing iconic sites like Brimstone Hill Fortress and the grave of Thomas Jefferson’s great-grandfather. Snap photos of Egrets nesting like flowers in trees and enjoy views of Nevis, the birthplace of Alexander Hamilton. Wrap up your scenic adventure with a drive through quaint villages back to your ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Complimentary specialty drinks and snacks on the train.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-st-kitts-scenic-railway-tour-3.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMzk0NTB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGtPUzlvTTJFdk9EZ3hORFEwT1RZMU5UZ3pPQzVxY0djfDE3NmRiMTNmZGI0ODc2ZWNmZDZlNmM3MDlkZjg3N2E0NDM1YzZmMjI1MmUwZDdmM2RhMDI1YzllMDZkZDMwMDk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '431051', 'port_slug': 'st-kitts', 'title': 'Top 10 Best of St. Kitts', 'slug': 'top-10-best-of-st-kitts-431051', 'price': 79.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.3, 'review_count': 153, 'desc_html': '<strong>Georges Anglican Church and Co-Cathedral Catholic Church:</strong> View the historical remains of colonial architectural buildings, historical attractions, the state St. Georges Anglican Church and Co-cathedral Catholic churches, dating back to the 17th century. Your informative driver guide will not only highlight the areas but entertain you en route. <br /><br /> <strong>Cenotaph:</strong> Built to commemorate the local soldiers who were killed in World War I and II. <br /><br /> <strong>Brimstone Hill Fortress National Park:</strong> UNESCO World Heritage Site, an impressive fort perched above the Caribbean Sea. <br /><br /> <strong>Timothy Hill:</strong> The most popular photo stop on the island.', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-top-10-best-of-st-kitts-st-kitts-wi-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNDEyMjh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzFOaTlvTW1Zdk9EZ3hORFExTlRFNU16WXpNQzVxY0djfDc0ZDRlYWFjNWY5YTg2NzQwNTJkNDAzMDBlYzg0OGY5OWNkYTRhMjRjMzYzMjE0ZmE1ZmIyZjgzYjhlNTI4ZTA', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '431054', 'port_slug': 'st-kitts', 'title': 'Dolphin Swim', 'slug': 'dolphin-swim-431054', 'price': 149.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.7, 'review_count': 55, 'desc_html': "<strong>Dolphin Swim:</strong> It is time to meet your dolphin pal! Fun awaits you for your chance to join your dolphin for a smile, caress, and swim. Enjoy this rare opportunity to touch the sleek and playful marine mammal and pose for the dolphin smile. You'll be led into deeper waters where you'll swim with your dolphin. Be amazed by your dolphin's speed, grace and agility as they perform fast swims, high jumps and other breathtaking moves.", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Dolphin-Push-Pull-Swim-8.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNTgxNDR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzFNQzlvTnpZdk9EZ3hORFExTlRjeE56a3hPQzVxY0djfDk0ZDE5MjQ4YWJmYmZiYmNiNjRkMWQ4YTQxZDA5OGQwZmEyYTYxYmQyYzgwYjBkMGY2N2NmMWYyNGZjNGEzMzg', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '431043', 'port_slug': 'st-kitts', 'title': 'Catamaran Snorkel, Nevis Beach with Lunch & Drinks', 'slug': 'catamaran-snorkel-nevis-beach-with-lunch--drinks-431043', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.5, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Catamaran Snorkel:</strong> After a brief walk to your catamaran, cruise along the picturesque coastline, flanked by both mountains and the Caribbean Sea. At a scenic cliff-side cove, grab your snorkeling gear and dive in to explore vibrant tropical fish, sea fans, sponges, and unique volcanic rock formations.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Pinney's Beach:</strong> Enjoy a scenic sail across the Narrows, a 2-mile channel that divides St. Kitts and Nevis, and arrive at the stunning Pinney's Beach. With Mount Nevis as a backdrop, savor a delicious onboard lunch, then relax on the beach before sailing back to your ship.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Snorkeling equipment.</li>\n\t<li>Lunch and open bar.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-catamaran-fan-ta-sea-and-nevis-beach-break-st-kitts-wi-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNzM0MDF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzVOeTlvTTJVdk9EZ3hORFExTXpRMU5qa3lOaTVxY0djfGIxYTBhYzk2MThkMmIwMzMzYTdlYmFlZGZjOWYxZWQ1YjE0ODhiNTYzYjNlZjhiMDM2ZmJlMjFjNjAwYWE2MDM', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
