    {'code': '432032', 'port_slug': 'st-lucia', 'title': 'Dolphin & Whale Watch Safari', 'slug': 'dolphin--whale-watch-safari-432032', 'price': 99.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y02-dolphin-and-whale-watch-safari-st-lucia-wi-2.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTc2MDR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzJOaTlvWm1Rdk9EZ3hORFEwTURBMU5EZ3hOQzVxY0djfDRkOTZiNTJkM2I3NjI2NWUwYTJjNTIyYTdkMjU3ZTMyOWVhMDM5MTIxZmU0N2M1MGIwYjYyNWQ3NDg3ZWNlYWU&w=700&h=550&resize_profile=pdpgallery', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '432057', 'port_slug': 'st-lucia', 'title': 'Snorkel Between the Pitons', 'slug': 'snorkel-between-the-pitons-432057', 'price': 74.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 2, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-snorkel-between-the-pitons-st-lucia-wi-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMTQzODZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGxNaTlvTlRRdk9EZ3hORFEwTWpjd09UQXlNaTVxY0djfDE2MjhjMmQzNzE2ODNlNzdlYmJiMDk2NjM3ZjU4MDYyNTY3YjM3NjE2MGU3ZGI0ZjYwZThlNWJkNGM2MDZmYTI&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '433007', 'port_slug': 'st-maarten', 'title': 'Explorer French & Dutch by Land & Sea', 'slug': 'explorer-french--dutch-by-land--sea-433007', 'price': 78.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.4, 'review_count': 7, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Island Cruise:</strong>Cruise through Simpson Bay Lagoon aboard the double-decked Explorer. Relax on spacious sun decks or shaded areas while enjoying unlimited rum punch from two onboard bars. This scenic ride offers a laid-back way to explore the island.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Marigot:</strong> Stroll through the heart of Marigot and discover its charming shops and cozy cafes.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Island Highlights:</strong> Discover the rich history of the island as you pass scenic coastal towns like Grand Case and Orient Bay. Enjoy captivating views and cultural insights along the way.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Phillipsburg:</strong> Cross from the French Quarter to the Dutch side and explore Phillipsburg. If time allows, enjoy shopping along Front Street before returning to the ship.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-explorer-cruise-and-island-tour-st-maarten-na-4.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNDEzMDV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzRaQzlvWmpRdk9EZ3hORFEzTmpVNU1URXpOQzVxY0djfGI5MjdmMGI4ZmQ2NWM2OGIxZjM2YmNiYjA2NWQ3OTM3ZDIxZjBjZGI4YTg3M2EyNjg5OTI4ZGUzNjczNWQyY2Q', 'duration': '4.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '433053', 'port_slug': 'st-maarten', 'title': 'Ultimate Snorkel & Beach Escape', 'slug': 'ultimate-snorkel--beach-escape-433053', 'price': 108.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.8, 'review_count': 12, 'desc_html': "<strong>Scenic Cruise:</strong> Cruise along the coast to Simpson Bay Lagoon and pass under the Dutch Draw Bridge. Enjoy views of luxury yachts of the rich and famous while your guide shares the history of St Maarten.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Snorkel Adventure:</strong> Glide out of the French Bridge to your first snorkeling stop, where vibrant coral reefs and tropical fish await. Discover the underwater beauty of St. Maarten in a serene setting.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Beach Break:</strong> Head to one of the Caribbean's most beautiful beaches for an hour of swimming and relaxation followed by a complimentary open bar.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Eyes on the Sky:</strong> As you leave the beach, travel by the world-renowned Princess Juliana airport. This iconic spot offers a rare chance to see planes flying just above you.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Snorkeling gear and life vests.</li>\n\t<li>Soft drinks, water, beer and rum punch after snorkeling.</li>\n</ul>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-starfish-cove-beach-and-snorkel-by-powerboat-st-maarten-na-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0ODUwOHxpbWFnZS9qcGVnfGFXMWhaMlZ6TDJnNU1DOW9ZVE12T0RneE5EUTRNVEkzTmprMU9DNXFjR2N8MzNlMzg4MjM4MTFiY2E3NmViMTllZmY5ZmQwYzhjODJiYTg1ODVkNjE4MzU0OTNlYjgxZDRiOWEwNTEzNTQ2OA', 'duration': '3.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '6'},
    {'code': '433105', 'port_slug': 'st-maarten', 'title': 'The Big 3: Zip, Slide & Fly', 'slug': 'the-big-3-zip-slide--fly-433105', 'price': 144.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Fly High:</strong> Ride a scenic chair lift to one of the highest peaks in St Maarten. Enjoy sweeping views of the island and nearby Caribbean destinations.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sentry Hill Zip:</strong> Face your fears as you fly down the steepest zipline in the world on the zip lines of Sentry Hill. Take in breathtaking scenery while enjoying one of the island's most exhilarating attractions.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Scenic Slide:</strong> Experience the thrill of the Caribbean's first waterless tube ride as you slide down scenic slopes. This gravity-powered adventure offers high-speed fun without the splash.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Access to all four attractions at Rockland Estate.</li>\n\t<li>Free Wi-Fi.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Flying-Dutchman.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0NTQ1NjZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzFZUzlvTTJFdk9EZ3hORFE1TWpBeU5EZzJNaTVxY0djfDhkMTY4YjMwNjZkMDM1Y2U0ZDE1MzU2ZDJkZjQ0OGU4NDg1MjUwZGY2Mzc5ZTJiODQzZTQwMGJlYzFiNTllNzc', 'duration': '6.0 Hours', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': '8'},
    {'code': '433013', 'port_slug': 'st-maarten', 'title': 'St. Maarten Island Tour', 'slug': 'st-maarten-island-tour-433013', 'price': 36.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.7, 'review_count': 3, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Dutch Side:</strong> See downtown Philipsburg, the capital of the Dutch side. View many important homes and businesses as you travel along Perimeter Road towards the lookout point.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>French Side:</strong> Depart the harbor with sightseeing to Marigot, the French capital. Stop at Marigot for 30 minutes to enjoy browsing and duty-free shops, open-air markets and take photos of yachts and local fishing boats in the harbor. Drive past the resort areas, featuring many luxury hotels and resorts.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cole Bay Lookout Point:</strong> Short stop at the Cole Bay Lookout Point, which serves up as a picturesque Simpson Bay Lagoon view. Our neighboring islands appear on favorable weather conditions.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-st-maarten-island-tour-st-maarten-na-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyMzEyNjV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaG1NUzlvTkRBdk9EZ3hORFEzT0RBMk5UWTVOQzVxY0djfDQxYjE5NDU1Yjc5ZWMwOWU1NDg4MjFmNzU4ZjAwYzBkZjk4NzM5MjQ1NzE5NThhZjQwYmM4MTY0MDhjNmQ2MTM', 'duration': '2.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Easy', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '433132', 'port_slug': 'st-maarten', 'title': 'Spirit of St Maarten Luxury VIP Snorkel Cruise', 'slug': 'spirit-of-st-maarten-luxury-vip-snorkel-cruise-433132', 'price': 128.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.7, 'review_count': 21, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Spirit of St. Maarten:</strong> You’ll begin your VIP marine adventure on board our custom-built 114-ft. wooden schooner, the only vessel of its kind on St. Maarten. It is owned by a charitable foundation, with some of its proceeds going toward a range of charitable development initiatives for the island’s foster care programs and youths.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Enjoy:</strong> Your journey begins with a welcome tropical juice as the boat navigates the panoramic southern coast of St. Maarten. These waters are connected to beaches and bays that make up one of the jewels of the Leeward Islands.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Swim &amp; Snorkel, Kayak, Paddleboard:</strong>&nbsp;Once anchored at the destination, you can take a refreshing dip in the crystal-clear waters of the Caribbean or snorkel and explore the tropical wildlife swimming around you. For those who enjoy more variety, kayaking and paddleboarding are available and included. Your trained crew will be happy to offer support and assistance if needed.</p>\n<p><br />\n<strong>Lunch:</strong> After exploring in the water, pick your favorite spot, relax and be treated to an open bar and a freshly grilled lunch prepared by your onboard chef. As your homeward-bound cruise begins, take in the views from a sundeck or find a shaded spot and relax while enjoying first-class service at every turn. As you sail east, you’ll pass the airport with its world famous “over the beach” landings and continue on toward Philipsburg and your ship’s harbor.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/433132-hero.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDAzMjl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR0U0TDJnM055ODRPVFUxT0RRNE5qZzNOalEyTHpRek16RXpNaTFvWlhKdkxtcHdad3w4ZDk1NWQ5NmI1NGNmYTBjZjFlZGJiNTA1YmFkNjU2Y2E0Yjc4MjgwZTM1NzBlNTY1ODA5YTlhMjkxMzMyNDYz', 'duration': '3.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '10'},
