    {'code': '863005', 'port_slug': 'st-peter-port', 'title': 'Guernsey by Bike', 'slug': 'guernsey-by-bike-863005', 'price': 169.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/863005-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTI5MzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREkyTDJoaE5DODVOVEE0T1RFM05URXdNVGMwTHpnMk16QXdOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3MTJkMmJlNDU0YzM0YjI3ZDVjODZkMjYzYmMzMjIyOTlmM2QxYzRhMmY4ZDRiNDc1YjVlZDU1MjEyY2VkNjRl', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '863004', 'port_slug': 'st-peter-port', 'title': 'Guernsey’s German Occupation Experience', 'slug': 'guernsey-s-german-occupation-experience-863004', 'price': 199.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>German Occupation History:</strong> Uncover the daily life of Guernsey under German occupation during World War II and its enduring legacy. Visit the German Military Museum to explore air-conditioned tunnels that housed U-boat fuel tanks, filled with compelling themed wartime exhibits.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Underground Hospital:</strong> Witness, the largest surviving structure from the Occupation era in the Channel Islands, an underground complex that boasts wards, operating theaters, and support areas chiseled deep into solid rock.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Pleinmont Cliffs:</strong> Experience the stunning coastal scenery at Pleinmont Cliffs while exploring the dramatic gun emplacements and fortifications along Guernsey's west coast.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Local Delights:</strong> Stop for a delightful treat of tea or coffee and Guernsey gâche.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Guided sightseeing tour by coach.</li>\n\t<li>Entrance to the German Military Museum.</li>\n\t<li>Visit to the Underground Hospital.</li>\n\t<li>Tea or coffee with traditional Guernsey gâche.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/863004-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNjU3NjZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR00wTDJoaU5DODVOVEE0T1RFM01EVXhOREl5THpnMk16QXdOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzYjMxYWMwMDNkMzlmNmI3NGM2YWQ0NTliODc0MGI2MWFiNmIzNGEyNDM1MzlkMDgwMzQ0MmExYzg2MDIwODJk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '863006', 'port_slug': 'st-peter-port', 'title': 'Historic Town Walk & Cream Tea', 'slug': 'historic-town-walk--cream-tea-863006', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>St. Peter Stroll:</strong> Experience the beauty of St Peter Port on a guided walking tour through its charming streets and narrow alleyways. Marvel at the scenic marina and the historic Castle Cornet, a fortress that has stood since the 13th century.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Candie Gardens:</strong> Wander through Candie Gardens, where Victorian-era elegance meets stunning views that overlook the town and the sparkling sea.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Victor Hugo:</strong> Delve into the life of Victor Hugo on Guernsey, the island where he wrote much of Les Misérables during his stay.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Local Delights:</strong> Delight in a traditional Guernsey cream tea at the Duke of Richmond Hotel. Savor freshly baked scones with jam and Guernsey cream while sipping on a refreshing cup of tea or coffee.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Guided walking tour of St. Peter Port.</li>\n\t<li>Visit to Candie Gardens.</li>\n\t<li>Traditional Guernsey cream tea with scones, jam, Guernsey cream, tea or coffee.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/863006-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNzQzNzB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFEzTDJnME1DODVOVEE0T1RFNE16azBPVEV3THpnMk16QXdOaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyZjFiYWFiZDhhMzgxYWM4ZjllYmYzZTYwMGVmYmQ5MGJkZTRmNzNlMDA5NmIxMTAxYjllYjRkZDRlN2EzMjA1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '434037', 'port_slug': 'st-thomas', 'title': 'Turtle Cove Sail & Snorkel With Open Bar', 'slug': 'turtle-cove-sail--snorkel-with-open-bar-434037', 'price': 102.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.8, 'review_count': 8, 'desc_html': '<strong>Turtle Cove Sail:</strong> Experience the thrill of sailing the crystal-clear Caribbean waters in a 65-foot catamaran followed by snorkeling around the world-famous Buck Island. You will enjoy a relaxing sailing experience before your Captain drops anchor at one of the magnificent coves near the island.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>Snorkel Adventure:</strong> No matter your skill level, you will be at ease snorkeling in these waters that feature an abundance of colorful tropical fish and brilliant corals. If you prefer to relax, you can go for a swim in the Caribbean Sea before soaking up the sun on the open deck.\n<br /><br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong>\n<ul>\n    <li>\n        Snorkel equipment.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Unlimited rum punch.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Complimentary soda/fruit punch.\n    </li>\n</ul>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-turtle-cove-sail-and-snorkel-st-thomas-usvi-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxODUzNDl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3dOUzlvTnpVdk9EZ3hNalV6T0RjMU56RTFNQzVxY0djfGE0OGJlMTI1ZDUwYjUyZjkwNzFiZTM3Zjk0N2QwMjljN2MwYjc3OGZjZjllYmU3ZGIxNGYyOGVjYzQ5NjdiZjA', 'duration': '3.0 Hours', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': '6'},
    {'code': '434056', 'port_slug': 'st-thomas', 'title': 'BOSS Underwater Adventure', 'slug': 'boss-underwater-adventure-434056', 'price': 154.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.2, 'review_count': 12, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Scenic Cruise:</strong> Board a 60-foot dive yacht for a scenic cruise to a tropical reef. Enjoy stunning ocean views as you head to your underwater adventure.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Underwater Explorations:</strong> Discover the underwater world with a guided B.O.S.S. (Breathing Observation Submersible Scooter) scooter tour through colorful reefs and marine life. Afterward, enjoy snorkeling or relax with snacks and drinks on the sun deck.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-boss-underwater-adventure-st-thomas-usvi-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w4MDQ3OXxpbWFnZS9qcGVnfGFXMWhaMlZ6TDJnM1pTOW9ZVFF2T0RneE1qVXpPVFEwTlRJM09DNXFjR2N8YzFhODM4ZTE5Nzk3Nzc3NjBlOTQzMjM3ZDM0Yjc5MTA1MTdjYzFhOWM0ODk5MjgxZjVjYTlmODczMjc1NDliMA', 'duration': '3.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '10'},
    {'code': '434078', 'port_slug': 'st-thomas', 'title': 'Fast Cat Turtle Bay Snorkel & Beach Time', 'slug': 'fast-cat-turtle-bay-snorkel--beach-time-434078', 'price': 98.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.6, 'review_count': 25, 'desc_html': "<p>Set sail on a Power Cat for an unforgettable Caribbean adventure filled with snorkeling at Buck Island and beach time at a secluded beach.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Buck Island:</strong> Embark on an unforgettable snorkeling adventure at Buck Island, where you'll sail on a Power Cat and dive into crystal-clear waters teeming with vibrant tropical fish and curious sea turtles. Enjoy an hour of exploration among stunning coral formations.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Secluded Beach:</strong> Set sail to a hidden Caribbean beach, accessible exclusively by boat, and enjoy an hour of bliss swimming, sunbathing, and relaxing in the beautiful turquoise waters.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Sips &amp; Sights:</strong> Enjoy a scenic cruise back to your ship, where you'll take in stunning views and savor complimentary rum punch to keep the fun going.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What's Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Snorkel equipment (mask, fins, snorkel).</li>\n\t<li>Beverages: Water, sodas, and rum punch.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-DSC-3698.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w0MTU3Nzd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNNUzlvTkRNdk9EZ3hORFEyTWpBd09UTTNOQzVxY0djfDZiMTY5MWUxYzVjM2RiOTEwNDgxYWJmZDFkNTUyNGU0NDU3OWU1MzBkOTE4OTRjMjJiYzQ0MzFhYTc2YmFkNGI', 'duration': '3.5 Hours', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': '5'},
    {'code': '434125', 'port_slug': 'st-thomas', 'title': "Magen's Bay Beach & Skyride to Paradise Point", 'slug': 'magen-s-bay-beach--skyride-to-paradise-point-434125', 'price': 92.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 7, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Drake's Seat:</strong> Head to Drake’s Seat for breathtaking views and a chance to snap unforgettable photos. This famous overlook is steeped in legend as the command post of Sir Frances Drake. A must-see stop for history and nature lovers.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Magen’s Bay:</strong> Unwind at the heart shaped, palm lined, Magen's Bay, where turquoise waters and white sands create a peaceful escape. Treat yourself to a meal at the Hungry cafeteria or sip a cold drink from the beach bar, available for purchase, then visit the gift shop for souvenirs. After two hours, meet your driver to continue the journey.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>SkyRide to Paradise Point:</strong> Ride the SkyRide to Paradise Point and ascend 700 feet above sea level for stunning views of St Thomas. Enjoy panoramic sights of the harbor and your cruise ship below. Capture memorable photos and explore local shops and eateries at the summit. Your admission bracelet allows for a smooth return to the main street, across from the port.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Beach admission.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Big-Covered-Deck.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w5NjEyMzN8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzBNUzlvTVRndk9EZ3hORFEyT1RRME56Y3hNQzVxY0djfGM1MWViYjQzZjE0NDZmMTJjNzZiOTUwNGZhZTYyNDkxZWRmMDU5YjA0MmFiNGE0NTk5NzVlMTQwMzk0ZDYzMDM', 'duration': '3.5 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '434178', 'port_slug': 'st-thomas', 'title': 'Kayak, Hike & Snorkel at Cas Cay', 'slug': 'kayak-hike--snorkel-at-cas-cay-434178', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 4, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Mangrove Kayak:</strong> Kayak through the serene channels of the St. Thomas Mangrove Lagoon Wildlife Sanctuary in a comfortable two-person sit-on-top kayak. Enjoy the calm waters and observe the vibrant wildlife of this protected coastal environment.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Nature Walk:</strong> Discover the beauty of Cas Cay, an uninhabited island, with a guided trek along a coastal trail that winds through mangroves and coral, shell and sand rubble. Spot hermit crabs in their natural habitat and explore tidal pools, before witnessing the Red Point blowhole where sea spray erupts against towering cliffs.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Shallow-Water Snorkel:</strong> Experience guided snorkeling in the serene waters of a shallow mangrove lagoon, where young marine life thrives. This relaxed adventure allows you to enjoy the clear Caribbean water before paddling back to the marina.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Kayak and paddle.</li>\n\t<li>Life jacket.</li>\n\t<li>Snorkel mask and snorkel.</li>\n\t<li>Drinking water.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/434178-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTY4MzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1EzTDJoa09TODVNVE00TmprMk1Ea3pOekkyTHpRek5ERTNPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wwZWJjODE5YmY5MzYxMTk1YzhjYzIzMjAwYmY2OTc1MWMzYzFmMTAxZTg0OTQ4ODQ5ZGU0ODYyYzdmYTViZmRm', 'duration': '4.0 Hours', 'activity_level': 'Moderate', 'min_age': '4'},
