    {'code': '868018', 'port_slug': 'valletta', 'title': 'Valletta Walking Tour & Cinema 5D Experience', 'slug': 'valletta-walking-tour--cinema-5d-experience-868018', 'price': 69.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/868018-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDUwNDd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFpqTDJoaE1pODVNREUxT1Rrek56azBOVGt3THpnMk9EQXhPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3wzMTNhNDNmYjgyMTgxMTRjYTI1ZTUwNmM1Zjk4YmI0NDY5NzZiMDZhZTdhMzM1YjVlOWE0ZmQ4MmI0YjcyYzk2&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '868015', 'port_slug': 'valletta', 'title': 'Taste of Malta', 'slug': 'taste-of-malta-868015', 'price': 89.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/Taste-of-Malta-HERO-.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTUxNzR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGpOeTlvT1RFdk9EZ3pNakl6TWpJeU5qZzBOaTVxY0djfDVhMWY5YmFlZjUyMzk0MzQzM2EzYmI0MGNkZjU1NzM3ZmE4ZjI3MWQwMmRkMDFkMGZjNmZjMDdkZTIwZjUxMGI&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '230048', 'port_slug': 'victoria', 'title': 'Oh Canada Night Light City Tour featuring Timbits', 'slug': 'oh-canada-night-light-city-tour-featuring-timbits-230048', 'price': 94.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 2.8, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>City Tour:</strong> See picturesque Victoria on this evening, entertaining tour with a distinctly sweet Canadian flavor. Drive along the water and take in the city's iconic landmarks along the way, noting Mile Zero which is the start of the nearly 5,000-mile-long Trans-Canada Highway. Pass by Beacon Hill Park, see the oldest Chinatown in Canada, as well as the stately Empress Hotel and Legislature building in Victoria's beautiful Inner Harbour. You will have a brief stop for a photo opportunity to capture the Inner Harbour with the night lights aglow. A Canadian trivia quiz will entertain you along the way – with prizes, of course – ensuring that you learn a little about the area!<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Tim Hortons:</strong> What's the big deal about Tim Hortons? You're about to find out as you stop for coffee and a small snack at this Canadian institution – a fast-food chain that is virtually synonymous with Canadians.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Parting Gift:</strong> A Canadian goodie bag is yours to enjoy, with chips, a chocolate bar, maple candy and a Canadian souvenir.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Snacks from Tim Hortons.</li>\n\t<li>Canadian souvenir goodie bag.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/230048-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE4Nzh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRE0xTDJnd1l5ODRPVFkxTnprNU9UWTROems0THpJek1EQTBPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xkMjNjNTg3OGExNzhiZTZkMTQ0ODZmYTVkOGFlZTZiN2I1NzdiNDdjMDdkYTY4YmIxMDRjMGY3YzdmNjcyOTIx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '230054', 'port_slug': 'victoria', 'title': 'Enchanting Butchart Gardens', 'slug': 'enchanting-butchart-gardens-230054', 'price': 141.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Butchart Gardens:</strong> Explore the National Historic Site of Butchart Gardens, spanning 55 acres of walking trails that connect lavish floral gardens, cascading fountains, ponds, and rock gardens. Amidst the enchanting floral aroma, embark on a self-guided tour through various themed gardens, including The Rose Garden, The Japanese Garden, The Italian Garden, and Butchart’s renowned Sunken Garden. Consistently ranked as one of the top display gardens in the world, Butchart Gardens transforms into a magical wonderland at night with beautiful illuminations.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Drive through Town:</strong> After experiencing the beauty of Butchart Gardens, continue your journey to Victoria’s Inner Harbour to see the iconic Empress Hotel and BC Legislative Buildings before making your way back to the cruise terminal.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Narrated tour.</li>\n\t<li>Entrance fees to Butchart Gardens.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/230054-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODUyODR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1psTDJnNE5DODVNREl5TVRNMU5qazNORE00THpJek1EQTFOQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0YjYxZGYwNDQwNDMzNDg4YTkwZTM4NmY5YjkyMjRmZWQxZTA1MjJlMzg4ZWMxNzIyMTBjNmM3OWMxMzgyM2Y1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '230060', 'port_slug': 'victoria', 'title': 'Victoria’s Heritage and Holy Places', 'slug': 'victoria-s-heritage-and-holy-places-230060', 'price': 90.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>City Highlights:</strong> Visit serene Beacon Hill Park to photograph majestic Garry oak trees, then pass the impressive Saint John the Divine and United Commons churches. Cruise along the Inner Harbour with views of Parliament, the Fairmont Empress Hotel, and the Royal BC Museum, ending with a downtown photo stop.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Cathedral:</strong> Explore this historic cathedral at your own pace, featuring a magnificent gallery organ crafted by Hellmuth Wolff &amp; Associés Ltée in 2005. Boasting 4,000 pipes and four manuals plus a pedal, it’s the largest organ on Vancouver Island and among the finest in North America.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Private access to cathedral.</li>\n\t<li>Canadian souvenir.</li>\n\t<li>Photo stops.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/230060-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyNTcxNjJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFF5TDJnd055ODVNVE13TkRVMU5UazNNRGcyTHpJek1EQTJNQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2MTY4YzUwZDVkZWY1Mzg5OTA5MTU0NzY0MGQ0Yjc3MWFiMWYzYzA5NDYyMDE3ODU0MTYwYTQ4ZmFiMDQ1Y2Yx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '230053', 'port_slug': 'victoria', 'title': 'Victoria By Horse Drawn Trolley', 'slug': 'victoria-by-horse-drawn-trolley-230053', 'price': 88.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.6, 'review_count': 5, 'desc_html': "<p><strong>Horse Trolley:</strong> Step back in time and experience old Victoria on this perfectly paced tour aboard a horse-drawn trolley. Your journey begins at Ogden Point Pier and takes you through the historic James Bay neighborhood and into Victoria’s famed Inner Harbour. Here, you'll see the Royal BC Museum and the iconic Fairmont Empress Hotel, known as the castle on the coast. If your tour takes place at night, prepare to be dazzled by the thousands of lights illuminating British Columbia’s stately Legislative Buildings. Blankets are provided to keep you warm on cool evenings, and the passenger area is covered for your comfort.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Narrated trolley ride through the downtown highlights of Victoria.</li>\n\t<li>Blankets on cool evenings.</li>\n</ul>\n", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/230053-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTU1MjR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREV3TDJoaVlTODVOakUzTXpBek5qTXpPVFV3THpJek1EQTFNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3wyZDExOGU5MGYxNGIwZWM5ODE5ZDAxMzkzYzc0YmY4ZjFkYjVhYjg3NzdmYmM4ODE3NzkwMzVlOTZkODZkYmNk', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
