    {'code': '230052', 'port_slug': 'victoria', 'title': 'Deluxe Butchart Gardens & Tim Hortons', 'slug': 'deluxe-butchart-gardens--tim-hortons-230052', 'price': 126.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/230052-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODY3MTR8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREUyTDJobU15ODVNREl5TVRNME5URTNOemt3THpJek1EQTFNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w3MzQyMGVmZWI4ZWRhNmVhMWZlNWRjMjFmYjE1ZjYwMzE0MTQxNzc5YzBkYjNjNzMzMGIzMmMyNzFlN2Q4MWUw&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '799020', 'port_slug': 'vigo', 'title': 'Tale of Two Cities', 'slug': 'tale-of-two-cities-799020', 'price': 134.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p>Depart from Vigo to the south of the province of Pontevedra, crossing the Portuguese border to arrive at the village of Valensa do Minho. Follow a guided tour to explore the city's fortress, before having some free time for independent exploration. Your next stop will return you to Spain for a tour of the beautiful walled medieval city of Tui. Visit the imposing 12th century cathedral, which was converted into a fortress to protect against invasion. With incredible contrasting views, the city of Tui and Valensa provide a glimpse into the shared history of these two countries.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Tale-of-two-cities-10.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNDI4NDd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyaGlPQzlvTXpjdk9EZ3hORFV3TXpBek5Ea3hNQzVxY0djfDZiMzVmNTFhNjc2YzJkZWMyZTJjZWFhMDBiNmY5OWExODUwODA3ZWFjMzQ2MWMxZjczMGE3ODc0OGU2Yzc0ZTQ', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '799022', 'port_slug': 'vigo', 'title': 'Vigo & Bayona', 'slug': 'vigo--bayona-799022', 'price': 139.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p>On this tour you will enjoy the beauty of the Southern Galicia, beginning with a drive up to Monte La Guia. Here you will find incredible views of city, river, and your ship from Monte La Guia. The tour will then continue to Baiona, one of the most significant fisherman villages of the Galician coastline. Here, you will visit the remains of the old walls dated from the 16th century, and view monuments that tell the villages’ rich history. Visit the town's incredible 13th century church and the historic Monterreal Castle.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/799022-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTg2NzF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1E1TDJnNE1pODRPVEE0TkRNeU5EUXhNemMwTHpjNU9UQXlNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlYjJkZDljYWYyNzMyNjBjZGYyOWIyZTc5NTc5YWNjODVmMGU2OWRmMmQ4Mzc0MjIzZjVmMmJkNTdhZTAxNzU1', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '799021', 'port_slug': 'vigo', 'title': 'Full Discovery of Rias Baixas', 'slug': 'full-discovery-of-rias-baixas-799021', 'price': 209.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p>Discover Galicia on this land and sea tour. Visit the magnificent Pazo de Rubianes, walking through wine vineyards with magical corners, a magical garden, and the palace with its 600 years of exciting stories. Next, guests will be driven to El Grove to board a small catamaran in the estuary. Visit floating docks used for mussel farming, where your guide will explain the process for harvesting mussels. Enjoy fresh boiled mussels and white wine on your way back to port.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Full-discovery-Rias-Baixas-10.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzOTQ3NDB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzFZUzlvWkRFdk9EZ3hORFV3TXpRNU16WTJNaTVxY0djfGM4ZDkzN2RjMDlkOWY5YmM3NjVmMmQ5ZTk3NDA1ZDk4YTVjOGUyYjQyYzY5ZTdhYzI0ODU5OGZmZWVkM2YzOGY', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '799019', 'port_slug': 'vigo', 'title': 'Galician Historical Gardens', 'slug': 'galician-historical-gardens-799019', 'price': 189.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': '<p>Step off your coach and into a botanical wonderland after a short, scenic drive from Vigo’s port. Here, at the Castle of Soutomaior, your guide will help you identify species of flowers and trees. Your next stop is Pazo de Rubianes, a palace dating back over 600 years and one of only three official Lordships in Spain. After a guided tour of the interior, stroll through the tranquil gardens, which cover almost 11 acres. There’s nothing quite like tasting wine at the vineyard where it’s made, and you’ll be invited to try a local wine. Enjoy it with tapas such as Spanish omelette, empanada (Galician salty pie) and local cheeses.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-Galician-Historical-gardens-16.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzNjg0OTd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZ3hNUzlvWTJZdk9EZ3hORFV3TWpFMU1ERTNOQzVxY0djfDcyYTRmYzM2Y2JmYzQ5MjJlMTQyNWM0M2E2MjVmN2UxMTI4NDI2YWM1ZGNkYjU2MTM2YzQwMTYxZmFhOWNjZmE', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '799027', 'port_slug': 'vigo', 'title': 'Best of Santiago de Compostela', 'slug': 'best-of-santiago-de-compostela-799027', 'price': 219.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "Visit the shrine of St. James the Apostle, Spain's patron saint, on this full-day tour. The cathedral was a site for Christian pilgrimage during the middle Ages. Take a guided tour of the richly decorated interior of St. James Cathedral and its interesting Museum. The original church was a 12th century Romanesque building, but additions over the ages have altered the cathedral. <br> <br /> </br><br /> The ornate Obradoiro fa&ccedil;ade dates from the 18th century. So many hands have touched the Tree of Jesus at the base of the central pillar over the centuries that indentations have been worn into the stone. You&rsquo;ll have free time to wander the squares to shop for souvenirs and religious articles from local vendors. Tapas Lunch will be served at the yards of the hotel Parador Hostal de los Reyes Catolicos, a former 15th century royal hospital, which provided shelter to numerous pilgrims.", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/y01-799027-best-of-santiago-de-compostela-1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTQ1NjB8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzNPQzlvWmpZdk9EZ3hORFV3TlRBek16YzFPQzVxY0djfDkzN2M4OTMyODk1ZmMyNjEyYzUwY2Y0MTlmNWI3MGY4ZmExZTA0ZTgzZTZiNzYyYjk3MjY4MzEyNzZiYWRlODA', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
