    {'code': '799028', 'port_slug': 'vigo', 'title': 'The Border Country', 'slug': 'the-border-country-799028', 'price': 129.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/799028-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDYwMjd8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREZqTDJnNU1TODRPVFExTXprek5qTXhNall5THpjNU9UQXlPQzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xjOWYxOGJjZGY2ZjFmYTM3NWNlNjE2MjZjNDM2ZDZjNWVjMTIwNWZiODU5YmJhYzA1MjQ4YTViNjk0NTc0Y2Mx&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '819013', 'port_slug': 'warnemunde-berlin', 'title': "Rostock & It's Countryside at a Glance", 'slug': 'rostock--it-s-countryside-at-a-glance-819013', 'price': 149.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/819013-img3.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyODk4ODF8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1V4TDJoaFpTODRPVGN3TXprd09UazBPVGMwTHpneE9UQXhNejFwYldjekxtcHdad3w1NmU5MThmZDExNzRhN2FiOTQxNGMyNTk3NjI3ZDU0YjMwM2E4MjhkODRkYzhlZjY4ZTU3ZmRhYjFmZmQyY2Nh&w=700&h=550&resize_profile=pdpgallery', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '819015', 'port_slug': 'warnemunde-berlin', 'title': 'Hanseatic Wismar & Schwerin Castel with Lunch', 'slug': 'hanseatic-wismar--schwerin-castel-with-lunch-819015', 'price': 304.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 5.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p>Visit the towns of Wismar and Schwerin, famous for their Gothic architecture and cathedrals. After arrival in Wismar, a UNESCO World Heritage Site and Hanseatic city, go on a walking tour through the old city. Enjoy the revealing architecture including the three main churches, the town hall, the magnificent Fürstenhof Palace and the Old Swede, built in 1380 and Wismar’s oldest surviving example of merchants’ residence. Depart Wismar and arrive in the old town of Schwerin for a guided city walk where you will see the city’s highlights such as the historical buildings in the old town, the Mecklenburg State Theatre and the medieval Schwerin Cathedral, an imposing Romanesque Gothic red-brick building. Pay an inside visit to the magnificent Schloss Schwerin, which is a picturesque castle located on an island and is the capital’s most famous building. Time permitting, you’ll have some leisure time in Wismar and Schwerin to stroll around the market square and have lunch in a traditional restaurant. Return to Warnemunde in the early evening having unveiled the treasures of Northern Germany.</p>', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/819015-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDY4NzZ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRGN5TDJnMFl5ODRPVGN3TXpreE56UTROak00THpneE9UQXhOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3w0NGE2NDY2ZjNlZjBiMWFlZTYwZDIxNDYxNjM4NTNiNzM5NTc0MzhhZGIxYmIyMmNlMmYzZDExYjk1YzU0NzY3', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '819038', 'port_slug': 'warnemunde-berlin', 'title': "Wismar's Old Town, German Brewery Visit with Beer", 'slug': 'wismar-s-old-town-german-brewery-visit-with-beer-819038', 'price': 169.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y01-Wismar-A-Baltic-Beauty-Unesco-World-Heritage-SiteLJPG.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3w4OTMzMnxpbWFnZS9qcGVnfGFXMWhaMlZ6TDJoak1TOW9Nall2T0RneE5EVXhOall3TURnMk1pNXFjR2N8NzNiMWNjNzQ2ODZhYjE3YmJmODE4MzkyODIwZmRkMTZmNDUwM2ViMDE2YmFmOTU1ZjZmNjZiNjkwODg5YzI5Mg&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '819041', 'port_slug': 'warnemunde-berlin', 'title': 'Berlin by train: Wall of Fame with Lunch', 'slug': 'berlin-by-train-wall-of-fame-with-lunch-819041', 'price': 409.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/819041-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMTA2Njl8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhREkwTDJnMlpDODRPVEkxTVRNNU9USTNNRGN3THpneE9UQTBNUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xiMzdiMzUyNGFjY2RkMmY0MzYwMmE1Nzc3NWM0ZDc5OGU1ZmQ1MWI4N2NmZWMwNjg2MDlhYjY0MzZiNWY3OTc0&w=1232&h=647&resize_profile=pdphero', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '819045', 'port_slug': 'warnemunde-berlin', 'title': 'Berlin by Train: Snapshot of Berlin', 'slug': 'berlin-by-train-snapshot-of-berlin-819045', 'price': 379.99, 'price_unit': 'Person', 'rating': 4.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': "<p>Take a short walk to the exclusively chartered train from Warnemünde to Berlin, a journey that lasts approximately 2.5-3 hours. During your transfer to Berlin, your escort will provide you with general information and a refreshment as well as a light evening snack on the way back to Warnemünde. Once you arrive in Berlin and your Berlin specialist tour guide has joined the coach, your sightseeing tour will begin with an overview of some of the major highlights of Berlin. You will pass by Remnants of the Berlin Wall, Alexanderplatz Square, the Red City Hall, Unter-den-Linden Boulevard, Potsdam Square, Tiergarten Park, Victory Column, Bellevue Palace and the Bebelplatz with the Empty Library. Stop for photographs (time permitting) at the Brandenburg Gate and the Reichstag, Check Point Charlie and Gendarmenmarkt – all world-famous landmarks. This tour will give you an excellent overview of Germany's capital. After all the most famous highlights of Berlin have been covered, you will have free time to explore Berlin on your own. Lunch is not included in this tour – you will have the opportunity to grab a snack during the leisure time, or visit a restaurant of your choice. It’s a good idea to have some euro currency with you to buy food and for any alternative transportation.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/819045-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTcwNDh8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFJqTDJnek5pODRPVEkxTVRRME1USXhNemMwTHpneE9UQTBOUzFwYldjeExtcHdad3xlMmU0ZjU3YTAwYTVlOTM2YWUzMGQ3MjY5YjA3YTdmNmI1Nzk4NDg1NzcyZDk0NGIwOGZjNWQ2YzJjMGM0YzYx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '819042', 'port_slug': 'warnemunde-berlin', 'title': 'Berlin byTrain:Holocaust Memorial&Track 17 (Lunch)', 'slug': 'berlin-bytrain-holocaust-memorial-track-17-lunch-819042', 'price': 409.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': None, 'review_count': 0, 'desc_html': "<p>Board the chartered train from Warnemünde to Berlin, that lasts approximately 2.5-3 hours, where your escort will provide general information and a refreshment. In Berlin, board your touring coach welcomed by your Berlin tour guide. First is the Bebelplatz, a square that was originally meant as a center for intellectual and artistic endeavor. Continue to Track 17 Memorial at Grunewald Train Station, which was one of the three stations where a total of 55,000 Berlin Jews were deported during the Nazi Regime. One of the platforms is lined with 183 steel plates; each plate commemorating the Jews who left this station on deportation trains. Next up will be the Holocaust Memorial, officially named the ‘Monument to the Murdered Jews’ in Europe. Opened in 2005, 60 years after the end of World War II, the U.S. architect Peter Eisenman's controversial design was chosen as a fitting tribute to those that died before and during World War II. Another touching memorial is the Neue Wache or New Guardhouse to remember the victims of war and tyranny. Finally, you will also see other major highlights of this metropolis, including Brandenburg Gate, Check Point Charlie, Berlin Dome, Unter den Linden, Reichstag, Victory Column, Strasse des 17. Juni and Alexanderplatz. Enjoy a typical, pub-style German lunch (included) in a local Berlin restaurant before your train ride back.</p>", 'image_url': '/shop/medias/819042-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wyOTYwMzJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhR1F6TDJoaE1DODRPVEkxTVRRd05qZ3dOek0wTHpneE9UQTBNaTFwYldjeExtcHdad3xhYzc0NGRmMmJjY2Y1OTZlYWY5NGM0NGMxMWE3MDczMDhlOGRhZjliMWYzZDFlZWRjZjkxNjkzYjY1ZjQwOTQ0', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '819043', 'port_slug': 'warnemunde-berlin', 'title': "Berlin by Train; Berlin's Top Ten with Lunch", 'slug': 'berlin-by-train-berlin-s-top-ten-with-lunch-819043', 'price': 444.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 3.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': '<p><strong>Chartered Travels:</strong> Board an exclusively chartered train from Warnemünde to Berlin with an onboard escort, destination insights, refreshments, and a light snack on the way.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Iconic Berlin:</strong> Experience Berlin’s most important historic, cultural and political landmarks linked to World War II, the Cold War, Prussian heritage, and modern Germany, including the Berlin Wall, Checkpoint Charlie, Brandenburg Gate, Reichstag, Holocaust Memorial, Charlottenburg Palace, Kurfürstendamm, and more. Gain powerful insight into the city’s past and rebirth as your guide brings to life the eras of war, division, and reunification.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>Local Flavors:</strong> Enjoy a traditional German lunch in a cozy, pub-style setting, featuring authentic local cuisine.<br />\n<br />\n<strong>What’s Included:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Round-trip transportation via exclusively chartered train.</li>\n\t<li>Professional escort during train journey.</li>\n\t<li>Guided sightseeing tour of Berlin’s top landmarks.</li>\n\t<li>Refreshment and light snack during train rides.</li>\n\t<li>Traditional German lunch.</li>\n</ul>\n', 'image_url': '/shop/medias/819043-img1.jpg?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wzMDE5ODJ8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhRFJpTDJnNVpDODRPVEkxTVRReU1USXlOVEkyTHpneE9UQTBNeTFwYldjeExtcHdad3w2NGIwOTFlYmE3NDViZTgzMzg4OGNhMjU1YzAzNTM2NmZhNjczZWE2MjllMTgzZGY0MTYzOGY0MjY0OGRjYWUx', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
    {'code': '819037', 'port_slug': 'warnemunde-berlin', 'title': '""Taste of Germany"" - Beer & Bratwurst', 'slug': 'taste-of-germany---beer--bratwurst-819037', 'price': 174.99, 'price_unit': 'Adult', 'rating': 1.0, 'review_count': 1, 'desc_html': None, 'image_url': 'https://www.carnival.com/shop/medias/y02-made-in-germany-bratwurst-beer-and-beach-basket-berlin-warnemunde-germany-1.JPG?context=bWFzdGVyfGltYWdlc3wxNzYyMTV8aW1hZ2UvanBlZ3xhVzFoWjJWekwyZzFOQzlvTVRndk9EZ3hORFV4TmpFME1qRXhNQzVxY0djfDBjZTIxMjdhOGNlMWY3ZThhYWRjOTJkM2JhNzhjNmMzZGVlNTgzZGRmYjE3MmE1NWY3MjJmNjY3MmMwZDY1MTc&w=700&h=550&resize_profile=pdpgallery', 'duration': '', 'activity_level': '', 'min_age': ''},
